rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "If no card of the chosen type is found before your library empties, you don\'t get a card, but you do get to order all the cards in your library any way you choose."}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'If you use this on a multi-card draw, each replaced draw is handled separately. In other words, you reveal and then put on the bottom of the library for the first card, then do the same for the second, and so on. In a multi-card draw you do not have to choose how many of those draws will be replaced before you do any drawing or use of this card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'This replacement effect replaces the draw, so nothing that triggers on a draw will trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2007-07-15\', \'text\': "If your library is empty, Abundance can prevent you from losing the game for being unable to draw a card. If an effect or turn-based action would cause you to draw a card, you can replace that draw with Abundance\'s replacement effect. (It doesn\'t matter that you\'d be unable to actually draw a card.) Since Abundance\'s effect has you put a card into your hand instead of drawing a card, you\'ll never be forced to draw a card with an empty library."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Because the "search" requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don\\\'t have to find the card if you don\\\'t want to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "The sacrifice of a land is part of the cost of casting Harrow. You can\'t pay this cost more than once to get a multiple effect."}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The two lands do not count toward your normal one land you can play each turn.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Because the "search" requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don\\\'t have to find the card if you don\\\'t want to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The land does not count toward your one per turn limit because it was put onto the battlefield by an effect.\'}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This is a triggered mana ability.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2004-12-01\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied artifact will trigger when Sculpting Steel enters the battlefield. Any "as enters the battlefield" or "enters the battlefield with" abilities of the chosen artifact will also work. For example, if Sculpting Steel copies an artifact creature with sunburst, the copy will get +1/+1 counters based on the number of different colors of mana used to pay Sculpting Steel\\\'s total cost. If Sculpting Steel copies a noncreature artifact with sunburst, the copy will get charge counters based on the number of different colors of mana used to pay Sculpting Steel\\\'s total cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2007-07-15\', \'text\': \'If the chosen artifact is a token, your Sculpting Steel copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that put it onto the battlefield. Your Sculpting Steel is not considered to be a token.\'}, {\'date\': \'2007-07-15\', \'text\': \'If the chosen artifact is copying something else (for example, if the chosen artifact is another Sculpting Steel), then your Sculpting Steel enters the battlefield as whatever the chosen artifact copied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2007-07-15\', \'text\': "Sculpting Steel doesn\'t copy whether the original artifact is tapped or untapped. It also doesn\'t copy any counters on that artifact, any Auras or Equipment attached to that artifact, or any effects that are currently affecting that artifact — you get exactly what\'s printed on the chosen card and nothing more. So if you copy an animated Chimeric Staff, for example, you get a normal, nonanimated Chimeric Staff."}, {\'date\': \'2007-07-15\', \'text\': "You can choose not to copy anything. In that case, Sculpting Steel stays on the battlefield as an artifact that doesn\'t do much of anything."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2006-02-01\', \'text\': "This spell isn\'t Modal. When it resolves, it will destroy the target if it\'s a creature or an enchantment, even if it changed from one to the other between targeting and resolution."}]', "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Cycling is an activated ability. Effects that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle or Rings of Brighthearth) will interact with cycling. Effects that interact with spells (such as Remove Soul or Faerie Tauntings) will not.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "If multiple effects modify your hand size, apply them in timestamp order. For example, if you put Null Profusion (an enchantment that says your maximum hand size is two) onto the battlefield and then put Reliquary Tower onto the battlefield, you\'ll have no maximum hand size. However, if those permanents enter the battlefield in the opposite order, your maximum hand size would be two."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Exotic Orchard checks the effects of all mana-producing abilities of lands your opponents control, but it doesn\\\'t check their costs. For example, Vivid Crag has the ability "{T}, Remove a charge counter from Vivid Crag: Add one mana of any color." If an opponent controls Vivid Crag and you control Exotic Orchard, you can tap Exotic Orchard for any color of mana. It doesn\\\'t matter whether Vivid Crag has a charge counter on it, and it doesn\\\'t matter whether it\\\'s untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "Exotic Orchard doesn\'t care about any restrictions or riders your opponents\' lands (such as Ancient Ziggurat or Hall of the Bandit Lord) put on the mana they produce. It just cares about colors of mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Lands that produce mana based only on what other lands "could produce" won\\\'t help each other unless some other land allows one of them to actually produce some type of mana. For example, if you control an Exotic Orchard and your opponent controls an Exotic Orchard and a Reflecting Pool, none of those lands would produce mana if their mana abilities were activated. On the other hand, if you control a Forest and an Exotic Orchard, and your opponent controls an Exotic Orchard and a Reflecting Pool, then each of those lands can be tapped to produce {G}. Your opponent\\\'s Exotic Orchard can produce {G} because you control a Forest. Your Exotic Orchard and your opponent\\\'s Reflecting Pool can each produce {G} because your opponent\\\'s Exotic Orchard can produce {G}.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "The colors of mana are white, blue, black, red, and green. Exotic Orchard can\'t be tapped for colorless mana, even if a land an opponent controls could produce colorless mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "When determining what colors of mana your opponents\' lands could produce, Exotic Orchard takes into account any applicable replacement effects that would apply to those lands\' mana abilities (such as Contamination\'s effect, for example). If there are more than one, consider them in any possible order."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Martial Coup checks the number you chose for X, not the amount of mana you actually spent.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "No one can cast spells or activate abilities between the time the Soldier tokens are put onto the battlefield and the time all other creatures are destroyed. For example, you can\'t sacrifice one of those Soldier tokens to regenerate a Skeletal Kathari."}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "You do what the spell says in order. If X is 5 or more, you\'ll put the Soldier tokens onto the battlefield, then you\'ll destroy all other creatures."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'If the copy says that it affects "you," it affects the controller of the copy, not the controller of the original spell. Similarly, if the copy says that it affects an "opponent," it affects an opponent of the copy\\\'s controller, not an opponent of the original spell\\\'s controller.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'If the spell Reverberate copies has an X whose value was determined as it was cast (like Earthquake does), the copy has the same value of X.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'If the spell Reverberate copies is modal (that is, it says "Choose one —" or the like), the copy will have the same mode. You can\\\'t choose a different one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': "Reverberate can target (and copy) any instant or sorcery spell, not just one with targets. It doesn\'t matter who controls it."}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': "The copy will have the same targets as the spell it\'s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can\'t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal)."}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'When Reverberate resolves, it creates a copy of a spell. You control the copy. That copy is created on the stack, so it\\\'s not "cast." Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won\\\'t trigger. The copy will then resolve like a normal spell, after players get a chance to cast spells and activate abilities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': "You can\'t choose to pay any additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy too. For example, if a player sacrifices a 3/3 creature to cast Fling, and you copy it with Reverberate, the copy of Fling will also deal 3 damage to its target."}]', "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'If you choose to find only one basic land card, you put it onto the battlefield tapped.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "If the targeted creature is also an artifact when Go for the Throat tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If the targeted creature is also an artifact when Go for the Throat tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "The creature that entered the battlefield deals damage equal to its current power to the targeted permanent or player. If it\'s no longer on the battlefield, its last known existence on the battlefield is checked to determine its power."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "Warstorm Surge is the source of the ability, but the creature is the source of the damage. The ability couldn\'t target a creature with protection from red, for example. It could target a creature with protection from creatures, but all the damage would be prevented. Since damage is dealt by the creature, abilities like lifelink, deathtouch and infect are taken into account, even if the creature has left the battlefield by the time it deals damage."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'A permanent card is a card with one or more of the following card types: artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "If the permanent is an illegal target by the time Chaos Warp tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will occur. No library will be shuffled and no card will be revealed."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "If the revealed card is a permanent card but can\'t enter the battlefield (perhaps because it\'s an Aura with nothing to enchant), it remains on top of that library."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'If the revealed card is not a permanent card, it remains on top of that library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "The owner of a token is the player under whose control the token was put onto the battlefield. If a token is shuffled into a player\'s library this way, that player shuffles before revealing the top card of that library."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2012-07-01\', \'text\': "The effect is based on the number of Swamps you control when Mutilate resolves. Only creatures on the battlefield at that time will be affected. The effect won\'t change later in the turn, even if the number of Swamps you control changes."}]', "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'X is the power of that creature as it last existed on the battlefield.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': "A creature that deals combat damage to a player must have a +1/+1 counter on it at the time damage is dealt in order for Bred for the Hunt\'s ability to trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "Scry appears on some spells and abilities with one or more targets. If all of the spell or ability\'s targets are illegal when it tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t scry."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'When you scry, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards on the bottom of your library, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them on the bottom.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'You choose how to order cards returned to your library after scrying no matter where you put them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, that means you\'ll scry last. For others, that means you\'ll scry and then perform other actions."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-02-01\', \'text\': \'Bile Blight has only one target. Other creatures with that name are not targeted. For example, a creature with hexproof will still get -3/-3 if it has the same name as the target creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-02-01\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target as Bile Blight tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. No creature will get -3/-3."}, {\'date\': \'2022-06-10\', \'text\': \'Unless a token is a copy of another permanent or was explicitly given a name by the effect that created it, its name is the subtypes it was given when it was created plus the word "Token." For example, if an effect creates a 1/1 Soldier creature token, that token is named "Soldier Token."\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'Although the tokens are attacking, they were never declared as attacking creatures (for purposes of abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks, for example).\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'If a spell or ability allows you to cast a strive spell without paying its mana cost, you must pay the additional costs for any targets beyond the first.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If all of the spell\'s targets are illegal when the spell tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. If one or more of its targets are legal when it tries to resolve, the spell will resolve and affect only those legal targets. It will have no effect on any illegal targets."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If such a spell is copied, and the effect that copies the spell allows a player to choose new targets for the copy, the number of targets can\'t be changed. The player may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, the player can\'t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal)."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "The mana cost and mana value of strive spells don\'t change no matter how many targets they have. Strive abilities affect only what you pay."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "You choose how many targets each spell with a strive ability has and what those targets are as you cast it. It\'s legal to cast such a spell with no targets, although this is rarely a good idea. You can\'t choose the same target more than once for a single strive spell."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "You declare which player or planeswalker each token is attacking as you put it onto the battlefield. It doesn\'t have to be the same player or planeswalker the original creature is attacking."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "Fell the Mighty won\'t destroy the target creature."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target when Fell the Mighty tries to resolve, Fell the Mighty won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. No creatures will be destroyed."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "Use the power of the target creature as Fell the Mighty resolves to determine which creatures are destroyed. Fell the Mighty doesn\'t target any of those creatures, so a creature with hexproof or protection from white will be destroyed if its power is high enough."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "If an effect instructs you to sacrifice a creature, and you control any creatures other than the creature equipped with Assault Suit, you must sacrifice one of them. You can\'t try to sacrifice the equipped creature, fail, and therefore ignore the effect."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "The equipped creature can\'t be sacrificed for any reason. If an effect instructs you to sacrifice it, you can\'t and it remains on the battlefield. You also can\'t sacrifice it to pay a cost that requires you to sacrifice a creature."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'Even though these lands have basic land types, they are not basic lands because "basic" doesn\\\'t appear on their type line. Notably, controlling two or more of them won\\\'t allow others to enter the battlefield untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'However, because these cards have basic land types, effects that specify a basic land type without also specifying that the land be basic can affect them. For example, a spell or ability that reads "Destroy target Forest" can target Canopy Vista, while one that reads "Destroy target basic Forest" cannot.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'If one of these lands enters the battlefield at the same time as any number of basic lands, those other lands are not counted when determining if this land enters the battlefield tapped or untapped.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': \'A "commander creature" is a permanent that\\\'s both someone\\\'s commander and a creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "Bastion Protector\'s ability applies to any commander creature you control, whether you own it or not."}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "Bastion Protector\'s ability doesn\'t apply to commanders that aren\'t currently creatures."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'If a Mountain or Forest is entering the battlefield from your hand at the same time as Game Trail, you may reveal the other land to have Game Trail enter untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to put Game Trail onto the battlefield tapped, it will still enter the battlefield tapped even if you reveal a land card from your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "Lands don\'t have a subtype just because they can produce mana of the corresponding color. Game Trail itself is neither a Mountain nor a Forest, even though it produces red and green mana, so you can\'t reveal one to satisfy the ability of another."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "You may reveal any land card with either or both of the appropriate subtypes. It doesn\'t have to be a basic land. For example, you could reveal Canopy Vista from the Battle for Zendikar set to satisfy the ability of Game Trail."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'If a Plains or Island is entering the battlefield from your hand at the same time as Port Town, you may reveal the other land to have Port Town enter untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to put Port Town onto the battlefield tapped, it will still enter the battlefield tapped even if you reveal a land card from your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "Lands don\'t have a subtype just because they can produce mana of the corresponding color. Port Town itself is neither a Plains nor an Island, even though it produces white and blue mana, so you can\'t reveal one to satisfy the ability of another."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "You may reveal any land card with either or both of the appropriate subtypes. It doesn\'t have to be a basic land. For example, you could reveal Canopy Vista from the Battle for Zendikar set to satisfy the ability of Port Town."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'If an Island or Swamp is entering the battlefield from your hand at the same time as Choked Estuary, you may reveal the other land to have Choked Estuary enter untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to put Choked Estuary onto the battlefield tapped, it will still enter the battlefield tapped even if you reveal a land card from your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "Lands don\'t have a subtype just because they can produce mana of the corresponding color. Choked Estuary itself is neither an Island nor a Swamp, even though it produces blue and black mana, so you can\'t reveal one to satisfy the ability of another."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "You may reveal any land card with either or both of the appropriate subtypes. It doesn\'t have to be a basic land. For example, you could reveal Prairie Stream from the Battle for Zendikar set to satisfy the ability of Choked Estuary."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': "Additional costs don\'t affect a spell\'s mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': \'Effects that reduce the cost of spells reduce the total cost, including any escalate costs added.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': \'If an effect allows you to cast a spell that has escalate without paying its mana cost, you pay escalate costs for that spell if you choose more than one mode.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': "If one target of an escalate spell becomes illegal, the other targets will still be affected. If all of the targets become illegal, the spell won\'t resolve."}, {\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': "If two of the chosen modes of an escalate spell target a creature, you may choose the same creature for each mode\'s target, or choose different creatures. The same is true if the chosen modes target a player (or opponent)."}, {\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': \'If you choose the first and third modes, and destroying the creature ends an "exile until" effect (such as that of Lunarch Inquisitors), the creature will return to the battlefield before you put +1/+1 counters on creatures. The same is true if you choose the second and third modes and destroying the enchantment ends such an effect.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': "You can tap any untapped creature you control to pay the escalate cost, including one you haven\'t controlled continuously since the beginning of the turn."}, {\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': "You can\'t choose any one mode multiple times."}, {\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': "You choose all of your modes at once. You can\'t wait to perform one mode\'s actions and then decide to choose more modes."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': \'An "attacking creature" is one that has been declared as an attacker or put onto the battlefield attacking during this combat. Unless that creature leaves combat, it continues to be an attacking creature through the end of combat step, even if the player it was attacking has left the game or the planeswalker it was attacking has left combat.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': "Entrapment Maneuver doesn\'t target the creature to be sacrificed. The target player chooses one as it resolves. No player may take any other actions between the target player choosing the creature and you creating Soldier tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': \'If you cast Entrapment Maneuver after combat damage has been dealt, only creatures that survived combat can be sacrificed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': \'To determine how many Soldier tokens are created, use the toughness of the sacrificed creature as it last existed on the battlefield.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': "Explore\'s effect allows you to play an additional land during your main phase. Doing so follows the normal timing rules for playing lands. In particular, you don\'t get to play a land as Explore resolves; Explore fully resolves first and you draw a card, perhaps a land you\'ll play later."}, {\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': "If you somehow manage to cast Explore when it\'s not your turn, you\'ll draw a card when it resolves, but you won\'t be able to play a land that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': "The effects of multiple Explores in the same turn are cumulative. They\'re also cumulative with other effects that let you play additional lands, such as the one from Urban Evolution."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Desert is a land subtype with no special meaning. It doesn\'t grant the land an intrinsic mana ability. Other cards may care about which lands are Deserts."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "If you don\'t put the top card of your library into your hand, you put it back on top of your library without revealing it. You\'ll draw it in that turn\'s draw step."}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "If you somehow control a Herald\'s Horn with no chosen creature type, no spells will cost less to cast, not even creature spells with no creature type. You\'ll be able to look at the top card of your library at the beginning of each of your upkeeps, but you can never put it into your hand this way, even if it\'s a creature card with no creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "The effect of Herald\'s Horn reduces only generic mana in a spell\'s cost. If that cost has no generic mana, the cost isn\'t reduced."}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': \'You can\\\'t choose multiple creature types, such as "Cat Warrior." A Cat Warrior is both a Cat and a Warrior. It\\\'s affected by anything that affects either type and unaffected by things that affect non-Cat or non-Warrior creatures.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': \'You must choose an existing creature type, such as Vampire or Cat. Card types such as "artifact" can\\\'t be chosen.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "Creatures you control that have +1/+1 counters put on them after Inspiring Call resolves won\'t gain indestructible."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'Once a creature gains indestructible, it will have it for the turn, even if it loses all its +1/+1 counters.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'An "attacking creature" is one that has been declared as an attacker this combat, or one that was put onto the battlefield attacking this combat. Unless that creature leaves combat, it continues to be an attacking creature through the end of combat step, even if the player it was attacking has left the game, or the planeswalker it was attacking has left combat. There\\\'s no such thing as an attacking creature outside of the combat phase.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': \'To choose a creature type, you must choose an existing creature type, such as Vampire or Knight. You can\\\'t choose multiple creature types, such as "Vampire Knight." Card types such as artifact can\\\'t be chosen, nor can subtypes that aren\\\'t creature types, such as Jace, Vehicle, or Treasure.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "You can choose to find one basic land card with Myriad Landscape\'s last ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'As Living Death resolves, all players exile their creature cards from graveyards at the same time. Then all players sacrifice all creatures they control at the same time. Then all players put all creatures they exiled onto the battlefield at the same time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Only cards exiled by Living Death\'s first instruction are put onto the battlefield. If a replacement effect (such as that of Leyline of the Void) causes any of the sacrificed creatures to be exiled instead of put into a graveyard, those cards aren\'t returned to the battlefield."}]', "[{'date': '2018-03-16', 'text': 'You draw three cards and put two cards back all while Brainstorm is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Lands you control won\'t lose any other abilities they had. They also won\'t gain or lose any land types."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "If the land this Aura would enchant is an illegal target by the time New Horizons resolves, the entire spell doesn\'t resolve. It won\'t enter the battlefield, so its ability won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': \'You can cast New Horizons even if you control no creatures.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "You must choose an existing creature type, such as Vampire or Warrior. Card types (such as artifact) and supertypes (such as legendary) can\'t be chosen."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': \'Because you never "cast" a land card, Mystic Forge doesn\\\'t allow you to play an artifact land from the top of your library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "If the top card of your library changes while you\'re casting a spell, playing a land, or activating an ability, you can\'t look at the new top card until you finish doing so. This means that if you cast the top card of your library, you can\'t look at the next one until you\'re done paying for that spell."}, {\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "If the top card of your library has a morph ability, you can cast it face down from the top of your library, even if it\'s normally not a colorless card."}, {\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "Mystic Forge lets you look at the top card of your library whenever you want (with one restriction—see below), even if you don\'t have priority. This action doesn\'t use the stack. Knowing what that card is becomes part of the information you have access to, just like you can look at the cards in your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': \'You must follow the normal timing permissions and restrictions of the spells you cast from your library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': \'You still pay all costs for a spell you cast from your library, including additional costs. You may also pay alternative costs.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Reconnaissance Mission\'s triggered ability triggers for each creature you control that deals combat damage to a player. You may draw one card each time the ability resolves, no matter how much damage was dealt."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Even though Adaptive Automaton is a Construct, other Construct creatures you control won\'t get +1/+1 unless you chose Construct as Adaptive Automaton entered the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "The choice of creature type is made as Adaptive Automaton enters the battlefield. Players can\'t take any actions between the time the choice is made and the time the appropriate creatures begin to get +1/+1."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You must choose an existing creature type, such as Human or Warrior. Card types such as artifact and supertypes such as legendary can\'t be chosen."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If the target card is an illegal target by the time Beacon of Unrest tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. You won\'t shuffle it into your library."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, the permanent you control from Beacon of Unrest is exiled.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Although players may respond to Blasphemous Act once it\'s been cast, once it\'s announced, they can\'t respond before the cost is calculated and paid."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Blasphemous Act\'s ability can\'t reduce the total cost to cast the spell below {R}."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'The total cost to cast Blasphemous Act is locked in before you pay that cost. For example, if there are three creatures on the battlefield, including one you can sacrifice to add {C} to your mana pool, the total cost of Blasphemous Act is {5}{R}. Then you can sacrifice the creature when you activate mana abilities just before paying the cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Blasphemous Act). The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If Opal Palace\'s last ability produces two mana (most likely due to Mana Reflection) and you spend them to cast a commander, that commander enters with two counters for each time it\'s been cast from the command zone this game."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Opal Palace\'s last ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the last ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Opal Palace\'s last ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'The "number of times it\\\'s been cast from the command zone" includes the most recent time. For example, the first time you cast your commander from the command zone in a game, if you spent mana from Opal Palace\\\'s last ability to do so, it will enter the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If Path of Ancestry\'s last ability produces two mana (most likely due to Mana Reflection), spending those two mana to cast creature spells that share a creature type with your commander will cause two abilities to trigger. Each of those abilities will cause you to scry 1. You won\'t scry 2. This is true whether you spend the mana on one creature spell or two."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you cast your commander with mana from Path of Ancestry, and your commander hasn\'t somehow lost all of its creature types while on the stack, you\'ll scry 1."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Path of Ancestry\'s ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander has no creature types, it can\'t share a creature type with any spell that you cast."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Path of Ancestry\'s ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "If you have two commanders, the last ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities. When you spend that mana on a creature spell that shares a creature type with either of your commanders, you\'ll scry 1."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "Your commander\'s creature types are checked immediately after you cast a creature spell spending mana from Path of Ancestry\'s last ability. They aren\'t set before the game begins, and they may not be the same types your commander had when you activated that ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Arcane Signet\'s ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Arcane Signet\'s ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Command Tower\'s ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Command Tower\'s ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Commander\'s Sphere\'s first ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Commander\'s Sphere\'s first ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You can cast Everflowing Chalice without kicking it at all if you wish. However, if Everflowing Chalice has no charge counters on it, activating its last ability won\'t produce any mana."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "You choose the target for Dread Return before paying any of its costs, so it\'s not possible to cast it using flashback and bring back one of the creatures you sacrifice."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If a card has multiple instances of flashback, you may choose any of its flashback costs to pay.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with no mana cost gains flashback, it has no flashback cost. It can\'t be cast this way."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a split card gains flashback, you pay only the cost of the half you\'re casting."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell with flashback, you can\'t pay any alternative costs such as overload costs. You can pay additional costs such as kicker costs. If the spell has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the spell with flashback."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If you cast an instant or sorcery with {X} in its mana cost this way, you still choose the value of X as part of casting the spell and pay that cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Past in Flames affects only cards in your graveyard at the time it resolves. Instant and sorcery cards put into your graveyard later in the turn won\'t gain flashback."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Cranial Plating is counted by its own ability, so it gives at least +1/+0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Cranial Plating\'s first activated ability is similar to an equip ability, but it\'s not an equip ability. Most importantly, it can be activated any time you could cast an instant, even during another player\'s turn."}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Farseek can find any land with any of the listed land types, including nonbasic ones, even if that land is a Forest in addition to one or more of those types.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "A spell\'s mana value is determined only by its mana cost. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'Cascade triggers when you cast the spell, meaning that it resolves before that spell. If you end up casting the exiled card, it will go on the stack above the spell with cascade.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Due to a 2021 rules change to cascade, not only do you stop exiling cards if you exile a nonland card with lesser mana value than the spell with cascade, but the resulting spell you cast must also have lesser mana value. Previously, in cases where a card\'s mana value differed from the resulting spell, such as with some modal double-faced cards or cards with an Adventure, you could cast a spell with a higher mana value than the exiled card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If a spell with cascade is countered, the cascade ability will still resolve normally.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If cascade allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half but not both halves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'When the cascade ability resolves, you must exile cards. The only optional part of the ability is whether or not you cast the last card exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'You exile the cards face up. All players will be able to see them.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-06-10\', \'text\': "An ability that triggers from the resolution of an activated mana ability is also a mana ability. This means that if the land\'s ability that caused you to add mana was an activated mana ability, Caged Sun\'s triggered ability won\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "A creature with ravenous gets its counters as it enters the battlefield. It doesn\'t enter the battlefield first and then get its counters. Any triggered ability that looks for a creature with a certain power or toughness entering the battlefield will see the counters when it checks to see if it should trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If a permanent spell with ravenous is copied, the copy will have the same value for X, and the token permanent that the spell becomes as it enters the battlefield will enter with X counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If another permanent enters the battlefield as a copy of a creature with Ravenous, it will not enter with any counters from the ravenous ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "If some of the creatures are illegal targets as Broodlord\'s triggered ability tries to resolve, the original distribution of counters still applies and the counters that would have been put on the illegal targets are lost. They won\'t be put instead on a legal target."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'The triggered ability that checks to see if X is 5 or greater refers to the value of X that was chosen as the spell was cast, which may be different from the number of counters it entered with if there are replacement effects involved. This is also true for any other ability that it has which refers to X and triggers when it enters the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "You choose how many targets Broodlord\'s triggered ability has and how the counters are distributed as you put the ability onto the stack. Each target must receive at least one counter."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "A creature with ravenous gets its counters as it enters the battlefield. It doesn\'t enter the battlefield first and then get its counters. Any triggered ability that looks for a creature with a certain power or toughness entering the battlefield will see the counters when it checks to see if it should trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If a permanent spell with ravenous is copied, the copy will have the same value for X, and the token permanent that the spell becomes as it enters the battlefield will enter with X counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If another permanent enters the battlefield as a copy of a creature with Ravenous, it will not enter with any counters from the ravenous ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "Players can respond to the triggered ability, but once it starts resolving and you decide whether to pay {2}{G}, it\'s too late for anyone to respond."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'The Endless Swarm ability triggers only if Hormagaunt Horde is in your graveyard at the moment the land enters the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'The Endless Swarm ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability puts a land onto the battlefield under your control.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'The triggered ability that checks to see if X is 5 or greater refers to the value of X that was chosen as the spell was cast, which may be different from the number of counters it entered with if there are replacement effects involved. This is also true for any other ability that it has which refers to X and triggers when it enters the battlefield.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "A creature with ravenous gets its counters as it enters the battlefield. It doesn\'t enter the battlefield first and then get its counters. Any triggered ability that looks for a creature with a certain power or toughness entering the battlefield will see the counters when it checks to see if it should trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If a permanent spell with ravenous is copied, the copy will have the same value for X, and the token permanent that the spell becomes as it enters the battlefield will enter with X counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If another permanent enters the battlefield as a copy of a creature with Ravenous, it will not enter with any counters from the ravenous ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'See also "New Keyword Ability: Ravenous" in General Notes.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'The triggered ability that checks to see if X is 5 or greater refers to the value of X that was chosen as the spell was cast, which may be different from the number of counters it entered with if there are replacement effects involved. This is also true for any other ability that it has which refers to X and triggers when it enters the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "Use Termagent Swarm\'s power as it last existed on the battlefield to determine the number of tokens you create."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "A creature with ravenous gets its counters as it enters the battlefield. It doesn\'t enter the battlefield first and then get its counters. Any triggered ability that looks for a creature with a certain power or toughness entering the battlefield will see the counters when it checks to see if it should trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If a permanent spell with ravenous is copied, the copy will have the same value for X, and the token permanent that the spell becomes as it enters the battlefield will enter with X counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If another permanent enters the battlefield as a copy of a creature with Ravenous, it will not enter with any counters from the ravenous ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'The creature Mawloc fights will be exiled instead of going to the graveyard if it would die on the same turn for any reason, not just because of the damage from fighting Mawloc. This is true even if Mawloc has left the battlefield by that time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'The triggered ability that checks to see if X is 5 or greater refers to the value of X that was chosen as the spell was cast, which may be different from the number of counters it entered with if there are replacement effects involved. This is also true for any other ability that it has which refers to X and triggers when it enters the battlefield.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "A creature with ravenous gets its counters as it enters the battlefield. It doesn\'t enter the battlefield first and then get its counters. Any triggered ability that looks for a creature with a certain power or toughness entering the battlefield will see the counters when it checks to see if it should trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If a permanent spell with ravenous is copied, the copy will have the same value for X, and the token permanent that the spell becomes as it enters the battlefield will enter with X counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If another permanent enters the battlefield as a copy of a creature with Ravenous, it will not enter with any counters from the ravenous ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'The triggered ability that checks to see if X is 5 or greater refers to the value of X that was chosen as the spell was cast, which may be different from the number of counters it entered with if there are replacement effects involved. This is also true for any other ability that it has which refers to X and triggers when it enters the battlefield.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "A spell\'s mana value is determined only by its mana cost. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "As Dark Apostle\'s activated ability resolves, it creates a continuous effect that won\'t begin to apply until you start casting a noncreature spell this turn. It applies to that spell and the timestamp of that effect is the time that the spell was put on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'Cascade triggers when you cast the spell, meaning that it resolves before that spell. If you end up casting the exiled card, it will go on the stack above the spell with cascade.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "Due to a 2021 rules change to cascade, not only do you stop exiling cards if you exile a nonland card with lesser mana value than the spell with cascade, but the resulting spell you cast must also have lesser mana value. Previously, in cases where a card\'s mana value differed from the resulting spell, such as with some modal double-faced cards or cards with an Adventure, you could cast a spell with a higher mana value than the exiled card."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If a spell with cascade is countered, the cascade ability will still resolve normally.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If you activate the ability of more than one Dark Apostle (or the same one more than once) in the same turn, the next noncreature spell you cast will have that many instances of cascade, each of which will trigger separately.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'See also "Returning Keyword Ability: Cascade" in the General Notes section.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'Two new cards in this set give the next spell you cast cascade. This means that the next spell you cast gains cascade as you begin to cast it by putting it on the stack, and the cascade ability will trigger when you finish casting that spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'When the cascade ability resolves, you must exile cards. The only optional part of the ability is whether or not you cast the last card exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'You exile the cards face up. All players will be able to see them.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "A spell\'s mana value is determined only by its mana cost. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "As Sloppity Bilepiper\'s activated ability resolves, it creates a continuous effect that won\'t begin to apply until you start casting a creature spell this turn. It applies to that spell and the timestamp of that effect is the time that the object was put on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'Cascade triggers when you cast the spell, meaning that it resolves before that spell. If you end up casting the exiled card, it will go on the stack above the spell with cascade.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "Due to a 2021 rules change to cascade, not only do you stop exiling cards if you exile a nonland card with lesser mana value than the spell with cascade, but the resulting spell you cast must also have lesser mana value. Previously, in cases where a card\'s mana value differed from the resulting spell, such as with some modal double-faced cards or cards with an Adventure, you could cast a spell with a higher mana value than the exiled card."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If a spell with cascade is countered, the cascade ability will still resolve normally.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If you activate the ability of more than one Sloppity Bilepiper (or the same one more than once) in the same turn, the next creature spell you cast will have that many instances of cascade, each of which will trigger separately.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'See also "Returning Keyword Ability: Cascade" in general notes.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'Two new cards in this set give the next spell you cast cascade. This means that the next spell you cast gains cascade as you begin to cast it by putting it on the stack, and the cascade ability will trigger when you finish casting that spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'When the cascade ability resolves, you must exile cards. The only optional part of the ability is whether or not you cast the last card exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'You exile the cards face up. All players will be able to see them.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "A spell\'s mana value is determined only by its mana cost. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'Cascade triggers when you cast the spell, meaning that it resolves before that spell. If you end up casting the exiled card, it will go on the stack above the spell with cascade.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "Due to a 2021 rules change to cascade, not only do you stop exiling cards if you exile a nonland card with lesser mana value than the spell with cascade, but the resulting spell you cast must also have lesser mana value. Previously, in cases where a card\'s mana value differed from the resulting spell, such as with some modal double-faced cards or cards with an Adventure, you could cast a spell with a higher mana value than the exiled card."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If a spell with cascade is countered, the cascade ability will still resolve normally.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "The spell you cast due to cascade resolves before Noise Marine, so when its enters-the-battlefield ability resolves it will count that spell as a spell you\'ve cast this turn."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'Two new cards in this set give the next spell you cast cascade. This means that the next spell you cast gains cascade as you begin to cast it by putting it on the stack, and the cascade ability will trigger when you finish casting that spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'When the cascade ability resolves, you must exile cards. The only optional part of the ability is whether or not you cast the last card exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'You exile the cards face up. All players will be able to see them.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "A spell\'s mana value is determined only by its mana cost. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'Cascade triggers when you cast the spell, meaning that it resolves before that spell. If you end up casting the exiled card, it will go on the stack above the spell with cascade.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "Due to a 2021 rules change to cascade, not only do you stop exiling cards if you exile a nonland card with lesser mana value than the spell with cascade, but the resulting spell you cast must also have lesser mana value. Previously, in cases where a card\'s mana value differed from the resulting spell, such as with some modal double-faced cards or cards with an Adventure, you could cast a spell with a higher mana value than the exiled card."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If a spell with cascade is countered, the cascade ability will still resolve normally.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'Two new cards in this set give the next spell you cast cascade. This means that the next spell you cast gains cascade as you begin to cast it by putting it on the stack, and the cascade ability will trigger when you finish casting that spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'When the cascade ability resolves, you must exile cards. The only optional part of the ability is whether or not you cast the last card exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'You exile the cards face up. All players will be able to see them.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "Activating a permanent card\'s unearth ability isn\'t the same as casting it as a spell. The unearth ability is put on the stack, but the card is not. Spells and abilities that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle) will interact with unearth, but spells and abilities that interact with spells (such as Cancel) will not."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "As Lokhust Heavy Destroyer\'s triggered ability resolves, first the player whose turn it is chooses a creature to sacrifice, then each other player in turn order does the same knowing the choices made before them. Then all those creatures are sacrificed simultaneously."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "At the beginning of the end step, a permanent returned to the battlefield with unearth is exiled. This is a delayed triggered ability, and it can be countered by effects that counter triggered abilities. If the ability is countered, the permanent will stay on the battlefield and the delayed trigger won\'t trigger again. However, the replacement effect will still exile it if it eventually leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "If a permanent returned to the battlefield by an unearth ability would leave it for any reason, it\'s exiled instead—unless the spell or ability that\'s causing it to leave the battlefield is actually trying to exile it. In that case, the spell or ability succeeds at exiling the permanent. If the spell or ability later returns the card to the battlefield, it will return as a new object with no relation to its previous existence. The unearth effect will no longer apply to it."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "If you activate a card\'s unearth ability but that card is removed from your graveyard before the ability resolves, that unearth ability will resolve and do nothing."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'Unearth grants haste to the permanent that\\\'s returned to the battlefield. However, neither of the "exile" abilities is granted to that permanent. If that creature loses all its abilities, it will still be exiled at the beginning of the end step, and if it would leave the battlefield, it is still exiled instead.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "When its triggered ability resolves, you may sacrifice Lokhust Heavy Destroyer itself. If you control no other creatures, you\'ll have to sacrifice it. If it was unearthed, it will be exiled."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "Activating a permanent card\'s unearth ability isn\'t the same as casting it as a spell. The unearth ability is put on the stack, but the card is not. Spells and abilities that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle) will interact with unearth, but spells and abilities that interact with spells (such as Cancel) will not."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "At the beginning of the end step, a permanent returned to the battlefield with unearth is exiled. This is a delayed triggered ability, and it can be countered by effects that counter triggered abilities. If the ability is countered, the permanent will stay on the battlefield and the delayed trigger won\'t trigger again. However, the replacement effect will still exile it if it eventually leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "Ghost Ark\'s triggered ability gives unearth {3} to each artifact that is in your graveyard as it resolves. Artifact cards that enter your graveyard after it resolves won\'t have unearth unless the ability triggers again later."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "If a permanent returned to the battlefield by an unearth ability would leave it for any reason, it\'s exiled instead—unless the spell or ability that\'s causing it to leave the battlefield is actually trying to exile it. In that case, the spell or ability succeeds at exiling the permanent. If the spell or ability later returns the card to the battlefield, it will return as a new object with no relation to its previous existence. The unearth effect will no longer apply to it."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "If you activate a card\'s unearth ability but that card is removed from your graveyard before the ability resolves, that unearth ability will resolve and do nothing."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'See also "Returning Keyword Ability: Unearth" in the General Notes section.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'Unearth grants haste to the permanent that\\\'s returned to the battlefield. However, neither of the "exile" abilities is granted to that permanent. If that creature loses all its abilities, it will still be exiled at the beginning of the end step, and if it would leave the battlefield, it is still exiled instead.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "Activating a permanent card\'s unearth ability isn\'t the same as casting it as a spell. The unearth ability is put on the stack, but the card is not. Spells and abilities that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle) will interact with unearth, but spells and abilities that interact with spells (such as Cancel) will not."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "At the beginning of the end step, a permanent returned to the battlefield with unearth is exiled. This is a delayed triggered ability, and it can be countered by effects that counter triggered abilities. If the ability is countered, the permanent will stay on the battlefield and the delayed trigger won\'t trigger again. However, the replacement effect will still exile it if it eventually leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "If a permanent returned to the battlefield by an unearth ability would leave it for any reason, it\'s exiled instead—unless the spell or ability that\'s causing it to leave the battlefield is actually trying to exile it. In that case, the spell or ability succeeds at exiling the permanent. If the spell or ability later returns the card to the battlefield, it will return as a new object with no relation to its previous existence. The unearth effect will no longer apply to it."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "If you activate a card\'s unearth ability but that card is removed from your graveyard before the ability resolves, that unearth ability will resolve and do nothing."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'The total cost to cast a spell is locked in before you pay that cost. For example, if you control three creature tokens, including one you can sacrifice to add {C} to your mana pool, the total cost to cast an instant with mana cost {4}{R} is {1}{R}. Then you can sacrifice the creature when you activate mana abilities just before paying the cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'Unearth grants haste to the permanent that\\\'s returned to the battlefield. However, neither of the "exile" abilities is granted to that permanent. If that creature loses all its abilities, it will still be exiled at the beginning of the end step, and if it would leave the battlefield, it is still exiled instead.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "Activating a permanent card\'s unearth ability isn\'t the same as casting it as a spell. The unearth ability is put on the stack, but the card is not. Spells and abilities that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle) will interact with unearth, but spells and abilities that interact with spells (such as Cancel) will not."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "At the beginning of the end step, a permanent returned to the battlefield with unearth is exiled. This is a delayed triggered ability, and it can be countered by effects that counter triggered abilities. If the ability is countered, the permanent will stay on the battlefield and the delayed trigger won\'t trigger again. However, the replacement effect will still exile it if it eventually leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "If a permanent returned to the battlefield by an unearth ability would leave it for any reason, it\'s exiled instead—unless the spell or ability that\'s causing it to leave the battlefield is actually trying to exile it. In that case, the spell or ability succeeds at exiling the permanent. If the spell or ability later returns the card to the battlefield, it will return as a new object with no relation to its previous existence. The unearth effect will no longer apply to it."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "If you activate a card\'s unearth ability but that card is removed from your graveyard before the ability resolves, that unearth ability will resolve and do nothing."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'Unearth grants haste to the permanent that\\\'s returned to the battlefield. However, neither of the "exile" abilities is granted to that permanent. If that creature loses all its abilities, it will still be exiled at the beginning of the end step, and if it would leave the battlefield, it is still exiled instead.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "All Cryptek\'s activated ability does when it resolves is set up a delayed triggered ability. If the target artifact creature isn\'t put into a graveyard this turn, that ability never triggers. If the targeted artifact creature is put into a graveyard this turn, that ability triggers and resolves like any other triggered ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "Although the tokens enter the battlefield attacking, they were never declared as attacking creatures. Abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "For the triggered ability, you declare which player or planeswalker the token is attacking as you put it onto the battlefield. It doesn\'t have to be the same player or planeswalker the equipped creature is attacking."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "Both targets must be chosen when putting Cybernetica Datasmith\'s activated ability on the stack. Notably, this means that if you target yourself to draw a card, you don\'t get to see what that card is before choosing which player to give a Robot to."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "Both the first and last abilities of Shadow in the Warp take into account spells cast before it was on the battlefield. For example, if an opponent cast a noncreature spell before it was on the battlefield, then casts a noncreature spell after it is put on the battlefield, Shadow in the Warp\'s second ability won\'t trigger because that is the second noncreature spell they\'ve cast that turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "Celestine\'s triggered ability looks at the total amount of life you gained to determine X, regardless of whether or not you also lost any life. For example, if you gained 3 life this turn, X is 3, even if you also lost some amount of life in the same turn."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "The target creature card is chosen as the triggered ability is put on the stack. Gaining life after that point won\'t let you choose a target with a higher mana value."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "Convergence of Dominion doesn\'t allow you to activate abilities of cards in graveyards unless you could already activate those abilities."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "For your life total to become 1, you will gain or lose the appropriate amount of life. For example, if your life total is -4 when The Golden Throne\'s ability applies, it will cause you to gain 5 life. Alternatively, if your life total is 20 when it applies (perhaps because you tried to draw a card from an empty library), you will lose 19 life. Other cards that interact with life gain or life loss will interact with this effect accordingly. Notably, this means that if you can\'t gain life or the life gain event is modified by another replacement effect, you might still have 0 or less life and still lose the game."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability both destroys The Golden Throne and deals enough damage to you to reduce your life total to zero or less, you will still lose the game. This is because the state-based action that causes a player to lose the game due to having zero or less life won\'t be performed until after the spell or ability finishes resolving. At that point, The Golden Throne is no longer on the battlefield to apply its replacement effect."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "If an effect says that you can\'t lose the game, The Golden Throne\'s first ability doesn\'t apply."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "If an effect states that an opponent wins the game, The Golden Throne\'s effect doesn\'t apply."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, The Golden Throne\'s ability set\'s the team\'s life total to 1, but only you gain or lose life."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "The Golden Throne\'s effect applies any time you would lose the game while it is on the battlefield, even if you\'re not losing due to your life total being 0 or less. If you would have lost the game because you tried to draw from an empty library, your life total becomes 1 and you won\'t lose again until you try to draw again and still can\'t do so. If you would have lost the game due to having ten or more poison counters, your life total becomes 1, but you will lose the game immediately afterward because you still have ten or more poison counters."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "The Golden Throne\'s effect does nothing if you concede the game. A player who concedes leaves the game."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "Having more than one Plague Drone on the battlefield doesn\'t have any noticeable effect on life gain. Once the effect of one Plague Drone applies, there is no life gain for the others to apply to."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If more than one replacement effect tries to apply to a life gain event, the player who would gain life chooses the order in which they apply. For example, if a player who controls Alhammarret\\\'s Archive would gain 3 life while Plague Drone is on the battlefield, that player may choose to have the 3 life become doubled to 6 life and then lose 6 life. The player may also choose to apply Plague Drone first, turning "gain 3 life" into "lose 3 life." Alhammarret\\\'s Archive would then not apply.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "Heirophant Bio-Titan\'s first ability can\'t reduce its cost below {G}{G}. You can remove any number of counters, even if they won\'t reduce its cost any further."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "Once a creature with power 3 or greater has blocked this creature, changing the power of the blocking creature won\'t cause this creature to become unblocked."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "Herald of Slaanesh\'s first ability only reduces the generic mana component of costs. It cannot reduce the cost of colored mana components."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "If Biophagus\'s ability produces more than one mana, perhaps due to an effect such as that of Mana Reflection, each creature cast with that mana will enter the battlefield with an additional +1/+1 counter. If all of that mana is spent on the same creature, it will enter the battlefield with that many additional +1/+1 counters."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "If Blight Grenade\'s target is no longer legal as it tries to resolve, it will be removed from the stack and no creatures will get -3/-3."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability sets a player\'s life total to a specified amount, that player gains or loses the appropriate amount of life. For example, if your life total is 20 and an effect sets your life total to 15, you lost 5 life."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "Mortarion, Demon Primarch\'s ability looks only at the amount of life you\'ve lost this turn, regardless of any life you may have gained. For example, if you lost 3 life due to combat damage, but gained 2 life later in the turn, X may be up to 3 for this ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "If an effect instructs a player to draw multiple cards, each of those cards are drawn independently, and Out of the Tombs\'s second ability will apply to each one if appropriate."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "If another source deals exactly 1 damage to a permanent or player multiple times or deals exactly 1 damage to multiple permanents and/or players simultaneously, Ghryson Starn, Kellermorph\'s last ability triggers that many times."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "If more than one card is exiled by Drach\'Nyen, usually because its triggered ability was copied one or more times, X is the total power of the exiled cards."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "If the exiled card doesn\'t have a printed power, perhaps because it was a noncreature permanent that was only a creature on the battlefield due to another effect, X is 0."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If the exiled card\\\'s power is determined by a characteristic-defining ability, usually denoted by a "*" in the power/toughness box, that ability applies in exile and should be used to determine the value of X.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "If the card in your opponent\'s graveyard isn\'t a legal target as the ability tries to resolve, it will be removed from the stack and your opponent won\'t get to choose a permanent card from your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "You choose the target card in your opponent\'s graveyard as you put the triggered ability on the stack. That opponent chooses the card in your graveyard as the ability resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "If the card you are putting onto the battlefield with the first chapter ability would enter the battlefield as a copy of another permanent, it will get +1/+1 counters this way only if the permanent that it is copying has a mana cost that contains {X}, regardless of the original card\'s mana cost."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "If the target artifact has indestructible, it isn\'t destroyed this way and you won\'t draw a card. If it is destroyed but put into a zone other than a graveyard, you\'ll draw a card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "If the target creature leaves the battlefield before Lucius the Eternal\'s ability resolves, Lucius will stay in your graveyard and will not be exiled or return to the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "If you still control Aspiring Champion as its triggered ability resolves, you must sacrifice it. You can\'t choose not to sacrifice it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "In Two-Headed Giant and other formats where multiple players can attack at the same time, Commissar Severina Raine\'s triggered ability counts all attacking creatures, even those controlled by other players."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "In Two-Headed giant and other formats where multiple players can attack at the same time, Epistolary Librarian\'s triggered ability counts all attacking creatures, even those controlled by other players."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "Mutalith\'s Vortex Beast deals 3 damage to the appropriate player for each lost flip, not 3 damage to each of those players for each lost flip."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "Old One-Eye\'s Fast Healing ability only triggers if it is in your graveyard at the beginning of your precombat main phase."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "Opponents may respond to the Fast Healing ability after it goes on the stack, but they don\'t get the chance to cast spells or activate abilities between the time you have chosen to discard two cards and the time Old One-Eye is returned to your hand."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "Protection from everything means that commanders you control can\'t be the target of any spells or abilities, they can\'t be blocked, nothing can be attached to them, and all damage that would be dealt to them is prevented. They can still be affected in other ways (such as by Their Name is Death, for example)."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "Replacement effects that modify artifacts as they enter the battlefield will apply after you apply Biotransference\'s effect. For example, if you control a Biotransference and there is an effect that says artifacts enter the battlefield tapped, creatures you control will enter the battlefield tapped."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "Resurrection Orb\'s triggered ability creates a delayed triggered ability that will trigger at the beginning of the next end step. It triggers even if Resurrection Orb is no longer on the battlefield at that time."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "The creature card that you return to the battlefield doesn\'t have to be one of the cards you milled. It can be a card that was already in your graveyard before you milled."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "The number of Demons you control is counted only as Be\'lakor, the Dark Master\'s ability resolves. If Be\'lakor is still on the battlefield, it will count itself."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "The protection ability means the following: - Reaver Titan can\'t be blocked by creatures with mana value 3 or less. - Reaver Titan can\'t be enchanted by Auras with mana value 3 or less. It also can\'t be equipped by Equipment with mana value 3 or less. - Reaver Titan can\'t be targeted by spells with mana value 3 or less. It also can\'t be targeted by abilities from sources with mana value 3 or less. - All damage that would be dealt to Reaver Titan by sources with mana value 3 or less is prevented."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "While a spell with X in its cost is on the stack, its mana value takes the chosen value of X into account. Reaver Titan can be chosen as a target for a Light Up the Night (which has mana cost {X}{R}) if X is 3 or greater, for example, but it can\'t be chosen as a target for a Light Up the Night if X is 2, 1, or 0."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "Use the mana value of the spell as it exists on the stack (or last existed on the stack, if it\'s been removed) to determine how much life is lost. If there is an {X} in that spell\'s cost, include the value chosen for X to determine its mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'You must follow all normal timing rules when casting a spell or playing a land using the permission granted by Ruinous Powers.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'"That creature" refers to the other target attacking creature. It doesn\\\'t refer to Trygon Prime, even if you didn\\\'t choose a target.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'A "cost that contains {X}" may be a spell\\\'s total cost, an activated ability\\\'s cost, a cost to perform a special action, or a cost you\\\'re asked to pay as part of the resolution of a spell or ability (such as Condescend). A spell\\\'s total cost includes either its mana cost (printed in the upper right corner) or its alternative cost (such as flashback), as well as any additional costs (such as kicker). If it\\\'s something you can spend mana on, it\\\'s a cost. If that cost includes the {X} symbol in it, you can spend mana generated by the granted ability on that cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "You can spend mana generated by the granted ability on a cost that includes {X} even if you\'ve chosen an X of 0, or if the card specifies that you can spend only colored mana on X. (You\'ll have to spend the {C}{C} on a different part of that cost, of course.)"}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "You can spend mana generated by the granted ability on any part of a cost that contains {X}. You\'re not limited to spending it only on the {X} part."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to spend all of the mana on the same cost."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'A copy is created even if the spell or ability that caused the delayed triggered ability to trigger has been countered by the time that delayed triggered ability resolves. The copy resolves before the original spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "A spell or ability with a cost that includes X, but not the mana symbol {X}, won\'t be copied."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'Activated abilities contain a colon. They\\\'re generally written "[Cost]: [Effect]." Some keyword abilities are activated abilities and will have a colon in their reminder text. Triggered abilities (starting with "when," "whenever," or "at") that ask a player to pay {X} aren\\\'t copied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "Any choices made when the spell or ability resolves won\'t have been made yet when it\'s copied. Any such choices will be made separately when the copy resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "If a permanent spell is copied, it\'s put onto the battlefield as a token as the spell resolves rather than putting the copy of the spell onto the battlefield. The rules that apply to a permanent spell becoming a permanent apply to a copy of a spell becoming a token."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "If the spell or ability has damage divided as it was put onto the stack, the division can\'t be changed, although the targets receiving that damage still can. The same is true of spells and abilities that distribute counters."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If the spell or ability that\\\'s copied is modal (that is, it says "Choose one —" or the like), the copy will have the same mode or modes. You can\\\'t choose different ones.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "Magus Lucea Kane\'s ability will copy any spell or activated ability whose mana cost or activation cost contains {X}, not just one with targets."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "Spells with additional costs that include {X} won\'t be affected by Magus Lucea Kane. {X} must be in the spell\'s mana cost."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'The copy has the same value of X.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'The copy is created on the stack, so it\\\'s not "cast" or "activated." Creating the copy won\\\'t cause abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell or activates an ability to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "The copy will have the same targets as the spell or ability it\'s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If the spell is a permanent spell with targets, such as an Aura, you may also choose a new target for that spell. The new targets must be legal. If, for any target, you can\'t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal)."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'The copy will resolve before the original spell or ability does.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'The token that a resolving copy of a spell becomes isn\\\'t said to have been "created."\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "The {C}{C} created by the mana ability doesn\'t need to be spent on the next spell or ability with {X} in its cost in order to copy it. That spell or ability will be copied even if that mana is spent on something else or not spent on anything at all."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "You can\'t choose to pay any additional costs for a copied spell. However, effects based on any additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy too."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'Activated abilities contain a colon. They\\\'re generally written "[Cost]: [Effect]." Some keywords are activated abilities; they have colons in their reminder text.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "If an activated ability of a card in a graveyard references the card it\'s printed on by name, treat Trazyn the Infinite\'s version of that ability as though it referenced Trazyn the Infinite by name instead."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "Trazyn the Infinite gains only activated abilities. It doesn\'t gain keyword abilities (unless those keyword abilities are activated), triggered abilities, or static abilities."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'An opponent gaining control of it is part of the replacement effect and happens immediately, even if you are in the middle of resolving the spell or ability and it has more instructions to perform after taking damage.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "In contrast, the Sigil of Corruption ability is a triggered ability, and it won\'t go onto the stack until after the spell or ability that tried to deal damage finishes resolving."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "In some cases, a single spell or ability will deal damage to this creature multiple times during its resolution. In that case, a new player gains control of it each time, its ability triggers once each time, and the appropriate players control those triggers. After that spell or ability is done resolving, all of those triggers are put onto the stack in turn order, starting with the active player (or the next player in turn order if the active player isn\'t involved). Usually, this means that the cards are drawn in a different order than the control-changing effects took place."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'You lose control of Khârn the Betrayer when it leaves the battlefield or another player gains control of it.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when Callidus Assassin enters the battlefield. You get to choose the order of those abilities and the triggered ability it has due to its copy effect. Any "as [this creature] enters the battlefield" or "[this creature] enters the battlefield with" abilities of the chosen creature will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "Callidus Assassin copies exactly what was printed on the original creature (unless that creature is copying something else or is a token; see below) and it has the triggered ability. It doesn\'t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or any Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "If Callidus Assassin somehow enters the battlefield at the same time as another creature, Callidus Assassin can\'t become a copy of that creature. You may choose only a creature that\'s already on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If the chosen creature is a token, Callidus Assassin copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created the token. Callidus Assassin is not a token in this case.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If the chosen creature is copying something else (for example, if the chosen creature is another Callidus Assassin), then your Callidus Assassin enters the battlefield as whatever the chosen creature copied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'The triggered ability that Callidus Assassin has is part of its copy effect and is a copiable value that other effects may copy.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'You can choose not to copy anything. In that case, Callidus Assassin enters the battlefield as a 3/3 creature. Notably, it does not have "When this creature enters the battlefield, destroy up to one other target creature with the same name as this creature."\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any "as [this creature] enters the battlefield" or "[this creature] enters the battlefield with" abilities of the creature will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature had {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature was copying something else, then the token enters the battlefield as whatever that creature copied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "If you control more than one Genestealer Patriarch as a creature with an infection counter on it dies, each one\'s ability will trigger, and you will make two tokens that are copies of it."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "The token copies exactly what was printed on the original creature and nothing else (unless that creature is copying something else; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that creature was tapped or untapped, whether it had any counters on it or Auras or Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that had changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'The token copies the creature as it last existed on the battlefield before it died, not as it exists in the graveyard.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'Canoptek Wraith has received an update to its Oracle text to make it clearer that the two lands must have the same name as each other. Its triggered ability now reads "When Canoptek Wraith deals combat damage to a player, you may pay {3} and sacrifice it. If you do, choose a land you control. Then search your library for up to two basic land cards which have the same name as the chosen land, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle."\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If Knight Rampager has multiple attack requirements applied to it, usually because it was also goaded, you must obey as many of the requirements as possible without violating any restrictions (such as effects that say it "can\\\'t attack") that might apply. For example, if the player chosen randomly also goaded Knight Rampager, then Knight Rampager must attack, but would be allowed to attack any player.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "If the spell you cast with the cascade ability is a creature, it will have entered the battlefield this turn when Let the Galaxy Burn resolves and will not take damage from Let the Galaxy Burn\'s effect."}]', "[{'date': '2022-10-07', 'text': 'If The Flesh is Weak enters the battlefield while you control a nonartifact creature with 1 toughness and no +1/+1 counters on it, the last ability will cause its toughness to become 0 and it will die before the first ability can put a counter on it.'}, {'date': '2022-10-07', 'text': 'The same happens if a nonartifact creature you control with no +1/+1 counters on it has damage marked on it equal to its toughness minus 1. For example, if a 5/5 creature was dealt 4 damage earlier in the turn and its controller resolves The Flesh Is Weak, that creature will die before the +1/+1 counter is placed on it.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-10-07', 'text': 'If Tzaangor Shaman deals combat damage to a player more than one time in a turn, perhaps because it has gained double strike, its delayed triggered ability will trigger that many times when you cast your next instant or sorcery spell this turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-10-07', 'text': 'If a card in your graveyard has an {X} in its cost, X is zero.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If a card in your graveyard has an {X} in its mana cost, X is zero.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "The artifact creature cards you choose don\'t need to be cards that you milled. You may choose cards that were already in your graveyard before you milled."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If a creature enters the battlefield with +1/+1 counters on it, consider those counters when determining if evolve will trigger. For example, a 1/1 creature that enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it will cause the evolve ability of a 2/2 creature to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If evolve triggers, the stat comparison will happen again when the ability tries to resolve. If neither stat of the new creature is greater, the ability will do nothing. If the creature that entered the battlefield leaves the battlefield before evolve tries to resolve, use its last known power and toughness to compare the stats.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If multiple creatures enter the battlefield at the same time, evolve may trigger multiple times, although the stat comparison will take place each time one of those abilities tries to resolve. For example, if you control a 2/2 creature with evolve and two 3/3 creatures enter the battlefield, evolve will trigger twice. The first ability will resolve and put a +1/+1 counter on the creature with evolve. When the second ability tries to resolve, neither the power nor the toughness of the new creature is greater than that of the creature with evolve, so that ability does nothing.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'Multiple instances of evolve trigger separately and, similar to above, the stat comparison takes place for each one independently as they try to resolve.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "When comparing the stats as the evolve ability resolves, it\'s possible that the stat that\'s greater changes from power to toughness or vice versa. If this happens, the ability will still resolve and you\'ll put a +1/+1 counter on the creature with evolve. For example, if you control a 2/2 creature with evolve and a 1/3 creature enters the battlefield under your control, its toughness is greater so evolve will trigger. In response, the 1/3 creature gets +2/-2. When the evolve trigger tries to resolve, its power is greater. You\'ll put a +1/+1 counter on the creature with evolve."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'When comparing the stats of the two creatures for evolve, you always compare power to power and toughness to toughness.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "Whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, check its power and toughness against the power and toughness of the creature with evolve. If neither stat of the new creature is greater, evolve won\'t trigger at all."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If a creature isn\\\'t able to attack for any reason (such as being tapped as its controller\\\'s declare attackers step begins or being affected by "summoning sickness"), that creature doesn\\\'t have to attack. If no creatures a player controls are able to attack, Seeker of Slaanesh\\\'s requirement has no effect during that combat. If there\\\'s a cost associated with having a creature attack, its controller isn\\\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\\\'t have to attack in that case either.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If a permanent has an ability that causes itself to be a land, such as that of Ashaya, Soul of the Wild, that ability will apply to it even though it loses that ability due to Toxicrene. This is because type-changing effects are always applied before any effects that add or remove abilities. It will still have "{T}: Add one mana of any color" and lose all other abilities.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If an effect puts a card into your hand without using the word "draw," the card wasn\\\'t drawn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "If the card leaves your hand before Inquisitor Eisenhorn\'s triggered ability resolves, you\'ll still create a Cherubael token."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "If you reveal a card this way, it remains revealed until Inquisitor Eisenhorn\'s triggered ability finishes resolving."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "It\'s important to reveal the first card you draw each turn (or choose not to reveal it) before it is mixed with the other cards in your hand. You look at the card as you draw it before choosing whether to reveal it."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "Multiple card draws are always treated as a sequence of individual card draws. For example, if you haven\'t drawn any cards yet during a turn and cast a spell that instructs you to draw three cards, you\'ll draw them one at a time. Only the first card drawn this way may be revealed with Inquisitor Eisenhorn\'s ability."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "You can reveal an instant or sorcery card this way on any turn to create a token, not just your own, if it\'s the first card you\'ve drawn that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to reveal a drawn card if you don\'t wish to create a Cherubael token."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If an effect puts a card into your hand without using the word "draw," the card wasn\\\'t drawn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "If the card with miracle leaves your hand before the triggered ability resolves, you won\'t be able to cast it using its miracle ability."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "It\'s important to reveal a card with miracle before it is mixed with the other cards in your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'Miracle is an alternative cost to cast the spell with miracle. It can\\\'t be combined with other alternative costs, such as casting a spell "without paying its mana cost."\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "Multiple card draws are always treated as a sequence of individual card draws. For example, if you haven\'t drawn any cards yet during a turn and cast a spell that instructs you to draw three cards, you\'ll draw them one at a time. Only the first card drawn this way may be revealed and cast using its miracle ability."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a miracle cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "You can cast a card for its miracle cost only as the miracle triggered ability resolves. If you don\'t want to cast it at that time (or you can\'t cast it, perhaps because there are no legal targets available), you won\'t be able to cast it later for the miracle cost."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "You can reveal and cast a card with miracle on any turn, not just your own, if it\'s the first card you\'ve drawn that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "You cast the card with miracle during the resolution of the triggered ability. Ignore any timing rules based on the card\'s type."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to reveal a drawn card with miracle if you don\'t wish to cast it at that time."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "You still draw the card, whether you use the miracle ability or not. Any ability that triggers whenever you draw a card, for example, will trigger. If you don\'t cast the card using its miracle ability, it will remain in your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "If you have fewer than six cards in your library or if Triumph of Saint Katherine isn\'t in your graveyard as the triggered ability resolves, no cards will be exiled and the ability will do nothing."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If an effect puts a card into your hand without using the word "draw," the card wasn\\\'t drawn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "If the card with miracle leaves your hand before the triggered ability resolves, you won\'t be able to cast it using its miracle ability."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "It\'s important to reveal a card with miracle before it is mixed with the other cards in your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'Miracle is an alternative cost to cast the spell with miracle. It can\\\'t be combined with other alternative costs, such as casting a spell "without paying its mana cost."\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "Multiple card draws are always treated as a sequence of individual card draws. For example, if you haven\'t drawn any cards yet during a turn and cast a spell that instructs you to draw three cards, you\'ll draw them one at a time. Only the first card drawn this way may be revealed and cast using its miracle ability."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a miracle cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "You can cast a card for its miracle cost only as the miracle triggered ability resolves. If you don\'t want to cast it at that time (or you can\'t cast it, perhaps because there are no legal targets available), you won\'t be able to cast it later for the miracle cost."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "You can reveal and cast a card with miracle on any turn, not just your own, if it\'s the first card you\'ve drawn that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "You cast the card with miracle during the resolution of the triggered ability. Ignore any timing rules based on the card\'s type."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to reveal a drawn card with miracle if you don\'t wish to cast it at that time."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "You still draw the card, whether you use the miracle ability or not. Any ability that triggers whenever you draw a card, for example, will trigger. If you don\'t cast the card using its miracle ability, it will remain in your hand."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If an effect puts a card into your hand without using the word "draw," the card wasn\\\'t drawn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "If the card with miracle leaves your hand before the triggered ability resolves, you won\'t be able to cast it using its miracle ability."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If the spell is countered, the squad ability will not trigger, and no tokens will be created.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If you cast Zephyrim for its miracle cost, you may also choose to pay its squad cost one or more times.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "If, for some reason, the creature doesn\'t have the squad ability when it\'s on the battlefield, the ability won\'t trigger, even if you\'ve paid the squad cost one or more times."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "It\'s important to reveal a card with miracle before it is mixed with the other cards in your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'Miracle is an alternative cost to cast the spell with miracle. It can\\\'t be combined with other alternative costs, such as casting a spell "without paying its mana cost."\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "Multiple card draws are always treated as a sequence of individual card draws. For example, if you haven\'t drawn any cards yet during a turn and cast a spell that instructs you to draw three cards, you\'ll draw them one at a time. Only the first card drawn this way may be revealed and cast using its miracle ability."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'See also "New Keyword Ability: Squad" and "Returning Keyword Ability: Miracle" in the General Notes section.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'The tokens created by the squad ability aren\\\'t "cast," so any abilities that trigger when a spell is cast won\\\'t trigger for the copies.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a miracle cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "You can cast a card for its miracle cost only as the miracle triggered ability resolves. If you don\'t want to cast it at that time (or you can\'t cast it, perhaps because there are no legal targets available), you won\'t be able to cast it later for the miracle cost."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "You can reveal and cast a card with miracle on any turn, not just your own, if it\'s the first card you\'ve drawn that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "You cast the card with miracle during the resolution of the triggered ability. Ignore any timing rules based on the card\'s type."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to reveal a drawn card with miracle if you don\'t wish to cast it at that time."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'You may pay the squad cost any number of times. You will get a token that is a copy of that permanent for each time you paid the squad cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "You still draw the card, whether you use the miracle ability or not. Any ability that triggers whenever you draw a card, for example, will trigger. If you don\'t cast the card using its miracle ability, it will remain in your hand."}]', "[{'date': '2022-10-07', 'text': 'If an exiled card is both an artifact card and a land card, you will create one token, not two.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-10-07', 'text': 'If multiple artifact cards leave your graveyard at the same time, the first ability triggers only once, and you will create only two tokens.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-10-07', 'text': 'If the chosen creature is an illegal target as Mandate of Abaddon tries to resolve, it will be removed from the stack and no creatures will be destroyed.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'If the spell is countered, the squad ability will not trigger, and no tokens will be created.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': "If, for some reason, the creature doesn\'t have the squad ability when it\'s on the battlefield, the ability won\'t trigger, even if you\'ve paid the squad cost one or more times."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'The tokens created by the squad ability aren\\\'t "cast," so any abilities that trigger when a spell is cast won\\\'t trigger for the copies.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'You may pay the squad cost any number of times. You will get a token that is a copy of that permanent for each time you paid the squad cost.\'}]', "[{'date': '2022-10-07', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with {X} in its mana cost this way, the only legal choice for X is 0.'}, {'date': '2022-10-07', 'text': 'You may only cast a spell this way by paying the appropriate amount of life. You may not pay its normal cost and may not pay any other alternative costs. You may still pay for additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the spell has mandatory additional costs, you must pay those.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-10-07', 'text': 'If you choose one or more permanents with indestructible, and there are any permanents chosen which do not have indestructible, one of the permanents without indestructible will be randomly chosen and destroyed.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'Space Marine Scout\\\'s triggered ability has an "intervening if clause," which means that it checks to see whether or not an opponent controls more lands than you both when it triggers and when it resolves. If it isn\\\'t true both times, you won\\\'t search your library for a Plains card.\'}]', "[{'date': '2022-10-07', 'text': 'The ability that reduces the mana cost only reduces its generic mana cost. It will cost at least {B}{B}{R}, even if more than eight creatures have died this turn.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'The phrase "target creatures controlled by different players" means that no two targets may be controlled by the same player.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-07\', \'text\': \'To choose a creature type, you must choose an existing creature type, such as Vampire or Knight. You can\\\'t choose multiple creature types, such as "Vampire Knight." Card types such as artifact can\\\'t be chosen, nor can subtypes that aren\\\'t creature types, such as Jace, Vehicle, or Treasure.\'}]', "[{'date': '2022-10-07', 'text': 'Use the mana value of the card as it last existed in the graveyard to determine the amount of life you gain.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-10-07', 'text': 'Use the mana value of the sacrificed creature as it last existed on the battlefield to determine the amount of {B} to add.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-10-07', 'text': 'X in the first ability is always calculated separately from X in the second ability, even if you activate second ability in response to the first ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-10-07', 'text': 'You must still pay its normal cost and follow all normal timing rules when casting Their Number is Legion from your graveyard using the permission granted by its last ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-10-07', 'text': 'You still need to follow all normal timing restrictions when casting Helbrute from your graveyard using the permission granted by its last ability. Usually, this means you may only cast it during one of your own main phases while the stack is empty.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "The cycling ability and the triggered ability are separate. If the triggered ability doesn\'t resolve (because, for example, it has been countered, or all of its targets have become illegal), the cycling ability will still resolve, and you\'ll draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': \'When you cycle this card, first the cycling ability goes on the stack, then the triggered ability goes on the stack on top of it. The triggered ability will resolve before you draw a card from the cycling ability.\'}]', "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Use the power of the creature from when it was last on the battlefield to determine how much life is gained.'}]", "[{'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Each additional Hardened Scales you control will increase the number of +1/+1 counters placed on a creature you control by one.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If a creature you control would enter the battlefield with a number of +1/+1 counters on it, it enters with that many plus one instead.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If two or more effects attempt to modify how many counters would be put on a creature you control, you choose the order to apply those effects, no matter who controls the sources of those effects.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "Because convoke isn\'t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "If a creature you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with convoke will result in the creature being tapped before you pay the spell\'s costs. You won\'t be able to tap it again for convoke. Similarly, if you sacrifice a creature to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with convoke, that creature won\'t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell\'s costs, so you won\'t be able to tap it for convoke."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "Tapping a multicolored creature using convoke will pay for {1} or one mana of your choice of any of that creature\'s colors."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "Tapping an untapped creature that\'s attacking or blocking to convoke a spell won\'t cause that creature to stop attacking or blocking."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "When calculating a spell\'s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Convoke applies after the total cost is calculated. Convoke doesn\'t change a spell\'s mana cost or mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "You can tap any untapped creature you control to convoke a spell, even one you haven\'t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn."}]']
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': "Drach\'Nyen", \'text\': "Echo des ersten Mordes — Wenn Drach\'Nyen ins Spiel kommt, schicke bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil.\\nDämonenschwert — Die ausgerüstete Kreatur hat Bedrohlichkeit und erhält +X/+0, wobei X gleich der Stärke der ins Exil geschickten Karte ist.\\nAusrüsten {2} ({2}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)", \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581099&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03793c9a-e666-4aa3-8c92-56d5b59aaf4f\', \'multiverseId\': 581099}, \'multiverseid\': 581099}, {\'name\': "Drach\'nyen", \'text\': "Eco del primer asesinato — Cuando Drach\'nyen entre al campo de batalla, exilia hasta una criatura objetivo.\\nEspada daemónica — La criatura equipada tiene la habilidad de amenaza y obtiene +X/+0, donde X es la fuerza de la carta exiliada.\\nEquipar {2}. ({2}: Anexa este Equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)", \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea494342-84e8-4221-9cdd-0b7581306eae\', \'multiverseId\': 581259}, \'multiverseid\': 581259}, {\'name\': "Drach\'Nyen", \'text\': "Écho du premier meurtre — Quand Drach\'Nyen arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez jusqu\'à une créature ciblée.\\nÉpée-démon — La créature équipée a la menace et gagne +X/+0, X étant la force de la carte exilée.\\nÉquipement {2} ({2} : Attachez à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581419&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dfcf66e-9c21-47d6-b41f-5eff370d67cd\', \'multiverseId\': 581419}, \'multiverseid\': 581419}, {\'name\': "Drach\'nyen", \'text\': "Eco del Primo Delitto — Quando Drach\'nyen entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia fino a una creatura bersaglio.\\nSpada Demoniaca — La creatura equipaggiata ha minacciare e prende +X/+0, dove X è la forza della carta esiliata.\\nEquipaggiare {2} ({2}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo come una stregoneria.)", \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2697076-48e1-403f-ab56-fb9247078c57\', \'multiverseId\': 581579}, \'multiverseid\': 581579}, {\'name\': \'ドラクニィエン\', \'text\': \'第一の殺人の残響 — ドラクニィエンが戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。それを追放する。\\n悪魔の剣 — 装備しているクリーチャーは威迫を持ち＋Ｘ/＋０の修整を受ける。Ｘはその追放されているカードのパワーに等しい。\\n装備{2}（{2}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581739&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f9062b6-2cd7-43d5-98c1-0ea93a77b352\', \'multiverseId\': 581739}, \'multiverseid\': 581739}, {\'name\': "Drach\'Nyen", \'text\': "Eco do Primeiro Assassinato — Quando Drach\'Nyen entrar no campo de batalha, exile até uma criatura alvo.\\nEspada Daemoníaca — A criatura equipada tem ameaçar e recebe +X/+0, sendo X o poder do card exilado.\\nEquipar {2} ({2}: Anexe este equipamento à criatura alvo que você controla. Equipe somente como um feitiço.)", \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581899&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35e62811-c7e8-4ce1-ab59-0fb2e0c41c36\', \'multiverseId\': 581899}, \'multiverseid\': 581899}, {\'name\': \'德拉克尼恩\', \'text\': \'首杀回声～当德拉克尼恩进战场时，放逐至多一个目标生物。\\n恶魔之剑～佩带此武具的生物具有威慑异能且得+X/+0，X为所放逐之牌的力量。\\n佩带{2}（{2}：贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。只能于法术时机佩带。）\', \'type\': \'传奇神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be0051eb-6ed7-4b59-a822-f123fd6cc9cf\', \'multiverseId\': 582219}, \'multiverseid\': 582219}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abaddons Weisung\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst. Zerstöre jede Kreatur, deren Stärke kleiner ist als die Stärke der bestimmten Kreatur.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich bin der Erzfeind, der Vernichter von Welten, und durch meine Hand wird der falsche Imperator fallen."\\n—Abaddon der Vernichter\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581022&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a823dff9-d2b1-4ff0-8632-721401f2cd4b\', \'multiverseId\': 581022}, \'multiverseid\': 581022}, {\'name\': \'Mandato de Abaddon\', \'text\': \'Elige la criatura objetivo que controlas. Destruye todas las criaturas con fuerza menor que la fuerza de esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Yo soy el Archidemonio, el Saqueador de Mundos, y mis manos serán las que hagan caer al falso Emperador".\\n—Abaddon, el Saqueador\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581182&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a4741ac-2eaf-46a9-bfb3-4d8301c831ef\', \'multiverseId\': 581182}, \'multiverseid\': 581182}, {\'name\': "Mandat d\'Abaddon", \'text\': \'Choisissez une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. Détruisez toutes les créatures de force inférieure à la force de cette créature.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Je suis l\'Archi-Ennemi, le Destructeur de Mondes. C\'est par ma main que le Faux Empereur sera déchu. »\\n—Abaddon le Fléau", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581342&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfd31865-6fb1-484d-9908-11b003bcb63d\', \'multiverseId\': 581342}, \'multiverseid\': 581342}, {\'name\': \'Mandato di Abaddon\', \'text\': \'Scegli una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Distruggi tutte le creature con forza inferiore alla forza di quella creatura.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Io sono l\\\'arcidemone, il distruttore di mondi, e per mano mia cadrà il falso Imperatore."\\n—Abaddon il Distruttore\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581502&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8859ab5-cfcc-4814-9557-f3837d2e2450\', \'multiverseId\': 581502}, \'multiverseid\': 581502}, {\'name\': \'アバドンの執行\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。パワーがそのクリーチャーより小さいすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「我こそがアーチフィーンド、世界の強奪者である。偽りの皇帝は我が手によって墜ちるのだ。」\\n――強奪者、アバドン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdda6b81-1f54-4173-ad53-0cada16015ea\', \'multiverseId\': 581662}, \'multiverseid\': 581662}, {\'name\': \'Ordens de Abaddon\', \'text\': \'Escolha a criatura alvo que você controla. Destrua todas as criaturas com poder inferior ao poder daquela criatura.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu sou o Arquidemônio, o Despojador de Mundos, e pelas minhas mãos cairá o falso Imperador."\\n— Abaddon, o Despojador\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581822&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'592926a9-0517-49a4-8180-176ee9f301a2\', \'multiverseId\': 581822}, \'multiverseid\': 581822}, {\'name\': \'阿巴顿的敕令\', \'text\': \'选择目标由你操控的生物。消灭所有力量小于前者的生物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「吾乃至高恶魔，吾是诸界之掠夺者，吾定将亲手摧毁伪帝统治。」\\n～掠夺者阿巴顿\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a74c503-5bc9-427b-8951-05e1250aeec7\', \'multiverseId\': 582142}, \'multiverseid\': 582142}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aberrant\', \'text\': \'Unersättlich (Diese Kreatur kommt mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel. Falls X gleich 5 oder mehr ist, ziehe eine Karte, wenn sie ins Spiel kommt.)\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden\\nSchwerer Energiehammer — Immer wenn der Aberrant einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, zerstöre ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl, das bzw. die jener Spieler kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Tyranide, Mutant\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581068&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0fc7a4e-72ca-4739-a0dc-15be944d13a5\', \'multiverseId\': 581068}, \'multiverseid\': 581068}, {\'name\': \'Aberrante\', \'text\': \'Voracidad. (Esta criatura entra al campo de batalla con X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella. Si X es 5 o más, roba una carta cuando entre.)\\nArrolla.\\nMartillo de energía pesado — Siempre que el Aberrante haga daño de combate a un jugador, destruye el artefacto o encantamiento objetivo que controla ese jugador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Mutante tiránido\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'526b56f9-f7a3-4ba9-a8cf-dc7507bd4397\', \'multiverseId\': 581228}, \'multiverseid\': 581228}, {\'name\': \'Aberrant\', \'text\': "Voracité (Cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle. Si X est supérieur ou égal à 5, piochez une carte quand elle arrive sur le champ de bataille.)\\nPiétinement\\nMarteau énergétique lourd — À chaque fois que l\'Aberrant inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, détruisez une cible, artefact ou enchantement, que ce joueur contrôle.", \'type\': \'Créature : tyranide et mutant\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581388&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc651b95-a7c6-48a2-b867-89bd3d932e48\', \'multiverseId\': 581388}, \'multiverseid\': 581388}, {\'name\': \'Aberrant\', \'text\': "Famelico (Questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia con X segnalini +1/+1. Se X è pari o superiore a 5, pesca una carta quando entra.)\\nTravolgere\\nMartello Potenziato Pesante — Ogniqualvolta l\'Aberrant infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, distruggi un artefatto o un incantesimo bersaglio controllato da quel giocatore.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mutante Tiranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581548&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3ca2c49-47c7-4153-9376-887f1324333d\', \'multiverseId\': 581548}, \'multiverseid\': 581548}, {\'name\': \'アベラント\', \'text\': \'貪欲（このクリーチャーは＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。Ｘが５以上であるなら、これが戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引く。）\\nトランプル\\nヘヴィパワーハンマー — アベラントがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしているアーティファクトやエンチャントのうち１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ティラニッド・ミュータント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581708&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad9cac68-1ed1-454f-96f6-c3de4378171e\', \'multiverseId\': 581708}, \'multiverseid\': 581708}, {\'name\': \'Aberrante\', \'text\': \'Voraz (Esta criatura entra no campo de batalha com X marcadores +1/+1. Se X for igual ou superior a 5, compre um card quando ela entrar.)\\nAtropelar\\nMartelo de Energia Pesado — Toda vez que Aberrante causar dano de combate a um jogador, destrua o artefato ou encantamento alvo que aquele jogador controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiranídeo Mutante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581868&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72de87d0-d194-4ac7-8e33-08fc68238d2f\', \'multiverseId\': 581868}, \'multiverseid\': 581868}, {\'name\': \'畸变体\', \'text\': \'贪食（此生物进战场时上面有X个+1/+1指示物。如果X等于或大于5，则当它进战场时抓一张牌。）\\n践踏\\n重型能量锤～每当畸变体对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，消灭目标由该牌手操控的神器或结界。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～泰伦虫族／突变体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582188&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df820978-5ac8-43d4-ac8d-4ec1f78e5e3a\', \'multiverseId\': 582188}, \'multiverseid\': 582188}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akolyth-Hybride\', \'text\': \'Schwerer Steinschneider — Immer wenn der Akolyth-Hybride angreift, zerstöre bis zu ein Artefakt deiner Wahl. Falls ein Artefakt auf diese Weise zerstört wird, zieht sein Beherrscher eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Tyranide, Mensch\', \'flavor\': \'Da die Akolythen zu offensichtliche Xenos sind, um sich in die menschliche Gesellschaft einzugliedern, treiben sie ihr Unwesen an dunklen Orten unter den Industriegebieten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581052&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac4a80b7-2ce9-4a91-83a0-180963fd7aba\', \'multiverseId\': 581052}, \'multiverseid\': 581052}, {\'name\': \'Híbrido Acólito\', \'text\': \'Cizalla pesada de roca — Siempre que el Híbrido Acólito ataque, destruye hasta un artefacto objetivo. Si un artefacto es destruido de esta manera, su controlador roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano tiránido\', \'flavor\': \'Los acólitos, que por su aspecto evidente de xenos no pueden camuflarse en la sociedad humana, rondan por lugares oscuros bajo las grandes zonas industriales.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581212&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52853011-9145-4030-a5e5-b63868d4f62f\', \'multiverseId\': 581212}, \'multiverseid\': 581212}, {\'name\': \'Hybride acolyte\', \'text\': "Cisaille lourde — À chaque fois que l\'Hybride acolyte attaque, détruisez jusqu\'à un artefact ciblé. Si un artefact est détruit de cette manière, son contrôleur pioche une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : tyranide et humain\', \'flavor\': \'De forme trop xénos pour se fondre dans la société humaine, les acolytes hantent les lieux sombres situés sous les complexes industriels.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581372&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a080559e-004c-430a-825a-5357fce53700\', \'multiverseId\': 581372}, \'multiverseid\': 581372}, {\'name\': \'Ibrido Accolito\', \'text\': "Spaccapietre Pesante — Ogniqualvolta l\'Ibrido Accolito attacca, distruggi fino a un artefatto bersaglio. Se un artefatto viene distrutto in questo modo, il suo controllore pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Umano Tiranide\', \'flavor\': \'Impossibilitati a mimetizzarsi nella società umana per il loro aspetto smaccatamente xeno, gli accoliti infestano gli angoli oscuri al di sotto delle distese industriali.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581532&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a6a49e4-dcf8-47ff-b9eb-f432a43e2201\', \'multiverseId\': 581532}, \'multiverseid\': 581532}, {\'name\': \'アコライト・ハイブリッド\', \'text\': \'ヘヴィロックカッター — アコライト・ハイブリッドが攻撃するたび、アーティファクト最大１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。これによりアーティファクトが破壊されたなら、それのコントローラーはカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ティラニッド・人間\', \'flavor\': \'人間社会に溶け込む上で、ゼノの姿かたちはあまりにもあからさま過ぎる。だから、アコライトは広大な工業地帯の地下の暗がりに巣食うのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a20a66b2-8b2e-45cd-9c5b-e54ca79227e2\', \'multiverseId\': 581692}, \'multiverseid\': 581692}, {\'name\': \'Híbrido Acólito\', \'text\': \'Corta-rochas Pesado — Toda vez que Híbrido Acólito atacar, destrua até um artefato alvo. Se um artefato for destruído dessa forma, seu controlador comprará um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiranídeo Humano\', \'flavor\': \'Os acólitos, incapacitados de se integrar na sociedade humana devido a sua aparência claramente xeno, assombram os lugares escuros sob as zonas industriais.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581852&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d502d17-86bd-4d08-993a-0539d21f8427\', \'multiverseId\': 581852}, \'multiverseid\': 581852}, {\'name\': \'混血信徒\', \'text\': \'重型切岩器～每当混血信徒攻击时，消灭至多一个目标神器。若以此法消灭了神器，则其操控者抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～泰伦虫族／人类\', \'flavor\': \'由于信徒的异形特征过于明显，难以融入人类社会，他们便盘踞在工业区底下的黑暗地带。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e12c822-3f44-4f48-96d6-b8bc7ca68c15\', \'multiverseId\': 582172}, \'multiverseid\': 582172}]', '[{\'name\': \'Albtraum\', \'text\': \'Lebensverknüpfung\\nLeichenfledderer — Wenn der Albtraum ins Spiel kommt, millst du drei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Necron\', \'flavor\': \'Wer verdächtigt wird, den Fluch eines Albtraums in sich zu tragen, wird kurzerhand verbannt, damit die Korruption nicht auf andere Necrons übergreift.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581016&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e07f143d-3891-4665-a213-87b9bc9a3812\', \'multiverseId\': 581016}, \'multiverseid\': 581016}, {\'name\': \'Desollador\', \'text\': \'Vínculo vital.\\nDesollador de carne — Cuando el Desollador entre al campo de batalla, muele tres cartas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Necrón\', \'flavor\': \'Los sospechosos de portar la maldición del desollador son desterrados sin contemplaciones para que la corrupción no se extienda a otros Necrones.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581176&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adc6ce54-8713-4967-a9ce-b9590a0ef643\', \'multiverseId\': 581176}, \'multiverseid\': 581176}, {\'name\': \'Dépeceur\', \'text\': \'Lien de vie\\nDépeceur de chair — Quand le Dépeceur arrive sur le champ de bataille, meulez trois cartes.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : nécron\', \'flavor\': "Quiconque est soupçonné d\'être porteur de la malédiction du dépeceur est banni sans sommation, pour éviter que la corruption s\'étende aux autres Nécrons.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581336&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0623de54-cda2-49e4-be6c-43b09757d700\', \'multiverseId\': 581336}, \'multiverseid\': 581336}, {\'name\': \'Scorticato\', \'text\': \'Legame vitale\\nScorticatore — Quando lo Scorticato entra nel campo di battaglia, macina tre carte.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Necron\', \'flavor\': \'Coloro che sono sospettati di portare la maledizione dello scorticatore vengono sommariamente banditi, per timore che la corruzione si diffonda ad altri Necron.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581496&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62c1a9aa-10ab-4b89-96b0-16e84a1a14ae\', \'multiverseId\': 581496}, \'multiverseid\': 581496}, {\'name\': \'フレイド・ワン\', \'text\': \'絆魂\\n肉を剥ぐもの — フレイド・ワンが戦場に出たとき、カード３枚を切削する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ネクロン\', \'flavor\': \'フレイヤーの呪いを保持していると疑われる者は、他のネクロンにその堕落が伝染しないためにも直ちに追放される。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581656&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ac41600-4a78-4e1c-a5ba-69d4bba8a52e\', \'multiverseId\': 581656}, \'multiverseid\': 581656}, {\'name\': \'Esfolado\', \'text\': \'Vínculo com a vida\\nEsfolador da Carne — Quando Esfolado entrar no campo de batalha, triture três cards.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Necron\', \'flavor\': \'Os suspeitos de portar a maldição do esfolador são sumariamente banidos para que a corrupção não se propague para outros necrons.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581816&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c4ece0e-3a76-4dd2-951f-94dfa2438641\', \'multiverseId\': 581816}, \'multiverseid\': 581816}, {\'name\': \'剥皮者\', \'text\': \'系命\\n剥离血肉～当剥皮者进战场时，磨三张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～太空死灵\', \'flavor\': \'怀疑身中剥皮诅咒者会被即刻逐放，以免将此等邪疫传染给其他太空死灵。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f47748af-3689-4084-9262-aa3d7735253b\', \'multiverseId\': 582136}, \'multiverseid\': 582136}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anrakyr der Reisende\', \'text\': \'Herr der pyrrhianischen Legionen — Immer wenn Anrakyr der Reisende angreift, kannst du einen Artefaktzauber aus deiner Hand oder deinem Friedhof wirken, indem du Lebenspunkte in Höhe seines Manabetrags bezahlst, anstatt seine Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Artefaktkreatur — Necron\', \'flavor\': \'„Auch wenn es eine Ewigkeit dauert, ich werde die unzähligen Dynastien wieder vereint sehen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581010&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0a50eff-25ff-4164-8439-ea36a7fa57e2\', \'multiverseId\': 581010}, \'multiverseid\': 581010}, {\'name\': \'Anrakyr, el Viajero\', \'text\': \'Señor de las Legiones Pyrrhianas — Siempre que Anrakyr, el Viajero ataque, puedes lanzar un hechizo de artefacto desde tu mano o cementerio pagando una cantidad de vidas igual a su valor de mana en lugar de pagar su coste de maná.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto legendaria — Necrón\', \'flavor\': \'"Aunque tarde una eternidad, veré a las innumerables dinastías unidas de nuevo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25d1bd15-d4ae-4f3d-a53e-421830c3ddbb\', \'multiverseId\': 581170}, \'multiverseid\': 581170}, {\'name\': \'Anrakyr le Voyageur\', \'text\': "Seigneur des Légions de Pyrrhia — À chaque fois qu\'Anrakyr le Voyageur attaque, vous pouvez lancer un sort d\'artefact depuis votre main ou votre cimetière en payant un nombre de points de vie égal à sa valeur de mana à la place de payer son coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact légendaire : nécron\', \'flavor\': \'« Même si cela prend une éternité, je verrai toutes les dynasties réunies une fois de plus. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581330&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48c1cafb-4af7-41f9-8038-b0fbd25e9863\', \'multiverseId\': 581330}, \'multiverseid\': 581330}, {\'name\': \'Anrakyr, il Viaggiatore\', \'text\': \'Signore delle Legioni di Pyrrhia — Ogniqualvolta Anrakyr, il Viaggiatore attacca, puoi lanciare una magia artefatto dalla tua mano o dal tuo cimitero pagando punti vita pari al suo valore di mana invece di pagare il suo costo di mana.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto Leggendaria — Necron\', \'flavor\': \'"Anche se potrebbe volerci un\\\'eternità, vedrò le miriadi di dinastie unite ancora una volta."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581490&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29d01038-bce0-49c7-8f97-823e8f47187a\', \'multiverseId\': 581490}, \'multiverseid\': 581490}, {\'name\': \'放浪者、アンラキール\', \'text\': \'ピリヤン兵団長 — 放浪者、アンラキールが攻撃するたび、あなたはあなたの手札や墓地からアーティファクト・呪文１つを、マナ・コストを支払うのではなくマナ総量に等しい点数のライフを支払って唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト・クリーチャー — ネクロン\', \'flavor\': \'「永遠にも思える年月をかけてでも、無数の王朝を再び統一させようぞ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f60336e-35cd-4097-8ab9-45dfd7da6718\', \'multiverseId\': 581650}, \'multiverseid\': 581650}, {\'name\': \'Anrakyr, o Viajante\', \'text\': \'Senhor das Legiões Pyrrhianas — Toda vez que Anrakyr, o Viajante, ataca, você pode conjurar uma mágica de artefato da sua mão ou do seu cemitério pagando uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual ao valor de mana dela, em vez de pagar seu custo de mana.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato Lendária — Necron\', \'flavor\': \'"Mesmo que leve uma eternidade, ainda verei as inúmeras dinastias unidas novamente."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581810&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2af4b8b1-fe30-4514-b361-7fbde0f2455c\', \'multiverseId\': 581810}, \'multiverseid\': 581810}, {\'name\': \'旅行者安拉克\', \'text\': \'派尔西亚军团领主～每当旅行者安拉克攻击时，你可以从你手上或你坟墓场中施放一个神器咒语，但须支付等同于其法术力值数量的生命，而不支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器生物 ～太空死灵\', \'flavor\': \'「虽然可能需历经永世岁月，我必将得见分裂王朝终归一统。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fda658c-a5c5-4155-87be-57ba37d69418\', \'multiverseId\': 582130}, \'multiverseid\': 582130}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arco-Flagellant\', \'text\': \'Trupp {2} (Als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken, kannst du beliebig oft {2} bezahlen. Wenn diese Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge entsprechend viele Spielsteine, die Kopien von ihr sind.)\\nDer Arco-Flagellant kann nicht blocken.\\nDuldsamer — Bezahle 3 Lebenspunkte: Der Arco-Flagellant erhält Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581011&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23ea2365-b644-4922-a80d-02e589c3ff0f\', \'multiverseId\': 581011}, \'multiverseid\': 581011}, {\'name\': \'Arcoflagelante\', \'text\': \'Escuadra {2}. (Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, puedes pagar {2} tantas veces como quieras. Cuando esta criatura entre al campo de batalla, crea esa cantidad de fichas que son copias de ella.)\\nEl Arcoflagelante no puede bloquear.\\nResiliente — Pagar 3 vidas: El Arcoflagelante gana la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cbdc4d2-8a4c-4d87-a421-ef46882b48a2\', \'multiverseId\': 581171}, \'multiverseid\': 581171}, {\'name\': \'Arco-flagellant\', \'text\': "Escouade {2} (En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, vous pouvez payer {2} autant de fois que vous le souhaitez. Quand cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez autant de jetons qui en sont des copies.)\\nL\'Arco-flagellant ne peut pas bloquer.\\nEndurant — Payez 3 points de vie : L\'Arco-flagellant acquiert l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581331&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5af7fb6b-3173-40d5-9279-2d0bb3eb43d7\', \'multiverseId\': 581331}, \'multiverseid\': 581331}, {\'name\': \'Arcoflagellante\', \'text\': "Squadra {2} (Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, puoi pagare {2} un qualsiasi numero di volte. Quando questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia, crea altrettante pedine che sono sue copie.)\\nL\'Arcoflagellante non può bloccare.\\nPerseverante — Paga 3 punti vita: L\'Arcoflagellante ha indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581491&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab92a663-24f7-4320-a6fe-34e9b2fe03bf\', \'multiverseId\': 581491}, \'multiverseid\': 581491}, {\'name\': \'特級贖罪者\', \'text\': \'分隊{2}（この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、あなたは望む回数の{2}を支払ってもよい。このクリーチャーが戦場に出たとき、その回数に等しい数の、これのコピーであるトークンを生成する。）\\n特級贖罪者ではブロックできない。\\nエンデュラント — ３点のライフを支払う：ターン終了時まで、特級贖罪者は破壊不能を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581651&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d716b077-7eb6-4e2e-bb3c-ea21f2abfdf9\', \'multiverseId\': 581651}, \'multiverseid\': 581651}, {\'name\': \'Arco-flagelante\', \'text\': \'Esquadrão {2} (Como custo adicional para conjurar esta mágica, você pode pagar {2} qualquer número de vezes. Quando esta criatura entrar no campo de batalha, crie aquela quantidade de fichas que sejam cópias dela.)\\nArco-flagelante não pode bloquear.\\nTenaz — Pague 3 pontos de vida: Arco-flagelante ganha indestrutível até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581811&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef6960f6-d4ce-40f1-b69b-7baa837d76a8\', \'multiverseId\': 581811}, \'multiverseid\': 581811}, {\'name\': \'深孽苦修者\', \'text\': \'小队{2}（你可以支付{2}任意次数，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。当此生物进战场时，派出等量为其复制品的衍生物。）\\n深孽苦修者不能进行阻挡。\\n坚忍者～支付3点生命：深孽苦修者获得不灭异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d0c06f3-bf00-4338-b2bf-8d11c1f07942\', \'multiverseId\': 582131}, \'multiverseid\': 582131}]', "[{'name': 'Atalan-Schakal', 'text': 'Verursacht Trampelschaden, Eile\\nAusgebildeter Excursor — Immer wenn der Atalan-Schakal einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, sie getappt ins Spiel bringen und danach mischen.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Tyranide, Späher', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581087&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c554aee4-cbd5-4770-9170-b0bc8528b629', 'multiverseId': 581087}, 'multiverseid': 581087}, {'name': 'Chacal Atalano', 'text': 'Arrolla, prisa.\\nIncursor hábil — Siempre que el Chacal Atalano haga daño de combate a un jugador, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, ponerla en el campo de batalla girada y luego barajar.', 'type': 'Criatura — Explorador tiránido humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581247&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ad5c9d39-4dfd-4b1f-ad37-4d2d1c14c958', 'multiverseId': 581247}, 'multiverseid': 581247}, {'name': 'Chacal Atalan', 'text': 'Piétinement, célérité\\nÉclaireur accompli — À chaque fois que le Chacal Atalan inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, la mettre sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélanger.', 'type': 'Créature : humain et tyranide et éclaireur', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581407&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '29ff4094-7490-4bd5-90e9-d54b770a6169', 'multiverseId': 581407}, 'multiverseid': 581407}, {'name': 'Sciacallo Atalan', 'text': 'Travolgere, rapidità\\nMotociclista Esperto — Ogniqualvolta lo Sciacallo Atalan infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, metterla sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescolare.', 'type': 'Creatura — Esploratore Tiranide Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581567&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0b94bdcc-23f0-4826-91ac-aec5942d47a0', 'multiverseId': 581567}, 'multiverseid': 581567}, {'name': 'アタラン・ジャッカル', 'text': 'トランプル、速攻\\n熟練のアウトライダー — アタラン・ジャッカルがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ティラニッド・スカウト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581727&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '45d294f3-59ad-47dc-93f1-228b750c15f4', 'multiverseId': 581727}, 'multiverseid': 581727}, {'name': 'Chacal de Atalan', 'text': 'Atropelar, ímpeto\\nVanguardeiro Habilidoso — Toda vez que Chacal de Atalan causa dano de combate a um jogador, você pode procurar em seu grimório um card de terreno básico, colocá-lo no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhar.', 'type': 'Criatura — Humano Tiranídeo Batedor', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581887&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ac61a012-ed1f-434f-8dd5-e509112040f5', 'multiverseId': 581887}, 'multiverseid': 581887}, {'name': '阿塔兰豺狼摩托手', 'text': '践踏，敏捷\\n熟练骑手～每当阿塔兰豺狼摩托手对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，你可以从你牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，将之横置放进战场，然后洗牌。', 'type': '生物 ～人类／泰伦虫族／斥候', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582207&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5e25daa6-3798-4a91-9e13-ca605e7d5644', 'multiverseId': 582207}, 'multiverseid': 582207}]", '[{\'name\': \'Aufstrebender Champion\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich\\nVerdorbener Aufstieg — Wenn der Aufstrebende Champion einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, opfere ihn. Falls du dies tust, decke Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek auf, bis du eine Kreaturenkarte aufdeckst. Bringe sie ins Spiel und mische dann den Rest in deine Bibliothek. Falls jene Kreatur ein Dämon ist, fügt sie jedem Gegner Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Astartes, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581053&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38757685-6cc2-4b56-ad12-03c607fa99fc\', \'multiverseId\': 581053}, \'multiverseid\': 581053}, {\'name\': \'Aspirante a Campeón\', \'text\': \'Amenaza.\\nAscensión ruinosa — Cuando el Aspirante a Campeón haga daño de combate a un jugador, sacrifícalo. Si lo haces, muestra las primeras cartas de tu biblioteca hasta que muestres una carta de criatura. Pon esa carta en el campo de batalla, luego baraja el resto en tu biblioteca. Si esa criatura es un Demonio, hace una cantidad de daño igual a su fuerza a cada oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero astartes\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581213&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53aa3b43-925d-4910-999c-032cbd9b390d\', \'multiverseId\': 581213}, \'multiverseid\': 581213}, {\'name\': \'Aspirant champion\', \'text\': "Menace\\nAscension destructrice — Quand l\'Aspirant champion inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, sacrifiez-le. Si vous faites ainsi, révélez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous révéliez une carte de créature. Mettez cette carte sur le champ de bataille, puis mélangez le reste dans votre bibliothèque. Si cette créature est un démon, elle inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à chaque adversaire.", \'type\': \'Créature : astartes et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581373&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d00cb663-0864-48e7-95f7-0d46e29f8538\', \'multiverseId\': 581373}, \'multiverseid\': 581373}, {\'name\': \'Aspirante Campione\', \'text\': "Minacciare\\nAscensione Maledetta — Quando l\'Aspirante Campione infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, sacrificalo. Se lo fai, rivela carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non riveli una carta creatura. Metti quella carta sul campo di battaglia, poi rimescola le altre nel tuo grimorio. Se quella creatura è un Demone, infligge danno pari alla sua forza a ogni avversario.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Astartes\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4558e280-bd12-41e5-9949-793fa25684ea\', \'multiverseId\': 581533}, \'multiverseid\': 581533}, {\'name\': \'アスパイアリング・チャンピオン\', \'text\': \'威迫\\n禍つ昇天 — アスパイアリング・チャンピオンがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えたとき、これを生け贄に捧げる。そうしたなら、クリーチャー・カード１枚が公開されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ公開していく。そのカードを戦場に出し、その後、残りをあなたのライブラリーに加えて切り直す。そのクリーチャーがデーモンであるなら、それは各対戦相手に、それぞれそれのパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — アスタルテス・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581693&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'faf6783c-0977-4fe9-ab7b-a9bf9cd2b0b0\', \'multiverseId\': 581693}, \'multiverseid\': 581693}, {\'name\': \'Aspirante a Campeão\', \'text\': \'Ameaçar\\nAscensão Ruinosa — Quando Aspirante a Campeão causar dano de combate a um jogador, sacrifique-o. Se fizer isso, revele cards do topo de seu grimório até revelar um card de criatura. Coloque aquele card no campo de batalha e depois embaralhe o restante em seu grimório. Se aquela criatura for um Demônio, ela causará a cada oponente dano igual ao próprio poder.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Astartes Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0030344-69ed-4c8a-9ba7-04d048156589\', \'multiverseId\': 581853}, \'multiverseid\': 581853}, {\'name\': \'野心勇士\', \'text\': \'威慑\\n敬从毁灭～当野心勇士对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，将它牺牲。若你如此作，则从你的牌库顶开始展示牌，直到展示出一张生物牌为止。将该牌放进战场，其余则洗入你的牌库。如果该生物是恶魔，则它向每位对手各造成等同于其力量的伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～阿斯塔特／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71e70394-6865-41ad-8163-09c237c16460\', \'multiverseId\': 582173}, \'multiverseid\': 582173}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aus der Gruft\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments legst du zwei Äonenmarken auf Aus der Gruft und millst dann so viele Karten, wie Äonenmarken darauf liegen.\\nFalls du eine Karte ziehen würdest, während deine Bibliothek keine Karten enthält, bringe stattdessen eine Kreaturenkarte aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Falls du das nicht kannst, verlierst du die Partie.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581028&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'066dbafd-370d-4573-9aa9-8c2baf11ba97\', \'multiverseId\': 581028}, \'multiverseid\': 581028}, {\'name\': \'Surgir de las Necrópolis\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, pon dos contadores de eones sobre Surgir de las Necrópolis y luego muele una cantidad de cartas igual a la cantidad de contadores de eones sobre este permanente.\\nSi fueras a robar una carta mientras tu biblioteca no tiene cartas, en vez de eso, regresa una carta de criatura de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Si no puedes, pierdes el juego.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581188&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90f0fe91-6a66-4c67-a3f9-e6a4d4452211\', \'multiverseId\': 581188}, \'multiverseid\': 581188}, {\'name\': \'Sortie des nécropoles\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, mettez deux marqueurs « éon » sur la Sortie des nécropoles, puis meulez un nombre de cartes égal au nombre de marqueurs « éon » sur elle.\\nSi vous deviez piocher une carte pendant que votre bibliothèque ne contient aucune carte, à la place renvoyez sur le champ de bataille une carte de créature depuis votre cimetière. Si vous ne pouvez pas le faire, vous perdez la partie.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581348&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f281c66b-b185-4353-a799-cd0ea0c1a692\', \'multiverseId\': 581348}, \'multiverseid\': 581348}, {\'name\': \'Fuori dalle Tombe\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, metti due segnalini eternità su Fuori dalle Tombe, poi macina carte pari al numero di segnalini eternità su di esso.\\nSe stai per pescare una carta mentre il tuo grimorio è vuoto, rimetti invece sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura dal tuo cimitero. Se non puoi farlo, perdi la partita.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581508&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad1fdccd-53ea-4001-a3c1-cde5344bea51\', \'multiverseId\': 581508}, \'multiverseid\': 581508}, {\'name\': \'墳墓からの脱出\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、墳墓からの脱出の上に永劫カウンター２個を置き、その後、これの上にある永劫カウンターの個数に等しい枚数のカードを切削する。\\nあなたがあなたのライブラリーにカードがない状態でカードを引くなら、代わりにあなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を戦場に戻す。そうできないなら、あなたはこのゲームに敗北する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b0bf848-338d-4e90-961b-33b823afee9a\', \'multiverseId\': 581668}, \'multiverseid\': 581668}, {\'name\': \'Sair das Tumbas\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, coloque dois marcadores de era em Sair das Tumbas, depois triture uma quantidade de cards igual ao número de marcadores de era nele.\\nSe você compraria um card de seu grimório vazio, em vez disso, devolva um card de criatura de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha. Se não puder fazer isso, você perderá o jogo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581828&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d210fca-6dcf-4c4f-a90c-853f0f1d3a31\', \'multiverseId\': 581828}, \'multiverseid\': 581828}, {\'name\': \'古墓苏生\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，在古墓苏生上放置两个亘古指示物，然后磨若干牌，其数量等同于其上的亘古指示物数量。\\n如果你将抓一张牌但牌库没有牌，则改为将一张生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。若你无法如此作，则你输掉这盘游戏。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582148&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fee33156-e42f-4a28-909e-c5a57b2074b0\', \'multiverseId\': 582148}, \'multiverseid\': 582148}]', '[{\'name\': \'Belisarius Cawl\', \'text\': \'Ultima-Gründung — {T}, tappe zwei ungetappte Artefakte, die du kontrollierst: Erzeuge einen 2/2 weißen Astartes-Krieger-Kreaturenspielstein mit Wachsamkeit.\\nMeister der Maschinen — {T}, tappe X ungetappte Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst: Schaue dir die obersten X Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst davon eine Artefaktkarte offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen. Lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Artefaktkreatur — Mensch\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581088&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0932ee5f-c9ca-475a-8d18-429498f6718f\', \'multiverseId\': 581088}, \'multiverseid\': 581088}, {\'name\': \'Belisarius Cawl\', \'text\': \'Fundación Ultima — {T}, girar dos artefactos enderezados que controlas: Crea una ficha de criatura Guerrero Astartes blanca 2/2 con la habilidad de vigilancia.\\nMaestro de las máquinas — {T}, girar X criaturas enderezadas que controlas: Mira las X primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes mostrar una carta de artefacto de entre ellas y ponerla en tu mano. Pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto legendaria — Humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9bff71c-0b3e-48d7-99fb-0452d1d9256a\', \'multiverseId\': 581248}, \'multiverseid\': 581248}, {\'name\': \'Belisarius Cawl\', \'text\': "Fondation Ultima — {T}, engagez deux artefacts dégagés que vous contrôlez : Créez un jeton de créature 2/2 blanche Astartes et Guerrier avec la vigilance.\\nMaître des machines — {T}, engagez X créatures dégagées que vous contrôlez : Regardez les X cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez révéler une carte d\'artefact parmi elles et la mettre dans votre main. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact légendaire : humain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581408&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9318dba0-6244-4a37-92a8-f003251b1591\', \'multiverseId\': 581408}, \'multiverseid\': 581408}, {\'name\': \'Belisarius Cawl\', \'text\': \'Fondazione Ultima — {T}, TAPpa due artefatti STAPpati che controlli: Crea una pedina creatura Guerriero Astartes 2/2 bianca con cautela.\\nSignore delle Macchine — {T}, TAPpa X creature STAPpate che controlli: Guarda le prime X carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi rivelare una carta artefatto scelta tra esse e aggiungerla alla tua mano. Metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto Leggendaria — Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56243657-eb2d-419c-9a3c-e006bedf8fe6\', \'multiverseId\': 581568}, \'multiverseid\': 581568}, {\'name\': \'ベリサリウス・カウル\', \'text\': \'極限期創設 — {T},あなたがコントロールしているアンタップ状態のアーティファクト２つをタップする：警戒を持つ白の２/２のアスタルテス・戦士・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nマスター・オブ・マシーン — {T},あなたがコントロールしているアンタップ状態のクリーチャーＸ体をタップする：あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカードＸ枚を見る。あなたは「その中からアーティファクト・カード１枚を公開してあなたの手札に加える。」を選んでもよい。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト・クリーチャー — 人間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581728&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'850eef25-711e-4632-aed6-65b3b70635ae\', \'multiverseId\': 581728}, \'multiverseid\': 581728}, {\'name\': \'Belisarius Cawl\', \'text\': \'Fundação Última — {T}, vire dois artefatos desvirados que você controla: Crie uma ficha de criatura Astartes Guerreiro branca 2/2 com vigilância.\\nMestre das Máquinas — {T}, vire X criaturas desviradas que você controla: Olhe os X cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode revelar um card de artefato dentre eles e colocá-lo em sua mão. Coloque o restante no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato Lendária — Humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a862899-690d-45f8-9443-c2ecacabef27\', \'multiverseId\': 581888}, \'multiverseid\': 581888}, {\'name\': \'贝利萨留斯·考尔\', \'text\': \'极限建军～{T}，横置两个由你操控且未横置的神器：派出一个2/2白色，具警戒异能的阿斯塔特／战士衍生生物。\\n机器之主～{T}，横置X个由你操控且未横置的生物：检视你牌库顶的X张牌。你可以展示其中一张神器牌，并将它置于你手上。将其余的牌以随机顺序置于你牌库底。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器生物 ～人类\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582208&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26e8f67f-88da-45d4-8294-2000fea31a65\', \'multiverseId\': 582208}, \'multiverseid\': 582208}]', '[{\'name\': \'Biophagus\', \'text\': \'Genomische Verbesserung — {T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe. Falls dieses Mana ausgegeben wird, um einen Kreaturenzauber zu wirken, kommt die Kreatur mit einer zusätzlichen +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Tyranide, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir garantieren dir, dass du dich innerhalb einer Woche wie ein neuer Mensch fühlen wirst."\\n—Galaxos Klynesmith, Biophagus\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581069&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8350537d-c8e5-4e90-945c-be11ef916d3b\', \'multiverseId\': 581069}, \'multiverseid\': 581069}, {\'name\': \'Biófago\', \'text\': \'Mejora genómica — {T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color. Si ese maná se usa para lanzar un hechizo de criatura, esa criatura entra al campo de batalla con un contador +1/+1 adicional sobre ella.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero tiránido humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Te garantizamos que en menos de una semana te sentirás como un hombre nuevo".\\n—Galaxos Klynesmith, biófago\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581229&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e10b405-a83a-465e-9f7f-5426ac85dd8d\', \'multiverseId\': 581229}, \'multiverseid\': 581229}, {\'name\': \'Biophagus\', \'text\': \'Amélioration génomique — {T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. Si ce mana est dépensé pour lancer un sort de créature, cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur +1/+1 supplémentaire sur elle.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et tyranide et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Nous vous garantissons qu\'en moins d\'une semaine, vous serez un nouvel homme. »\\n—Galaxos Klynesmith, biophagus", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581389&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d52bd72f-e32b-426e-b389-653e13627afb\', \'multiverseId\': 581389}, \'multiverseid\': 581389}, {\'name\': \'Biophagus\', \'text\': \'Miglioria Genomica — {T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore. Se questo mana viene speso per lanciare una magia creatura, quella creatura entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1 addizionale.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Tiranide Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Hai la nostra garanzia che, entro una settimana, ti sentirai un uomo nuovo."\\n—Galaxos Klynesmith, biophagus\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581549&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dddab653-6dc3-4de6-9989-39dd4209de42\', \'multiverseId\': 581549}, \'multiverseid\': 581549}, {\'name\': \'バイオファガス\', \'text\': \'ゲノム強化 — {T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。このマナがクリーチャー・呪文を唱えるために支払われたなら、そのクリーチャーは追加で＋１/＋１カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ティラニッド・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「一週間もしないうちに生まれ変わったような気分になることを保証しよう。」\\n――バイオファガス、ギャラクソス・クラインスミス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581709&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fb75927-908a-4bce-960b-7ce226553da4\', \'multiverseId\': 581709}, \'multiverseid\': 581709}, {\'name\': \'Biófago\', \'text\': \'Aperfeiçoamento Genômico — {T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor. Se este mana for gasto para conjurar uma mágica de criatura, aquela criatura entra no campo de batalha com um marcador +1/+1 adicional.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Tiranídeo Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Garantimos que em uma semana você se sentirá um novo homem."\\n— Galaxos Klynesmith, biófago\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581869&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db720194-cdee-481f-8f28-565536862fd6\', \'multiverseId\': 581869}, \'multiverseid\': 581869}, {\'name\': \'生物噬变师\', \'text\': \'基因增强～{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。如果该法术力用来施放生物咒语，则该生物进战场时上面额外有一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／泰伦虫族／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「我们保证，要不了一周你就能脱胎换骨。」\\n～生物噬变师加拉索斯·克莱斯密\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582189&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77f5bd15-f46b-4062-9caf-45b58b8422f8\', \'multiverseId\': 582189}, \'multiverseid\': 582189}]', '[{\'name\': \'Biotransfer\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, sind zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen Artefakte. Dasselbe gilt für Kreaturenzauber, die du kontrollierst, und Kreaturenkarten, die du besitzt und die nicht im Spiel sind.\\nImmer wenn du einen Artefaktzauber wirkst, verlierst du 1 Lebenspunkt und erzeugst einen 2/2 schwarzen Necron-Krieger-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581012&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'096dc58e-ab94-40db-91b3-603626ac8c3d\', \'multiverseId\': 581012}, \'multiverseid\': 581012}, {\'name\': \'Biotransferencia\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que controlas son artefactos además de sus otros tipos. Lo mismo sucede con los hechizos de criatura que controlas y con las cartas de criatura de las que eres propietario que no están en el campo de batalla.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo de artefacto, pierdes 1 vida y creas una ficha de criatura artefacto Guerrero Necrón negra 2/2.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5839f98b-30ae-4218-b35a-108ba076a435\', \'multiverseId\': 581172}, \'multiverseid\': 581172}, {\'name\': \'Biotransfert\', \'text\': "Les créatures que vous contrôlez sont des artefacts en plus de leurs autres types. C\'est vrai aussi pour les sorts de créature que vous contrôlez et les cartes de créature que vous possédez qui ne sont pas sur le champ de bataille.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'artefact, vous perdez 1 point de vie et vous créez un jeton de créature-artefact 2/2 noire Nécron et Guerrier.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581332&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61a018ae-fad7-41ba-a4e4-00b341e3bc36\', \'multiverseId\': 581332}, \'multiverseid\': 581332}, {\'name\': \'Biotrasferimento\', \'text\': \'Le creature che controlli sono artefatti in aggiunta ai loro altri tipi. Lo stesso vale per le magie creatura che controlli e le carte creatura che possiedi e che non sono sul campo di battaglia.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia artefatto, perdi 1 punto vita e crei una pedina creatura artefatto Guerriero Necron 2/2 nera.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581492&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed22ea83-5398-4ce8-8942-31a82cfdbf86\', \'multiverseId\': 581492}, \'multiverseid\': 581492}, {\'name\': \'生体転移\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーはそれぞれ、それの他のタイプに加えてアーティファクトでもある。あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャー・呪文と、あなたがオーナーであり戦場にないすべてのクリーチャー・カードについても同様である。\\nあなたがアーティファクト・呪文を唱えるたび、あなたは１点のライフを失い、黒の２/２のネクロン・戦士・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581652&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acde9af8-c9e1-4388-8c30-87f74a2178ce\', \'multiverseId\': 581652}, \'multiverseid\': 581652}, {\'name\': \'Biotransferência\', \'text\': \'As criaturas que você controla são artefatos além de seus outros tipos. O mesmo vale para mágicas de criatura que você controla e cards de criatura seus que não estejam no campo de batalha.\\nToda vez que você conjura uma mágica de artefato, você perde 1 ponto de vida e cria uma ficha de criatura artefato Necron Guerreiro preta 2/2.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581812&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ad491d0-8a14-4921-9cbd-529e527a7e7c\', \'multiverseId\': 581812}, \'multiverseid\': 581812}, {\'name\': \'生物质转化\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物额外具有神器此类别。由你操控的生物咒语和由你拥有且不在战场上的生物牌也是如此。\\n每当你施放神器咒语时，你失去1点生命并派出一个2/2黑色太空死灵／战士衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2eaf14e-7ff4-458a-9536-1d52005330d8\', \'multiverseId\': 582132}, \'multiverseid\': 582132}]', "[{'name': 'Blut für den Blutgott!', 'text': 'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jede Kreatur, die in diesem Zug gestorben ist, {1} weniger.\\nWirf deine Hand ab und ziehe dann acht Karten. Blut für den Blutgott fügt jedem Gegner 8 Schadenspunkte zu. Schicke Blut für den Blutgott ins Exil.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Schädel für den Schädelthron.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581090&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cc836c5b-12e6-4cec-8ddd-ffacbd730b46', 'multiverseId': 581090}, 'multiverseid': 581090}, {'name': '¡Sangre para el Dios de la Sangre!', 'text': 'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar este hechizo por cada criatura que murió este turno.\\nDescarta tu mano, luego roba ocho cartas. ¡Sangre para el Dios de la Sangre hace 8 puntos de daño a cada oponente. Exilia ¡Sangre para el Dios de la Sangre', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'Cráneos para el Trono de Cráneos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581250&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1cad1674-8340-46a2-b3fe-d4f485dc19da', 'multiverseId': 581250}, 'multiverseid': 581250}, {'name': 'Du sang pour le dieu du Sang !', 'text': 'Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque créature qui est morte ce tour-ci.\\nDéfaussez-vous de votre main, puis piochez huit cartes. Du sang pour le dieu du Sang inflige 8 blessures à chaque adversaire. Exilez Du sang pour le dieu du Sang', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Des crânes pour le Trône des Crânes.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581410&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '15e3dd3e-a5aa-48ac-963f-54cec80a0a1f', 'multiverseId': 581410}, 'multiverseid': 581410}, {'name': 'Sangue per il Dio del Sangue!', 'text': 'Questa magia costa {1} in meno per essere lanciata per ogni creatura morta in questo turno.\\nScarta la tua mano, poi pesca otto carte. Sangue per il Dio del Sangue infligge 8 danni a ogni avversario. Esilia Sangue per il Dio del Sangue', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'Teschi per il Trono di Teschi.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581570&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8a395357-35c5-46f2-92d6-c0c05f55a9f3', 'multiverseId': 581570}, 'multiverseid': 581570}, {'name': '血の神に血を捧げよ！', 'text': 'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、このターンに死亡したクリーチャー１体につき{1}少なくなる。\\nあなたの手札を捨て、その後、カード８枚を引く。血の神に血を捧げよ！は各対戦相手にそれぞれ８点のダメージを与える。血の神に血を捧げよ！を追放する。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '髑髏の王座に髑髏を。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581730&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b4f11647-5374-403f-bb88-aed85e835a7b', 'multiverseId': 581730}, 'multiverseid': 581730}, {'name': 'Sangue Para O Deus Do Sangue!', 'text': 'Esta mágica custa {1} a menos para ser conjurada para cada criatura que morreu neste turno.\\nDescarte sua mão e depois compre oito cards. Sangue Para O Deus Do Sangue causa 8 pontos de dano a cada oponente. Exile Sangue Para O Deus Do Sangue.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': 'Caveiras para o Trono das Caveiras.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581890&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fc93de87-24be-4f2f-a35b-2c2b67b692ff', 'multiverseId': 581890}, 'multiverseid': 581890}, {'name': '血祭血神！', 'text': '本回合中每有一个生物死去，此咒语便减少{1}来施放。\\n弃掉你的手牌，然后抓八张牌。血祭血神！向每位对手各造成8点伤害。放逐血祭血神！', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '颅献颅座。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582210&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1202f46d-ffd4-49be-8c0f-4d562fc91738', 'multiverseId': 582210}, 'multiverseid': 582210}]", '[{\'name\': \'Blutdämon\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, verursacht Trampelschaden\\nImmer wenn der Blutdämon einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, enttappe ihn. Nach dieser Kampfphase gibt es eine zusätzliche Kampfphase.\\nDer Blutdämon kann keinen Spieler angreifen, den er in diesem Zug bereits angegriffen hat.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581055&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'058e4255-4e6a-415c-be74-48b081f7441d\', \'multiverseId\': 581055}, \'multiverseid\': 581055}, {\'name\': \'Devorador de Almas\', \'text\': \'Vuela, arrolla.\\nSiempre que el Devorador de Almas haga daño de combate a un jugador, enderézalo. Después de esta fase de combate, hay una fase de combate adicional.\\nEl Devorador de Almas no puede atacar a un jugador al que ya atacó este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581215&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a86bab4f-6d6c-458e-b114-c2cd4fdf67bd\', \'multiverseId\': 581215}, \'multiverseid\': 581215}, {\'name\': \'Buveur de sang\', \'text\': "Vol, piétinement\\nÀ chaque fois que le Buveur de sang inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, dégagez-le. Cette phase de combat est suivie d\'une phase de combat supplémentaire.\\nLe Buveur de sang ne peut pas attaquer un joueur qu\'il a déjà attaqué ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature : démon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581375&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68ecf96f-15bf-4454-b2ad-0ec1b948c641\', \'multiverseId\': 581375}, \'multiverseid\': 581375}, {\'name\': \'Assetato di Sangue\', \'text\': "Volare, travolgere\\nOgniqualvolta l\'Assetato di Sangue infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, STAPpalo. Dopo questa fase di combattimento, c\'è una fase di combattimento addizionale.\\nL\'Assetato di Sangue non può attaccare un giocatore che ha già attaccato in questo turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5da611ad-3586-49db-924d-7f602485b9cc\', \'multiverseId\': 581535}, \'multiverseid\': 581535}, {\'name\': \'ブラッドサースター\', \'text\': \'飛行、トランプル\\nブラッドサースターがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、これをアンタップする。この戦闘フェイズの後に、追加の戦闘フェイズ１つを加える。\\nブラッドサースターでは、これがすでにこのターンに攻撃したプレイヤーを攻撃できない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee7d9fee-12b9-4804-83f6-e6f8aee72188\', \'multiverseId\': 581695}, \'multiverseid\': 581695}, {\'name\': \'Sedento de Sangue\', \'text\': \'Voar, atropelar\\nToda vez que Sedento de Sangue causar dano de combate a um jogador, desvire-o. Depois dessa fase de combate, há uma fase de combate adicional.\\nSedento de Sangue não pode atacar um jogador que ele já tenha atacado neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demônio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581855&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d429ac9a-8d84-4178-87e9-1d18eb5f266c\', \'multiverseId\': 581855}, \'multiverseid\': 581855}, {\'name\': \'嗜血魔\', \'text\': \'飞行，践踏\\n每当嗜血魔对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，将它重置。在此战斗阶段后，额外多出一个战斗阶段。\\n嗜血魔不能攻击它本回合中攻击过的牌手。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～恶魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60de017f-10f8-4786-b235-a151ef349ea5\', \'multiverseId\': 582175}, \'multiverseid\': 582175}]', '[{\'name\': \'Callidus-Assassine\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nPolymorphin — Du kannst die Callidus-Assassine getappt als Kopie einer beliebigen Kreatur im Spiel ins Spiel kommen lassen, außer dass sie „Wenn diese Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, zerstöre bis zu eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl mit demselben Namen wie diese Kreatur" hat.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Gestaltwandler, Assassine\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581091&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa884de2-ea6e-4a4d-a2f7-2c45205ec6e1\', \'multiverseId\': 581091}, \'multiverseid\': 581091}, {\'name\': \'Asesina Callidus\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nPolimorfina — Puedes hacer que la Asesina Callidus entre al campo de batalla girada como una copia de cualquier criatura en el campo de batalla, excepto que tiene "Cuando esta criatura entre al campo de batalla, destruye hasta otra criatura objetivo con el mismo nombre que esta criatura".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Asesino metamorfo humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82648f82-21d6-45c3-842b-16a1c2d80b87\', \'multiverseId\': 581251}, \'multiverseid\': 581251}, {\'name\': \'Assassin Callidus\', \'text\': "Flash\\nPolymorphine — Vous pouvez faire que l\'Assassin Callidus arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé comme une copie de n\'importe quelle créature sur le champ de bataille, excepté qu\'il a « Quand cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, détruisez jusqu\'à une autre créature ciblée ayant le même nom que cette créature. »", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et changeforme et assassin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581411&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'665130be-92e5-4d56-bf38-90a587ae09fa\', \'multiverseId\': 581411}, \'multiverseid\': 581411}, {\'name\': \'Assassina Callidus\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nPolimorfina — Puoi far entrare l\\\'Assassina Callidus nel campo di battaglia TAPpata come una copia di qualsiasi creatura sul campo di battaglia, tranne che ha "Quando questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia, distruggi fino a un\\\'altra creatura bersaglio con lo stesso nome di questa creatura".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Assassino Polimorfo Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e932e6db-e7a3-4e9d-98d7-0111deecf5b7\', \'multiverseId\': 581571}, \'multiverseid\': 581571}, {\'name\': \'キャリダス・アサシン\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n変身薬 — あなたはキャリダス・アサシンを、これが「このクリーチャーが戦場に出たとき、このクリーチャーと同じ名前を持ちこれでないクリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。」を持つことを除いて、戦場にあるクリーチャー１体のコピーとしてタップ状態で戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・多相の戦士・暗殺者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581731&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8503263-fd7a-4bbe-b9d6-8c96f9162327\', \'multiverseId\': 581731}, \'multiverseid\': 581731}, {\'name\': \'Assassina Callidus\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nPolimorfina — Você pode fazer com que Assassina Callidus entre no campo de batalha virada como cópia de qualquer criatura no campo de batalha, exceto por ter "Quando esta criatura entrar no campo de batalha, destrua até uma outra criatura alvo com o mesmo nome que esta criatura".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Metamorfo Assassino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581891&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e149030-3ee0-496b-b8d9-4177bd8f9ee5\', \'multiverseId\': 581891}, \'multiverseid\': 581891}, {\'name\': \'卡利都司刺客\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n多态啡～你可以使卡利都司刺客当成战场上任一生物的复制品来横置进入战场，但它具有「当此生物进战场时，消灭至多另一个目标与此生物同名的生物。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／变形兽／杀手\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582211&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a488e39d-6b1a-4aca-bed3-a7667d6da416\', \'multiverseId\': 582211}, \'multiverseid\': 582211}]', '[{\'name\': \'Celestine, die Lebende Heilige\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Lebensverknüpfung\\nHeilende Tränen — Zu Beginn deines Endsegments bringst du eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag X oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof in Spiel zurück, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Lebenspunkten ist, die du in diesem Zug dazuerhalten hast.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=580992&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ff7c3f4-25e9-45c4-a149-5909336e0482\', \'multiverseId\': 580992}, \'multiverseid\': 580992}, {\'name\': \'Celestine, la Santa en Vida\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vínculo vital.\\nLágrimas curativas — Al comienzo de tu paso final, regresa la carta de criatura objetivo con valor de maná de X o menos de tu cementerio al campo de batalla, donde X es la cantidad de vidas que ganaste este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581152&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2074316b-4f4a-4d1d-8296-8411df913f89\', \'multiverseId\': 581152}, \'multiverseid\': 581152}, {\'name\': \'Célestine, la Sainte vivante\', \'text\': \'Vol, lien de vie\\nLarmes guérisseuses — Au début de votre étape de fin, renvoyez sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière une carte de créature ciblée avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à X, X étant le nombre de points de vie que vous avez gagnés ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581312&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1e3eb44-7131-468e-948c-5af291e0c7a7\', \'multiverseId\': 581312}, \'multiverseid\': 581312}, {\'name\': \'Celestine, la Santa Vivente\', \'text\': "Volare, legame vitale\\nLacrime Guaritrici — All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, rimetti sul campo di battaglia dal tuo cimitero una carta creatura bersaglio con valore di mana pari o inferiore a X, dove X sono i punti vita che hai guadagnato in questo turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581472&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dec2e502-f4a1-4709-b60c-9939769fac8c\', \'multiverseId\': 581472}, \'multiverseid\': 581472}, {\'name\': \'生ける聖人、セレスティン\', \'text\': \'飛行、絆魂\\n癒しの涙 — あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたの墓地にありマナ総量がＸ以下であるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それを戦場に戻す。Ｘはこのターンにあなたが得たライフの点数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93a53d96-8e7d-4099-b204-9620cc3017f3\', \'multiverseId\': 581632}, \'multiverseid\': 581632}, {\'name\': \'Celestine, a Santa Viva\', \'text\': \'Voar, vínculo com a vida\\nLágrimas Curativas — No início de sua etapa final, devolva de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha o card de criatura alvo com valor de mana igual ou inferior a X, sendo X a quantidade de pontos de vida que você ganhou neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581792&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'857f799d-7063-4367-8e3e-bf8de004ebe2\', \'multiverseId\': 581792}, \'multiverseid\': 581792}, {\'name\': \'活圣人塞莱斯汀\', \'text\': \'飞行，系命\\n愈伤圣泪～在你的结束步骤开始时，将目标法术力值等于或小于X的生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场，X为你本回合中获得过的生命数量。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bec63270-5d2c-4a14-9654-9d1a9df314dd\', \'multiverseId\': 582112}, \'multiverseid\': 582112}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chaos-Geißel\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nKampfgeschütz — Wenn die Chaos-Geißel ins Spiel kommt oder stirbt, bestimme für jeden Gegner eine bleibende Karte, die kein Land ist und die jener Spieler kontrolliert. Bestimme eine davon per Zufall und zerstöre sie.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Dämon, Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581092&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29e17215-7c57-4652-8847-ffb1ce6e5121\', \'multiverseId\': 581092}, \'multiverseid\': 581092}, {\'name\': \'Profanador del Caos\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nCañón de batalla — Cuando el Profanador del Caos entre al campo de batalla o muera, por cada oponente, elige un permanente que no sea tierra que controla ese jugador. Destruye uno de ellos elegido al azar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo demonio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581252&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58ec3228-41c3-44cd-a38a-d6837a6c7a0b\', \'multiverseId\': 581252}, \'multiverseid\': 581252}, {\'name\': \'Defiler du Chaos\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nObusier — Quand le Defiler du Chaos arrive sur le champ de bataille ou meurt, pour chaque adversaire, choisissez un permanent non-terrain que ce joueur contrôle. Détruisez l\'un d\'eux choisi au hasard.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : démon et construction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581412&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a06f479-b20e-4dfb-9948-6d3cd88fd226\', \'multiverseId\': 581412}, \'multiverseid\': 581412}, {\'name\': \'Chaos Defiler\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nCannone da Battaglia — Quando il Chaos Defiler entra nel campo di battaglia o muore, per ogni avversario, scegli un permanente non terra controllato da quel giocatore. Distruggi uno di essi scelto a caso.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto Demone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581572&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08bd7b27-d7df-48ed-ab34-dcd5dcda08f6\', \'multiverseId\': 581572}, \'multiverseid\': 581572}, {\'name\': \'ケイオス・ディファイラー\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\nバトルキャノン — ケイオス・ディファイラーが戦場に出たか死亡したとき、各対戦相手につきぞれぞれ、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしていて土地でないパーマネント１つを選ぶ。それらのうち無作為に選んだ１つを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — デーモン・構築物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581732&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b80d4b75-4df8-4b1b-afe4-ad5e1b87f0b7\', \'multiverseId\': 581732}, \'multiverseid\': 581732}, {\'name\': \'Defiler do Caos\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nCanhão de Batalha — Quando Defiler do Caos entrar no campo de batalha ou morrer, para cada oponente, escolha uma permanente não de terreno que aquele jogador controla. Destrua uma delas escolhida aleatoriamente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Demônio Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581892&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a71f68f3-9b44-4fa6-bdb3-7b6d62e7821c\', \'multiverseId\': 581892}, \'multiverseid\': 581892}, {\'name\': \'混沌亵渎者\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n战斗加农炮～当混沌亵渎者进战场或死去时对每位对手而言，你选择一个由该牌手操控的非地永久物。随机选择并消灭其中一个。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～恶魔／组构体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582212&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd022fa5-33dd-4bfd-96e0-91d0655c2f8f\', \'multiverseId\': 582212}, \'multiverseid\': 582212}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chaosmutation\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen deiner Wahl, die von unterschiedlichen Spielern kontrolliert werden, ins Exil. Für jede Kreatur, die auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickt wurde, deckt ihr Beherrscher Karten oben von seiner Bibliothek auf, bis er eine Kreaturenkarte aufdeckt, bringt sie ins Spiel und legt dann den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter seine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581093&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf462dcc-c097-4fa3-95c3-0eefaa92f637\', \'multiverseId\': 581093}, \'multiverseid\': 581093}, {\'name\': \'Mutación del Caos\', \'text\': \'Exilia cualquier cantidad de criaturas objetivo controladas por diferentes jugadores. Por cada criatura exiliada de esta manera, su controlador muestra cartas de la parte superior de su biblioteca hasta que muestre una carta de criatura. Luego, pone esa carta en el campo de batalla y el resto en el fondo de su biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3022fc23-e221-4799-a71a-d8faafb46c6e\', \'multiverseId\': 581253}, \'multiverseid\': 581253}, {\'name\': \'Mutation du Chaos\', \'text\': "Exilez n\'importe quel nombre de créatures ciblées contrôlées par des joueurs différents. Pour chaque créature exilée de cette manière, son contrôleur révèle les cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce qu\'il révèle une carte de créature, met cette carte sur le champ de bataille, puis met et le reste au-dessous de sa bibliothèque, dans un ordre aléatoire.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581413&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58e9bfe1-0279-421a-9189-9ccc383f8940\', \'multiverseId\': 581413}, \'multiverseid\': 581413}, {\'name\': \'Mutazione del Caos\', \'text\': \'Esilia un qualsiasi numero di creature bersaglio controllate da giocatori diversi. Per ogni creatura esiliata in questo modo, il suo controllore rivela carte dalla cima del proprio grimorio finché non rivela una carta creatura, mette quella carta sul campo di battaglia e poi le altre in fondo al proprio grimorio in ordine casuale.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'087507b7-06db-4d90-a9a3-0c8e22f74f08\', \'multiverseId\': 581573}, \'multiverseid\': 581573}, {\'name\': \'ケイオスの変異\', \'text\': \'望む数のクリーチャーをそれぞれ異なるプレイヤーがコントロールしているように選んで対象とする。それらを追放する。これにより追放された各クリーチャーにつきそれぞれ、それのコントローラーは、クリーチャー・カード１枚が公開されるまで、自分のライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ公開していく。その後、そのカードを戦場に、残りをライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581733&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdb3e90a-1fb8-4987-9846-294044c401e4\', \'multiverseId\': 581733}, \'multiverseid\': 581733}, {\'name\': \'Mutação do Caos\', \'text\': \'Exile qualquer número de criaturas alvo controladas por jogadores diferentes. Para cada criatura exilada dessa forma, seu controlador revela cards do topo do próprio grimório até revelar um card de criatura, coloca aquele card no campo de batalha e depois coloca o restante no fundo do próprio grimório em ordem aleatória.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b71c8f0-f5f4-4dc6-a0de-08b9cf063058\', \'multiverseId\': 581893}, \'multiverseid\': 581893}, {\'name\': \'混沌异变\', \'text\': \'放逐任意数量的目标生物，且其操控者须各不相同。对每个以此法放逐的生物而言，其操控者从其牌库顶开始展示牌，直到展示出一张生物牌为止，将该牌放进战场，然后将其余的牌以任意顺序置于其牌库底。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582213&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b298d41-e2fc-40ae-83ed-665aa42ed8e6\', \'multiverseId\': 582213}, \'multiverseid\': 582213}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chaosterminator-Lord\', \'text\': \'Lord des Chaos — Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug erhält eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, Doppelschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Astartes, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Angriff, Brüder! Tod dem falschen Imperator!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581056&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21a33be5-4d2e-440d-ab8d-4ee71fa36577\', \'multiverseId\': 581056}, \'multiverseid\': 581056}, {\'name\': \'Señor Exterminador del Caos\', \'text\': \'Señor de Caos — Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, otra criatura objetivo que controlas gana la habilidad de dañar dos veces hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero astartes\', \'flavor\': \'"¡A la carga, hermanos! ¡Muerte al falso Emperador!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc11ec64-281d-481d-a6f3-c5207f32fbe4\', \'multiverseId\': 581216}, \'multiverseid\': 581216}, {\'name\': \'Seigneur du Chaos Terminator\', \'text\': "Seigneur du Chaos — Au début du combat pendant votre tour, une autre créature ciblée que vous contrôlez acquiert la double initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : astartes et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'« Chargez, mes frères ! Mort au Faux Empereur !"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581376&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab417d40-6b5f-49e3-806a-eaaf080ca075\', \'multiverseId\': 581376}, \'multiverseid\': 581376}, {\'name\': \'Condottiero Terminator del Caos\', \'text\': "Condottiero del Caos — All\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, un\'altra creatura bersaglio che controlli ha doppio attacco fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Astartes\', \'flavor\': \'"Attaccate, fratelli! Morte al falso Imperatore!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8282075-a108-4da5-89cb-bac48783a40f\', \'multiverseId\': 581536}, \'multiverseid\': 581536}, {\'name\': \'ケイオス・ターミネイター・ロード\', \'text\': \'渾沌の魔将 — あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは二段攻撃を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — アスタルテス・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「同士よ、突撃だ！偽りの皇帝に死を！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581696&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aae97b0f-45ae-4b0a-b272-d595e8b6aacb\', \'multiverseId\': 581696}, \'multiverseid\': 581696}, {\'name\': \'Senhor Exterminador do Caos\', \'text\': \'Senhor do Caos — No início do combate no seu turno, outra criatura alvo que você controla ganha golpe duplo até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Astartes Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Carga, irmãos! Morte ao falso Imperador!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581856&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5132637-c6ed-4151-a5bc-7fcee0fbb897\', \'multiverseId\': 581856}, \'multiverseid\': 581856}, {\'name\': \'混沌终结者领主\', \'text\': \'混沌之主～在你回合的战斗开始时，另一个目标由你操控的生物获得连击异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～阿斯塔特／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「兄弟们冲啊！打倒伪皇！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582176&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd283412-d8ca-411d-a19d-22396ad20a95\', \'multiverseId\': 582176}, \'multiverseid\': 582176}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chronomant\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nAtomare Transmutation — {1}, {T}, opfere ein anderes Artefakt: Ziehe eine Karte.\\nExhumieren {2}{B} ({2}{B}: Bringe diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Sie erhält Eile. Schicke sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments, oder falls sie das Spiel verlassen würde, ins Exil. Spiele Exhumieren wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Necron, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581014&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5b73c11-7880-4eaf-922c-3defc82ed331\', \'multiverseId\': 581014}, \'multiverseid\': 581014}, {\'name\': \'Cronomante\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nTransmutación atómica — {1}, {T}, sacrificar otro artefacto: Roba una carta.\\nDesenterrar {2}{B}. ({2}{B}: Regresa esta carta de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Gana la habilidad de prisa. Exíliala al comienzo del próximo paso final o si fuera a dejar el campo de batalla. Activa la habilidad de desenterrar solo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Hechicero necrón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e4aa7f4-d0ae-454d-be45-6785118da0ca\', \'multiverseId\': 581174}, \'multiverseid\': 581174}, {\'name\': \'Chronomancien\', \'text\': "Vol\\nTransmutation atomique — {1}, {T}, sacrifiez un autre artefact : Piochez une carte.\\nExhumation {2}{B} ({2}{B} : Renvoyez cette carte sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière. Elle acquiert la célérité. Exilez-la au début de la prochaine étape de fin ou si elle devait quitter le champ de bataille. N\'exhumez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : nécron et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581334&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d2838d1-e357-443d-ae2e-ac44320405df\', \'multiverseId\': 581334}, \'multiverseid\': 581334}, {\'name\': \'Chronomancer\', \'text\': "Volare\\nTrasmutazione Atomica — {1}, {T}, Sacrifica un altro artefatto: Pesca una carta.\\nDissotterrare {2}{B} ({2}{B}: Rimetti sul campo di battaglia questa carta dal tuo cimitero. Ha rapidità. Esiliala all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale o se sta per lasciare il campo di battaglia. Dissotterra solo come una stregoneria.)", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Mago Necron\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581494&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fe6fa78-fa9a-435d-8d59-5aaf0f622e4a\', \'multiverseId\': 581494}, \'multiverseid\': 581494}, {\'name\': \'クロノマンサー\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n原子変成術 — {1},{T},これでないアーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。\\n蘇生{2}{B}（{2}{B}：あなたの墓地にあるこのカードを戦場に戻す。これは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、またはこれが戦場を離れるなら、これを追放する。蘇生はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ネクロン・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8e3c16d-db10-4be7-bff3-57ada95f5a3a\', \'multiverseId\': 581654}, \'multiverseid\': 581654}, {\'name\': \'Cronomante\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nTransmutação Atômica — {1}, {T}, sacrifique outro artefato: Compre um card.\\nDesenterrar {2}{B} ({2}{B}: Devolva este card de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha. Ele ganha ímpeto. Exile-o no início da próxima etapa final ou se ele for deixar o campo de batalha. Use desenterrar somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Necron Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581814&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'212c9001-5076-443b-a912-e66a64cbe2c1\', \'multiverseId\': 581814}, \'multiverseid\': 581814}, {\'name\': \'时间巫师\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n原子转变～{1}，{T}，牺牲另一个神器：抓一张牌。\\n破坟{2}{B}（{2}{B}：将此牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。它获得敏捷异能。在下一个结束步骤开始时，或若它将离开战场，将它放逐。只能于法术时机破坟。）\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～太空死灵／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582134&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'611da2e5-d19b-456b-ab23-e0762e5cf0be\', \'multiverseId\': 582134}, \'multiverseid\': 582134}]', '[{\'name\': \'Clamavus\', \'text\': \'Proklamationsbeschaller — Jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, erhält +1/+1 für jede +1/+1-Marke, die auf ihr liegt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Tyranide, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Sternengeborenen nähern sich! Ihre heiligen Engel steigen herab! Ergreift die Waffen, meine Brüder und Schwestern, denn der Tag des Aufstiegs steht bevor!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581072&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d31bba66-6f63-448c-aabf-3bf564f94dad\', \'multiverseId\': 581072}, \'multiverseid\': 581072}, {\'name\': \'Clamavus\', \'text\': \'Proclamador de saludos — Cada criatura que controlas obtiene +1/+1 por cada contador +1/+1 sobre ella.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice tiránido humano\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Llega la progenie de las estrellas! ¡Sus ángeles santos descienden! ¡Tomen las armas, mis hermanos y hermanas, pues se avecina el Día de la Ascensión!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581232&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bde5695-12d8-442f-bf1c-1cb40c4a3289\', \'multiverseId\': 581232}, \'multiverseid\': 581232}, {\'name\': \'Clamavus\', \'text\': \'Déclamateur — Chaque créature que vous contrôlez gagne +1/+1 pour chaque marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et tyranide et artificier\', \'flavor\': "« Les stellaires approchent ! Leurs saints anges descendent des cieux ! Prenez les armes, frères et sœurs, car le Jour de l\'Ascension est arrivé ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581392&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e7ef35e-1af9-4ace-bc2a-ca6a71724def\', \'multiverseId\': 581392}, \'multiverseid\': 581392}, {\'name\': \'Clamavus\', \'text\': \'Cantore Proclamator — Ogni creatura che controlli prende +1/+1 per ogni segnalino +1/+1 su di essa.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Tiranide Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"I nati dalle stelle sono vicini! I loro angeli sacri discendono su di noi! Imbracciate le armi, fratelli e sorelle, poiché il giorno dell\\\'Ascensione è alle porte!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c453b517-ee04-46ab-a0c1-7857111f2f9c\', \'multiverseId\': 581552}, \'multiverseid\': 581552}, {\'name\': \'クラマヴァス\', \'text\': \'鼓舞工作員 — あなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーはそれぞれ、それの上にある＋１/＋１カウンター１個につき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ティラニッド・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'「星生まれがやってくる！彼らの聖なる天使が降臨する！武器を手に取れ、我が同胞たちよ。昇天の日がやってきた！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581712&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'940a3fc4-65c6-44c1-ab49-3c93429ac35d\', \'multiverseId\': 581712}, \'multiverseid\': 581712}, {\'name\': \'Clamavus\', \'text\': \'Saudador Proclamador — Cada criatura que você controla recebe +1/+1 para cada marcador +1/+1 nela.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Tiranídeo Artesão\', \'flavor\': \'"Os nascidos nas estrelas estão chegando! Os anjos deles estão descendo! Às armas, irmãos e irmãs, que o Dia da Ascensão está vindo!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581872&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54c31d2a-103b-4ecb-a4e5-0474e2702cc5\', \'multiverseId\': 581872}, \'multiverseid\': 581872}, {\'name\': \'传教员\', \'text\': \'宣导呼号～对每个由你操控的生物而言，其上每有一个+1/+1指示物，便得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／泰伦虫族／神器师\', \'flavor\': \'「星辰之子已经上路！神圣天使就要降临！兄弟姐妹，握紧手中武器，飞升之日即将到来！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48c468d4-1ce9-4daf-910e-7c4bd8f20b3d\', \'multiverseId\': 582192}, \'multiverseid\': 582192}]', '[{\'name\': \'Cybernetica-Datenschmied\', \'text\': \'Schutz vor Robotern\\nUmprogrammierung im Feld — {U}, {T}: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl zieht eine Karte. Ein anderer Spieler deiner Wahl erzeugt einen 4/4 farblosen Roboter-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit „Diese Kreatur kann nicht blocken."\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'„Aktiviere das Protektor-Protokoll."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581096&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0ceeb7b-0315-4e7d-8c9e-2ebb14beb258\', \'multiverseId\': 581096}, \'multiverseid\': 581096}, {\'name\': \'Datartífice Cibernético\', \'text\': \'Protección contra Robots.\\nReprogramación en batalla — {U}, {T}: El jugador objetivo roba una carta. Otro jugador objetivo crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Robot incolora 4/4 con "Esta criatura no puede bloquear".\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Activando el protocolo de protección".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581256&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4cfceb1-7eab-4425-b4c0-c1c1aacf4799\', \'multiverseId\': 581256}, \'multiverseid\': 581256}, {\'name\': \'Compilateur cybernétique\', \'text\': \'Protection contre les robots\\nReprogrammation de terrain — {U}, {T} : Un joueur ciblé pioche une carte. Un autre joueur ciblé crée un jeton de créature-artefact 4/4 incolore Robot avec « Cette créature ne peut pas bloquer. »\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': \'« Engagez le protocole Protecteur. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581416&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04b84546-c8c1-402a-b6c0-f724ae972e92\', \'multiverseId\': 581416}, \'multiverseid\': 581416}, {\'name\': \'Fabbro Dati della Cybernetica\', \'text\': \'Protezione dai Robot\\nRiprogrammazione sul Campo — {U}, {T}: Un giocatore bersaglio pesca una carta. Un altro giocatore bersaglio crea una pedina creatura artefatto Robot 4/4 incolore con "Questa creatura non può bloccare".\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Attivazione protocollo del Protettore."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581576&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e8c5d94-959f-43b5-94e9-e80aabe221dd\', \'multiverseId\': 581576}, \'multiverseid\': 581576}, {\'name\': \'サイバネティカ・データスミス\', \'text\': \'プロテクション（ロボット）\\n戦場リプログラミング — {U},{T}：プレイヤー１人と、他のプレイヤー１人を対象とする。その前者のプレイヤーはカード１枚を引く。その後者のプレイヤーは「このクリーチャーではブロックできない。」を持つ無色の４/４のロボット・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'「保護プロトコルを実行します。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a033eb9d-985f-4b24-b196-8c9e99b08b64\', \'multiverseId\': 581736}, \'multiverseid\': 581736}, {\'name\': \'Especialista em Dados da Cybernetica\', \'text\': \'Proteção contra Robôs\\nReprogramação de Campo — {U}, {T}: O jogador alvo compra um card. Outro jogador alvo cria uma ficha de criatura artefato Robô incolor 4/4 com "Esta criatura não pode bloquear".\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': \'"Iniciando protocolo Protetor."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a691622-3ca4-4f60-8ac7-a4525255d56a\', \'multiverseId\': 581896}, \'multiverseid\': 581896}, {\'name\': \'智控数据技师\', \'text\': \'反机器人保护\\n战地重编～{U}，{T}：目标牌手抓一张牌。另一位目标牌手派出一个4/4无色机器人衍生神器生物，且具有「此生物不能进行阻挡。」\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': \'「启动护卫程序。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1b34629-89db-418e-8c05-ccb30cf2a8b5\', \'multiverseId\': 582216}, \'multiverseid\': 582216}]', "[{'name': 'Das Fleisch ist schwach', 'text': 'Wenn Das Fleisch ist schwach ins Spiel kommt, lege auf jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, eine +1/+1-Marke.\\nKreaturen, die du kontrollierst und auf denen +1/+1-Marken liegen, sind zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen Artefakte.\\nNichtartefaktkreaturen erhalten -1/-1.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581104&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '02ce5e9f-ef35-4092-947e-73a715e388a0', 'multiverseId': 581104}, 'multiverseid': 581104}, {'name': 'La carne es débil', 'text': 'Cuando La carne es débil entre al campo de batalla, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura que controlas.\\nLas criaturas que controlas con contadores +1/+1 sobre ellas son artefactos además de sus otros tipos.\\nLas criaturas que no sean artefacto obtienen -1/-1.', 'type': 'Encantamiento', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581264&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3d40d10f-2e4f-42be-8b6d-a3af62e573ee', 'multiverseId': 581264}, 'multiverseid': 581264}, {'name': 'La chair est faible', 'text': 'Quand La chair est faible arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature que vous contrôlez.\\nLes créatures que vous contrôlez avec des marqueurs +1/+1 sur elles sont des artefacts en plus de leurs autres types.\\nLes créatures non-artefact gagnent -1/-1.', 'type': 'Enchantement', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581424&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '092345d1-28dd-47c5-8c9b-cfe8fae3db33', 'multiverseId': 581424}, 'multiverseid': 581424}, {'name': 'La Carne è Debole', 'text': 'Quando La Carne è Debole entra nel campo di battaglia, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni creatura che controlli.\\nLe creature che controlli con segnalini +1/+1 sono artefatti in aggiunta ai loro altri tipi.\\nLe creature non artefatto prendono -1/-1.', 'type': 'Incantesimo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581584&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f39eef88-3583-417e-b448-667c32b2f2f3', 'multiverseId': 581584}, 'multiverseid': 581584}, {'name': '肉体は脆い', 'text': '肉体は脆いが戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーの上にそれぞれ＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\nあなたがコントロールしていて＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれている各クリーチャーはそれぞれ、それの他のタイプに加えてアーティファクトでもある。\\nアーティファクトでないすべてのクリーチャーは－１/－１の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581744&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4e74933d-e0eb-46b9-a463-78bcf06566b6', 'multiverseId': 581744}, 'multiverseid': 581744}, {'name': 'A Carne É Fraca', 'text': 'Quando A Carne É Fraca entrar no campo de batalha, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada criatura que você controla.\\nAs criaturas que você controla com marcadores +1/+1 são artefatos além de seus outros tipos.\\nAs criaturas não artefato recebem -1/-1.', 'type': 'Encantamento', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581904&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c123c0fa-7567-479b-8ad4-c859b737bcf6', 'multiverseId': 581904}, 'multiverseid': 581904}, {'name': '血肉苦弱', 'text': '当血肉苦弱进战场时，在每个由你操控的生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n由你操控且其上有+1/+1指示物的生物额外具有神器此类别。\\n非神器生物得-1/-1。', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582224&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '172cf4a6-9dba-4756-a20d-1852b1891ecc', 'multiverseId': 582224}, 'multiverseid': 582224}]", '[{\'name\': \'Denn sie kennen keine Furcht\', \'text\': \'Bestimme einen Kreaturentyp. Kreaturen des bestimmten Typs, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+0 und Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Sie sind mein Bollwerk gegen den Schrecken. Sie sind die Verteidiger der Menschheit. Sie sind meine Space Marines."\\n—Der Imperator der Menschheit\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=580991&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5bb6ff2-b164-4a43-a080-c64294d75e24\', \'multiverseId\': 580991}, \'multiverseid\': 580991}, {\'name\': \'Y no conocerán el miedo\', \'text\': \'Elige un tipo de criatura. Las criaturas que controlas del tipo elegido obtienen +1/+0 y ganan la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Son mi escudo contra el Terror. Son los Defensores de la humanidad. Son mis Marines Espaciales".\\n—El Emperador de la Humanidad\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581151&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3b57b01-b70f-4725-8ed6-9d675db0ebf3\', \'multiverseId\': 581151}, \'multiverseid\': 581151}, {\'name\': \'Et ils ne connaîtront pas la peur\', \'text\': "Choisissez un type de créature. Les créatures que vous contrôlez du type choisi gagnent +1/+0 et acquièrent l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Ils seront mon bastion face à la Terreur. Ils seront les Défenseurs de l\'Humanité. Ils seront mes Space Marines. »\\n—L\'Empereur de l\'Humanité", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581311&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9411ede2-f987-4236-8439-48ab84d0349c\', \'multiverseId\': 581311}, \'multiverseid\': 581311}, {\'name\': \'Ed Essi Non Conosceranno la Paura\', \'text\': \'Scegli un tipo di creatura. Le creature che controlli del tipo scelto prendono +1/+0 e hanno indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Sono i miei baluardi contro il Terrore. Sono i Difensori dell\\\'Umanità. Sono i miei Space Marines."\\n—L\\\'Imperatore dell\\\'Umanità\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581471&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53bb58fb-eb64-4e8c-b878-3c07326e1952\', \'multiverseId\': 581471}, \'multiverseid\': 581471}, {\'name\': \'恐怖を知らざる者に\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー・タイプ１つを選ぶ。ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしていてその選ばれたタイプを持つすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受け破壊不能を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「テラーへの備え、人類の防衛者。それが我がスペースマリーンなのだ。」\\n――人類の皇帝\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581631&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0f8a7f8-6dc6-490a-b2db-258c5bfff982\', \'multiverseId\': 581631}, \'multiverseid\': 581631}, {\'name\': \'E Eles Não Conhecerão O Medo\', \'text\': \'Escolha um tipo de criatura. As criaturas que você controla do tipo escolhido recebem +1/+0 e ganham indestrutível até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Eles são meu baluarte contra o Terror. Eles são os Defensores da Humanidade. Eles são meus Space Marines."\\n— O Imperador da Humanidade\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581791&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'273199c3-9820-4ab2-a146-92d7c48648cc\', \'multiverseId\': 581791}, \'multiverseid\': 581791}, {\'name\': \'他们无所畏惧\', \'text\': \'选择一种生物类别。直到回合结束，由你操控的该类别生物得+1/+0且获得不灭异能。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「他们是我对抗恐惧的堡垒。他们是人类的捍卫者。他们是我的星际战士。」\\n～人类帝皇\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582111&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a58fab3-bca1-4c67-8c46-8ce74a34b588\', \'multiverseId\': 582111}, \'multiverseid\': 582111}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Goldene Thron\', \'text\': \'Arkanes Lebenserhaltungssystem — Falls du die Partie verlieren würdest, schicke stattdessen Den Goldenen Thron ins Exil. Dein Lebenspunktestand wird zu 1.\\nTausend Seelen sterben jeden Tag — {T}, opfere eine Kreatur: Erzeuge drei Mana in einer beliebigen Kombination von Farben.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581139&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c4484ff-1e30-4591-8bd8-d3300ce85f89\', \'multiverseId\': 581139}, \'multiverseid\': 581139}, {\'name\': \'El Trono Dorado\', \'text\': \'Soporte vital arcano — Si fueras a perder el juego, en vez de eso, exilia El Trono Dorado y tu total de vidas se convierte en 1.\\nMil almas mueren cada día — {T}, sacrificar una criatura: Agrega tres manás de cualquier combinación de colores.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581299&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1bf48e3-4a11-4d68-8bd2-ad227d86fe6d\', \'multiverseId\': 581299}, \'multiverseid\': 581299}, {\'name\': "Le Trône d\'or", \'text\': "Système de survie arcanique — Si vous deviez perdre la partie, à la place exilez Le Trône d\'or et votre total de points de vie devient 1.\\nMille âmes meurent chaque jour — {T}, sacrifiez une créature : Ajoutez trois manas de la combinaison de mana coloré de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581459&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'719ce8fd-6621-4702-b33a-1329299d58eb\', \'multiverseId\': 581459}, \'multiverseid\': 581459}, {\'name\': "Il Trono d\'Oro", \'text\': "Supporto Vitale Arcano — Se stai per perdere la partita, invece esilia Il Trono d\'Oro e i tuoi punti vita diventano 1.\\nMigliaia di Anime Muoiono Ogni Giorno — {T}, Sacrifica una creatura: Aggiungi tre mana in qualsiasi combinazione di colori.", \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f900c2c6-2af7-4450-8b0e-fcc8ca1bf5ed\', \'multiverseId\': 581619}, \'multiverseid\': 581619}, {\'name\': \'黄金の玉座\', \'text\': \'秘術の生命維持装置 — あなたがゲームに敗北するなら、代わりに黄金の玉座を追放し、あなたのライフ総量は１点になる。\\n毎日千の魂が失われていく — {T},クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：望む色の組み合わせのマナ３点を加える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581779&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99033c84-de93-405d-b1f2-2bab0a13a037\', \'multiverseId\': 581779}, \'multiverseid\': 581779}, {\'name\': \'O Trono Dourado\', \'text\': \'Suporte de Vida Arcano — Se você perderia o jogo, em vez disso, exile O Trono Dourado e seu total de pontos de vida se torna 1.\\nMil Almas Morrem Todos Os Dias — {T}, sacrifique uma criatura: Adicione três manas em qualquer combinação de cores.\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581939&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b7506f4-31af-418a-8caa-2b18c8d088a9\', \'multiverseId\': 581939}, \'multiverseid\': 581939}, {\'name\': \'黄金王座\', \'text\': \'神秘维生仪～如果你将输掉这盘游戏，则改为放逐黄金王座且你的总生命成为1。\\n一日耗千魂～{T}，牺牲一个生物：加三点法术力，其颜色组合由你选择。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e55a91a9-767c-4903-98b9-58171623ce12\', \'multiverseId\': 582259}, \'multiverseid\': 582259}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Krieg im Himmel\', \'text\': \'(Je eine Sagenmarke beim Ins-Spiel-Kommen und nach deinem Ziehsegment. Opfern nach III.)\\nI — Du ziehst drei Karten und verlierst 3 Lebenspunkte.\\nII — Du millst drei Karten.\\nIII — Bestimme bis zu drei Kreaturenkarten deiner Wahl mit Gesamt-Manabetrag 8 oder weniger in deinem Friedhof. Bringe jede von ihnen mit einer Necrodermismarke ins Spiel zurück. Sie sind zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen Artefakte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Sage\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581051&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8193686-1551-49d2-a74b-a5f83de17027\', \'multiverseId\': 581051}, \'multiverseid\': 581051}, {\'name\': \'La Guerra en el Cielo\', \'text\': \'(En cuanto esta Saga entre y después de tu paso de robar, agrega un contador de sabiduría. Sacrifícala después de III.)\\nI — Robas tres cartas y pierdes 3 vidas.\\nII — Muele tres cartas.\\nIII — Elige hasta tres cartas de criatura objetivo en tu cementerio con valor de maná total de 8 o menos. Regresa cada una de ellas al campo de batalla con un contador de necrodermis sobre ellas. Son artefactos además de sus otros tipos.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581211&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a08b936d-0c78-40c6-ae47-74d3faffa1e3\', \'multiverseId\': 581211}, \'multiverseid\': 581211}, {\'name\': \'La Guerre Céleste\', \'text\': "(Au moment où cette saga arrive sur le champ de bataille et après votre étape de pioche, ajoutez un marqueur « sapience ». Sacrifiez après III.)\\nI — Vous piochez trois cartes et vous perdez 3 points de vie.\\nII — Meulez trois cartes.\\nIII — Choisissez jusqu\'à trois cartes de créature ciblées avec une valeur de mana totale inférieure ou égale à 8 dans votre cimetière. Renvoyez chacune d\'elles sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur « nécroderme » sur elle. Ce sont des artefacts en plus de leurs autres types.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581371&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d40b77b0-38b4-4307-a772-76e310a4b5ce\', \'multiverseId\': 581371}, \'multiverseid\': 581371}, {\'name\': \'La Guerra dei Cieli\', \'text\': \'(Mentre questa Saga entra e dopo la tua sottofase di acquisizione, aggiungi un segnalino sapere. Sacrifica dopo III.)\\nI — Peschi tre carte e perdi 3 punti vita.\\nII — Macina tre carte.\\nIII — Scegli fino a tre carte creatura bersaglio con valore di mana totale pari o inferiore a 8 nel tuo cimitero. Rimetti ognuna di esse sul campo di battaglia con un segnalino necroderma. Sono artefatti in aggiunta ai loro altri tipi.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581531&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'827623a4-02c7-4279-9ca2-e17c531e122c\', \'multiverseId\': 581531}, \'multiverseid\': 581531}, {\'name\': \'天界の戦争\', \'text\': \'（この英雄譚が出た際とあなたのドロー・ステップの後に、伝承カウンター１個を加える。IIIの後に、生け贄に捧げる。）\\nI — あなたはカード３枚を引き３点のライフを失う。\\nII — カード３枚を切削する。\\nIII — あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード最大３枚をマナ総量の合計が８以下になるように選んで対象とする。それらをそれぞれネクロダーミス・カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に戻す。それらはそれぞれ、それの他のタイプに加えてアーティファクトでもある。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — 英雄譚\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581691&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31e19a21-248b-4e3d-a1c0-2215ae51215d\', \'multiverseId\': 581691}, \'multiverseid\': 581691}, {\'name\': \'A Guerra dos Céus\', \'text\': \'(Conforme esta Saga entra e após sua etapa de compra, adicione um marcador de conhecimento. Sacrifique-a após III.)\\nI — Você compra três cards e perde 3 pontos de vida.\\nII — Triture três cards.\\nIII — Escolha até três cards de criatura alvo com valor de mana total igual ou inferior a 8 em seu cemitério. Devolva cada um deles ao campo de batalha com um marcador de necrodermis. Eles são artefatos além de seus outros tipos.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581851&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c09677c-f9e4-420a-a665-a9d0e4071dbf\', \'multiverseId\': 581851}, \'multiverseid\': 581851}, {\'name\': \'天堂之战\', \'text\': \'（于此传纪进战场时及于你抓牌步骤后，加一个学问指示物。到III后牺牲之。）\\nI — 你抓三张牌且失去3点生命。\\nII — 磨三张牌。\\nIII — 选择至多三张目标在你坟墓场中的生物牌，且这些牌的法术力值总和须等于或小于8。将它们移回战场且上面均有一个死灵外皮指示物。它们额外具有神器此类别。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～传纪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80117b7a-cf63-40e7-9582-6eb2587854ef\', \'multiverseId\': 582171}, \'multiverseid\': 582171}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Rote Schrecken\', \'text\': \'Fortgeschrittene Spezies — Immer wenn eine rote Quelle, die du kontrollierst, einer oder mehreren bleibenden Karten und/oder Spielern Schaden zufügt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf Den Roten Schrecken.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Tyranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581065&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92f3057a-71ea-4655-92e9-432adcb1c48a\', \'multiverseId\': 581065}, \'multiverseid\': 581065}, {\'name\': \'El Horror Rojo\', \'text\': \'Especie superdesarrollada — Siempre que una fuente roja que controlas haga daño a uno o más permanentes y/o jugadores, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre El Horror Rojo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Tiránido\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581225&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6f11baf-5d12-44f7-9c33-00c6210c278b\', \'multiverseId\': 581225}, \'multiverseid\': 581225}, {\'name\': \'La Terreur rouge\', \'text\': "Espèce évoluée — À chaque fois qu\'une source rouge que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures à au moins un permanent et/ou joueur, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur La Terreur rouge.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : tyranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581385&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eee5f97d-aa63-4662-a672-ebd2fa597d84\', \'multiverseId\': 581385}, \'multiverseid\': 581385}, {\'name\': \'Il Terrore Rosso\', \'text\': \'Specie Avanzata — Ogniqualvolta una fonte rossa che controlli infligge danno a uno o più permanenti e/o giocatori, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su Il Terrore Rosso.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Tiranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ef7f19a-1943-435f-b9a8-e1bd6c861097\', \'multiverseId\': 581545}, \'multiverseid\': 581545}, {\'name\': \'レッドテラー\', \'text\': \'強化種 — あなたがコントロールしている赤の発生源が１つ以上のパーマネントやプレイヤーにダメージを与えるたび、レッドテラーの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ティラニッド\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581705&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a092979-720e-4895-a905-c74859877862\', \'multiverseId\': 581705}, \'multiverseid\': 581705}, {\'name\': \'O Terror Vermelho\', \'text\': \'Espécie Avançada — Toda vez que uma fonte vermelha que você controla causar dano a uma ou mais permanentes e/ou jogadores, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em O Terror Vermelho.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Tiranídeo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581865&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efbd3033-4827-427d-8689-facd92d2b934\', \'multiverseId\': 581865}, \'multiverseid\': 581865}, {\'name\': \'红色恐怖\', \'text\': \'高级种～每当一个由你操控的红色来源对一个或数个永久物和／或牌手造成伤害时，在红色恐怖上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～泰伦虫族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582185&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e8450ef-3340-4bf0-84a6-8dd2d551f054\', \'multiverseId\': 582185}, \'multiverseid\': 582185}]', "[{'name': 'Der erste Tyranidenkrieg', 'text': '(Je eine Sagenmarke beim Ins-Spiel-Kommen und nach deinem Ziehsegment. Opfern nach III.)\\nI — Du kannst eine Kreaturenkarte aus deiner Hand ins Spiel bringen. Falls ihre Manakosten {X} enthalten, kommt sie mit so vielen +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel, wie du Länder kontrollierst.\\nII, III — Verdopple die Anzahl an Marken jeder Sorte auf einer Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Sage', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581103&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1d91de35-95a1-4c3b-9618-f898d7b5fed9', 'multiverseId': 581103}, 'multiverseid': 581103}, {'name': 'La Primera Guerra Tiránida', 'text': '(En cuanto esta Saga entre y después de tu paso de robar, agrega un contador de sabiduría. Sacrifícala después de III.)\\nI — Puedes poner en el campo de batalla una carta de criatura de tu mano. Si su coste de maná contiene {X}, entra al campo de batalla con una cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre ella igual a la cantidad de tierras que controlas.\\nII, III — Duplica la cantidad de cada tipo de contador sobre la criatura objetivo que controlas.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Saga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581263&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7c13ac0a-4063-4cfd-8d1c-9cb18a8dedfd', 'multiverseId': 581263}, 'multiverseid': 581263}, {'name': 'La Première guerre tyrannique', 'text': '(Au moment où cette saga arrive sur le champ de bataille et après votre étape de pioche, ajoutez un marqueur « sapience ». Sacrifiez après III.)\\nI — Vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille une carte de créature de votre main. Si son coût de mana contient {X}, elle arrive sur le champ de bataille avec, sur elle, un nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 égal au nombre de terrains que vous contrôlez.\\nII, III — Doublez le nombre de chaque sorte de marqueur sur une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez.', 'type': 'Enchantement : saga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581423&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b615cbbc-cf2e-462f-9821-266aaf00eacb', 'multiverseId': 581423}, 'multiverseid': 581423}, {'name': 'La Prima Guerra di Tyran', 'text': '(Mentre questa Saga entra e dopo la tua sottofase di acquisizione, aggiungi un segnalino sapere. Sacrifica dopo III.)\\nI — Puoi mettere sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura dalla tua mano. Se il suo costo di mana contiene {X}, entra nel campo di battaglia con un numero di segnalini +1/+1 pari al numero di terre che controlli.\\nII, III — Raddoppia il numero di ogni tipo di segnalino su una creatura bersaglio che controlli.', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Saga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581583&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5258c3e8-1941-4750-b4ae-a38a30c6008b', 'multiverseId': 581583}, 'multiverseid': 581583}, {'name': '第一次ティラン戦役', 'text': '（この英雄譚が出た際とあなたのドロー・ステップの後に、伝承カウンター１個を加える。IIIの後に、生け贄に捧げる。）\\nI — あなたはあなたの手札にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。それのマナ・コストに{X}が含まれるなら、それはあなたがコントロールしている土地の数に等しい数の＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\nII,III — あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上にある各種類のカウンターの個数をそれぞれ２倍にする。', 'type': 'エンチャント — 英雄譚', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581743&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'daf6156c-983e-47ee-9076-3b77aaa3115d', 'multiverseId': 581743}, 'multiverseid': 581743}, {'name': 'A Primeira Guerra Tirânica', 'text': '(Conforme esta Saga entra e após sua etapa de compra, adicione um marcador de conhecimento. Sacrifique-a após III.)\\nI — Você pode colocar no campo de batalha um card de criatura de sua mão. Se seu custo de mana contiver {X}, ele entrará no campo de batalha com um número de marcadores +1/+1 igual ao número de terrenos que você controla.\\nII, III — Duplique o número de cada tipo de marcador na criatura alvo que você controla.', 'type': 'Encantamento — Saga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581903&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '54054184-8fd1-410c-a190-1bb9fe99b1b2', 'multiverseId': 581903}, 'multiverseid': 581903}, {'name': '第一次泰伦战争', 'text': '（于此传纪进战场时及于你抓牌步骤后，加一个学问指示物。到III后牺牲之。）\\nI — 你可以将一张生物牌从你手上放进战场。如果其法术力费用中包含{X}，则它进战场时上面有数个+1/+1指示物，其数量等同于由你操控的地数量。\\nII, III — 将目标由你操控之生物上的各种指示物数量加倍。', 'type': '结界 ～传纪', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582223&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'da9bad41-8eaa-4be0-b3ac-4a05fdbcce49', 'multiverseId': 582223}, 'multiverseid': 582223}]", '[{\'name\': \'Devastor der Space Marines\', \'text\': \'Trupp {2} (Als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken, kannst du beliebig oft {2} bezahlen. Wenn diese Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge entsprechend viele Spielsteine, die Kopien von ihr sind.)\\nGravkanone — Wenn der Devastor der Space Marines ins Spiel kommt, zerstöre bis zu ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Astartes, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=580996&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10719bee-af39-4599-b1a9-05b924daac11\', \'multiverseId\': 580996}, \'multiverseid\': 580996}, {\'name\': \'Marine Espacial Devastador\', \'text\': \'Escuadra {2}. (Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, puedes pagar {2} tantas veces como quieras. Cuando esta criatura entre al campo de batalla, crea esa cantidad de fichas que son copias de ella.)\\nCañón grav — Cuando el Marine Espacial Devastador entre al campo de batalla, destruye hasta un artefacto o encantamiento objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero astartes\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581156&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6580ec42-1ced-4a7c-bce5-386f138235ce\', \'multiverseId\': 581156}, \'multiverseid\': 581156}, {\'name\': \'Space Marine Devastator\', \'text\': "Escouade {2} (En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, vous pouvez payer {2} autant de fois que vous le souhaitez. Quand cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez autant de jetons qui en sont des copies.)\\nCanon à gravitons — Quand le Space Marine Devastator arrive sur le champ de bataille, détruisez jusqu\'à une cible, artefact ou enchantement.", \'type\': \'Créature : astartes et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581316&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8ea8385-54d3-4f89-ae86-2e83838973f8\', \'multiverseId\': 581316}, \'multiverseid\': 581316}, {\'name\': \'Space Marine Devastatore\', \'text\': \'Squadra {2} (Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, puoi pagare {2} un qualsiasi numero di volte. Quando questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia, crea altrettante pedine che sono sue copie.)\\nCannone Grav — Quando lo Space Marine Devastatore entra nel campo di battaglia, distruggi fino a un artefatto o incantesimo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Astartes\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581476&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8b49a4b-b97e-4281-92b9-019a4e6b5efd\', \'multiverseId\': 581476}, \'multiverseid\': 581476}, {\'name\': \'スペースマリーン・デヴァステイター\', \'text\': \'分隊{2}（この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、あなたは望む回数の{2}を支払ってもよい。このクリーチャーが戦場に出たとき、その回数に等しい数の、これのコピーであるトークンを生成する。）\\nグラヴキャノン — スペースマリーン・デヴァステイターが戦場に出たとき、アーティファクトやエンチャントのうち最大１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — アスタルテス・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581636&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5aa7d1f4-ad3a-40f3-92ec-fdb2b50d239d\', \'multiverseId\': 581636}, \'multiverseid\': 581636}, {\'name\': \'Devastador Space Marine\', \'text\': \'Esquadrão {2} (Como custo adicional para conjurar esta mágica, você pode pagar {2} qualquer número de vezes. Quando esta criatura entrar no campo de batalha, crie aquela quantidade de fichas que sejam cópias dela.)\\nCanhão Gravitacional — Quando Devastador Space Marine entrar no campo de batalha, destrua até um artefato ou encantamento alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Astartes Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581796&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'404740ca-858f-4e4d-973e-88383591de79\', \'multiverseId\': 581796}, \'multiverseid\': 581796}, {\'name\': \'星际战士破坏者\', \'text\': \'小队{2}（你可以支付{2}任意次数，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。当此生物进战场时，派出等量为其复制品的衍生物。）\\n重力炮～当星际战士破坏者进战场时，消灭至多一个目标神器或结界。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～阿斯塔特／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97f688a9-0969-43fa-8537-680d456388a1\', \'multiverseId\': 582116}, \'multiverseid\': 582116}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Horus-Häresie\', \'text\': \'(Je eine Sagenmarke beim Ins-Spiel-Kommen und nach deinem Ziehsegment. Opfern nach III.)\\nI — Übernimm von jedem Gegner die Kontrolle über bis zu eine nichtlegendäre Kreatur deiner Wahl, die jener Spieler kontrolliert, solange Die Horus-Häresie im Spiel bleibt.\\nII — Ziehe für jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, aber nicht besitzt, eine Karte.\\nIII — Beginnend mit dir bestimmt jeder Spieler eine Kreatur. Zerstöre jede Kreatur, die auf diese Weise bestimmt wurde.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Sage\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581108&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c84d9f86-f2e2-4916-a2e0-05f32d51e979\', \'multiverseId\': 581108}, \'multiverseid\': 581108}, {\'name\': \'La Herejía de Horus\', \'text\': \'(En cuanto esta Saga entre y después de tu paso de robar, agrega un contador de sabiduría. Sacrifícala después de III.)\\nI — Por cada oponente, gana el control de hasta una criatura objetivo que no sea legendaria que controla ese jugador mientras La Herejía de Horus permanezca en el campo de batalla.\\nII — Roba una carta por cada criatura que controlas pero de la que no eres propietario.\\nIII — Comenzando contigo, cada jugador elige una criatura. Destruye cada criatura elegida de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9456bbab-5728-4526-a18a-f66a01ecbed2\', \'multiverseId\': 581268}, \'multiverseid\': 581268}, {\'name\': "L\'Hérésie d\'Horus", \'text\': "(Au moment où cette saga arrive sur le champ de bataille et après votre étape de pioche, ajoutez un marqueur « sapience ». Sacrifiez après III.)\\nI — Pour chaque adversaire, acquérez le contrôle de jusqu\'à une créature non-légendaire ciblée que ce joueur contrôle tant que L\'Hérésie d\'Horus reste sur le champ de bataille.\\nII — Piochez une carte pour chaque créature que vous contrôlez, mais que vous ne possédez pas.\\nIII — En commençant par vous, chaque joueur choisit une créature. Détruisez chaque créature choisie de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581428&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4c98b31-6233-481d-ab99-053dfb9316ac\', \'multiverseId\': 581428}, \'multiverseid\': 581428}, {\'name\': \'Eresia di Horus\', \'text\': "(Mentre questa Saga entra e dopo la tua sottofase di acquisizione, aggiungi un segnalino sapere. Sacrifica dopo III.)\\nI — Per ogni avversario, scegli fino a una creatura non leggendaria bersaglio controllata da quel giocatore. Prendi il controllo di quella creatura fintanto che l\'Eresia di Horus rimane sul campo di battaglia.\\nII — Pesca una carta per ogni creatura che controlli ma non possiedi.\\nIII — A partire da te, ogni giocatore sceglie una creatura. Distruggi ogni creatura scelta in questo modo.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4078e3f0-43b3-4b5c-b736-3cc026cfb306\', \'multiverseId\': 581588}, \'multiverseid\': 581588}, {\'name\': \'ホルスの大逆\', \'text\': \'（この英雄譚が出た際とあなたのドロー・ステップの後に、伝承カウンター１個を加える。IIIの後に、生け贄に捧げる。）\\nI — 各対戦相手につきそれぞれ、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしていて伝説でないクリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。ホルスの大逆が戦場に残り続けているかぎり、それのコントロールを得る。\\nII — あなたがコントロールしていてあなたがオーナーでないクリーチャーの数に等しい枚数のカードを引く。\\nIII — あなたから始めて、各プレイヤーはそれぞれクリーチャー１体を選ぶ。これにより選ばれたすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — 英雄譚\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581748&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af19bf98-1413-47e3-bde0-a89a18dd6c3b\', \'multiverseId\': 581748}, \'multiverseid\': 581748}, {\'name\': \'A Heresia de Horus\', \'text\': \'(Conforme esta Saga entra e após sua etapa de compra, adicione um marcador de conhecimento. Sacrifique-a após III.)\\nI — Para cada oponente, ganhe o controle de até uma criatura não lendária alvo que aquele jogador controla enquanto A Heresia de Horus permanecer no campo de batalha.\\nII — Compre um card para cada criatura que você controla, mas não possui.\\nIII — A começar por você, cada jogador escolhe uma criatura. Destrua cada criatura escolhida dessa forma.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581908&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ae76826-8117-49bf-a59a-3dd56965e2f5\', \'multiverseId\': 581908}, \'multiverseid\': 581908}, {\'name\': \'荷鲁斯之乱\', \'text\': \'（于此传纪进战场时及于你抓牌步骤后，加一个学问指示物。到III后牺牲之。）\\nI — 对每位对手而言，你选择至多一个目标由该牌手操控的非传奇生物。于荷鲁斯之乱仍在战场上的时段内，获得这些生物的操控权。\\nII — 你每操控一个不由你拥有的生物，便抓一张牌。\\nIII — 由你开始，每位牌手各选择一个生物。消灭所有以此法选择的生物。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～传纪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4747daf6-58bb-4ba4-9308-a24db8becf9c\', \'multiverseId\': 582228}, \'multiverseid\': 582228}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Mächte der Verderbnis\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments bestimmst du per Zufall einen Gegner. Schicke die oberste Karte der Bibliothek jenes Spielers ins Exil. Bis zum Ende des Zuges kannst du die Karte spielen, und um sie zu wirken kannst du Mana ausgeben, als wäre es Mana einer beliebigen Farbe. Wenn du auf diese Weise einen Zauberspruch wirkst, verliert sein Besitzer Lebenspunkte in Höhe seines Manabetrags.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581121&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a241038a-4c22-4c4d-a58a-0e77cd507fdd\', \'multiverseId\': 581121}, \'multiverseid\': 581121}, {\'name\': \'Los Poderes Ruinosos\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, elige un oponente al azar. Exilia la primera carta de la biblioteca de ese jugador. Hasta el final del turno, puedes jugar esa carta y puedes usar maná como si fuera maná de cualquier color para lanzarla. Cuando lances un hechizo de esta manera, su propietario pierde una cantidad de vidas igual a su valor de maná.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581281&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d6ee52c-05c1-462e-b22a-df22fbd973da\', \'multiverseId\': 581281}, \'multiverseid\': 581281}, {\'name\': \'Les Puissances de la Ruine\', \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, choisissez un adversaire au hasard. Exilez la carte du dessus de la bibliothèque de ce joueur. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, vous pouvez jouer cette carte et vous pouvez dépenser du mana comme s\'il s\'agissait de mana de n\'importe quelle couleur pour la lancer. Quand vous lancez un sort de cette manière, son propriétaire perd un nombre de points de vie égal à sa valeur de mana.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581441&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1b0720b-28d6-4cf8-b673-928a91bb8ba0\', \'multiverseId\': 581441}, \'multiverseid\': 581441}, {\'name\': \'I Poteri Perniciosi\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, scegli un avversario a caso. Esilia la prima carta del grimorio di quel giocatore. Fino alla fine del turno, puoi giocare quella carta e puoi spendere mana come se fosse mana di qualsiasi colore per lanciarla. Quando lanci una magia in questo modo, il suo proprietario perde punti vita pari al suo valore di mana.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581601&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9127b370-4567-4162-9498-da71ef4579cf\', \'multiverseId\': 581601}, \'multiverseid\': 581601}, {\'name\': \'禍つ神々\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、対戦相手１人を無作為に選ぶ。そのプレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を追放する。ターン終了時まで、あなたはそのカードをプレイしてもよく、マナを望む色のマナであるかのように支払ってそれを唱えてもよい。これによりあなたが呪文を唱えたとき、それのオーナーはそれのマナ総量に等しい点数のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581761&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbdbdb7d-0976-413b-80f9-75641abaf629\', \'multiverseId\': 581761}, \'multiverseid\': 581761}, {\'name\': \'Os Poderes Ruinosos\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, escolha um oponente aleatoriamente. Exile o card do topo do grimório daquele jogador. Até o final do turno, você pode jogar aquele card e pode gastar mana como se fosse de qualquer cor para conjurá-lo. Quando você conjura uma mágica dessa forma, o dono dela perde uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual a seu valor de mana.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581921&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6934dce8-92fa-481b-ac3d-c317ae7d765f\', \'multiverseId\': 581921}, \'multiverseid\': 581921}, {\'name\': \'毁灭大能\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，随机选择一位对手。放逐该牌手的牌库顶牌。直到回合结束，你可以使用该牌，且你可以将法术力视同任意颜色的法术力来支付施放该牌的费用。当你以此法施放咒语时，其拥有者失去等同于其法术力值的生命。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582241&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc391270-2892-4c33-8330-885adc7cb636\', \'multiverseId\': 582241}, \'multiverseid\': 582241}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Verlorenen und Verdammten\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Land von irgendwoher außer deiner Hand unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt oder du einen Zauberspruch von irgendwoher außer deiner Hand wirkst, erzeuge einen 3/3 roten Ausgeburt-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Die Götter des Chaos beschenken ihre Champions mit Mutationen. Zu viele dieser Geschenke verwandeln ihren Träger in eine hirnlose, sich windende Ausgeburt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581111&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8fc558c-0266-41ac-a897-50645438020d\', \'multiverseId\': 581111}, \'multiverseid\': 581111}, {\'name\': \'Los perdidos y los condenados\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control desde cualquier parte excepto desde tu mano o siempre que lances un hechizo desde cualquier parte excepto desde tu mano, crea una ficha de criatura Engendro roja 3/3.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Los dioses del Caos conceden mutaciones a sus campeones a modo de dádivas, pero un exceso de generosidad transforma a sus siervos en engendros del caos irracionales y retorcidos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581271&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ce693c8-53d9-4c27-8e0e-5c2dfd4623a2\', \'multiverseId\': 581271}, \'multiverseid\': 581271}, {\'name\': \'Les Égarés et les Damnés\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle depuis autre part que votre main ou que vous lancez un sort depuis autre part que votre main, créez un jeton de créature 3/3 rouge Engeance.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Les dieux du Chaos offrent des dons de mutation à leurs champions. Ces dons transforment trop souvent leurs destinataires en engeances de chaos corrompues.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581431&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7219d5e8-8c5f-4aa8-883f-bacfd1ec583a\', \'multiverseId\': 581431}, \'multiverseid\': 581431}, {\'name\': \'I Perduti e i Dannati\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo da una zona diversa dalla tua mano o lanci una magia da una zona diversa dalla tua mano, crea una pedina creatura Progenie 3/3 rossa.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Gli dei del Caos concedono il dono della mutazione ai loro campioni. Troppi di questi doni trasformano il loro portatore in una progenie del caos dissennata e in preda agli spasmi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581591&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'583b529f-55b4-42e4-8e9d-682c1859d96b\', \'multiverseId\': 581591}, \'multiverseid\': 581591}, {\'name\': \'ロスト・アンド・ダムド\', \'text\': \'あなたの手札以外から土地１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るか、あなたがあなたの手札以外から呪文を唱えるたび、赤の３/３の落とし子・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'渾沌の神は勇者に変異の贈り物を授ける。授かった者の心を失わせ蠢くケイオススポーンに成り果てさせる贈り物はあまりにも多い。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581751&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9830af0-76b4-4501-8efa-75c3a0e63101\', \'multiverseId\': 581751}, \'multiverseid\': 581751}, {\'name\': \'Os Perdidos e os Condenados\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um terreno entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle de qualquer lugar além de sua mão ou você conjurar uma mágica de qualquer lugar além de sua mão, crie uma ficha de criatura Prole vermelha 3/3.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Os deuses do Caos concedem dádivas de mutação a seus campeões. Muitas dessas dádivas transformam os agraciados em germes mentecaptos do caos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581911&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'670fc259-3db3-43b0-bf73-504cd1b2c926\', \'multiverseId\': 581911}, \'multiverseid\': 581911}, {\'name\': \'迷失和被诅咒者\', \'text\': \'每当一个地在你的操控下从你手牌以外的任何区域进入战场或你从你手牌以外的任何区域施放咒语时，派出一个3/3红色后裔衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'混沌诸神将变异作为赋礼赐给手下勇士。但这些赋礼大多将主人转化为丧失心智之混沌卵。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06cb9b69-da22-4228-894b-587fc0c52d1f\', \'multiverseId\': 582231}, \'multiverseid\': 582231}]', "[{'name': 'Donnerwolfreiter', 'text': 'Erstschlag\\nZerreißende Zähne — Immer wenn der Donnerwolfreiter einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, lege auf jede andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, eine +1/+1-Marke.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Astartes, Krieger', 'flavor': 'Das Fährtenlesen und Ausbilden von Donnerwölfen ist eine Art Initiationsritual für die höheren Ränge der Wolfsgarde.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=580998&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fec7b4bb-3ae4-4be9-8028-4535189b3ee2', 'multiverseId': 580998}, 'multiverseid': 580998}, {'name': 'Caballería de Lobo Trueno', 'text': 'Daña primero.\\nDientes aplastantes — Siempre que la Caballería de Lobo Trueno haga daño de combate a un jugador, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada otra criatura que controlas.', 'type': 'Criatura — Guerrero astartes', 'flavor': 'La práctica de rastrear y entrenar a Lobos Trueno es una suerte de rito de iniciación a los escalafones superiores de la Guardia del Lobo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581158&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7e25bf1d-25e1-4fd1-8c41-faa5d87b9839', 'multiverseId': 581158}, 'multiverseid': 581158}, {'name': 'Cavalerie sur Loups Tonnerres', 'text': 'Initiative\\nCrocs broyeurs — À chaque fois que la Cavalerie sur Loups Tonnerres inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque autre créature que vous contrôlez.', 'type': 'Créature : astartes et guerrier', 'flavor': 'La pratique visant à traquer et dresser les Loups Tonnerres est une sorte de rite initiatique pour atteindre les échelons supérieurs de la Garde Loup.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581318&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8025f845-f416-4560-a5cd-b5b42b9e30cd', 'multiverseId': 581318}, 'multiverseid': 581318}, {'name': 'Cavalieri su Lupi del Tuono', 'text': 'Attacco improvviso\\nZanne Dilanianti — Ogniqualvolta i Cavalieri su Lupi del Tuono infliggono danno da combattimento a un giocatore, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni altra creatura che controlli.', 'type': 'Creatura — Guerriero Astartes', 'flavor': 'La pratica di scovare e addestrare i Lupi del Tuono è una sorta di rituale di iniziazione per le alte sfere della Guardia del Lupo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581478&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '51b29a65-3bd8-46c2-a97d-073f3e399f88', 'multiverseId': 581478}, 'multiverseid': 581478}, {'name': 'サンダーウルフ・キャバルリー', 'text': '先制攻撃\\n破砕の牙 — サンダーウルフ・キャバルリーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでない各クリーチャーの上にそれぞれ＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — アスタルテス・戦士', 'flavor': 'サンダーウルフの追跡やしつけの訓練は、ウルフガードの上層部へ上がるための通過儀礼のようなものである。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581638&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e0c01efd-ee2d-4ef5-8b45-ba501c17cccb', 'multiverseId': 581638}, 'multiverseid': 581638}, {'name': 'Cavalaria de Lobos-trovão', 'text': 'Iniciativa\\nDentes Esmagadores — Toda vez que Cavalaria de Lobos-trovão causar dano de combate a um jogador, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada outra criatura que você controla.', 'type': 'Criatura — Astartes Guerreiro', 'flavor': 'A prática de caçar e treinar os lobos-trovão é como um ritual de iniciação para o alto escalão da Guarda Lupina.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581798&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '634e1462-00d2-4f63-8aea-5117caa8ebe1', 'multiverseId': 581798}, 'multiverseid': 581798}, {'name': '雷狼骑兵', 'text': '先攻\\n粉碎利齿～每当雷狼骑兵对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，在每个由你操控的其他生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '生物 ～阿斯塔特／战士', 'flavor': '追踪并驯化雷狼算是成为高阶狼卫的入门仪式。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582118&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1ef3fffc-9370-452d-806c-109f1d45864f', 'multiverseId': 582118}, 'multiverseid': 582118}]", '[{\'name\': \'Dunkler Apostel\', \'text\': \'Geschenk des Chaos — {3}, {T}: Der nächste Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch, den du in diesem Zug wirkst, hat Kaskade. (Wenn du ihn wirkst, schicke Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis du eine Nichtland-Karte ins Exil schickst, die weniger kostet. Du kannst sie wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Lege die so ins Exil geschickten Karten in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Astartes, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581057&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65a87ecc-af56-435d-b622-b10fb9433cc6\', \'multiverseId\': 581057}, \'multiverseid\': 581057}, {\'name\': \'Apóstol Oscuro\', \'text\': \'Regalo del Caos — {3}, {T}: El próximo hechizo que no sea de criatura que lances este turno tiene la habilidad de cascada. (Cuando lances ese hechizo, exilia cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca hasta que exilies una carta que no sea tierra y que cueste menos. Puedes lanzarla sin pagar su coste de maná. Pon las cartas exiliadas en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Brujo astartes\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581217&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fe80068-4ee7-4007-9070-9eda94d4b036\', \'multiverseId\': 581217}, \'multiverseid\': 581217}, {\'name\': \'Apôtre noir\', \'text\': "Don du Chaos — {3}, {T} : Le prochain sort non-créature que vous lancez ce tour-ci a la cascade. (Quand vous lancez ce sort, exilez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous exiliez une carte non-terrain d\'un coût inférieur. Vous pouvez la lancer sans payer son coût de mana. Mettez les cartes exilées au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.)", \'type\': \'Créature : astartes et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581377&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f05872f-1b61-41e9-9f74-2560b2eda9d4\', \'multiverseId\': 581377}, \'multiverseid\': 581377}, {\'name\': \'Apostolo Oscuro\', \'text\': \'Dono del Caos — {3}, {T}: La prossima magia non creatura che lanci in questo turno ha cascata. (Quando lanci quella magia, esilia carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non esili una carta non terra che costa meno. Puoi lanciarla senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Metti le carte esiliate in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Warlock Astartes\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a228b748-8fce-49b7-b3c4-dd2f65429c47\', \'multiverseId\': 581537}, \'multiverseid\': 581537}, {\'name\': \'ダークアポスル\', \'text\': \'渾沌の恩恵 — {3},{T}：このターンにあなたが唱えてクリーチャーでない次の呪文は続唱を持つ。（あなたがその呪文を唱えたとき、コストがそれより低く土地でないカード１枚が追放されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ追放していく。あなたはそれをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。追放したカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — アスタルテス・邪術師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581697&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45bf0e43-a60f-48b0-b695-722bcb7f4c84\', \'multiverseId\': 581697}, \'multiverseid\': 581697}, {\'name\': \'Apóstolo Sombrio\', \'text\': \'Dádiva do Caos — {3}, {T}: A próxima mágica não de criatura que você conjurar neste turno terá cascata. (Quando conjurar aquela mágica, exile cards do topo de seu grimório até exilar um card não de terreno e que tenha custo inferior. Você pode conjurá-lo sem pagar seu custo de mana. Coloque os cards exilados no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Astartes Bruxo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18347587-0ca5-4592-9638-fbd827a83688\', \'multiverseId\': 581857}, \'multiverseid\': 581857}, {\'name\': \'黑暗使徒\', \'text\': \'混沌之赐～{3}，{T}：你本回合中施放的下一个非生物咒语具有倾曳异能。（当你施放该咒语时，从你的牌库顶开始放逐牌，直到放逐一张费用比此咒语低的非地牌为止。你可以施放该牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。将所放逐的牌以随机顺序置于你牌库底。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～阿斯塔特／邪术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582177&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4e073e5-83ac-4b40-bfbb-81aaca9a05e8\', \'multiverseId\': 582177}, \'multiverseid\': 582177}]', '[{\'name\': \'Einauge\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nAndere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, verursachen Trampelschaden.\\nWenn Einauge ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 5/5 grünen Tyranide-Kreaturenspielstein.\\nSchnelle Heilung — Zu Beginn deiner Hauptphase vor dem Kampf kannst du zwei Karten abwerfen. Falls du dies tust, bringe Einauge aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Tyranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581078&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b0ed596-39c0-4c6a-8e75-94bb5c74de78\', \'multiverseId\': 581078}, \'multiverseid\': 581078}, {\'name\': \'Viejo Un Ojo\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nLas otras criaturas que controlas tienen la habilidad de arrollar.\\nCuando el Viejo Un Ojo entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura Tiránido verde 5/5.\\nCuración rápida — Al comienzo de tu fase principal precombate, puedes descartar dos cartas. Si lo haces, regresa al Viejo Un Ojo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Tiránido\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581238&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eafded09-d252-40e7-9ea0-3129d0232c8d\', \'multiverseId\': 581238}, \'multiverseid\': 581238}, {\'name\': \'Le Vieux Borgne\', \'text\': \'Piétinement\\nLes autres créatures que vous contrôlez ont le piétinement.\\nQuand Le Vieux Borgne arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature 5/5 verte Tyranide.\\nGuérison rapide — Au début de votre première phase principale, vous pouvez vous défausser de deux cartes. Si vous faites ainsi, renvoyez Le Vieux Borgne depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : tyranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581398&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'084ebc5e-7c8a-4ba8-a3c4-d14eb2c43e0a\', \'multiverseId\': 581398}, \'multiverseid\': 581398}, {\'name\': \'Vecchio Occhio Solo\', \'text\': "Travolgere\\nLe altre creature che controlli hanno travolgere.\\nQuando Vecchio Occhio Solo entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura Tiranide 5/5 verde.\\nGuarigione Veloce — All\'inizio della tua fase principale pre-combattimento, puoi scartare due carte. Se lo fai, riprendi in mano Vecchio Occhio Solo dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Tiranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581558&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55145162-6d6d-4dad-a627-6dd61eb67e0e\', \'multiverseId\': 581558}, \'multiverseid\': 581558}, {\'name\': \'オールド・ワン・アイ\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\nあなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのクリーチャーはトランプルを持つ。\\nオールド・ワン・アイが戦場に出たとき、緑の５/５のティラニッド・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n高速回復 — あなたの戦闘前メイン・フェイズの開始時に、あなたはカード２枚を捨ててもよい。そうしたなら、あなたの墓地にあるオールド・ワン・アイをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ティラニッド\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581718&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ab8bf29-1401-428b-82dd-37322cc63414\', \'multiverseId\': 581718}, \'multiverseid\': 581718}, {\'name\': \'Velho Caolho\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nAs outras criaturas que você controla têm atropelar.\\nQuando Velho Caolho entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de criatura Tiranídeo verde 5/5.\\nCura Rápida — No início de sua fase principal pré-combate, você pode descartar dois cards. Se fizer isso, devolva Velho Caolho de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Tiranídeo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581878&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5594f599-16a6-41f4-b3b7-36f4df067dcc\', \'multiverseId\': 581878}, \'multiverseid\': 581878}, {\'name\': \'老独眼\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n由你操控的其他生物具有践踏异能。\\n当老独眼进战场时，派出一个5/5绿色泰伦虫族衍生生物。\\n快速治疗～在你战斗前的行动阶段开始时，你可以弃两张牌。若你如此作，则将老独眼从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～泰伦虫族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582198&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70e3a4c7-e825-48b7-b4be-985533b5f3c0\', \'multiverseId\': 582198}, \'multiverseid\': 582198}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erhabener Flammenwerfer des Tzeentch\', \'text\': \'Hexerische Inspiration — Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments bringst du eine per Zufall bestimmte Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\\nFeuer von Tzeentch — Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst, fügt der Erhabene Flammenwerfer des Tzeentch jedem Gegner 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581101&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'156dc33c-d3df-403b-b297-9cadaaa7bcd8\', \'multiverseId\': 581101}, \'multiverseid\': 581101}, {\'name\': \'Incinerador Glorioso de Tzeentch\', \'text\': \'Inspiración hechizada — Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, regresa una carta de instantáneo o de conjuro al azar de tu cementerio a tu mano.\\nFuego de Tzeentch — Siempre que lances un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, el Incinerador Glorioso de Tzeentch hace 1 punto de daño a cada oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581261&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f43f0e4-e35c-49af-93e4-c49b4d63116e\', \'multiverseId\': 581261}, \'multiverseid\': 581261}, {\'name\': \'Incendiaire exalté de Tzeentch\', \'text\': "Sorcellerie inspirante — Au début de votre entretien, renvoyez une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel choisie au hasard depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\\nFeu de Tzeentch — À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, l\'Incendiaire exalté de Tzeentch inflige 1 blessure à chaque adversaire.", \'type\': \'Créature : démon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581421&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'480814c1-564a-48eb-95da-8bfbce8c02eb\', \'multiverseId\': 581421}, \'multiverseid\': 581421}, {\'name\': \'Pirodemone Supremo di Tzeentch\', \'text\': "Ispirazione Magica — All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, riprendi in mano una carta istantaneo o stregoneria a caso dal tuo cimitero.\\nFuoco di Tzeentch — Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, il Pirodemone Supremo di Tzeentch infligge 1 danno a ogni avversario.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bc52350-4dc4-4282-ba41-b4eee30439c4\', \'multiverseId\': 581581}, \'multiverseid\': 581581}, {\'name\': \'ティーンチの高貴なるフレイマー\', \'text\': \'魔術的霊感 — あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたの墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるカード１枚を無作為に選んであなたの手札に戻す。\\nティーンチの炎 — あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、ティーンチの高貴なるフレイマーは各対戦相手にそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581741&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0710c39d-b257-4b0f-9687-1ff609981e06\', \'multiverseId\': 581741}, \'multiverseid\': 581741}, {\'name\': \'Lança-chamas Superior de Tzeentch\', \'text\': \'Inspiração Feiticeira — No início de sua manutenção, devolva um card de mágica instantânea ou de feitiço aleatório de seu cemitério para sua mão.\\nFogo de Tzeentch — Toda vez que você conjura uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço, Lança-chamas Superior de Tzeentch causa 1 ponto de dano a cada oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demônio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581901&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c605d53-97b9-404d-badf-73720405e198\', \'multiverseId\': 581901}, \'multiverseid\': 581901}, {\'name\': \'奸奇至尊火妖\', \'text\': \'巫法启示～在你的维持开始时，随机将一张瞬间或法术牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\\n奸奇之火～每当你施放瞬间或法术咒语时，奸奇至尊火妖向每位对手各造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～恶魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582221&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'080e85c6-6c77-47d1-a996-afaf43b1a02d\', \'multiverseId\': 582221}, \'multiverseid\': 582221}]', '[{\'name\': \'Exocrine\', \'text\': \'Unersättlich (Diese Kreatur kommt mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel. Falls X gleich 5 oder mehr ist, ziehe eine Karte, wenn sie ins Spiel kommt.)\\nBioplasma-Bombardement — Wenn die Exocrine ins Spiel kommt, fügt sie jedem Spieler und jeder anderen Kreatur X Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Tyranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581058&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d87b2374-1d70-43e8-b116-7f6127bf99e9\', \'multiverseId\': 581058}, \'multiverseid\': 581058}, {\'name\': \'Exocrino\', \'text\': \'Voracidad. (Esta criatura entra al campo de batalla con X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella. Si X es 5 o más, roba una carta cuando entre.)\\nDescarga bioplásmica — Cuando el Exocrino entre al campo de batalla, hace X puntos de daño a cada jugador y a cada otra criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiránido\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581218&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5134379c-d82a-4d63-a90c-c7792787c7df\', \'multiverseId\': 581218}, \'multiverseid\': 581218}, {\'name\': \'Exocrine\', \'text\': "Voracité (Cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle. Si X est supérieur ou égal à 5, piochez une carte quand elle arrive sur le champ de bataille.)\\nBarrage bioplasmique — Quand l\'Exocrine arrive sur le champ de bataille, il inflige X blessures à chaque joueur et à chaque autre créature.", \'type\': \'Créature : tyranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581378&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54579e8f-2085-491a-bfe9-bde882f62f08\', \'multiverseId\': 581378}, \'multiverseid\': 581378}, {\'name\': \'Esocrino\', \'text\': "Famelico (Questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia con X segnalini +1/+1. Se X è pari o superiore a 5, pesca una carta quando entra.)\\nBombardamento al Bioplasma — Quando l\'Esocrino entra nel campo di battaglia, infligge X danni a ogni giocatore e a ogni altra creatura.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Tiranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'953a4c74-9f18-4802-9eb6-6dfdb84afc65\', \'multiverseId\': 581538}, \'multiverseid\': 581538}, {\'name\': \'エグゾクライン\', \'text\': \'貪欲（このクリーチャーは＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。Ｘが５以上であるなら、これが戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引く。）\\nバイオプラズマ砲撃 — エグゾクラインが戦場に出たとき、これは各プレイヤーとこれでない各クリーチャーにそれぞれＸ点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ティラニッド\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581698&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b18a0c61-6618-4919-9946-696a15eab651\', \'multiverseId\': 581698}, \'multiverseid\': 581698}, {\'name\': \'Exócrino\', \'text\': \'Voraz (Esta criatura entra no campo de batalha com X marcadores +1/+1. Se X for igual ou superior a 5, compre um card quando ela entrar.)\\nBarragem Bioplásmica — Quando Exócrino entra no campo de batalha, ele causa X pontos de dano a cada jogador e a cada outra criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiranídeo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581858&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84c8391c-cf79-4423-a5fd-9d05e8be751e\', \'multiverseId\': 581858}, \'multiverseid\': 581858}, {\'name\': \'离子炮兽\', \'text\': \'贪食（此生物进战场时上面有X个+1/+1指示物。如果X等于或大于5，则当它进战场时抓一张牌。）\\n生物等离子齐射～当离子炮兽进战场时，它对每位牌手和每个其他生物各造成X点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～泰伦虫族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6ffb2bc-b555-455f-ae7b-cfdcecb36ac4\', \'multiverseId\': 582178}, \'multiverseid\': 582178}]', '[{\'name\': \'Expugnatorgarde-Supressor\', \'text\': \'Trupp {2} (Als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken, kannst du beliebig oft {2} bezahlen. Wenn diese Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge entsprechend viele Spielsteine, die Kopien von ihr sind.)\\nFliegend\\nUnterdrückungsfeuer — Immer wenn der Expugnatorgarde-Supressor einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Astartes, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581009&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ae3801b-f7bb-4605-879d-81e7b7f4489c\', \'multiverseId\': 581009}, \'multiverseid\': 581009}, {\'name\': \'Vanguardia de Supresores\', \'text\': \'Escuadra {2}. (Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, puedes pagar {2} tantas veces como quieras. Cuando esta criatura entre al campo de batalla, crea esa cantidad de fichas que son copias de ella.)\\nVuela.\\nFuego de supresión — Siempre que la Vanguardia de Supresores haga daño de combate a un jugador, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero astartes\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d61a5f0-4555-440c-b506-81d1635cbd49\', \'multiverseId\': 581169}, \'multiverseid\': 581169}, {\'name\': \'Suppressor Vanguard\', \'text\': \'Escouade {2} (En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, vous pouvez payer {2} autant de fois que vous le souhaitez. Quand cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez autant de jetons qui en sont des copies.)\\nVol\\nTir de suppression — À chaque fois que le Suppressor Vanguard inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature : astartes et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581329&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fcfcb979-a7b0-4237-adea-ddba1a6d31b9\', \'multiverseId\': 581329}, \'multiverseid\': 581329}, {\'name\': "Soppressore dell\'Avanguardia", \'text\': "Squadra {2} (Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, puoi pagare {2} un qualsiasi numero di volte. Quando questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia, crea altrettante pedine che sono sue copie.)\\nVolare\\nFuoco di Soppressione — Ogniqualvolta il Soppressore dell\'Avanguardia infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Astartes\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581489&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34bc528c-bf70-4f0f-9c20-53eb1c26f60e\', \'multiverseId\': 581489}, \'multiverseid\': 581489}, {\'name\': \'ヴァンガード・サプレッサー\', \'text\': \'分隊{2}（この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、あなたは望む回数の{2}を支払ってもよい。このクリーチャーが戦場に出たとき、その回数に等しい数の、これのコピーであるトークンを生成する。）\\n飛行\\n制圧射撃 — ヴァンガード・サプレッサーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — アスタルテス・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581649&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'018e060a-5104-45d3-b24c-65bc5f2ec746\', \'multiverseId\': 581649}, \'multiverseid\': 581649}, {\'name\': \'Supressor da Vanguarda\', \'text\': \'Esquadrão {2} (Como custo adicional para conjurar esta mágica, você pode pagar {2} qualquer número de vezes. Quando esta criatura entrar no campo de batalha, crie aquela quantidade de fichas que sejam cópias dela.)\\nVoar\\nFogo de Supressão — Toda vez que Supressor da Vanguarda causar dano de combate a um jogador, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Astartes Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581809&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9445fe54-1456-4ad3-a56d-5f08a5712527\', \'multiverseId\': 581809}, \'multiverseid\': 581809}, {\'name\': \'先锋压制者\', \'text\': \'小队{2}（你可以支付{2}任意次数，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。当此生物进战场时，派出等量为其复制品的衍生物。）\\n飞行\\n火力压制～每当先锋压制者对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～阿斯塔特／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582129&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25cd1b16-7f40-4506-a5a7-e9d4c15714db\', \'multiverseId\': 582129}, \'multiverseid\': 582129}]', '[{\'name\': \'Exterminatus\', \'text\': \'Bleibende Karten, die keine Länder sind und die deine Gegner kontrollieren, verlieren Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nZerstöre alle bleibenden Karten, die keine Länder sind.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Einige mögen an unserem Recht zweifeln, zehn Milliarden Menschen zu vernichten. Jene, die verstehen, werden erkennen, dass wir kein Recht haben, sie leben zu lassen."\\n—Exterminatus Extremis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581102&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7448f96-70f6-4853-926e-3317bb5bca0d\', \'multiverseId\': 581102}, \'multiverseid\': 581102}, {\'name\': \'Exterminatus\', \'text\': \'Los permanentes que no sean tierra que controlan tus oponentes pierden la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno.\\nDestruye todos los permanentes que no sean tierra.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Algunos cuestionarán tu derecho a exterminar a diez mil millones de personas. Otros, en cambio, comprenderán que no tienes derecho a dejarlos vivir".\\n—Exterminatus Extremis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16eaf8ab-4cc2-47ac-9672-72621ba4aa1f\', \'multiverseId\': 581262}, \'multiverseid\': 581262}, {\'name\': \'Exterminatus\', \'text\': "Les permanents non-terrain que vos adversaires contrôlent perdent l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nDétruisez tous les permanents non-terrain.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Certains d\'entre vous peuvent mettre en doute le droit que vous avez de faire périr dix milliards d\'individus. Mais ceux qui comprennent réalisent que, bien au contraire, vous n\'avez pas le droit de les laisser vivre. »\\n—Exterminatus Extremis", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581422&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'197d0c5b-469a-441a-9df0-d7b3bab06fc7\', \'multiverseId\': 581422}, \'multiverseid\': 581422}, {\'name\': \'Exterminatus\', \'text\': \'I permanenti non terra controllati dai tuoi avversari perdono indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno.\\nDistruggi tutti i permanenti non terra.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Alcuni potrebbero mettere in dubbio il tuo diritto di distruggere dieci miliardi di persone. Coloro che comprendono sanno che non hai il diritto di lasciarle in vita".\\n—Exterminatus Extremis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581582&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa6ea812-0bf5-49cc-9f76-1dd7c9377143\', \'multiverseId\': 581582}, \'multiverseid\': 581582}, {\'name\': \'究極浄化\', \'text\': \'ターン終了時まで、対戦相手がコントロールしていて土地でないすべてのパーマネントは破壊不能を失う。\\n土地でないすべてのパーマネントを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「中には百億人もの命を奪う権利に疑問を呈する者もいるだろう。有識者なら、あなたに彼らを生かす権利がないことを理解するだろう。」\\n――断絶の究極浄化\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581742&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ee0624b-8d78-4d53-9b61-9e0ec49cbb8a\', \'multiverseId\': 581742}, \'multiverseid\': 581742}, {\'name\': \'Exterminatus\', \'text\': \'As permanentes não de terreno que seus oponentes controlam perdem indestrutível até o final do turno.\\nDestrua todas as permanentes não de terreno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Pode haver quem questione o seu direito de destruir dez bilhões de pessoas. Quem compreende sabe que você não tem o direito de deixá-los viver."\\n— Exterminatus Extremis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581902&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adfa7eec-73e0-4641-8f50-e917c646fdda\', \'multiverseId\': 581902}, \'multiverseid\': 581902}, {\'name\': \'灭绝令\', \'text\': \'由对手操控的非地永久物失去不灭异能直到回合结束。\\n消灭所有非地永久物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「有人会质疑你为何有权让数百亿人死。明白人则知道你没权让他们活。」\\n～终极灭绝令\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d4403b8-8514-4fe7-b476-2aa1f428de97\', \'multiverseId\': 582222}, \'multiverseid\': 582222}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fragment des Drachen\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nSpeer des Drachen — Immer wenn das Fragment des Drachen angreift, opfert jeder Gegner eine bleibende Karte, die kein Land ist.\\nMaterieabsorption — Immer wenn ein Artefakt aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt oder aus dem Spiel ins Exil geschickt wird, lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf das Fragment des Drachen.\', \'type\': "Kreatur — C\'tan", \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581038&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a428c2aa-0181-4f32-8f89-ce5f9a40fc69\', \'multiverseId\': 581038}, \'multiverseid\': 581038}, {\'name\': \'Fragmento del Dragón de vacío\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nLanza del dragón de vacío — Siempre que el Fragmento del Dragón de vacío ataque, cada oponente sacrifica un permanente que no sea tierra.\\nAbsorción de materia — Siempre que un artefacto vaya a un cementerio desde el campo de batalla o vaya al exilio desde el campo de batalla, pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre el Fragmento del Dragón de vacío.\', \'type\': "Criatura — C\'tan", \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581198&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff1c85f2-afd8-4613-a642-351686e0cee7\', \'multiverseId\': 581198}, \'multiverseid\': 581198}, {\'name\': \'Écharde du Dragon du Néant\', \'text\': "Vol\\nLance du Dragon du Néant — À chaque fois que l\'Écharde du Dragon du Néant attaque, chaque adversaire sacrifie un permanent non-terrain.\\nAbsorption de matière — À chaque fois qu\'un artefact est mis dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille ou en exil depuis le champ de bataille, mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur l\'Écharde du Dragon du Néant.", \'type\': "Créature : c\'tan", \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581358&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e0da3e8-e9d1-4dc0-99ea-c410588eb765\', \'multiverseId\': 581358}, \'multiverseid\': 581358}, {\'name\': \'Scheggia del Drago del Vuoto\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nLancia del Drago del Vuoto — Ogniqualvolta la Scheggia del Drago del Vuoto attacca, ogni avversario sacrifica un permanente non terra.\\nAssorbimento della Materia — Ogniqualvolta un artefatto viene messo in un cimitero dal campo di battaglia o viene messo in esilio dal campo di battaglia, metti due segnalini +1/+1 sulla Scheggia del Drago del Vuoto.\', \'type\': "Creatura — C\'tan", \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581518&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'174eceee-8f07-4520-9270-6045c69963eb\', \'multiverseId\': 581518}, \'multiverseid\': 581518}, {\'name\': \'虚ろの竜のシャード\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n虚ろの竜の槍 — 虚ろの竜のシャードが攻撃するたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれ土地でないパーマネント１つを生け贄に捧げる。\\n物質吸収 — アーティファクト１つが戦場から墓地や追放領域に置かれるたび、虚ろの竜のシャードの上に＋１/＋１カウンター２個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ク＝タン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ccd0b88-4a8b-4135-ae5d-f1c662bf8a34\', \'multiverseId\': 581678}, \'multiverseid\': 581678}, {\'name\': \'Fragmento do Dragão do Vazio\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nLança do Dragão do Vazio — Toda vez que Fragmento do Dragão do Vazio ataca, cada oponente sacrifica uma permanente não de terreno.\\nAbsorção de Matéria — Toda vez que um artefato for colocado do campo de batalha em um cemitério ou no exílio , coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 em Fragmento do Dragão do Vazio.\', \'type\': "Criatura — C\'tan", \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581838&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf985fa0-fba5-429a-87fd-a4fc46d086c1\', \'multiverseId\': 581838}, \'multiverseid\': 581838}, {\'name\': \'虚空龙碎片\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n虚空龙之矛～每当虚空龙碎片攻击时，每位对手各牺牲一个非地永久物。\\n物质吸收～每当一个神器从战场进入坟墓场或放逐区时，在虚空龙碎片上放置两个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～星神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582158&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c20bd982-93bc-4f66-a049-db5c10742dcc\', \'multiverseId\': 582158}, \'multiverseid\': 582158}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fragment des Todesboten\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nLebensenergie absaugen — Wenn das Fragment des Todesboten ins Spiel kommt und falls du es gewirkt hast, verliert ein Gegner deiner Wahl die Hälfte seiner Lebenspunkte, aufgerundet. Du erhältst so viele Lebenspunkte dazu, wie auf diese Weise Lebenspunkte verloren wurden.\', \'type\': "Kreatur — C\'tan", \'flavor\': \'„Aza\\\'gorod, der Todesbote. Die Verkörperung des Todes. Der Vernichter von Sternen und Welten."\\n—Illuminor Szeras\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581037&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1ca6962-2095-4730-8933-6a466d14da0c\', \'multiverseId\': 581037}, \'multiverseid\': 581037}, {\'name\': \'Fragmento del Portador de la Noche\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nDrenar vida — Cuando el Fragmento del Portador de la Noche entre al campo de batalla, si lo lanzaste, el oponente objetivo pierde la mitad de sus vidas, redondeando hacia arriba. Ganas una cantidad de vidas igual a la cantidad de vidas perdidas de esta manera.\', \'type\': "Criatura — C\'tan", \'flavor\': \'"Aza\\\'gorod, el Portador de la Noche. La encarnación de la muerte. Un asesino de estrellas y mundos".\\n—Illuminor Szeras\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581197&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bb5b2f0-09e2-4e97-93ac-16d56a3383f9\', \'multiverseId\': 581197}, \'multiverseid\': 581197}, {\'name\': \'Écharde du Nyctophore\', \'text\': "Vol\\nDrain de vie — Quand l\'Écharde du Nyctophore arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous l\'avez lancée, un adversaire ciblé perd la moitié de ses points de vie, arrondie à l\'unité supérieure. Vous gagnez autant de points de vie que ceux perdus de cette manière.", \'type\': "Créature : c\'tan", \'flavor\': "« Aza\'gorod, le Nyctophore. L\'incarnation de la mort. Un tueur d\'étoiles, et de mondes. »\\n—Illuminor Szeras", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581357&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7be36c8-1aeb-449c-977d-add088bf9350\', \'multiverseId\': 581357}, \'multiverseid\': 581357}, {\'name\': \'Scheggia del Noctifero\', \'text\': "Volare\\nProsciuga Vita — Quando la Scheggia del Noctifero entra nel campo di battaglia, se l\'hai lanciata, un avversario bersaglio perde metà dei suoi punti vita, arrotondati per eccesso. Guadagni tanti punti vita quanti sono i punti vita persi in questo modo.", \'type\': "Creatura — C\'tan", \'flavor\': \'"Aza\\\'gorod, il Noctifero. L\\\'incarnazione della morte. Uccisore di stelle e di mondi."\\n—Illuminor Szeras\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581517&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'620f3030-0165-4751-84a8-37f116aea7d3\', \'multiverseId\': 581517}, \'multiverseid\': 581517}, {\'name\': \'夜をもたらすもののシャード\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nドレインライフ — 夜をもたらすもののシャードが戦場に出たとき、あなたがこれを唱えていた場合、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分のライフの端数を切り上げた半分の点数のライフを失う。あなたはこれにより失われたライフに等しい点数のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ク＝タン\', \'flavor\': \'「夜をもたらすもの、アザ＝ゴロド。死の権化。星や惑星を滅ぼすものだ。」\\n――イルミノール・スゼラス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581677&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27e79b73-6ea4-4f02-8a65-19bae0c5dac5\', \'multiverseId\': 581677}, \'multiverseid\': 581677}, {\'name\': \'Fragmento do Arauto da Noite\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nDrenar Vida — Quando Fragmento do Arauto da Noite entra no campo de batalha, se você o conjurou, o oponente alvo perde metade dos próprios pontos de vida, arredondada para cima. Você ganha uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual à quantidade de pontos de vida perdida dessa maneira.\', \'type\': "Criatura — C\'tan", \'flavor\': \'"Aza\\\'gorod, o Arauto da Noite. A personificação da morte. Assassino de estrelas e mundos."\\n— Illuminor Szeras\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581837&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cca2ba2-dc9d-438c-a1cb-0964f0a5a384\', \'multiverseId\': 581837}, \'multiverseid\': 581837}, {\'name\': \'拥夜者碎片\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n吸取生命～当拥夜者碎片进战场时，若它经你施放，则目标对手失去一半生命，小数点后进位。你获得若干生命，其数量等同于以此法失去的生命数量。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～星神\', \'flavor\': \'「阿札格罗，拥夜者。死亡化身。毁星灭世。」\\n～光耀者斯泽拉斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582157&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e60e86a3-4ffc-46a6-8d1e-cabb7d420e76\', \'multiverseId\': 582157}, \'multiverseid\': 582157}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fäulnis des Nurgle\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur, die ein Gegner kontrolliert.\\nWenn die verzauberte Kreatur stirbt, bringe die Fäulnis des Nurgle auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück und du erzeugst einen 1/3 schwarzen Dämon-Kreaturenspielstein namens Seuchenhüter des Nurgle.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Jeder Seuchenhüter wird aus der verdorbenen Seele eines Sterblichen geformt, der von der Fäulnis des Nurgle dahingerafft wurde.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581027&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb31014e-04f3-4d24-ad16-195f101398e9\', \'multiverseId\': 581027}, \'multiverseid\': 581027}, {\'name\': \'Podredumbre de Nurgle\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura que controla un oponente.\\nCuando la criatura encantada muera, regresa la Podredumbre de Nurgle a la mano de su propietario y tú creas una ficha de criatura Demonio negra 1/3 llamada Portador de Plaga de Nurgle.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Cada portador de plaga se forma a partir del alma corrompida de un mortal víctima de la Podredumbre de Nurgle.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581187&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c9c3820-369a-4c6d-97ad-bb0802386b5d\', \'multiverseId\': 581187}, \'multiverseid\': 581187}, {\'name\': \'Gangrène de Nurgle\', \'text\': "Enchanter : une créature qu\'un adversaire contrôle\\nQuand la créature enchantée meurt, renvoyez la Gangrène de Nurgle dans la main de son propriétaire et vous créez un jeton de créature 1/3 noire Démon appelé Portepeste de Nurgle.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "Chaque portepeste est constitué de l\'âme corrompue d\'un mortel tué par la Gangrène de Nurgle.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581347&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c306ae8-df81-4e1d-b06b-e2ae0c6b221d\', \'multiverseId\': 581347}, \'multiverseid\': 581347}, {\'name\': \'Putrefazione di Nurgle\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura controllata da un avversario\\nQuando la creatura incantata muore, fai tornare la Putrefazione di Nurgle in mano al suo proprietario e crei una pedina creatura Demone 1/3 nera chiamata Untori di Nurgle.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': "Ogni untore viene formato dall\'anima corrotta di un mortale ucciso dalla putrefazione di Nurgle.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17e1391b-4874-430d-86dc-6274dbc7a60d\', \'multiverseId\': 581507}, \'multiverseid\': 581507}, {\'name\': \'ナーグルの腐蝕\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーが死亡したとき、ナーグルの腐蝕をオーナーの手札に戻し、あなたは「プレーグベアラー・オヴ・ナーグル」という名前の黒の１/３のデーモン・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'プレーグベアラー一体一体が、ナーグルの腐蝕によって殺された定命の者の荒廃した魂によって形成される。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65b29b7f-fcd0-4bee-b6da-1f611912724b\', \'multiverseId\': 581667}, \'multiverseid\': 581667}, {\'name\': \'Podridão de Nurgle\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura que um oponente controla\\nQuando a criatura encantada morrer, devolva Podridão de Nurgle para a mão de seu dono e você cria uma ficha de criatura Demônio preta 1/3 com o nome Porta-peste de Nurgle.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Cada porta-peste é formado pela alma pestilenta de um mortal vítima da Podridão de Nurgle.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581827&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97d870c8-1a78-4df1-bfdc-c5401afecc0a\', \'multiverseId\': 581827}, \'multiverseid\': 581827}, {\'name\': \'纳垢之腐\', \'text\': \'结附于由对手操控的生物\\n当所结附的生物死去时，将纳垢之腐移回其拥有者手上，且你派出一个1/3黑色，名称为纳垢瘟疫行者的恶魔衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'每个瘟疫行者，都来自因纳垢之腐而丧命的凡人枯萎灵魂。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a450f2cf-b1e2-4101-bc5e-d93c1791a1a5\', \'multiverseId\': 582147}, \'multiverseid\': 582147}]', '[{\'name\': \'Für den Imperator!\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +2/+2, Wachsamkeit und Lebensverknüpfung bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Sie alle haben den Ruf vernommen, die Missionare, die Pilger, die Schwestern des Ordo Militaris. Die Mächte des Chaos schmolzen unter dem Feuer ihres Glaubens.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=580994&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b302b2e6-1a78-43c3-907a-3445211bee78\', \'multiverseId\': 580994}, \'multiverseid\': 580994}, {\'name\': \'¡Por el Emperador!\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que controlas obtienen +2/+2 y ganan las habilidades de vigilancia y vínculo vital hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Todos acudieron a la llamada: los misioneros, los peregrinos, las hermanas de las Órdenes Militantes. Su fe ardiente calcinó a las fuerzas del Caos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581154&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bfb8aae-9c9d-4285-84b9-89316209e47f\', \'multiverseId\': 581154}, \'multiverseid\': 581154}, {\'name\': "Pour l\'Empereur !", \'text\': "Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+2 et acquièrent la vigilance et le lien de vie jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Tous reprirent le cri : les missionnaires, les pèlerins, les sœurs des Ordres militants. Les forces du Chaos fondirent dans le feu de leur foi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581314&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f8273b3-c2ef-48a8-8eb2-57c921f14f2e\', \'multiverseId\': 581314}, \'multiverseid\': 581314}, {\'name\': "Per l\'Imperatore!", \'text\': \'Le creature che controlli prendono +2/+2 e hanno cautela e legame vitale fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Risposero tutti alla chiamata, i missionari, i pellegrini, le sorelle degli Ordini Militant. Le forze del Caos si sciolsero davanti al fuoco della loro fede.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581474&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bfb2024-c697-4b53-a115-1de9056b1187\', \'multiverseId\': 581474}, \'multiverseid\': 581474}, {\'name\': \'皇帝の為に！\', \'text\': \'ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受け警戒と絆魂を得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'聖務団も、巡礼者も、騎士修道会の修道女も皆、咆哮をあげた。渾沌の軍勢は、彼らの信仰心の炎によって焼き尽くされた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581634&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0cdc05c-4fbd-4200-a217-b1554b9f774f\', \'multiverseId\': 581634}, \'multiverseid\': 581634}, {\'name\': \'Pelo Imperador!\', \'text\': \'As criaturas que você controla recebem +2/+2 e ganham vigilância e vínculo com a vida até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Todos se uniram no brado: os missionários, os peregrinos, as irmãs das Ordens Militantes. As forças do Caos sucumbiram ante o fogo de sua fé.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581794&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2cf884e-2218-4808-81e5-fb4774e3765f\', \'multiverseId\': 581794}, \'multiverseid\': 581794}, {\'name\': \'为了帝皇！\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，由你操控的生物得+2/+2且获得警戒与系命异能。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'传教士、朝圣者、军事修会的战斗修女之呼喊声一波高过一波。明亮的信念火光将混沌大军全都烧成灰烬。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582114&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf3baaf9-e2ad-414e-886f-8acec5f14bee\', \'multiverseId\': 582114}, \'multiverseid\': 582114}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gargoylenschwarm\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nHimmelsschwarm — Zu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls in diesem Zug eine Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel gekommen ist, erzeuge einen 1/1 blauen Tyranide-Gargoyle-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Tyranide, Gargoyle\', \'flavor\': \'Sie stürzen sich schreiend auf die Verteidigungslinien und verbreiten Chaos, bevor der Hauptangriff beginnt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581105&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdd4b447-dafc-4ed8-8057-ec04d04e4f41\', \'multiverseId\': 581105}, \'multiverseid\': 581105}, {\'name\': \'Bandada de Gárgolas\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nEnjambre volador — Al comienzo de tu paso final, si una criatura entró al campo de batalla bajo tu control este turno, crea una ficha de criatura Gárgola Tiránida azul 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gárgola tiránida\', \'flavor\': \'Se abalanzan chillando hacia las líneas defensivas para sembrar el caos antes de que comience el asalto principal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0ba96b7-e7a5-4af8-b221-6f72e3f04e82\', \'multiverseId\': 581265}, \'multiverseid\': 581265}, {\'name\': \'Vol de gargouilles\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nEssaim volant — Au début de votre étape de fin, si une créature est arrivée sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle ce tour-ci, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 bleue Tyranide et Gargouille avec le vol.\', \'type\': \'Créature : tyranide et gargouille\', \'flavor\': "Elles plongent en hurlant sur les lignes de défense, semant le chaos avant le début de l\'assaut principal.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581425&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60b61c8d-4ed9-4cc7-81c7-f62a6097d3df\', \'multiverseId\': 581425}, \'multiverseid\': 581425}, {\'name\': \'Stormo di Gargolle\', \'text\': "Volare\\nSciameceleste — All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, se una creatura è entrata nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo in questo turno, crea una pedina creatura Tiranide Gargolla 1/1 blu con volare.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Gargoyle Tiranide\', \'flavor\': "Scendono in picchiata urlando sulle linee difensive, seminando il caos ancor prima che inizi l\'assalto principale.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581585&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06039b57-efaf-4c54-aba2-bfeaefa8fbc4\', \'multiverseId\': 581585}, \'multiverseid\': 581585}, {\'name\': \'ガーゴイルの戦群\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n飛行群集団 — あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、このターンにあなたのコントロール下でクリーチャーが戦場に出たことがある場合、飛行を持つ青の１/１のティラニッド・ガーゴイル・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ティラニッド・ガーゴイル\', \'flavor\': \'防衛線に悲鳴を上げながら急降下し、本体の攻撃が始まる前に混乱の種をまく。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581745&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a051d37f-bc7b-4f45-ae51-51da8807d9e1\', \'multiverseId\': 581745}, \'multiverseid\': 581745}, {\'name\': \'Bando de Gárgulas\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nEnxame Celeste — No início de sua etapa final, se uma criatura tiver entrado no campo de batalha sob seu controle neste turno, crie uma ficha de criatura Tiranídeo Gárgula azul 1/1 com voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiranídeo Gárgula\', \'flavor\': \'Eles mergulham gritando nas linhas defensivas, semeando o caos antes do início do ataque principal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581905&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e7f0ce2-2f91-4b2e-aa49-c6b2e10489e8\', \'multiverseId\': 581905}, \'multiverseid\': 581905}, {\'name\': \'石像鬼群\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n蔽空大群～在你的结束步骤开始时，若本回合中有生物在你的操控下进战场，则派出一个1/1蓝色，具飞行异能的泰伦虫族／石像鬼衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～泰伦虫族／石像鬼\', \'flavor\': \'他们啸叫着冲入防线，在总攻开始前制造混乱。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582225&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9e1aebc-25bf-4fe5-83cd-64271a6a6499\', \'multiverseId\': 582225}, \'multiverseid\': 582225}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geflügelter Schwarmtyrant\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Eile\\nDer Wille des Schwarmbewusstseins — Andere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst und auf denen Marken liegen, haben Flugfähigkeit und Eile.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Tyranide\', \'flavor\': \'Die synaptische Verbindung eines Schwarmtyranten ist die Hauptverbindung, mit der das Schwarmbewusstsein seine Herrschaft auf die niederen Kreaturen der Schwarmflotte ausübt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581130&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06183147-d637-48a4-919b-9e502924f3b9\', \'multiverseId\': 581130}, \'multiverseid\': 581130}, {\'name\': \'Tirano de Enjambre Alado\', \'text\': \'Vuela, prisa.\\nLa voluntad de la Mente colmena — Las otras criaturas que controlas con contadores sobre ellas tienen las habilidades de volar y prisa.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiránido\', \'flavor\': \'El vínculo sináptico de un tirano de enjambre es el método principal con el que la Mente colmena se impone sobre las criaturas menores de una flota enjambre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581290&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac908c6b-0fde-4301-a73c-9a3bc5f0ddc6\', \'multiverseId\': 581290}, \'multiverseid\': 581290}, {\'name\': \'Tyran des Ruches ailé\', \'text\': "Vol, célérité\\nVolonté de l\'Esprit-ruche — Les autres créatures que vous contrôlez avec des marqueurs sur elles ont le vol et la célérité.", \'type\': \'Créature : tyranide\', \'flavor\': "Le lien synaptique d\'un Tyran des Ruches est le conduit principal par lequel l\'Esprit-ruche assure sa dominance sur les créatures inférieures d\'une flotte-ruche.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581450&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93ee2e2d-3651-40cb-9527-ce2d87996d82\', \'multiverseId\': 581450}, \'multiverseid\': 581450}, {\'name\': "Tiranno dell\'Alveare Alato", \'text\': "Volare, rapidità\\nVolontà della Mente dell\'Alveare — Le altre creature con segnalini che controlli hanno volare e rapidità.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Tiranide\', \'flavor\': "Il collegamento sinaptico di un tiranno dell\'alveare è il condotto principale attraverso il quale la Mente dell\'Alveare impone il suo dominio sulle creature minori di una flotta alveare.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e83c55f8-38cd-4236-8147-418abdc4a602\', \'multiverseId\': 581610}, \'multiverseid\': 581610}, {\'name\': \'有翼ハイヴタイラント\', \'text\': \'飛行、速攻\\n群巣意識の総意 — あなたがコントロールしていてカウンターが置かれていてこれでないすべてのクリーチャーは飛行と速攻を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ティラニッド\', \'flavor\': \'ハイヴタイラントのシナプスの結合は、群巣意識が群巣艦隊の下等生物を支配する主導管の役割を果たしている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca3fa7bc-30e0-488c-883d-18776b3a54ff\', \'multiverseId\': 581770}, \'multiverseid\': 581770}, {\'name\': \'Tirano da Colmeia Alado\', \'text\': \'Voar, ímpeto\\nA Vontade da Mente-colmeia — As outras criaturas que você controla com marcadores têm voar e ímpeto.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiranídeo\', \'flavor\': \'O elo sináptico de um tirano da colmeia é o conduíte primário pelo qual a Mente-colmeia impõe seu domínio sobre as criaturas inferiores de uma frota-colmeia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581930&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89f0f2fd-c896-4d8d-80fd-afef00640cea\', \'multiverseId\': 581930}, \'multiverseid\': 581930}, {\'name\': \'有翼虫巢暴君\', \'text\': \'飞行，敏捷\\n虫巢之意志～由你操控且其上有指示物的其他生物具有飞行与敏捷异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～泰伦虫族\', \'flavor\': \'虫巢暴君的突触连结，乃是虫巢意志有效统领虫巢舰队低级生物的主要传导通道。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e7d5c49-56ef-4064-91e6-484ea1eb0c8b\', \'multiverseId\': 582250}, \'multiverseid\': 582250}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geisterbarke\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nReparaturgleiter — Immer wenn die Geisterbarke bemannt wird, erhält jede Artefaktkreaturenkarte in deinem Friedhof Exhumieren {3} bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nBemannen 2 (Tappe eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst und die zusammen Stärke 2 oder mehr haben: Dieses Fahrzeug wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer Artefaktkreatur.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Fahrzeug\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581138&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62f021f3-bbd5-41b8-9997-89a638b10f5f\', \'multiverseId\': 581138}, \'multiverseid\': 581138}, {\'name\': \'Arca Fantasma\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nPlataforma de reparación — Siempre que el Arca Fantasma sea tripulada, cada carta de criatura artefacto en tu cementerio gana la habilidad de desenterrar {3} hasta el final del turno.\\nTripular 2. (Girar cualquier cantidad de criaturas que controlas con una fuerza total de 2 o más: Este Vehículo se convierte en una criatura artefacto hasta el final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Vehículo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581298&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6974926-8186-460f-b852-8ea3b86a1a76\', \'multiverseId\': 581298}, \'multiverseid\': 581298}, {\'name\': \'Arche fantôme\', \'text\': "Vol\\nConsole de réparation — À chaque fois que l\'Arche fantôme devient pilotée, chaque carte de créature-artefact dans votre cimetière acquiert exhumation {3} jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nPilotage 2 (Engagez n\'importe quel nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez dont la force totale est supérieure ou égale à 2 : Ce véhicule devient une créature-artefact jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : véhicule\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581458&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fca0acc2-6a99-46d2-9a56-a4e849de1656\', \'multiverseId\': 581458}, \'multiverseid\': 581458}, {\'name\': \'Arca Fantasma\', \'text\': "Volare\\nVascello di Riparazione — Ogniqualvolta l\'Arca Fantasma viene manovrata, ogni carta creatura artefatto nel tuo cimitero ha dissotterrare {3} fino alla fine del turno.\\nManovrare 2 (TAPpa un qualsiasi numero di creature che controlli con forza totale pari o superiore a 2: Questo Veicolo diventa una creatura artefatto fino alla fine del turno.)", \'type\': \'Artefatto — Veicolo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25571912-fe04-43ca-ad81-ecc1ef910998\', \'multiverseId\': 581618}, \'multiverseid\': 581618}, {\'name\': \'ゴーストアーク\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n修復船 — ゴーストアークが搭乗された状態になるたび、ターン終了時まで、あなたの墓地にあるすべてのアーティファクト・クリーチャー・カードは蘇生{3}を得る。\\n搭乗２（あなたがコントロールしている望む数のクリーチャーを、パワーの合計が２以上になるように選んでタップする：ターン終了時まで、この機体はアーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 機体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581778&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0b26b5a-1345-498f-99ef-9e115bfc7efa\', \'multiverseId\': 581778}, \'multiverseid\': 581778}, {\'name\': \'Arca Fantasma\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nBarcaça de Reparos — Toda vez que Arca Fantasma se torna tripulada, cada card de criatura artefato em seu cemitério ganha desenterrar {3} até o final do turno.\\nTripular 2 (Vire qualquer número de criaturas que você controla com total de poder igual ou superior a 2: Este Veículo torna-se uma criatura artefato até o final do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Veículo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581938&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3b4d6f7-800a-4d15-b477-0bdbb8470cf6\', \'multiverseId\': 581938}, \'multiverseid\': 581938}, {\'name\': \'幽灵方舟\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n维修驳船～每当幽灵方舟成为已搭载时，你坟墓场中的每张神器生物牌均获得破坟{3}直到回合结束。\\n搭载2（横置任意数量由你操控且力量总和等于或大于2的生物：此载具成为神器生物直到回合结束。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～载具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582258&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f27d5cb-fd07-4876-bd8f-fde7b0a6e2bc\', \'multiverseId\': 582258}, \'multiverseid\': 582258}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ghyrson Starn, Kelermorph\', \'text\': \'Abwehr {2} (Immer wenn diese Kreatur das Ziel eines Zauberspruchs oder einer Fähigkeit wird, den bzw. die ein Gegner kontrolliert, neutralisiere ihn bzw. sie, es sei denn, jener Spieler bezahlt {2}.)\\nDrei Automatikpistolen — Immer wenn eine andere Quelle, die du kontrollierst, einer bleibenden Karte oder einem Spieler genau 1 Schadenspunkt zufügt, fügt Ghyrson Starn jener bleibenden Karte bzw. jenem Spieler 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Tyranide, Mensch\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581106&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93ee5bb5-e7aa-4d8f-b5ef-6a7be003dbed\', \'multiverseId\': 581106}, \'multiverseid\': 581106}, {\'name\': \'Ghyrson Starn, Kelermorfo\', \'text\': \'Rebatir {2}. (Siempre que esta criatura sea objetivo de un hechizo o habilidad que controla un oponente, contrarréstalo a menos que ese jugador pague {2}.)\\nTres revólveres — Siempre que otra fuente que controlas haga exactamente 1 punto de daño a un permanente o jugador, Ghyrson Starn, Kelermorfo hace 2 puntos de daño a ese permanente o jugador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Humano tiránido\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04b2d645-560f-45b7-a1c5-f05dc66f8473\', \'multiverseId\': 581266}, \'multiverseid\': 581266}, {\'name\': \'Ghyrson Starn, kelermorphe\', \'text\': "Parade {2} (À chaque fois que cette créature devient la cible d\'un sort ou d\'une capacité qu\'un adversaire contrôle, contrecarrez ce sort ou cette capacité à moins que ce joueur ne paie {2}.)\\nTrois armes automatiques — À chaque fois qu\'une autre source que vous contrôlez inflige exactement 1 blessure à un permanent ou à un joueur, Ghyrson Starn, kelermorphe inflige 2 blessures à ce permanent ou à ce joueur.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : tyranide et humain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581426&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c411df7-cad0-40ec-9682-c0ad8f28b1d8\', \'multiverseId\': 581426}, \'multiverseid\': 581426}, {\'name\': \'Ghyrson Starn, Kelemorph\', \'text\': "Egida {2} (Ogniqualvolta questa creatura diventa bersaglio di una magia o abilità controllata da un avversario, neutralizza quella magia o abilità a meno che quel giocatore non paghi {2}.)\\nTre Mitragliatori Automatici — Ogniqualvolta un\'altra fonte che controlli infligge esattamente 1 danno a un permanente o a un giocatore, Ghyrson Starn, Kelemorph infligge 2 danni a quel permanente o a quel giocatore.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Umano Tiranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5ea5d09-2459-4cc6-b704-9fa2aef638d3\', \'multiverseId\': 581586}, \'multiverseid\': 581586}, {\'name\': \'ケラーモーフ、ギルソン・スターン\', \'text\': \'護法{2}（このクリーチャーが対戦相手がコントロールしている呪文や能力の対象になるたび、そのプレイヤーが{2}を支払わないかぎり、その呪文や能力を打ち消す。）\\n三連オートスタブ — あなたがコントロールしていてこれでない発生源がパーマネントやプレイヤーのうち１つに１点ちょうどのダメージを与えるたび、ケラーモーフ、ギルソン・スターンはそのパーマネントやプレイヤーに２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ティラニッド・人間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581746&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3f4e76e-b39f-4145-be7d-7592c4808088\', \'multiverseId\': 581746}, \'multiverseid\': 581746}, {\'name\': \'Ghyrson Starn, Kelermorfo\', \'text\': \'Salvaguarda {2} (Toda vez que esta criatura se tornar alvo de uma mágica ou habilidade que um oponente controla, anule-a, a menos que aquele jogador pague {2}.)\\nTrês Autotocos — Toda vez que outra fonte que você controla causar exatamente 1 ponto de dano a uma permanente ou a um jogador, Ghyrson Starn, Kelermorfo, causará 2 pontos de dano àquela permanente ou àquele jogador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Tiranídeo Humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581906&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f763aca8-15ec-474a-bb40-b58bbda84803\', \'multiverseId\': 581906}, \'multiverseid\': 581906}, {\'name\': \'三枪侠吉尔森·史塔恩\', \'text\': \'守护{2}（每当此生物成为由对手操控之咒语或异能的目标时，除非该牌手支付{2}，否则反击之。）\\n三管自动枪～每当另一个由你操控的来源对任一永久物或牌手造成正好1点伤害时，三枪侠吉尔森·史塔恩对该永久物或牌手造成2点伤害。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～泰伦虫族／人类\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582226&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ee84e36-c8a1-48ff-a2fb-79a76cf6fbe4\', \'multiverseId\': 582226}, \'multiverseid\': 582226}]', '[{\'name\': \'Goliath-Truck\', \'text\': \'Laderaum — Immer wenn der Goliath-Truck angreift, lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf eine andere angreifende Kreatur deiner Wahl.\\nBemannen 2 (Tappe eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst und die zusammen Stärke 2 oder mehr haben: Dieses Fahrzeug wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer Artefaktkreatur.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Fahrzeug\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581140&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'577ef10e-8b2a-4a3d-a297-53a9c7af1aa1\', \'multiverseId\': 581140}, \'multiverseid\': 581140}, {\'name\': \'Camión Goliath\', \'text\': \'Almacenamiento — Siempre que el Camión Goliath ataque, pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre otra criatura atacante objetivo.\\nTripular 2. (Girar cualquier cantidad de criaturas que controlas con una fuerza total de 2 o más: Este Vehículo se convierte en una criatura artefacto hasta el final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Vehículo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581300&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7417978f-d2cc-4b43-b37a-f67cdb458936\', \'multiverseId\': 581300}, \'multiverseid\': 581300}, {\'name\': \'Camion Goliath\', \'text\': "Transport — À chaque fois que le Camion Goliath attaque, mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur une autre créature attaquante ciblée.\\nPilotage 2 (Engagez n\'importe quel nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez dont la force totale est supérieure ou égale à 2 : Ce véhicule devient une créature-artefact jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : véhicule\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581460&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79c45d73-30a6-44b7-a62f-2c73aeb4980a\', \'multiverseId\': 581460}, \'multiverseid\': 581460}, {\'name\': \'Camionetta Goliath\', \'text\': "Stivaggio — Ogniqualvolta la Camionetta Goliath attacca, metti due segnalini +1/+1 su un\'altra creatura attaccante bersaglio.\\nManovrare 2 (TAPpa un qualsiasi numero di creature che controlli con forza totale pari o superiore a 2: Questo Veicolo diventa una creatura artefatto fino alla fine del turno.)", \'type\': \'Artefatto — Veicolo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581620&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54a089a7-c2a9-41c7-8160-fd0f041a1bb1\', \'multiverseId\': 581620}, \'multiverseid\': 581620}, {\'name\': \'ゴライアス・トラック\', \'text\': \'積載貨物 — ゴライアス・トラックが攻撃するたび、これでない攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター２個を置く。\\n搭乗２（あなたがコントロールしている望む数のクリーチャーを、パワーの合計が２以上になるように選んでタップする：ターン終了時まで、この機体はアーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 機体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b702a0e2-9434-4f8b-b6d7-bb4653a34ee4\', \'multiverseId\': 581780}, \'multiverseid\': 581780}, {\'name\': \'Caminhão Golias\', \'text\': \'Estiva — Toda vez que Caminhão Golias atacar, coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 em outra criatura atacante alvo.\\nTripular 2 (Vire qualquer número de criaturas que você controla com total de poder igual ou superior a 2: Este Veículo torna-se uma criatura artefato até o final do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Veículo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581940&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba3b04a6-a4f0-4d9d-a3aa-e32089e2545b\', \'multiverseId\': 581940}, \'multiverseid\': 581940}, {\'name\': \'格利亚卡车\', \'text\': \'装载部队～每当格利亚卡车攻击时，在另一个目标进行攻击的生物上放置两个+1/+1指示物。\\n搭载2（横置任意数量由你操控且力量总和等于或大于2的生物：此载具成为神器生物直到回合结束。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～载具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582260&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5216ac47-06b5-4947-8d93-3d64ef2a8550\', \'multiverseId\': 582260}, \'multiverseid\': 582260}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grimmritter\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nWütende Raserei — Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug bestimmst du per Zufall einen Gegner. Der Grimmritter greift jenen Spieler in diesem Kampf an, falls möglich.\\nWenn der Grimmritter stirbt, fügt er einem per Zufall bestimmten Gegner deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Ritter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581062&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eef31202-3117-4730-8f96-cd7a8d172be0\', \'multiverseId\': 581062}, \'multiverseid\': 581062}, {\'name\': \'Knight Rampager\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nAsalto frenético — Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, elige un oponente al azar. El Knight Rampager ataca a ese jugador este combate si puede.\\nCuando el Knight Rampager muera, hace 4 puntos de daño a un oponente objetivo elegido al azar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Caballero\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a1189cf-61de-4496-bae4-9d1cb8f905a3\', \'multiverseId\': 581222}, \'multiverseid\': 581222}, {\'name\': \'Chevalier Saccageur\', \'text\': \'Piétinement\\nCarnage frénétique — Au début du combat pendant votre tour, choisissez un adversaire au hasard. Le Chevalier Saccageur attaque ce joueur pendant ce combat si possible.\\nQuand le Chevalier Saccageur meurt, il inflige 4 blessures à un adversaire ciblé choisi au hasard.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : chevalier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581382&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22973710-4452-4c1d-bc2c-d3583853145c\', \'multiverseId\': 581382}, \'multiverseid\': 581382}, {\'name\': \'Knight Rampager\', \'text\': "Travolgere\\nFrenesia Furiosa — All\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, scegli un avversario a caso. Il Knight Rampager attacca quel giocatore in questo combattimento, se può farlo.\\nQuando il Knight Rampager muore, infligge 4 danni a un avversario bersaglio scelto a caso.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Cavaliere\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68274c55-1593-419c-957f-7a1b68d8b217\', \'multiverseId\': 581542}, \'multiverseid\': 581542}, {\'name\': \'ナイト・ランペイジャー\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n狂気の蹂躙 — あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、対戦相手１人を無作為に選ぶ。この戦闘で、ナイト・ランペイジャーは可能ならそのプレイヤーを攻撃する。\\nナイト・ランペイジャーが死亡したとき、対戦相手１人を無作為に選んで対象とする。これはそのプレイヤーに４点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581702&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2962267f-1dd9-4013-9db4-7cfdd26ee679\', \'multiverseId\': 581702}, \'multiverseid\': 581702}, {\'name\': \'Knight Rampager\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nMassacre Frenético — No início do combate no seu turno, escolha um oponente aleatoriamente. Knight Rampager ataca aquele jogador neste combate se estiver apto.\\nQuando Knight Rampager morre, ele causa 4 pontos de dano ao oponente alvo escolhido aleatoriamente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581862&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36abad11-99cf-404c-b14d-6a56811c93dd\', \'multiverseId\': 581862}, \'multiverseid\': 581862}, {\'name\': \'肆虐者骑士\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n发狂愤怒～在你回合的战斗开始时，随机选择一位对手。肆虐者骑士本次战斗若能攻击该牌手，则须如此作。\\n当肆虐者骑士死去时，它向随机选择的目标对手造成4点伤害。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～骑士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582182&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df11e7d5-8db1-46d1-9537-44ef73b043a0\', \'multiverseId\': 582182}, \'multiverseid\': 582182}]', '[{\'name\': \'Großer Verpester\', \'text\': \'Nachhallende Beschwörungen — Zu Beginn deines Endsegments verliert jeder Gegner 2 Lebenspunkte. Erzeuge dann für jeden Gegner, der weniger Lebenspunkte hat als du, einen 1/3 schwarzen Dämon-Kreaturenspielstein namens Seuchenhüter des Nurgle.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581017&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e399e00-5014-451b-b10f-c850cc5acd79\', \'multiverseId\': 581017}, \'multiverseid\': 581017}, {\'name\': \'Gran Inmundicia\', \'text\': \'Invocación reverberante — Al comienzo de tu paso final, cada oponente pierde 2 vidas. Luego, por cada oponente que tenga menos vidas que tú, creas una ficha de criatura Demonio negra 1/3 llamada Portador de Plaga de Nurgle.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581177&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'941d25a9-a304-47f0-b176-e12be983940f\', \'multiverseId\': 581177}, \'multiverseid\': 581177}, {\'name\': \'Grand Immonde\', \'text\': \'Invocations réverbérantes — Au début de votre étape de fin, chaque adversaire perd 2 points de vie. Puis, pour chaque adversaire qui a moins de points de vie que vous, créez un jeton de créature 1/3 noire Démon appelé Portepeste de Nurgle.\', \'type\': \'Créature : démon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581337&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5928356-cf9e-4f88-8ec7-4d12ff21632c\', \'multiverseId\': 581337}, \'multiverseid\': 581337}, {\'name\': \'Grande Immondo\', \'text\': "Evocazioni Riverberanti — All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, ogni avversario perde 2 punti vita. Poi, per ogni avversario che ha meno punti vita di te, crei una pedina creatura Demone 1/3 nera chiamata Untori di Nurgle.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581497&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c29685a5-d193-45b3-bcb0-20458a0c3e03\', \'multiverseId\': 581497}, \'multiverseid\': 581497}, {\'name\': \'グレイト・アンクリーン・ワン\', \'text\': \'反響せし召喚 — あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、各対戦相手はそれぞれ２点のライフを失う。その後、ライフがあなたより少ない対戦相手１人につき１体の、「プレーグベアラー・オヴ・ナーグル」という名前の黒の１/３のデーモン・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07308618-d06c-415b-b8ed-494dc5ff462f\', \'multiverseId\': 581657}, \'multiverseid\': 581657}, {\'name\': \'Grande Imundo\', \'text\': \'Invocações Reverberantes — No início de sua etapa final, cada oponente perde 2 pontos de vida. Em seguida, para cada oponente que tenha menos pontos de vida que você, crie uma ficha de criatura Demônio preta 1/3 com o nome Porta-peste de Nurgle.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demônio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581817&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20d41992-0719-4689-b0b5-b838a069fdde\', \'multiverseId\': 581817}, \'multiverseid\': 581817}, {\'name\': \'大不净者\', \'text\': \'回响召唤～在你的结束步骤开始时，每位对手各失去2点生命。然后每有一位总生命比你少的对手，便派出一个1/3黑色，名称为纳垢瘟疫行者的恶魔衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～恶魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582137&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d88be299-a8a6-4b0f-a4e4-666b5602e9cf\', \'multiverseId\': 582137}, \'multiverseid\': 582137}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gruftfestung\', \'text\': \'Die Gruftfestung kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B}.\\n{2}{B}{B}{B}, {T}, schicke die Gruftfestung ins Exil: Du millst vier Karten und bringst dann eine Kreaturenkarte aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581150&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5319ffeb-af08-427b-b7ac-e28818d629a2\', \'multiverseId\': 581150}, \'multiverseid\': 581150}, {\'name\': \'Fuerte de la Necrópolis\', \'text\': \'El Fuerte de la Necrópolis entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {B}.\\n{2}{B}{B}{B}, {T}, exiliar el Fuerte de la Necrópolis: Muele cuatro cartas, luego regresa una carta de criatura de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581310&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfbbb724-5564-4586-a1a9-3c4f6138b485\', \'multiverseId\': 581310}, \'multiverseid\': 581310}, {\'name\': \'Forteresse nécropole\', \'text\': "La Forteresse nécropole arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B}.\\n{2}{B}{B}{B}, {T}, exilez la Forteresse nécropole : Meulez quatre cartes, puis renvoyez sur le champ de bataille une carte de créature depuis votre cimetière. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581470&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5303c77b-179b-4749-9710-2330e36e8e40\', \'multiverseId\': 581470}, \'multiverseid\': 581470}, {\'name\': \'Fortezza Tomba\', \'text\': \'La Fortezza Tomba entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B}.\\n{2}{B}{B}{B}, {T}, Esilia la Fortezza Tomba: Macina quattro carte, poi fai tornare sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura dal tuo cimitero. Attiva solo come una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ad0459c-82ea-49cb-bf88-8a3bd5206422\', \'multiverseId\': 581630}, \'multiverseid\': 581630}, {\'name\': \'墳墓の要塞\', \'text\': \'墳墓の要塞はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{B}を加える。\\n{2}{B}{B}{B},{T},墳墓の要塞を追放する：カード４枚を切削する。その後、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を戦場に戻す。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581790&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c19d6d7-ed92-46fd-86ca-36c78a1d7409\', \'multiverseId\': 581790}, \'multiverseid\': 581790}, {\'name\': \'Fortaleza da Tumba\', \'text\': \'Fortaleza da Tumba entra no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {B}.\\n{2}{B}{B}{B}, {T}, exile Fortaleza da Tumba: Triture quatro cards, depois devolva um card de criatura de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha. Ative somente como um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581950&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2033b9f-d3d2-4830-b535-cb9b2ea08f32\', \'multiverseId\': 581950}, \'multiverseid\': 581950}, {\'name\': \'古墓堡垒\', \'text\': \'古墓堡垒须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{B}。\\n{2}{B}{B}{B}，{T}，放逐古墓堡垒：磨四张牌，然后将一张生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6941b38-5ab0-4313-8635-71c151158ac0\', \'multiverseId\': 582270}, \'multiverseid\': 582270}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gruftklinge\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn die Gruftklinge einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, verliert er so viele Lebenspunkte, wie er Kreaturen kontrolliert, es sei denn, er opfert eine Kreatur.\\nExhumieren {6}{B}{B}\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Necron\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581046&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'325e4e9a-365d-413e-947d-33ffcdc90a64\', \'multiverseId\': 581046}, \'multiverseid\': 581046}, {\'name\': \'Cuchillas de la Necrópolis\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que las Cuchillas de la Necrópolis hagan daño de combate a un jugador, ese jugador pierde una cantidad de vidas igual a la cantidad de criaturas que controla a menos que sacrifique una criatura.\\nDesenterrar {6}{B}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Necrón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1f55f40-b346-4644-81af-1a8ede6ee2d2\', \'multiverseId\': 581206}, \'multiverseid\': 581206}, {\'name\': \'Mécanoptère nécron\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que le Mécanoptère nécron inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, ce joueur perd un nombre de points de vie égal au nombre de créatures qu\'il contrôle à moins qu\'il ne sacrifie une créature.\\nExhumation {6}{B}{B}", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : nécron\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581366&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67140763-1c17-4186-b4fa-6b0fc6ea1ce6\', \'multiverseId\': 581366}, \'multiverseid\': 581366}, {\'name\': \'Lama Tombale\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta la Lama Tombale infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, quel giocatore perde punti vita pari al numero di creature che controlla a meno che quel giocatore non sacrifichi una creatura.\\nDissotterrare {6}{B}{B}\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Necron\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581526&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3c17de1-b2e5-42e9-a747-224cd4b4d2fa\', \'multiverseId\': 581526}, \'multiverseid\': 581526}, {\'name\': \'トゥームブレイド\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nトゥームブレイドがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーがクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げないかぎり、そのプレイヤーは自分がコントロールしているクリーチャーの数に等しい点数のライフを失う。\\n蘇生{6}{B}{B}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ネクロン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581686&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e56e91df-e019-4dec-b37e-384e9205d266\', \'multiverseId\': 581686}, \'multiverseid\': 581686}, {\'name\': \'Lâmina da Tumba\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que Lâmina da Tumba causa dano de combate a um jogador, aquele jogador perde uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual ao número de criaturas que ele controla, a menos que ele sacrifique uma criatura.\\nDesenterrar {6}{B}{B}\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Necron\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581846&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b4b7b5b-15bf-4227-a2e8-6b998bc74f98\', \'multiverseId\': 581846}, \'multiverseid\': 581846}, {\'name\': \'古墓之刃\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当古墓之刃对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，除非该牌手牺牲一个生物，否则他失去若干生命，其数量等同于由其操控的生物数量。\\n破坟{6}{B}{B}\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～太空死灵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d14c7e7b-f9fa-40a0-abc6-4786715c57cd\', \'multiverseId\': 582166}, \'multiverseid\': 582166}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gründung des Imperiums\', \'text\': \'(Je eine Sagenmarke beim Ins-Spiel-Kommen und nach deinem Ziehsegment. Opfern nach III.)\\nI — Erzeuge für jeden deiner Gegner einen 2/2 weißen Astartes-Krieger-Kreaturenspielstein mit Wachsamkeit.\\nII — Jeder Gegner opfert eine Kreatur.\\nIII — Ziehe für jeden Gegner, der weniger Kreaturen kontrolliert als du, zwei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Sage\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581089&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65f9f0f2-8237-408c-8271-73f4e5933419\', \'multiverseId\': 581089}, \'multiverseid\': 581089}, {\'name\': \'Nacimiento del Imperium\', \'text\': \'(En cuanto esta Saga entre y después de tu paso de robar, agrega un contador de sabiduría. Sacrifícala después de III.)\\nI — Crea una ficha de criatura Guerrero Astartes blanca 2/2 con la habilidad de vigilancia por cada oponente que tengas.\\nII — Cada oponente sacrifica una criatura.\\nIII — Roba dos cartas por cada oponente que controla menos criaturas que tú.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581249&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3ac0889-94a4-47f9-af9d-f7945a0df65f\', \'multiverseId\': 581249}, \'multiverseid\': 581249}, {\'name\': "Genèse de l\'Imperium", \'text\': \'(Au moment où cette saga arrive sur le champ de bataille et après votre étape de pioche, ajoutez un marqueur « sapience ». Sacrifiez après III.)\\nI — Créez un jeton de créature 2/2 blanche Astartes et Guerrier avec la vigilance pour chaque adversaire que vous avez.\\nII — Chaque adversaire sacrifie une créature.\\nIII — Piochez deux cartes pour chaque adversaire qui contrôle moins de créatures que vous.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581409&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08380470-f5dd-4649-932d-f02f11b0d02a\', \'multiverseId\': 581409}, \'multiverseid\': 581409}, {\'name\': "Nascita dell\'Imperium", \'text\': \'(Mentre questa Saga entra e dopo la tua sottofase di acquisizione, aggiungi un segnalino sapere. Sacrifica dopo III.)\\nI — Crea una pedina creatura Guerriero Astartes 2/2 bianca con cautela per ogni avversario che hai.\\nII — Ogni avversario sacrifica una creatura.\\nIII — Pesca due carte per ogni avversario che controlla meno creature di te.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b6d2496-663d-4c27-878e-4df9e8e5c318\', \'multiverseId\': 581569}, \'multiverseid\': 581569}, {\'name\': \'帝国の誕生\', \'text\': \'（この英雄譚が出た際とあなたのドロー・ステップの後に、伝承カウンター１個を加える。IIIの後に、生け贄に捧げる。）\\nI — あなたは対戦相手１人につき１体の、警戒を持つ白の２/２のアスタルテス・戦士・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。\\nII — 各対戦相手はそれぞれクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。\\nIII — あなたはコントロールしているクリーチャーの数があなたより少ない対戦相手１人につき２枚のカードを引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — 英雄譚\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581729&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'361a3b6f-4ada-4b85-8312-5c8912dbe4ba\', \'multiverseId\': 581729}, \'multiverseid\': 581729}, {\'name\': \'Nascimento do Imperium\', \'text\': \'(Conforme esta Saga entra e após sua etapa de compra, adicione um marcador de conhecimento. Sacrifique-a após III.)\\nI — Crie uma ficha de criatura Astartes Guerreiro branca 2/2 com vigilância para cada oponente que você tem.\\nII — Cada oponente sacrifica uma criatura.\\nIII — Compre dois cards para cada oponente que controlar menos criaturas que você.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581889&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d75eec3a-4a6e-4484-8516-6c2227f989c9\', \'multiverseId\': 581889}, \'multiverseid\': 581889}, {\'name\': \'帝国诞生\', \'text\': \'（于此传纪进战场时及于你抓牌步骤后，加一个学问指示物。到III后牺牲之。）\\nI — 你每有一位对手，便派出一个2/2白色，具警戒异能的阿斯塔特／战士衍生生物。\\nII — 每位对手各牺牲一个生物。\\nIII — 每有一位操控生物数量比你少的对手，你便抓两张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～传纪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582209&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26b101a4-57f1-4052-81ac-e0d2b9df2f01\', \'multiverseId\': 582209}, \'multiverseid\': 582209}]', '[{\'name\': \'Haruspex\', \'text\': \'Rasender Hunger — Immer wenn eine andere Kreatur stirbt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Haruspex.\\nVerschlingendes Monster — {T}, entferne X +1/+1-Marken vom Haruspex: Erzeuge X Mana genau einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Tyranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581073&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d39fcd7-c407-4108-900f-21eae495d00e\', \'multiverseId\': 581073}, \'multiverseid\': 581073}, {\'name\': \'Haruspex\', \'text\': \'Hambre rapaz — Siempre que otra criatura muera, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Haruspex.\\nMonstruo devorador — {T}, remover X contadores +1/+1 del Haruspex: Agrega X manás de un color cualquiera.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiránido\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581233&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89e0b761-2b10-4b51-9044-adec7fed3dee\', \'multiverseId\': 581233}, \'multiverseid\': 581233}, {\'name\': \'Haruspex tyranide\', \'text\': "Faim dévorante — À chaque fois qu\'une autre créature meurt, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Haruspex tyranide.\\nMonstre vorace — {T}, retirez X marqueurs +1/+1 du Haruspex tyranide : Ajoutez X manas de la couleur de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Créature : tyranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581393&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8eb7d99b-0944-4df0-ba61-c27b5091708b\', \'multiverseId\': 581393}, \'multiverseid\': 581393}, {\'name\': \'Aruspice\', \'text\': "Fame Rapace — Ogniqualvolta un\'altra creatura muore, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sull\'Aruspice.\\nMostro Divoratore — {T}, Rimuovi X segnalini +1/+1 dall\'Aruspice: Aggiungi X mana di un qualsiasi colore.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Tiranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581553&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae4a1ad3-8eaa-4021-a38c-4f094a192600\', \'multiverseId\': 581553}, \'multiverseid\': 581553}, {\'name\': \'ハルスペックス\', \'text\': \'猛烈な飢え — これでないクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、ハルスペックスの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\n貪るモンスター — {T},ハルスペックスの上から＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個を取り除く：好きな色１色のマナＸ点を加える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ティラニッド\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581713&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fee6119a-b962-4965-a62d-fd5b353507c3\', \'multiverseId\': 581713}, \'multiverseid\': 581713}, {\'name\': \'Arúspice\', \'text\': \'Fome Rapace — Toda vez que outra criatura morrer, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Arúspice.\\nMonstro Devorador — {T}, remova X marcadores +1/+1 de Arúspice: Adicione X manas de uma cor à sua escolha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiranídeo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581873&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd80a471-2e46-42e5-81ef-1f2404232380\', \'multiverseId\': 581873}, \'multiverseid\': 581873}, {\'name\': \'巨噬兽\', \'text\': \'掠食饥渴～每当另一个生物死去时，在巨噬兽上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n吞噬巨兽～{T}，从巨噬兽上移去X个+1/+1指示物：加X点任意颜色的单色法术力。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～泰伦虫族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582193&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0dba155-7c70-425b-b7a4-0b348ec4b1dd\', \'multiverseId\': 582193}, \'multiverseid\': 582193}]', '[{\'name\': \'Herold des Slaanesh\', \'text\': \'Locus des Slaanesh — Dämon-Zaubersprüche, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {2} weniger.\\nAndere Dämonen, die du kontrollierst, haben Eile.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich kann dir Genuss ohne Reue, grenzenloses Vergnügen und unermessliche Befriedigung bieten."\\n—Sha\\\'ris, Diakon der Begierde\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581059&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b412022-f61e-4154-bd4e-98b726ceb4ea\', \'multiverseId\': 581059}, \'multiverseid\': 581059}, {\'name\': \'Heraldo de Slaanesh\', \'text\': \'Locus de Slaanesh — Te cuesta {2} menos lanzar hechizos de Demonio.\\nLos otros Demonios que controlas tienen la habilidad de prisa.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio\', \'flavor\': \'"Puedo mostrarte excesos sin remordimientos, deleite desenfrenado, satisfacción sin límites".\\n—Sha\\\'ris, Heraldo de la Lujuria\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab85e5ae-81da-4644-87e9-208033a84ec6\', \'multiverseId\': 581219}, \'multiverseid\': 581219}, {\'name\': \'Héraut de Slaanesh\', \'text\': \'Privilège de Slaanesh — Les sorts de démon que vous lancez coûtent {2} de moins à lancer.\\nLes autres démons que vous contrôlez ont la célérité.\', \'type\': \'Créature : démon\', \'flavor\': "« Je peux te faire connaître l\'indulgence sans regret, le délice sans limite, les gratifications innombrables. »\\n—Sha\'ris, diacre de la luxure", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581379&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bed7dbe-9ee3-4156-bd22-0773281bb422\', \'multiverseId\': 581379}, \'multiverseid\': 581379}, {\'name\': \'Araldo di Slaanesh\', \'text\': \'Ricettacolo di Slaanesh — Le magie Demone che lanci costano {2} in meno per essere lanciate.\\nGli altri Demoni che controlli hanno rapidità.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone\', \'flavor\': \'"Posso mostrarti indulgenza senza rimpianti, piacere senza confini, gratificazioni oltre ogni limite."\\n—Sha\\\'ris, diacono della lussuria\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581539&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d06f41e-feaf-4a65-95c8-04a17586e9a5\', \'multiverseId\': 581539}, \'multiverseid\': 581539}, {\'name\': \'ヘラルド・オヴ・スラーネッシュ\', \'text\': \'ローカス・オヴ・スラーネッシュ — あなたがデーモン・呪文を唱えるためのコストは{2}少なくなる。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのデーモンは速攻を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン\', \'flavor\': \'「後悔なき耽溺、天井知らずの快楽、そして数限りない満足感を貴様に見せてやろう。」\\n――欲望の助祭、シャ＝リス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581699&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c8a240e-141e-422f-8c01-697bf37c6486\', \'multiverseId\': 581699}, \'multiverseid\': 581699}, {\'name\': \'Arauto de Slaanesh\', \'text\': \'Locus de Slaanesh — As mágicas de Demônio que você conjura custam {2} a menos para serem conjuradas.\\nOs outros Demônios que você controla têm ímpeto.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demônio\', \'flavor\': \'"Posso lhe mostrar indulgência sem arrependimento, delícias sem limites e gratificações incontáveis."\\n— Sha\\\'ris, Diácono da Luxúria\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581859&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'431587a7-8a8f-409f-84f6-9c09ecdc27dc\', \'multiverseId\': 581859}, \'multiverseid\': 581859}, {\'name\': \'色孽先锋\', \'text\': \'色孽基卫～你施放的恶魔咒语减少{2}来施放。\\n由你操控的其他恶魔具有敏捷异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～恶魔\', \'flavor\': \'「我可以向你们展示何谓无悔放纵、无边快乐、无尽满足。」\\n～欲望执事煞莉姿\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582179&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b5f2b45-1e7e-4161-9e85-451b047fd409\', \'multiverseId\': 582179}, \'multiverseid\': 582179}]', '[{\'name\': \'Herolde des Tzeentch\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nKaskade (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, schicke Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis du eine Nichtland-Karte ins Exil schickst, die weniger kostet. Du kannst sie wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Lege die so ins Exil geschickten Karten in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581005&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c3a338d-b692-4a35-95e8-999f05209be4\', \'multiverseId\': 581005}, \'multiverseid\': 581005}, {\'name\': \'Heraldos de Tzeentch\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCascada. (Cuando lances este hechizo, exilia cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca hasta que exilies una carta que no sea tierra y que cueste menos. Puedes lanzarla sin pagar su coste de maná. Pon las cartas exiliadas en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0423a796-a382-413d-becf-b1d851e776b6\', \'multiverseId\': 581165}, \'multiverseid\': 581165}, {\'name\': \'Hérauts de Tzeentch\', \'text\': "Vol\\nCascade (Quand vous lancez ce sort, exilez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous exiliez une carte non-terrain d\'un coût inférieur. Vous pouvez la lancer sans payer son coût de mana. Mettez les cartes exilées au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.)", \'type\': \'Créature : démon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581325&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3d00f22-f146-43da-a28c-7c021f9d20f2\', \'multiverseId\': 581325}, \'multiverseid\': 581325}, {\'name\': \'Araldi di Tzeentch\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nCascata (Quando lanci questa magia, esilia carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non esili una carta non terra che costa meno. Puoi lanciarla senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Metti le carte esiliate in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581485&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f60fce5a-61b5-406f-89a6-a2c6828a02f6\', \'multiverseId\': 581485}, \'multiverseid\': 581485}, {\'name\': \'ヘラルド・オヴ・ティーンチ\', \'text\': \'飛行,\\n続唱（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、コストがこれより低く土地でないカード１枚が追放されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ追放していく。あなたはそれをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。追放したカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581645&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cc97976-6155-4aa1-8e4e-2a476087f5b2\', \'multiverseId\': 581645}, \'multiverseid\': 581645}, {\'name\': \'Arautos de Tzeentch\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nCascata (Quando conjurar esta mágica, exile cards do topo de seu grimório até exilar um não de terreno com custo inferior. Você pode conjurá-lo sem pagar seu custo de mana. Coloque os cards exilados no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demônio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581805&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e73067e-25c5-4fb4-b1f9-648fb65481ae\', \'multiverseId\': 581805}, \'multiverseid\': 581805}, {\'name\': \'奸奇先锋\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n倾曳（当你施放此咒语时，从你的牌库顶开始放逐牌，直到放逐一张费用比此咒语低的非地牌为止。你可以施放该牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。将所放逐的牌以随机顺序置于你牌库底。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～恶魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2da294e8-50fb-4f57-be2a-8d98197c7780\', \'multiverseId\': 582125}, \'multiverseid\': 582125}]', '[{\'name\': \'Herrscher des Wandels\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Abwehr {3}\\nArchitekt der Täuschung — Wenn der Herrscher des Wandels ins Spiel kommt, ziehe drei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': \'Die Herrscher des Wandels sind die größten Diener des Tzeentch. Die mächtigsten von ihnen beherrschen Fragmente seiner Macht über das Schicksal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581006&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4420c3e-019c-414c-991e-4e2e3f985880\', \'multiverseId\': 581006}, \'multiverseid\': 581006}, {\'name\': \'Señor de la Transformación\', \'text\': \'Vuela, rebatir {3}.\\nArquitecto del engaño — Cuando el Señor de la Transformación entre al campo de batalla, roba tres cartas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio\', \'flavor\': \'Los Señores de la Transformación son los mejores sirvientes de Tzeentch. Los más poderosos de ellos tienen una pequeña fracción de su capacidad de encauzar el destino.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd5af803-3afc-4c1c-9bec-848d46ee3378\', \'multiverseId\': 581166}, \'multiverseid\': 581166}, {\'name\': \'Duc du Changement\', \'text\': \'Vol, parade {3}\\nArchitecte de la tromperie — Quand le Duc du Changement arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez trois cartes.\', \'type\': \'Créature : démon\', \'flavor\': "Les Ducs du Changement sont les plus grands serviteurs de Tzeentch. Les plus puissants d\'entre eux utilisent des fragments de son pouvoir sur la destinée.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581326&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1f70121-382a-4610-aa4a-d45061f991e5\', \'multiverseId\': 581326}, \'multiverseid\': 581326}, {\'name\': \'Signore del Mutamento\', \'text\': "Volare, egida {3}\\nArchitetto dell\'Inganno — Quando il Signore del Mutamento entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca tre carte.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone\', \'flavor\': \'I Signori del Mutamento sono i più grandi servitori di Tzeentch. I più potenti tra essi esercitano frammenti del suo potere sul destino.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581486&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d45887b0-88d1-48c4-9b50-d38635e99fb9\', \'multiverseId\': 581486}, \'multiverseid\': 581486}, {\'name\': \'ロード・オヴ・チェンジ\', \'text\': \'飛行、護法{3}\\n欺きの構築者 — ロード・オヴ・チェンジが戦場に出たとき、カード３枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン\', \'flavor\': \'ロード・オヴ・チェンジはティーンチの最も優れた配下たちである。その中でも特に強力な者は彼の運命の支配力の一片を武器とする。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581646&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19b1d264-7bdc-4192-b160-c10e443e3249\', \'multiverseId\': 581646}, \'multiverseid\': 581646}, {\'name\': \'Senhor da Mudança\', \'text\': \'Voar, salvaguarda {3}\\nArquiteto do Logro — Quando Senhor da Mudança entrar no campo de batalha, compre três cards.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demônio\', \'flavor\': \'Os Senhores da Mudança são os maiores servos de Tzeentch. Os mais poderosos dentre eles usam como arma fragmentos do poder de Tzeentch sobre o destino.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581806&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9ca6fc0-806b-4cd3-be68-f2a566059e79\', \'multiverseId\': 581806}, \'multiverseid\': 581806}, {\'name\': \'万变魔君\', \'text\': \'飞行，守护{3}\\n虚境筑师～当万变魔君进战场时，抓三张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～恶魔\', \'flavor\': \'万变魔君是奸奇手下最得力的仆从。其中最强大者甚至能运用奸奇部分力量来改变命运。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582126&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b126f63c-a381-40a1-8475-eb480b4079da\', \'multiverseId\': 582126}, \'multiverseid\': 582126}]', '[{\'name\': \'Herstellung\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Artefaktkarte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582577&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0d32f0d-7d05-42fd-88be-3d89311220f1\', \'multiverseId\': 582577}, \'multiverseid\': 582577}, {\'name\': \'Fabricar\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de artefacto, muéstrala, ponla en tu mano y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582578&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4842e48-ec98-4116-bc4c-6912fd73a16a\', \'multiverseId\': 582578}, \'multiverseid\': 582578}, {\'name\': \'Fabrication\', \'text\': "Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte d\'artefact, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582579&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e2ef967-7f93-4d22-9b41-563aa39e7e03\', \'multiverseId\': 582579}, \'multiverseid\': 582579}, {\'name\': \'Fabbricare\', \'text\': \'Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta artefatto, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1add1943-b916-4147-99e5-01d09b9fc3a3\', \'multiverseId\': 582580}, \'multiverseid\': 582580}, {\'name\': \'加工\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーからアーティファクト・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'672f2ed6-262b-4447-a6be-9b9bdb80b152\', \'multiverseId\': 582581}, \'multiverseid\': 582581}, {\'name\': \'Fabricar\', \'text\': \'Procure em seu grimório um card de artefato, revele-o, coloque-o em sua mão e depois embaralhe.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582582&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c18322b-2441-4a4f-a1e1-87d02e122bad\', \'multiverseId\': 582582}, \'multiverseid\': 582582}, {\'name\': \'装配\', \'text\': \'从你牌库中搜寻一张神器牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b35a065-b26d-45a5-9ee6-a65059356f26\', \'multiverseId\': 582584}, \'multiverseid\': 582584}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hexjäger-Destruktor\', \'text\': \'Multiziel-Eliminator — Der Hexjäger-Destruktor kann nicht geblockt werden, außer von sechs oder mehr Kreaturen.\\nExhumieren {4}{B}{B} ({4}{B}{B}: Bringe diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Sie erhält Eile. Schicke sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments, oder falls sie das Spiel verlassen würde, ins Exil. Spiele Exhumieren wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Necron\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581018&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9016872e-81c5-49f4-8937-3f8f37fdc360\', \'multiverseId\': 581018}, \'multiverseid\': 581018}, {\'name\': \'Destructor Maldicida\', \'text\': \'Eliminador de múltiples amenazas — El Destructor Maldicida no puede ser bloqueado excepto por seis o más criaturas.\\nDesenterrar {4}{B}{B}. ({4}{B}{B}: Regresa esta carta de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Gana la habilidad de prisa. Exíliala al comienzo del próximo paso final o si fuera a dejar el campo de batalla. Activa la habilidad de desenterrar solo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Necrón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a880388-8eae-4479-8bce-9d02602c1803\', \'multiverseId\': 581178}, \'multiverseid\': 581178}, {\'name\': \'Destroyer Hexmark\', \'text\': "Éliminateur de menaces multiples — Le Destroyer Hexmark ne peut pas être bloqué excepté par au moins six créatures.\\nExhumation {4}{B}{B} ({4}{B}{B} : Renvoyez cette carte sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière. Elle acquiert la célérité. Exilez-la au début de la prochaine étape de fin ou si elle devait quitter le champ de bataille. N\'exhumez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : nécron\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581338&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a31c98c9-815b-4397-a6ba-90f2aa6f3ef9\', \'multiverseId\': 581338}, \'multiverseid\': 581338}, {\'name\': \'Distruttore Esacecchino\', \'text\': "Eliminatore Pluriminaccia — Il Distruttore Esacecchino non può essere bloccato tranne che da sei o più creature.\\nDissotterrare {4}{B}{B} ({4}{B}{B}: Rimetti sul campo di battaglia questa carta dal tuo cimitero. Ha rapidità. Esiliala all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale o se sta per lasciare il campo di battaglia. Dissotterra solo come una stregoneria.)", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Necron\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581498&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24786139-1059-4a01-aa4f-d979908a3408\', \'multiverseId\': 581498}, \'multiverseid\': 581498}, {\'name\': \'ヘックスマーク・デストロイヤー\', \'text\': \'マルチスレット・エリミネイター — ヘックスマーク・デストロイヤーは６体以上のクリーチャーにしかブロックされない。\\n蘇生{4}{B}{B}（{4}{B}{B}：あなたの墓地にあるこのカードを戦場に戻す。これは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、またはこれが戦場を離れるなら、これを追放する。蘇生はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ネクロン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581658&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af840bfc-f299-4a1b-a6f5-def8713b17e2\', \'multiverseId\': 581658}, \'multiverseid\': 581658}, {\'name\': \'Destruidor Hexatirador\', \'text\': \'Eliminador de Multiameaças — Destruidor Hexatirador só pode ser bloqueado por seis ou mais criaturas.\\nDesenterrar {4}{B}{B} ({4}{B}{B}: Devolva este card de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha. Ele ganha ímpeto. Exile-o no início da próxima etapa final ou se ele for deixar o campo de batalha. Use desenterrar somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Necron\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581818&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2df4dda7-6ce2-40c1-8827-400777be2c24\', \'multiverseId\': 581818}, \'multiverseid\': 581818}, {\'name\': \'巫印毁灭者\', \'text\': \'多重威胁抹消炮～巫印毁灭者只能被六个或更多生物阻挡。\\n破坟{4}{B}{B}（{4}{B}{B}：将此牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。它获得敏捷异能。在下一个结束步骤开始时，或若它将离开战场，将它放逐。只能于法术时机破坟。）\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～太空死灵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d50ef19-e1a1-4fc9-b004-7d9b27853d77\', \'multiverseId\': 582138}, \'multiverseid\': 582138}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hierophant-Biotitan\', \'text\': \'Wilder Metabolismus — Als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken, kannst du eine beliebige Anzahl an +1/+1-Marken von Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, entfernen. Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jede auf diese Weise entfernte Marke {2} weniger.\\nWachsamkeit, Reichweite, Abwehr {2}\\nTitanisch — Der Hierophant-Biotitan kann von Kreaturen mit Stärke 2 oder weniger nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Tyranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581074&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6032ddd8-10f4-4a94-b797-aba3f1737b0b\', \'multiverseId\': 581074}, \'multiverseid\': 581074}, {\'name\': \'Biotitán Hierofante\', \'text\': \'Metabolismo frenético — Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, puedes remover cualquier cantidad de contadores +1/+1 de entre las criaturas que controlas. Te cuesta {2} menos lanzar este hechizo por cada contador removido de esta manera.\\nVigilancia, alcance, rebatir {2}.\\nTitánico — El Biotitán Hierofante no puede ser bloqueado por criaturas con fuerza de 2 o menos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiránido\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8537358e-28c7-427c-adc3-d459ad4a6a61\', \'multiverseId\': 581234}, \'multiverseid\': 581234}, {\'name\': \'Bio-titan Hiérophante\', \'text\': "Métabolisme frénétique — En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, vous pouvez retirer n\'importe quel nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 parmi les créatures que vous contrôlez. Ce sort coûte {2} de moins à lancer pour chaque marqueur retiré de cette manière.\\nVigilance, portée, parade {2}\\nTitanesque — Le Bio-titan Hiérophante ne peut pas être bloqué par les créatures de force inférieure ou égale à 2.", \'type\': \'Créature : tyranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581394&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e0006b6-d915-410f-9943-d5a21bd8fb3d\', \'multiverseId\': 581394}, \'multiverseid\': 581394}, {\'name\': \'Biotitano Ierofante\', \'text\': \'Metabolismo Frenetico — Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, puoi rimuovere un qualsiasi numero di segnalini +1/+1 scelti tra le creature che controlli. Questa magia costa {2} in meno per essere lanciata per ogni segnalino rimosso in questo modo.\\nCautela, raggiungere, egida {2}\\nTitanico — Il Biotitano Ierofante non può essere bloccato da creature con forza pari o inferiore a 2.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Tiranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581554&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00401d61-30fe-4403-8884-6ff88eab33c9\', \'multiverseId\': 581554}, \'multiverseid\': 581554}, {\'name\': \'バイオタイタンの司祭\', \'text\': \'代謝暴走 — この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーの中から望む数の＋１/＋１カウンターを取り除いてもよい。この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、これにより取り除かれたカウンター１個につき{2}少なくなる。\\n警戒、到達、護法{2}\\n巨大兵器 — バイオタイタンの司祭は、パワーが２以下のクリーチャーにはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ティラニッド\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581714&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a69d04c-a3f0-4266-ad9c-ebec7a69c6e0\', \'multiverseId\': 581714}, \'multiverseid\': 581714}, {\'name\': \'Biotitã Hierofante\', \'text\': \'Metabolismo Frenético — Como custo adicional para conjurar esta mágica, você pode remover qualquer número de marcadores +1/+1 dentre os das criaturas que você controla. Esta mágica custa {2} a menos para ser conjurada para cada marcador removido dessa forma.\\nVigilância, alcance, salvaguarda {2}\\nTitânico — Biotitã Hierofante não pode ser bloqueado por criaturas com poder igual ou inferior a 2.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiranídeo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581874&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70b2fb7c-ea1e-48c3-83b5-b6da14ae18f9\', \'multiverseId\': 581874}, \'multiverseid\': 581874}, {\'name\': \'恶像怪生物泰坦\', \'text\': \'狂热代谢～你可以从由你操控的生物上移去总共任意数量的+1/+1指示物，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。每以此法移去一个指示物，此咒语便减少{2}来施放。\\n警戒，延势，守护{2}\\n泰坦巨物～恶像怪生物泰坦不能被力量等于或小于2的生物阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～泰伦虫族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06d634d7-689b-4ab1-a64f-73f0ac0721e9\', \'multiverseId\': 582194}, \'multiverseid\': 582194}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hormaganten-Rotte\', \'text\': \'Unersättlich (Diese Kreatur kommt mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel. Falls X gleich 5 oder mehr ist, ziehe eine Karte, wenn sie ins Spiel kommt.)\\nEndloser Schwarm — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du {2}{G} bezahlen.\\nFalls du dies tust, bringe die Hormaganten-Rotte aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Tyranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581075&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'367b7cf8-7eca-4a20-8a7f-af1377ae1d75\', \'multiverseId\': 581075}, \'multiverseid\': 581075}, {\'name\': \'Horda de Hormagantes\', \'text\': \'Voracidad. (Esta criatura entra al campo de batalla con X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella. Si X es 5 o más, roba una carta cuando entre.)\\nEnjambre inacabable — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes pagar {2}{G}.\\nSi lo haces, regresa la Horda de Hormagantes de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiránido\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7d0b7f6-de05-474c-a0df-31bb0029da87\', \'multiverseId\': 581235}, \'multiverseid\': 581235}, {\'name\': \'Horde de hormagaunts\', \'text\': "Voracité (Cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle. Si X est supérieur ou égal à 5, piochez une carte quand elle arrive sur le champ de bataille.)\\nEssaim infini — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez payer {2}{G}.\\nSi vous faites ainsi, renvoyez la Horde de hormagaunts depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature : tyranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581395&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b552a7c-8b11-4622-92cd-3a9a1a1d7eac\', \'multiverseId\': 581395}, \'multiverseid\': 581395}, {\'name\': \'Orda di Hormagaunt\', \'text\': "Famelico (Questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia con X segnalini +1/+1. Se X è pari o superiore a 5, pesca una carta quando entra.)\\nSciame Infinito — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi pagare {2}{G}.\\nSe lo fai, riprendi in mano l\'Orda di Hormagaunt dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Tiranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581555&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c5f7678-21af-436b-bb00-dd275460f1e5\', \'multiverseId\': 581555}, \'multiverseid\': 581555}, {\'name\': \'ホーマゴーントの大群\', \'text\': \'貪欲（このクリーチャーは＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。Ｘが５以上であるなら、これが戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引く。）\\n無尽蔵の大群 — 土地１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは{2}{G}を支払ってもよい。\\nそうしたなら、あなたの墓地にあるホーマゴーントの大群をあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ティラニッド\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581715&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6175a9c0-5ff0-4c66-bd69-894a27dc54c4\', \'multiverseId\': 581715}, \'multiverseid\': 581715}, {\'name\': \'Horda de Hormagauntes\', \'text\': \'Voraz (Esta criatura entra no campo de batalha com X marcadores +1/+1. Se X for igual ou superior a 5, compre um card quando ela entrar.)\\nEnxame Infindável — Toda vez que um terreno entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, você pode pagar {2}{G}.\\nSe fizer isso, devolva Horda de Hormagauntes de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiranídeo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581875&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba518a88-f762-4ab9-b38d-8673cd218d8f\', \'multiverseId\': 581875}, \'multiverseid\': 581875}, {\'name\': \'刀虫大群\', \'text\': \'贪食（此生物进战场时上面有X个+1/+1指示物。如果X等于或大于5，则当它进战场时抓一张牌。）\\n无尽虫群{G}。\\n若你如此作，则将刀虫大群从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～泰伦虫族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20318e5d-5dd9-427f-acb7-2611d11ad0d0\', \'multiverseId\': 582195}, \'multiverseid\': 582195}]', '[{\'name\': \'Höllenschlächter\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nSarcophagus — Du kannst den Höllenschlächter aus deinem Friedhof wirken, indem du zusätzlich zu seinen anderen Kosten eine andere Kreaturenkarte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil schickst.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Astartes, Schlachtschiff\', \'flavor\': \'„Nein. Nein! Nicht den Sarcophagus … Khorne soll euch verfluchen, ihr unloyalen Hundesöhne. TÖTET MICH EINFACH!"\\n—Kalos der Verwüster\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581107&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'910c938f-ef35-4563-9de9-9de225986603\', \'multiverseId\': 581107}, \'multiverseid\': 581107}, {\'name\': \'Bruto Infernal\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nSarcófago — Puedes lanzar el Bruto Infernal desde tu cementerio exiliando otra carta de criatura de tu cementerio además de pagar sus otros costes.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Acorazado astartes\', \'flavor\': \'"No. ¡No! El sarcófago no... Que Khorne los maldiga, canallas traicioneros. ¡PREFIERO LA MUERTE!".\\n—Kalos el Devastador\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e639157-e404-4c3c-8092-c13243e38b71\', \'multiverseId\': 581267}, \'multiverseid\': 581267}, {\'name\': \'Helbrute\', \'text\': \'Célérité\\nSarcophage — Vous pouvez lancer le Helbrute depuis votre cimetière en exilant une autre carte de créature de votre cimetière en plus de payer ses autres coûts.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : astartes et dreadnought\', \'flavor\': \'« Non. Non ! Pas le sarcophage... Que Khorne vous maudisse, infâmes chiens, tuez-moi. TUEZ-MOI ! »\\n—Kalos le Ravageur\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581427&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b18f7dc-26e0-4ab2-9659-d25e7fc2a460\', \'multiverseId\': 581427}, \'multiverseid\': 581427}, {\'name\': \'Bruto Infernale\', \'text\': "Rapidità\\nSarcofago — Puoi lanciare il Bruto Infernale dal tuo cimitero esiliando un\'altra carta creatura dal tuo cimitero oltre a pagare i suoi altri costi.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Sterminatore Astartes\', \'flavor\': \'"No. No! Non il sarcofago... Che Khorne vi maledica, maledette carogne. UCCIDETEMI E BASTA!"\\n—Kalos il Devastatore\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d09526b0-f2b0-4bce-b858-f274ce3eada2\', \'multiverseId\': 581587}, \'multiverseid\': 581587}, {\'name\': \'ヘルブルート\', \'text\': \'速攻\\nサルコファガス — あなたはあなたの墓地にあるヘルブルートを、他のコストの支払いに加えてあなたの墓地にありこれでないクリーチャー・カード１枚を追放することで唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — アスタルテス・ドレッドノート\', \'flavor\': \'「くそ。くそ！ サルコファガスが……おのれコーン！ この恩知らずの野犬め！ さっさと俺を殺せ！」\\n――ラヴェイジャー、カロス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581747&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13339715-70e2-47ed-9c2b-4e31c550d4ee\', \'multiverseId\': 581747}, \'multiverseid\': 581747}, {\'name\': \'Bruto Infernal\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto\\nSarcófago — Você pode conjurar Bruto Infernal de seu cemitério exilando outro card de criatura de seu cemitério além de pagar seus outros custos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Astartes Encouraçado\', \'flavor\': \'"Não. Não! O sarcófago não... Khorne amaldiçoe vocês, seus cães traidores. ME MATEM DE UMA VEZ!"\\n— Kalos, o Devastador\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581907&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f16e6d06-3a94-4ec2-927c-f63da9e9d1b3\', \'multiverseId\': 581907}, \'multiverseid\': 581907}, {\'name\': \'地狱兽\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n棺椁～你可以从你的坟墓场中施放地狱兽，但在其他费用外，还须从你的坟墓场放逐另一张生物牌。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～阿斯塔特／无畏舰\', \'flavor\': \'「别！住手！不要把我装进棺椁…恐虐让你们不得好死，你们这些叛徒杂种。快杀了我！」\\n～劫掠者卡洛斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a02898f-b0fa-4e86-a47c-3fc633cfae1e\', \'multiverseId\': 582227}, \'multiverseid\': 582227}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hüter der Geheimnisse\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag, Eile\\nSymphonie der Schmerzen — Immer wenn du einen Zauberspruch von irgendwoher außer deiner Hand wirkst, fügt der Hüter der Geheimnisse einem Gegner deiner Wahl Schadenspunkte in Höhe des Manabetrags jenes Zauberspruchs zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': \'Einen anzuschauen bedeutet, den letzten Rest von Eigenwillen aufzugeben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581060&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1402d84-f076-4e2f-8e43-76a00a19eabd\', \'multiverseId\': 581060}, \'multiverseid\': 581060}, {\'name\': \'Guardián de Secretos\', \'text\': \'Daña primero, prisa.\\nSinfonía de dolor — Siempre que lances un hechizo desde cualquier parte excepto desde tu mano, el Guardián de Secretos hace una cantidad de daño igual al valor de maná de ese hechizo al oponente objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio\', \'flavor\': \'Mirar a una de estas criaturas supone renunciar a la última pizca de voluntad propia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581220&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c224873-5a22-42b9-bafc-b3e9746ddb7c\', \'multiverseId\': 581220}, \'multiverseid\': 581220}, {\'name\': \'Gardien des Secrets de Slaanesh\', \'text\': \'Initiative, célérité\\nSymphonie de souffrance — À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort depuis autre part que votre main, le Gardien des Secrets de Slaanesh inflige un nombre de blessures égal à la valeur de mana de ce sort à un adversaire ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Créature : démon\', \'flavor\': \'En contempler un équivaut à abandonner les derniers vestiges de votre volonté.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581380&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68549ea9-042b-490e-9c02-e21f37c0dc4c\', \'multiverseId\': 581380}, \'multiverseid\': 581380}, {\'name\': \'Custode dei Segreti\', \'text\': \'Attacco improvviso, rapidità\\nSinfonia di Dolore — Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia da una zona diversa dalla tua mano, il Custode dei Segreti infligge a un avversario bersaglio danno pari al valore di mana di quella magia.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone\', \'flavor\': "Osservarne uno significa cedere fino all\'ultimo brandello di volontà propria.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581540&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcfb210b-6633-4d35-a5fa-a956ada95ed8\', \'multiverseId\': 581540}, \'multiverseid\': 581540}, {\'name\': \'キーパー・オヴ・シークレット\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃、速攻\\n苦しみのシンフォニー — あなたがあなたの手札以外から呪文を唱えるたび、対戦相手１人を対象とする。キーパー・オヴ・シークレットはそのプレイヤーにその呪文のマナ総量に等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン\', \'flavor\': \'誰かを調べ上げるということは、自由意志を一切合切放棄する事を意味する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581700&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'415c515c-465d-4604-9fac-4b1b1b51ca22\', \'multiverseId\': 581700}, \'multiverseid\': 581700}, {\'name\': \'Guardião dos Segredos\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa, ímpeto\\nSinfonia da Dor — Toda vez que você conjura uma mágica de qualquer lugar além de sua mão, Guardião dos Segredos causa ao oponente alvo dano igual ao valor de mana daquela mágica.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demônio\', \'flavor\': \'Olhar para um deles é desistir dos últimos vestígios de livre arbítrio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581860&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1df34e98-4656-4eb7-9513-504c162c694a\', \'multiverseId\': 581860}, \'multiverseid\': 581860}, {\'name\': \'守密者\', \'text\': \'先攻，敏捷\\n苦痛悲曲～每当你从你手牌以外的任何区域施放咒语时，守密者向目标对手造成等同于该咒语法术力值的伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～恶魔\', \'flavor\': \'死心塌地追随某人，便要将每一丝自我意识都全数放弃。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44dcc065-c3bb-42c6-add2-c98289f75067\', \'multiverseId\': 582180}, \'multiverseid\': 582180}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ihr Name bedeutet Tod\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre alle Nichtartefaktkreaturen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Als der Stumme König sah, was geschehen war, erkannte er endlich die wahre Natur der C\\\'tan und das Unheil, das sie in seinem Namen angerichtet hatten."\\n—*Das Buch der Trauernden Nacht*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581044&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83575aa4-2b87-4da1-b884-34607dead0fa\', \'multiverseId\': 581044}, \'multiverseid\': 581044}, {\'name\': \'Son muerte\', \'text\': \'Destruye todas las criaturas que no sean artefacto.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuando el Rey Silente vio lo sucedido, comprendió al fin la verdadera naturaleza de los C\\\'tan y los estragos que habían causado en su nombre".\\n—*El Libro de la Noche del Lamento*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581204&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32f9e18f-f3d9-4080-8ba9-efb1640cda34\', \'multiverseId\': 581204}, \'multiverseid\': 581204}, {\'name\': \'Leur nom est la Mort\', \'text\': \'Détruisez toutes les créatures non-artefact.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Lorsque le Roi Silencieux vit ce qu\'il avait fait, il comprit enfin la véritable nature des C\'tan et du destin qu\'il avait infligé à son peuple. »\\n—*Le Livre de la Nuit Funèbre*", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581364&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61079d93-044a-484a-8af7-70a594894123\', \'multiverseId\': 581364}, \'multiverseid\': 581364}, {\'name\': \'Il Loro Nome è Morte\', \'text\': \'Distruggi tutte le creature non artefatto.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando il Re Silente vide ciò che era stato fatto, seppe infine la vera natura degli C\\\'tan e la catastrofe che avevano provocato nel suo nome."\\n—*Il Libro della Notte del Lamento*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581524&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d05d2ff-7a9a-4953-bbe8-182718930a23\', \'multiverseId\': 581524}, \'multiverseid\': 581524}, {\'name\': \'彼らの名は死を意味する\', \'text\': \'アーティファクトでないすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「沈黙の王がその余波を目の当たりにしたとき、ク＝タンの本性、そして彼の名の下にもたらした破滅をついに理解したのである。」\\n――「*悲嘆の夜の書*」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581684&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4692a8d2-362b-4c70-8293-dbbf74402fbb\', \'multiverseId\': 581684}, \'multiverseid\': 581684}, {\'name\': \'O Nome Deles é Morte\', \'text\': \'Destrua todas as criaturas não artefato.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando o Rei Silencioso viu o que havia sido feito, ele finalmente conheceu a verdadeira natureza dos C\\\'tan e a ruína que eles haviam trazido em seu nome."\\n— *O Livro da Noite do Luto*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581844&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c20122e4-f446-4513-a509-f7fe0d86348c\', \'multiverseId\': 581844}, \'multiverseid\': 581844}, {\'name\': \'死为其名\', \'text\': \'消灭所有非神器的生物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「待沉默之王亲见历史之后，他终于看清星神的本性所在，并察觉他们所谋划的末日早已强加于自己身上。」\\n～*《哀夜之书》*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53743989-4e90-4639-ac1e-581bb8e83598\', \'multiverseId\': 582164}, \'multiverseid\': 582164}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ihre Zahl ist Legion\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge X getappte 2/2 schwarze Necron-Krieger-Artefaktkreaturenspielsteine, dann erhältst du so viele Lebenspunkte dazu, wie du Artefakte kontrollierst. Schicke Ihre Zahl ist Legion ins Exil.\\nDu kannst Ihre Zahl ist Legion aus deinem Friedhof wirken.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581045&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c084712-d4a2-481b-be85-608d4967f2b7\', \'multiverseId\': 581045}, \'multiverseid\': 581045}, {\'name\': \'Son legión\', \'text\': \'Crea X fichas de criatura artefacto Guerrero Necrón negras 2/2 giradas, luego ganas una cantidad de vidas igual a la cantidad de artefactos que controlas. Exilia Son legión.\\nPuedes lanzar Son legión desde tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96b84ff2-9940-46d0-9930-915f8af451ee\', \'multiverseId\': 581205}, \'multiverseid\': 581205}, {\'name\': \'Leur nombre est Légion\', \'text\': "Créez X jetons de créature-artefact 2/2 noire Nécron et Guerrier, puis vous gagnez un nombre de points de vie égal au nombre d\'artefacts que vous contrôlez. Exilez Leur nombre est Légion.\\nVous pouvez lancer Leur nombre est Légion depuis votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581365&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30ffc44f-085f-48eb-8483-aa893d6db282\', \'multiverseId\': 581365}, \'multiverseid\': 581365}, {\'name\': \'Il Loro Numero è Legione\', \'text\': \'Crea X pedine creatura artefatto Guerriero Necron 2/2 nere TAPpate, poi guadagni punti vita pari al numero di artefatti che controlli. Esilia Il Loro Numero è Legione.\\nPuoi lanciare Il Loro Numero è Legione dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581525&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'390a73c2-fe29-4ee5-b5cf-02b1368495b0\', \'multiverseId\': 581525}, \'multiverseid\': 581525}, {\'name\': \'彼らの数は兵団に値する\', \'text\': \'黒の２/２のネクロン・戦士・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体をタップ状態で生成する。その後、あなたはあなたがコントロールしているアーティファクトの数に等しい点数のライフを得る。彼らの数は兵団に値するを追放する。\\nあなたはあなたの墓地にある、彼らの数は兵団に値するを唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581685&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4aa0f39d-5e12-4df7-9845-74cba2f4711f\', \'multiverseId\': 581685}, \'multiverseid\': 581685}, {\'name\': \'O Número Deles é Legião\', \'text\': \'Crie X fichas de criatura artefato Necron Guerreiro preta 2/2 viradas e, depois, você ganha uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual ao número de artefatos que você controla. Exile O Número Deles é Legião.\\nVocê pode conjurar O Número Deles é Legião do seu cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581845&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fc7b254-45f6-4a3f-805a-c5fcbce1faae\', \'multiverseId\': 581845}, \'multiverseid\': 581845}, {\'name\': \'数如繁军\', \'text\': \'派出X个已横置的2/2黑色太空死灵／战士衍生神器生物，然后你获得若干生命，其数量等同于由你操控的神器数量。放逐数如繁军。\\n你可以从你的坟墓场中施放数如繁军。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad77a736-0968-4726-9f26-e385a01ee4a3\', \'multiverseId\': 582165}, \'multiverseid\': 582165}]', '[{\'name\': \'Illuminor Szeras\', \'text\': \'Geheimnisse der Seele — {T}, opfere eine andere Kreatur: Erzeuge {B} in Höhe des Manabetrags der geopferten Kreatur.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Artefaktkreatur — Necron\', \'flavor\': \'„Unsterblichkeit ist nicht das Gleiche wie Unverwundbarkeit, kommt ihr aber nahe genug."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581019&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'feb2da9c-59d8-4ed4-b772-d50cab4103ed\', \'multiverseId\': 581019}, \'multiverseid\': 581019}, {\'name\': \'Illuminor Szeras\', \'text\': \'Secretos del alma — {T}, sacrificar otra criatura: Agrega una cantidad de {B} igual al valor de maná de la criatura sacrificada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto legendaria — Necrón\', \'flavor\': \'"La inmortalidad no es lo mismo que la invulnerabilidad, pero se parece bastante".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581179&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8259484e-9edb-4c98-9970-8b1d99bf1fbe\', \'multiverseId\': 581179}, \'multiverseid\': 581179}, {\'name\': \'Illuminor Szeras\', \'text\': "Secrets de l\'âme — {T}, sacrifiez une autre créature : Ajoutez une quantité de {B} égale à la valeur de mana de la créature sacrifiée.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact légendaire : nécron\', \'flavor\': "« L\'immortalité n\'est pas l\'invulnérabilité, mais elle s\'en rapproche. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581339&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ff7d884-7eca-4434-8d00-ff12cee2ca31\', \'multiverseId\': 581339}, \'multiverseid\': 581339}, {\'name\': \'Illuminor Szeras\', \'text\': "Segreti dell\'Anima — {T}, Sacrifica un\'altra creatura: Aggiungi un ammontare di {B} pari al valore di mana della creatura sacrificata.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto Leggendaria — Necron\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'immortalità non è esattamente la stessa cosa dell\\\'invulnerabilità, ma ci va abbastanza vicino."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581499&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e96a2c1-204d-44d9-9513-7f288e6cc498\', \'multiverseId\': 581499}, \'multiverseid\': 581499}, {\'name\': \'イルミノール・スゼラス\', \'text\': \'魂の奥義 — {T},これでないクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：その生け贄に捧げられたクリーチャーのマナ総量に等しい数の{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト・クリーチャー — ネクロン\', \'flavor\': \'「不死は難攻不落とは少し違うが、似たようなものだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581659&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc7c5416-4959-47db-9086-be8839c58ab3\', \'multiverseId\': 581659}, \'multiverseid\': 581659}, {\'name\': \'Illuminor Szeras\', \'text\': \'Segredos da Alma — {T}, sacrifique outra criatura: Adicione uma quantidade de {B} igual ao valor de mana da criatura sacrificada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato Lendária — Necron\', \'flavor\': \'"Imortalidade não é o mesmo que invulnerabilidade, mas dá pro gasto."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581819&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1409eb94-a0d0-412b-9e6c-1aa3f91f4392\', \'multiverseId\': 581819}, \'multiverseid\': 581819}, {\'name\': \'光耀者斯泽拉斯\', \'text\': \'灵魂秘密～{T}，牺牲另一个生物：加若干{B}，其数量等同于所牺牲生物的法术力值。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器生物 ～太空死灵\', \'flavor\': \'「虽然永生不死与刀枪不入不尽相同，但也无甚区别。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582139&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de2e0a41-2f93-4711-83c9-fbd5d21141d7\', \'multiverseId\': 582139}, \'multiverseid\': 582139}]', '[{\'name\': \'Inquisitor Eisenhorn\', \'text\': \'Du kannst die erste Karte, die du pro Zug ziehst, beim Ziehen vorzeigen. Immer wenn du auf diese Weise eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte vorzeigst, erzeuge Cherubael, einen legendären 4/4 schwarzen Dämon-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\\nImmer wenn Inquisitor Eisenhorn einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, stelle entsprechend oft Nachforschungen an. (Erzeuge einen Hinweis-Spielstein. Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{2}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Ziehe eine Karte.")\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Inquisitor\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581109&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2ebe5dd-9366-498c-8f4a-f4cc7e21b21e\', \'multiverseId\': 581109}, \'multiverseid\': 581109}, {\'name\': \'Inquisidor Eisenhorn\', \'text\': \'Puedes mostrar la primera carta que robes cada turno en cuanto la robes. Siempre que muestres una carta de instantáneo o de conjuro de esta manera, crea a Cherubael, una ficha de criatura legendaria Demonio negra 4/4 con la habilidad de volar.\\nSiempre que el Inquisidor Eisenhorn haga daño de combate a un jugador, investiga esa misma cantidad de veces. (Crea una ficha de Pista. Es un artefacto con "{2}, sacrificar este artefacto: Roba una carta".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Inquisidor humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20304422-0137-40ad-b94b-3781712d15ce\', \'multiverseId\': 581269}, \'multiverseid\': 581269}, {\'name\': \'Inquisiteur Eisenhorn\', \'text\': "Vous pouvez révéler la première carte que vous piochez à chaque tour au moment où vous la piochez. À chaque fois que vous révélez une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel de cette manière, créez Cherubael, un jeton de créature légendaire 4/4 noire Démon avec le vol.\\nÀ chaque vois que l\'Inquisiteur Eisenhorn inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, enquêtez autant de fois. (Créez un jeton Indice. C\'est un artefact avec « {2}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Piochez une carte. »)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et inquisiteur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581429&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'018db1ce-280e-43ac-a728-61c4a99f1b1b\', \'multiverseId\': 581429}, \'multiverseid\': 581429}, {\'name\': \'Inquisitore Eisenhorn\', \'text\': \'Puoi rivelare la prima carta che peschi in ogni turno mentre la peschi. Ogniqualvolta riveli una carta istantaneo o stregoneria in questo modo, crea Cherubael, una pedina creatura leggendaria Demone 4/4 nera con volare.\\nOgniqualvolta l\\\'Inquisitore Eisenhorn infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, indaga altrettante volte. (Crea una pedina Indizio. È un artefatto con "{2}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Pesca una carta".)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Inquisitore Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc78f918-a1b3-4810-8344-7090e048bb5e\', \'multiverseId\': 581589}, \'multiverseid\': 581589}, {\'name\': \'異端審問官アイゼンホーン\', \'text\': \'各ターンであなたの最初のカードを引くに際し、あなたはそれを公開してもよい。これによりあなたがインスタントやソーサリーであるカードを公開するたび、「ケルバエル」という名前で飛行を持つ黒の４/４の伝説のデーモン・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n異端審問官アイゼンホーンがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、その点数に等しい回数の調査を行う。（手掛かり・トークン１つを生成する。（それは、「{2},このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・異端審問官\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581749&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4b0fe54-5359-4415-be0a-74e346688294\', \'multiverseId\': 581749}, \'multiverseid\': 581749}, {\'name\': \'Inquisidor Eisenhorn\', \'text\': \'Você pode revelar o primeiro card que comprar em cada turno conforme o compra. Toda vez que você revelar um card de mágica instantânea ou de feitiço dessa forma, crie Cherubael, uma ficha de criatura Demônio preta 4/4 lendária com voar.\\nToda vez que Inquisidor Eisenhorn causar dano de combate a um jogador, investigue aquela quantidade de vezes. (Crie uma ficha de Pista. Ela é um artefato com "{2}, sacrifique este artefato: Compre um card".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Inquisidor\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581909&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'404d589b-83ca-4b11-9fe3-16a481cd2481\', \'multiverseId\': 581909}, \'multiverseid\': 581909}, {\'name\': \'审判官艾森霍恩\', \'text\': \'你可以于你抓每回合第一张牌时展示之。每当你以此法展示一张瞬间或法术牌时，派出传奇衍生生物凯鲁贝尔，其为4/4黑色，具飞行异能的恶魔。\\n每当审判官艾森霍恩对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，探查等量次数。（派出一个线索衍生物。它是具有「{2}，牺牲此神器：抓一张牌」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／审判官\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582229&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8f1b2ae-793e-495b-9bf5-c7d21b318156\', \'multiverseId\': 582229}, \'multiverseid\': 582229}]', '[{\'name\': \'Inquisitor-Rosette\', \'text\': \'Agenten der Inquisition — Immer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur angreift, erzeuge einen angreifenden 2/2 weißen Astartes-Krieger-Kreaturenspielstein mit Wachsamkeit. Dann erhalten angreifende Kreaturen Bedrohlichkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nAusrüsten {3} ({3}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581141&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'116c1eda-6c21-4f91-a1ad-656dd19e51db\', \'multiverseId\': 581141}, \'multiverseid\': 581141}, {\'name\': \'Insignia de Inquisidor\', \'text\': \'Agentes de la Inquisición — Siempre que la criatura equipada ataque, crea una ficha de criatura Guerrero Astartes blanca 2/2 con la habilidad de vigilancia que está atacando. Luego, las criaturas atacantes ganan la habilidad de amenaza hasta el final del turno.\\nEquipar {3}. ({3}: Anexa este Equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581301&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fb60ee0-5a67-4e78-856a-1cf04efe1b14\', \'multiverseId\': 581301}, \'multiverseid\': 581301}, {\'name\': \'Rosette inquisitoriale\', \'text\': "Agents de l\'Inquisition — À chaque fois que la créature équipée attaque, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 blanche Astartes et Guerrier avec la vigilance, attaquant. Puis les créatures attaquantes acquièrent la menace jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nÉquipement {3} ({3} : Attachez à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581461&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a60bd7f1-7606-4ff7-b4e8-0c640f5c5c61\', \'multiverseId\': 581461}, \'multiverseid\': 581461}, {\'name\': \'Rosetta degli Inquisitori\', \'text\': "Agenti dell\'Inquisizione — Ogniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata attacca, crea una pedina creatura Guerriero Astartes 2/2 bianca con cautela e attaccante. Poi le creature attaccanti hanno minacciare fino alla fine del turno.\\nEquipaggiare {3} ({3}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo come una stregoneria.)", \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9a68b8a-a9ed-4d4a-a7d9-d71e9ae93746\', \'multiverseId\': 581621}, \'multiverseid\': 581621}, {\'name\': \'異端審問官の勲章\', \'text\': \'異端審問庁の工作員 — 装備しているクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、警戒を持つ白の２/２のアスタルテス・戦士・クリーチャー・トークン１体を攻撃している状態で生成する。その後、ターン終了時まで、すべての攻撃クリーチャーは威迫を得る。\\n装備{3}（{3}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581781&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c731c35e-3d35-4238-bb02-7781e9b2caff\', \'multiverseId\': 581781}, \'multiverseid\': 581781}, {\'name\': \'Insígnia de Inquisidor\', \'text\': \'Agentes da Inquisição — Toda vez que a criatura equipada atacar, crie uma ficha de criatura Astartes Guerreiro branca 2/2 com vigilância atacando. Em seguida, as criaturas atacantes ganham ameaçar até o final do turno.\\nEquipar {3} ({3}: Anexe este equipamento à criatura alvo que você controla. Equipe somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581941&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69a336b1-b245-4aa8-84cb-fdb4ec0a99f6\', \'multiverseId\': 581941}, \'multiverseid\': 581941}, {\'name\': \'审判庭玫瑰结\', \'text\': \'审判庭官员～每当佩带此武具的生物攻击时，派出一个2/2白色，具警戒异能的阿斯塔特／战士衍生生物，且正进行攻击。然后进行攻击的生物获得威慑异能直到回合结束。\\n佩带{3}（{3}：贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。只能于法术时机佩带。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582261&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44b15e92-e75d-4074-872d-fcc792708b12\', \'multiverseId\': 582261}, \'multiverseid\': 582261}]', '[{\'name\': \'Invasion der Tyraniden\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge so viele 3/3 grüne Tyranide-Krieger-Kreaturenspielsteine, die Trampelschaden verursachen, wie du Gegner hast.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Als die Blood Angels vom Himmel herabstiegen, war Phodia eine transformierte Stadt. Kilometerlange Flüsse aus Fleisch führten in die zentralen Verdauungsbecken und hinauf in die Schwarmflotte im Orbit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581084&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d729b4a9-0476-40a3-a480-1db6171a7bae\', \'multiverseId\': 581084}, \'multiverseid\': 581084}, {\'name\': \'Invasión Tiránida\', \'text\': \'Crea una cantidad de fichas de criatura Guerrero Tiránido verdes 3/3 con la habilidad de arrollar igual a la cantidad de oponentes que tienes.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando los Ángeles Sangrientos descendieron de los cielos, la ciudad de Phodia ya se había transformado por completo. Miles de ríos de carne desembocaban en las piscinas de digestión centrales y subían hacia la flota enjambre que estaba por encima.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6319956a-3fb3-4b92-80a7-6fe0bab2981b\', \'multiverseId\': 581244}, \'multiverseid\': 581244}, {\'name\': \'Invasion tyranide\', \'text\': "Créez un nombre de jetons de créature 3/3 verte Tyranide et Guerrier avec le piétinement égal au nombre d\'adversaires que vous avez.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Quand les Blood Angels descendirent des cieux sur Phodia, la ville était transformée. Des kilomètres de rivières de chair nourrissaient des bassins de digestion centralisés et la flotte-ruche.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581404&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5c2ae0f-803a-496d-9b0b-cfb181efcd39\', \'multiverseId\': 581404}, \'multiverseid\': 581404}, {\'name\': \'Invasione Tiranide\', \'text\': \'Crea un numero di pedine creatura Guerriero Tiranide 3/3 verdi con travolgere pari al numero di avversari che hai.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Quando i Blood Angels scesero dal cielo, Phodia era una città trasformata. Chilometri di fiumi traboccanti di carne sfociavano nei bacini di digestione centrali e poi all\'insù, nella flotta alveare soprastante.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581564&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e256537-1934-4b18-a9bc-4dc3ccacfdb8\', \'multiverseId\': 581564}, \'multiverseid\': 581564}, {\'name\': \'ティラニッドの侵略\', \'text\': \'対戦相手の人数に等しい数の、トランプルを持つ緑の３/３のティラニッド・戦士・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ブラッドエンジェル戦団が天から降臨した頃には、都市フォディアはすでに姿を変えていた。何キロにもわたる肉片の川が都心の消化泉へと流れ込み、頭上の群巣艦隊へと繋がっていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581724&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2d717a4-7caf-4041-bc5b-f74595832962\', \'multiverseId\': 581724}, \'multiverseid\': 581724}, {\'name\': \'Invasão Tiranídea\', \'text\': \'Crie um número de fichas de criatura Tiranídeo Guerreiro verde 3/3 com atropelar igual ao número de oponentes que você tem.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'No momento em que os Anjos Sangrentos desceram dos céus, a cidade de Phódia foi transformada. Quilômetros de rios cheios de carne desaguavam nos poços de digestão centrais e subiam para a frota-colmeia acima.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581884&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06ee137b-8340-420f-a5f6-af8df7ac07ca\', \'multiverseId\': 581884}, \'multiverseid\': 581884}, {\'name\': \'泰伦虫族入侵\', \'text\': \'派出若干3/3绿色，具践踏异能的泰伦虫族／战士衍生生物，其数量等同于你的对手数量。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'待圣血天使从天而降，弗迪亚城早已面目全非。绵延数里的尸体挤满河道，随着流水进入中央消化池，直送上方的虫巢舰队。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582204&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5e80056-ec05-4015-b2c0-e58b894925fb\', \'multiverseId\': 582204}, \'multiverseid\': 582204}]', "[{'name': 'Jägerin des Slaanesh', 'text': 'Eile\\nVerlockung des Slaanesh — Jeder Gegner muss in jedem Kampf mit mindestens einer Kreatur angreifen, falls möglich.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Dämon', 'flavor': 'Für sie ist Krieg ein Tanz. Und sie ist auf der Suche nach Partnern.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581067&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '78044721-5413-421e-804e-d6f4ca79715d', 'multiverseId': 581067}, 'multiverseid': 581067}, {'name': 'Rastreaalmas de Slaanesh', 'text': 'Prisa.\\nFascinación de Slaanesh — Cada oponente debe atacar con al menos una criatura cada combate si puede.', 'type': 'Criatura — Demonio', 'flavor': 'La guerra es una danza y buscan compañeros.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581227&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '926c90f0-138c-4f15-9571-bd53feb7cb12', 'multiverseId': 581227}, 'multiverseid': 581227}, {'name': 'Veneuse de Slaanesh', 'text': 'Célérité\\nAppas de Slaanesh — Chaque adversaire doit attaquer avec au moins une créature à chaque combat si possible.', 'type': 'Créature : démon', 'flavor': 'La guerre est une danse. Et elles cherchent des partenaires.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581387&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cacc19ad-02aa-4427-bc5c-63c595292f84', 'multiverseId': 581387}, 'multiverseid': 581387}, {'name': 'Cacciatrice di Slaanesh', 'text': 'Rapidità\\nFascino di Slaanesh — Ogni avversario deve attaccare con almeno una creatura in ogni combattimento, se possibile.', 'type': 'Creatura — Demone', 'flavor': 'La guerra è una danza. E loro sono alla ricerca di un compagno di ballo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581547&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '32e66b76-8390-4c8a-954f-e62fab2517a4', 'multiverseId': 581547}, 'multiverseid': 581547}, {'name': 'シーカー・オヴ・スラーネッシュ', 'text': '速攻\\nスラーネッシュの誘惑 — 各対戦相手はそれぞれ、各戦闘で可能なら１体以上のクリーチャーで攻撃しなければならない。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — デーモン', 'flavor': '戦争はダンスだ。そしてそれはパートナーを探している。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581707&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aa6b3538-0bdb-4f6d-845c-a692ba8b052e', 'multiverseId': 581707}, 'multiverseid': 581707}, {'name': 'Buscador de Slaanesh', 'text': 'Ímpeto\\nFascínio de Slaanesh — Cada oponente precisa atacar com ao menos uma criatura a cada combate se estiver apto.', 'type': 'Criatura — Demônio', 'flavor': 'A guerra é uma dança. E eles buscam parceiros.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581867&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '78982f91-7c66-47a8-bd97-43f66721ddab', 'multiverseId': 581867}, 'multiverseid': 581867}, {'name': '色孽探索者', 'text': '敏捷\\n色孽之诱～每位对手每次战斗若能以至少一个生物攻击，则须如此作。', 'type': '生物 ～恶魔', 'flavor': '战争不过是场舞会。而他们只是在找舞伴。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582187&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd7153a54-b7b3-4c39-84d0-9eb3af4150af', 'multiverseId': 582187}, 'multiverseid': 582187}]", '[{\'name\': \'Kanoptech-Gruftwächter\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nExilationskanone — Wenn der Kanoptech-Gruftwächter aus einem Friedhof ins Spiel kommt, schicke bis zu eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist, ins Exil.\\nExhumieren {7} ({7}: Bringe diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Sie erhält Eile. Schicke sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments, oder falls sie das Spiel verlassen würde, ins Exil. Spiele Exhumieren wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Insekt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581134&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7ca2080-00b7-4652-9ec6-6c3dc9b96a33\', \'multiverseId\': 581134}, \'multiverseid\': 581134}, {\'name\': \'Centinela canóptico de la Necrópolis\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\nCañón del exilio — Cuando el Centinela canóptico de la Necrópolis entre al campo de batalla desde un cementerio, exilia hasta un permanente objetivo que no sea tierra.\\nDesenterrar {7}. ({7}: Regresa esta carta de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Gana la habilidad de prisa. Exíliala al comienzo del próximo paso final o si fuera a dejar el campo de batalla. Activa la habilidad de desenterrar solo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Insecto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51b66556-a1a4-4594-9f17-f14d916a8733\', \'multiverseId\': 581294}, \'multiverseid\': 581294}, {\'name\': \'Sentinelles des nécropoles Canoptek\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\nCanon d\'exil — Quand les Sentinelles des nécropoles Canoptek arrivent sur le champ de bataille depuis un cimetière, exilez jusqu\'à un permanent non-terrain ciblé.\\nExhumation {7} ({7} : Renvoyez cette carte sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière. Elle acquiert la célérité. Exilez-la au début de la prochaine étape de fin ou si elle devait quitter le champ de bataille. N\'exhumez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : insecte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581454&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0abf5186-a152-4f5e-8434-2a6749385e0a\', \'multiverseId\': 581454}, \'multiverseid\': 581454}, {\'name\': \'Sentinella delle Tombe Canoptek\', \'text\': "Cautela\\nCannone dell\'Esilio — Quando la Sentinella delle Tombe Canoptek entra nel campo di battaglia da un cimitero, esilia fino a un permanente non terra bersaglio.\\nDissotterrare {7} ({7}: Rimetti sul campo di battaglia questa carta dal tuo cimitero. Ha rapidità. Esiliala all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale o se sta per lasciare il campo di battaglia. Dissotterra solo come una stregoneria.)", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Insetto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581614&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3d7a6ee-a8f5-47bc-901f-6911fe50ecf9\', \'multiverseId\': 581614}, \'multiverseid\': 581614}, {\'name\': \'カノプテック・トゥーム・センチネル\', \'text\': \'警戒\\nエグザイルキャノン — 墓地にあるカノプテック・トゥーム・センチネルが戦場に出たとき、土地でないパーマネント最大１つを対象とする。それを追放する。\\n蘇生{7}（{7}：あなたの墓地にあるこのカードを戦場に戻す。これは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、またはこれが戦場を離れるなら、これを追放する。蘇生はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 昆虫\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581774&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31aa6df0-d13c-489f-afca-7e9143afdfc8\', \'multiverseId\': 581774}, \'multiverseid\': 581774}, {\'name\': \'Sentinela das Tumbas Canopteca\', \'text\': \'Vigilância\\nCanhão do Exílio — Quando Sentinela das Tumbas Canopteca entrar no campo de batalha vindo de um cemitério, exile até uma permanente não de terreno alvo.\\nDesenterrar {7} ({7}: Devolva este card de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha. Ele ganha ímpeto. Exile-o no início da próxima etapa final ou se ele for deixar o campo de batalha. Use desenterrar somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Inseto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581934&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac915c26-6076-4a2f-b689-5e3304ccb9b0\', \'multiverseId\': 581934}, \'multiverseid\': 581934}, {\'name\': \'墓穴陵哨卫\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n流亡炮～当墓穴陵哨卫从坟墓场进战场时，放逐至多一个目标非地永久物。\\n破坟{7}（{7}：将此牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。它获得敏捷异能。在下一个结束步骤开始时，或若它将离开战场，将它放逐。只能于法术时机破坟。）\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～昆虫\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582254&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'566fe038-c30a-46dc-86d5-94cc2776aa1d\', \'multiverseId\': 582254}, \'multiverseid\': 582254}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kanoptech-Phantom\', \'text\': \'Phantomform — Das Kanoptech-Phantom kann nicht geblockt werden.\\nTransdimensionaler Scout — Wenn das Kanoptech-Phantom einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du {3} bezahlen und es opfern. Falls du dies tust, durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten mit demselben Namen wie ein Land, das du kontrollierst, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Wraith\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581135&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca73d44d-772a-47f0-9bfc-1b357f70490c\', \'multiverseId\': 581135}, \'multiverseid\': 581135}, {\'name\': \'Espectro canóptico\', \'text\': \'Forma espectral — El Espectro canóptico no puede ser bloqueado.\\nExplorador transdimensional — Cuando el Espectro canóptico haga daño de combate a un jugador, puedes pagar {3} y sacrificarlo. Si lo haces, busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica con el mismo nombre que una tierra que controlas, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Aparición\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d239b55-c52a-4246-9909-bfde8acf0cbc\', \'multiverseId\': 581295}, \'multiverseid\': 581295}, {\'name\': \'Spectre Canoptek\', \'text\': "Enveloppe spectrale — Le Spectre Canoptek ne peut pas être bloqué.\\nÉclaireur transdimensionnel — Quand le Spectre Canoptek inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, vous pouvez payer {3} et le sacrifier. Si vous faites ainsi, cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base ayant le même nom qu\'un terrain que vous contrôlez, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : apparition\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581455&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0219578-7ec1-4e49-b485-8403ead58b89\', \'multiverseId\': 581455}, \'multiverseid\': 581455}, {\'name\': \'Spettro Canoptek\', \'text\': \'Forma Spettrale — Lo Spettro Canoptek non può essere bloccato.\\nEsploratore Transdimensionale — Quando lo Spettro Canoptek infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, puoi pagare {3} e sacrificarlo. Se lo fai, passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base con lo stesso nome di una terra che controlli, mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Necrospettro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581615&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bc6cf8f-a6de-47fa-a19d-f9c3f78559ce\', \'multiverseId\': 581615}, \'multiverseid\': 581615}, {\'name\': \'カノプテック・レイス\', \'text\': \'半実体 — カノプテック・レイスはブロックされない。\\n超次元の斥候 — カノプテック・レイスがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えたとき、あなたは「{3}を支払ってこれを生け贄に捧げる。」を選んでもよい。そうしたなら、あなたのライブラリーから、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つと同じ名前を持つ基本土地・カード最大２枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — レイス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aabed851-54d2-43d7-b298-a461712ed0d2\', \'multiverseId\': 581775}, \'multiverseid\': 581775}, {\'name\': \'Aparição Canopteca\', \'text\': \'Forma de Aparição — Aparição Canopteca não pode ser bloqueada.\\nBatedor Transdimensional — Quando Aparição Canopteca causa dano de combate a um jogador, você pode pagar {3} e sacrificá-la. Se fizer isso, procure em seu grimório até dois cards de terreno básico com o mesmo nome que um terreno que você controla, coloque-os no campo de batalha virados e depois embaralhe.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Aparição\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581935&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c18db540-0330-49a5-923b-c7c40ce59936\', \'multiverseId\': 581935}, \'multiverseid\': 581935}, {\'name\': \'墓穴幽魂\', \'text\': \'幽魂形态～墓穴幽魂不能被阻挡。\\n超维斥候～当墓穴幽魂对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，你可以支付{3}并牺牲之。若你如此作，则从你牌库中搜寻至多两张基本地牌，且均须与由你操控的某个地同名；将它们横置放进战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～鬼魂\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcda9c12-8602-4e2a-adce-db2dcb252a02\', \'multiverseId\': 582255}, \'multiverseid\': 582255}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kanoptech-Skarabäenschwarm\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nFresskiefer — Wenn der Kanoptech-Skarabäenschwarm ins Spiel kommt, schicke den Friedhof eines Spielers deiner Wahl ins Exil. Erzeuge für jede auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickte Artefakt- oder Länderkarte einen 1/1 farblosen Insekt-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Insekt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581132&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7a63530-d473-448a-92da-1fcb1e9b092b\', \'multiverseId\': 581132}, \'multiverseid\': 581132}, {\'name\': \'Enjambre Canóptico Escarabeo\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nMandíbulas devoradoras — Cuando el Enjambre Canóptico Escarabeo entre al campo de batalla, exilia el cementerio del jugador objetivo. Por cada carta de artefacto o de tierra exiliada de esta manera, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Insecto incolora 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Insecto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581292&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88e6a3de-d63c-4c97-8028-6e11de352798\', \'multiverseId\': 581292}, \'multiverseid\': 581292}, {\'name\': \'Nuée de scarabées Canoptek\', \'text\': "Vol\\nMandibules — Quand la Nuée de scarabées Canoptek arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez le cimetière d\'un joueur ciblé. Pour chaque carte d\'artefact ou de terrain exilée de cette manière, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Insecte avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : insecte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581452&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c4588f7-1b72-4772-9a03-b0386213c432\', \'multiverseId\': 581452}, \'multiverseid\': 581452}, {\'name\': \'Sciame di Scarabei Canoptek\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nMandibole — Quando lo Sciame di Scarabei Canoptek entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia il cimitero di un giocatore bersaglio. Per ogni carta terra o artefatto esiliata in questo modo, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Insetto 1/1 incolore con volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Insetto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581612&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37596b99-e94d-49a4-a1fa-786dca89f2ec\', \'multiverseId\': 581612}, \'multiverseid\': 581612}, {\'name\': \'カノプテック・スカラベ・スウォーム\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n分解者の顎 — カノプテック・スカラベ・スウォームが戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーの墓地を追放する。これにより追放されてアーティファクトや土地であるカード１枚につき１体の、飛行を持つ無色の１/１の昆虫・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 昆虫\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c1859dd-38b8-4535-b6f0-5c80255561ae\', \'multiverseId\': 581772}, \'multiverseid\': 581772}, {\'name\': \'Enxame de Escaravelhos Canoptecas\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nMandíbulas Alimentadoras — Quando Enxame de Escaravelhos Canoptecas entrar no campo de batalha, exile o cemitério do jogador alvo. Para cada card de artefato ou terreno exilado dessa forma, crie uma ficha de criatura artefato Inseto incolor 1/1 com voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Inseto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6f75400-9e62-40e3-81ff-d275dda7ae22\', \'multiverseId\': 581932}, \'multiverseid\': 581932}, {\'name\': \'墓穴圣甲虫群\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n啃食巨颚～当墓穴圣甲虫群进战场时，放逐目标牌手的坟墓场。每以此法放逐一张神器或地牌，便派出一个1/1无色，具飞行异能的昆虫衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～昆虫\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582252&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97f527ab-308a-48b7-90c1-5e0400eec30c\', \'multiverseId\': 582252}, \'multiverseid\': 582252}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kanoptech-Spinne\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nFabrikator-Vorrichtung — Immer wenn eine andere Nichtspielstein-Artefaktkreatur oder ein Nichtspielstein-Fahrzeug unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Spinne\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581133&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a8f6403-6646-42ba-9185-7d386920975a\', \'multiverseId\': 581133}, \'multiverseid\': 581133}, {\'name\': \'Araña canóptica\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nGarras de reparación — Siempre que otra criatura artefacto o Vehículo que no sea ficha entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Araña\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581293&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3921ef20-7821-4239-aabf-8650303ec9ec\', \'multiverseId\': 581293}, \'multiverseid\': 581293}, {\'name\': \'Arachnyde Canoptek\', \'text\': "Vol\\nPanoplie de pinces — À chaque fois qu\'une autre créature-artefact non-jeton ou un véhicule non-jeton arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : araignée\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581453&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70eaf01c-221d-4227-9202-785ac114d91b\', \'multiverseId\': 581453}, \'multiverseid\': 581453}, {\'name\': \'Spyder Canoptek\', \'text\': "Volare\\nArtiglio Fabricator — Ogniqualvolta un\'altra creatura artefatto o Veicolo non pedina entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Ragno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f81cbb5-7003-4f99-bf48-7e448e68d04b\', \'multiverseId\': 581613}, \'multiverseid\': 581613}, {\'name\': \'カノプテック・スパイダー\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n製造者の爪 — トークンでもこれでもないアーティファクト・クリーチャーや機体のうち１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a191d14-57fb-4514-a9fa-60d9e07605ad\', \'multiverseId\': 581773}, \'multiverseid\': 581773}, {\'name\': \'Aranha Canopteca\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nGarras do Fabricador — Toda vez que outra criatura artefato ou Veículo não ficha entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Aranha\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581933&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49aa9cbf-8ed6-445b-ad51-c6608d4668b3\', \'multiverseId\': 581933}, \'multiverseid\': 581933}, {\'name\': \'墓穴蜘蛛\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n织造爪列～每当另一个非衍生物的神器或载具在你操控下进战场时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e800fb10-4530-44f9-a2e7-915738ee3595\', \'multiverseId\': 582253}, \'multiverseid\': 582253}]', "[{'name': 'Khârn der Verräter', 'text': 'Berserker — Khârn der Verräter greift in jedem Kampf an und blockt in jedem Kampf, falls möglich.\\nSiegel der Korruption — Wenn du die Kontrolle über Khârn den Verräter verlierst, ziehe zwei Karten.\\nDer Verräter — Falls Khârn dem Verräter Schaden zugefügt würde, verhindere den Schaden und ein Gegner, den du bestimmst, übernimmt die Kontrolle über ihn.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Astartes, Berserker', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581061&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '46871e89-2f4b-448c-a683-81b5c5c75af8', 'multiverseId': 581061}, 'multiverseid': 581061}, {'name': 'Khârn, el Traidor', 'text': 'Berzerker — Khârn, el Traidor ataca o bloquea cada combate si puede.\\nSello de corrupción — Cuando pierdas el control de Khârn, el Traidor, roba dos cartas.\\nEl Traidor — Si Khârn, el Traidor fuera a recibir daño, prevén ese daño y un oponente de tu elección gana el control de él.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Berserker astartes', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581221&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2796491e-b4dd-45c3-980d-ff5363bd9694', 'multiverseId': 581221}, 'multiverseid': 581221}, {'name': 'Khârn le Félon', 'text': 'Berzerker — Khârn le Félon attaque ou bloque à chaque combat si possible.\\nSymbole de Corruption — Quand vous perdez le contrôle de Khârn le Félon, piochez deux cartes.\\nLe Félon — Si des blessures devaient être infligées à Khârn le Félon, prévenez ces blessures et un adversaire de votre choix en acquiert le contrôle.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire : astartes et berserker', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581381&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4196b8da-f191-434e-a844-9251213d4b82', 'multiverseId': 581381}, 'multiverseid': 581381}, {'name': 'Khârn il Traditore', 'text': 'Berzerker — Khârn il Traditore attacca o blocca in ogni combattimento, se può farlo.\\nSigillo della Corruzione — Quando perdi il controllo di Khârn il Traditore, pesca due carte.\\nIl Traditore — Se sta per essere inflitto danno a Khârn il Traditore, previeni quel danno e un avversario a tua scelta ne prende il controllo.', 'type': 'Creatura Leggendaria — Berserker Astartes', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581541&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '10575779-92e7-44c2-9384-e029580bd902', 'multiverseId': 581541}, 'multiverseid': 581541}, {'name': '裏切者、カーン', 'text': 'バーザーカー — 各戦闘で、裏切者、カーンは可能なら攻撃かブロックする。\\n堕落の印章 — あなたが裏切者、カーンのコントロールを失ったとき、カード２枚を引く。\\n裏切者 — 裏切者、カーンがダメージを受けるなら、そのダメージを軽減し、あなたは対戦相手１人を選ぶ。そのプレイヤーはこれのコントロールを得る。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — アスタルテス・狂戦士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581701&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aa8a8ff3-0c1f-4bc4-a902-006f8fffb45c', 'multiverseId': 581701}, 'multiverseid': 581701}, {'name': 'Khârn, o Traidor', 'text': 'Berzerker — Khârn, o Traidor, ataca ou bloqueia a cada combate se estiver apto.\\nInsígnia da Corrupção — Quando você perder o controle de Khârn, o Traidor, compre dois cards.\\nO Traidor — Se algum dano seria causado a Khârn, o Traidor, previna aquele dano e um oponente à sua escolha ganha o controle dele.', 'type': 'Criatura Lendária — Astartes Amoque', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581861&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7fa905e0-9ae7-4a3a-b586-abe42822d5d1', 'multiverseId': 581861}, 'multiverseid': 581861}, {'name': '背叛者卡恩', 'text': '狂战士～背叛者卡恩每次战斗若能攻击或阻挡，则须如此作。\\n腐败符文～当你失去背叛者卡恩的操控权时，抓两张牌。\\n背叛者～如果背叛者卡恩将受到伤害，则防止该伤害，且你选择一位对手来让他获得背叛者卡恩的操控权。', 'type': '传奇生物 ～阿斯塔特／狂战士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582181&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6b134b1a-4fda-4509-ac66-fe73ba8825b5', 'multiverseId': 582181}, 'multiverseid': 582181}]", '[{\'name\': \'Knochensäbel\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur angreift, lege vier +1/+1-Marken auf sie.\\nAusrüsten {3} ({3}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Die mit psionischer Energie geladenen Nahkampfwaffen der Tyraniden sind weit mehr als Knochen und Chitin.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581070&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea2cd947-f980-404c-b915-62a18b571166\', \'multiverseId\': 581070}, \'multiverseid\': 581070}, {\'name\': \'Sables óseos\', \'text\': \'Siempre que la criatura equipada ataque, pon cuatro contadores +1/+1 sobre ella.\\nEquipar {3}. ({3}: Anexa este Equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'Las armas cuerpo a cuerpo de los tiránidos, cargadas de energía psíquica, son mucho más que huesos y quitina.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84b21489-8482-40af-856b-816be9761310\', \'multiverseId\': 581230}, \'multiverseid\': 581230}, {\'name\': "Épées d\'os", \'text\': "À chaque fois que la créature équipée attaque, mettez quatre marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle.\\nÉquipement {3} ({3} : Attachez à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': "Chargées d\'énergie psychique, les armes de contact des Tyranides sont bien plus que de l\'os et de la chitine.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581390&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9dc8503b-1e7f-4395-92b1-14a36fdfa80e\', \'multiverseId\': 581390}, \'multiverseid\': 581390}, {\'name\': \'Osteosciabole\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata attacca, metti quattro segnalini +1/+1 su di essa.\\nEquipaggiare {3} ({3}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo come una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'Caricate di energia psichica, le armi da mischia dei Tiranidi sono molto più che ossa e chitina.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581550&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f99651a-b9df-4312-9f33-e750184cb06b\', \'multiverseId\': 581550}, \'multiverseid\': 581550}, {\'name\': \'ボーン・サーベル\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター４個を置く。\\n装備{3}（{3}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'サイキックエネルギーを帯びたティラニッドの近接武器は、ただの骨とキチン質で出来た武器ではない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581710&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b54ae13c-ba07-42a1-ae27-64e6d2b6096d\', \'multiverseId\': 581710}, \'multiverseid\': 581710}, {\'name\': \'Sabres Ósseos\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que a criatura equipada atacar, coloque quatro marcadores +1/+1 nela.\\nEquipar {3} ({3}: Anexe este equipamento à criatura alvo que você controla. Equipe somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'Carregadas com energia psíquica, as armas de corpo a corpo dos tiranídeos são muito mais que osso e quitina.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581870&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba21685a-ed1a-4087-8291-051df1666253\', \'multiverseId\': 581870}, \'multiverseid\': 581870}, {\'name\': \'坚骨利刃\', \'text\': \'每当佩带此武具的生物攻击时，在其上放置四个+1/+1指示物。\\n佩带{3}（{3}：贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。只能于法术时机佩带。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'泰伦虫族的近战武器得灵能之力加持，绝非骨头甲质这般单纯。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582190&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'345006a7-468a-4a00-8ef0-8070a3168c58\', \'multiverseId\': 582190}, \'multiverseid\': 582190}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kommissarin Severina Raine\', \'text\': \'Führung von der Frontlinie — Immer wenn Kommissarin Severina Raine angreift, verliert jeder Gegner X Lebenspunkte, wobei X gleich der Anzahl anderer angreifender Kreaturen ist.\\nExemplarische Exekution — {2}, opfere eine andere Kreatur: Du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu und ziehst eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581094&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b7fdaa4-1a0f-48fa-85e4-0c78fd47a62c\', \'multiverseId\': 581094}, \'multiverseid\': 581094}, {\'name\': \'Comisaria Severina Raine\', \'text\': \'Liderar desde el frente — Siempre que la Comisaria Severina Raine ataque, cada oponente pierde X vidas, donde X es la cantidad de otras criaturas atacantes.\\nEjecución sumaria — {2}, sacrificar otra criatura: Ganas 2 vidas y robas una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581254&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6e643e7-d6fc-4c00-b08e-c5c019586322\', \'multiverseId\': 581254}, \'multiverseid\': 581254}, {\'name\': \'Commissaire Severina Raine\', \'text\': "Officier de ligne — À chaque fois que la Commissaire Severina Raine attaque, chaque adversaire perd X points de vie, X étant le nombre d\'autres créatures attaquantes.\\nExécution sommaire — {2}, sacrifiez une autre créature : Vous gagnez 2 points de vie et vous piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581414&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aae60842-f2a3-4055-b798-7b1eb533c681\', \'multiverseId\': 581414}, \'multiverseid\': 581414}, {\'name\': \'Commissario Severina Raine\', \'text\': "Guidare dalla Prima Linea — Ogniqualvolta il Commissario Severina Raine attacca, ogni avversario perde X punti vita, dove X è il numero delle altre creature attaccanti.\\nEsecuzione Sommaria — {2}, Sacrifica un\'altra creatura: Guadagni 2 punti vita e peschi una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'543ba58c-557b-43ce-ab1b-5794896fdde9\', \'multiverseId\': 581574}, \'multiverseid\': 581574}, {\'name\': \'コミッサー・セヴェリナ・レイン\', \'text\': \'先陣指揮 — コミッサー・セヴェリナ・レインが攻撃するたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれＸ点のライフを失う。Ｘはこれでない攻撃クリーチャーの数に等しい。\\n略式処刑 — {2},これでないクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：あなたは２点のライフを得てカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581734&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54947cff-7bfc-4619-be0f-9fd9620a6061\', \'multiverseId\': 581734}, \'multiverseid\': 581734}, {\'name\': \'Comissária Severina Raine\', \'text\': \'Liderar da Vanguarda — Toda vez que Comissária Severina Raine ataca, cada oponente perde X pontos de vida, sendo X o número de outras criaturas atacantes.\\nExecução Sumária — {2}, sacrifique outra criatura: Você ganha 2 pontos de vida e compra um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581894&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5c3d102-89cc-4d18-95f6-b0a7af16bdeb\', \'multiverseId\': 581894}, \'multiverseid\': 581894}, {\'name\': \'塞弗丽娜·雷恩政委\', \'text\': \'前线领导～每当塞弗丽娜·雷恩政委攻击时，每位对手各失去X点生命，X为其他进行攻击的生物数量。\\n就地处决～{2}，牺牲另一个生物：你获得2点生命且抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582214&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bd5a664-b9e7-438d-8f91-28b1e84fbe9b\', \'multiverseId\': 582214}, \'multiverseid\': 582214}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kompanie-Commander\', \'text\': \'Kommandoabteilung — Wenn der Kompanie-Commander ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge so viele 1/1 weiße Soldat-Kreaturenspielsteine, wie du Gegner hast.\\nFeuer frei — Immer wenn der Kompanie-Commander angreift, erhalten Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, Todesberührung bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581095&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20688e40-30d6-4972-a51f-91d0f1c12c88\', \'multiverseId\': 581095}, \'multiverseid\': 581095}, {\'name\': \'Comandante de la Compañía\', \'text\': \'Sección de mando — Cuando la Comandante de la Compañía entre al campo de batalla, crea una cantidad de fichas de criatura Soldado blancas 1/1 igual a la cantidad de oponentes que tienes.\\n¡Derríbenlo — Siempre que la Comandante de la Compañía ataque, las criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de toque mortal hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef036832-03cc-4b59-a0f1-25c246e00b77\', \'multiverseId\': 581255}, \'multiverseid\': 581255}, {\'name\': \'Commandante de compagnie\', \'text\': "Section de commandement — Quand la Commandante de compagnie arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un nombre de jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Soldat égal au nombre d\'adversaires que vous avez.\\nAbattez-le — À chaque fois que la Commandante de compagnie attaque, les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent le contact mortel jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581415&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67db8c8b-07d1-4fdb-9e83-9713d937b514\', \'multiverseId\': 581415}, \'multiverseid\': 581415}, {\'name\': \'Comandante della Compagnia\', \'text\': \'Divisione Comando — Quando la Comandante della Compagnia entra nel campo di battaglia, crea un numero di pedine creatura Soldato 1/1 bianche pari al numero di avversari che hai.\\nAbbattetelo — Ogniqualvolta la Comandante della Compagnia attacca, le creature che controlli hanno tocco letale fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1dda7ff-25fa-4e3d-91cc-29bb304e2aee\', \'multiverseId\': 581575}, \'multiverseid\': 581575}, {\'name\': \'中隊の司令\', \'text\': \'指揮官直属部隊 — 中隊の司令が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手の人数に等しい数の白の１/１の兵士・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。\\n打倒せよ！ — 中隊の司令が攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは接死を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581735&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2bcc6df-9b41-4051-858b-91f94a08d294\', \'multiverseId\': 581735}, \'multiverseid\': 581735}, {\'name\': \'Comandante de Companhia\', \'text\': \'Seção de Comando — Quando Comandante de Companhia entrar no campo de batalha, crie um número de fichas de criatura Soldado branca 1/1 igual ao número de oponentes que você tem.\\nDerruba — Toda vez que Comandante de Companhia ataca, as criaturas que você controla ganham toque mortífero até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44cd1e55-c9f9-4acc-9164-e304c427f2ac\', \'multiverseId\': 581895}, \'multiverseid\': 581895}, {\'name\': \'连队指挥官\', \'text\': \'指挥组～当连队指挥官进战场时，派出若干1/1白色士兵衍生生物，其数量等同于你的对手数量。\\n击倒对方！～每当连队指挥官攻击时，由你操控的生物获得死触异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582215&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0fb0ba1-b232-45ec-ae6e-d378953de505\', \'multiverseId\': 582215}, \'multiverseid\': 582215}]', '[{\'name\': \'Konvergenz der Herrschaft\', \'text\': \'Dynastischer Kommandoknoten — Solange du deinen Kommandeur kontrollierst, kosten aktivierte Fähigkeiten von Karten in deinem Friedhof beim Aktivieren {2} weniger. Dieser Effekt kann die Menge Mana in den Aktivierungskosten solcher Fähigkeiten nicht unter ein Mana reduzieren.\\nUmsiedlungsprotokolle — {3}, {T}: Du millst drei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581136&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3738abb8-1ec9-46ab-a429-2095fab1579c\', \'multiverseId\': 581136}, \'multiverseid\': 581136}, {\'name\': \'Convergencia de Dominio\', \'text\': \'Nodo de mando dinástico — Mientras controles a tu comandante, te cuesta {2} menos activar las habilidades activadas de las cartas en tu cementerio. Este efecto no puede reducir esos costes de activación de habilidades a menos de un maná.\\nProtocolos de translocación — {3}, {T}: Muele tres cartas.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581296&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e3d582e-f202-4560-845f-52e6cd03435f\', \'multiverseId\': 581296}, \'multiverseid\': 581296}, {\'name\': \'Convergence de domination\', \'text\': "Relais de commandement dynastique — Tant que vous contrôlez votre commandant, les capacités activées des cartes dans votre cimetière coûtent {2} de moins à activer. Cet effet ne peut pas réduire le mana du coût d\'activation de cette capacité à moins de un mana.\\nProtocoles de translocalisation — {3}, {T} : Meulez trois cartes.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581456&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e138523-db7f-4790-94ee-7c57dd24d1ff\', \'multiverseId\': 581456}, \'multiverseid\': 581456}, {\'name\': \'Confluenza di Potere\', \'text\': \'Nodo di Comando Dinastico — Fintanto che controlli il tuo comandante, le abilità attivate delle carte nel tuo cimitero costano {2} in meno per essere attivate. Questo effetto non può ridurre il mana nel costo di attivazione di quella abilità a meno di un mana.\\nProtocolli di Traslocazione — {3}, {T}: Macina tre carte.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bca60102-a9a7-4ae9-892d-5e278e26a69c\', \'multiverseId\': 581616}, \'multiverseid\': 581616}, {\'name\': \'結集せし支配碑\', \'text\': \'王朝のコマンドノード — あなたがあなたの統率者をコントロールしているかぎり、あなたの墓地にあるすべてのカードのすべての起動型能力は起動するためのコストが{2}少なくなる。この効果は、その能力の起動コストに含まれるマナを１点未満に減らすことはできない。\\n転移プロトコル — {3},{T}：カード３枚を切削する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'068568f6-b6e9-45c2-aaa8-cf9d5833a5a5\', \'multiverseId\': 581776}, \'multiverseid\': 581776}, {\'name\': \'Convergência de Domínio\', \'text\': \'Nodo de Comando Dinástico — Enquanto você controla seu comandante, as habilidades ativadas dos cards em seu cemitério custam {2} a menos para serem ativadas. Este efeito não pode reduzir o mana do custo de ativação daquela habilidade a menos de um mana.\\nProtocolos de Translocação — {3}, {T}: Triture três cards.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581936&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8183b25d-5b0f-45ca-bb51-5c64cde15fc8\', \'multiverseId\': 581936}, \'multiverseid\': 581936}, {\'name\': \'支配聚合\', \'text\': \'王朝指挥节点～只要你操控你的指挥官，你坟墓场中牌的起动式异能便减少{2}来起动。此效应无法将该异能之起动费用中的法术力减少到少于一点法术力。\\n易位程序～{3}，{T}：磨三张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582256&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4353ad5-2919-4275-b3d4-c3f280033751\', \'multiverseId\': 582256}, \'multiverseid\': 582256}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kreischer-Killer\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nBioplasma-Kreischen — Immer wenn du einen Kreaturenzauber mit Manabetrag 5 oder mehr wirkst, fügt der Kreischer-Killer einem Ziel deiner Wahl 5 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Tyranide\', \'flavor\': \'Sein Schrei ist unverständlich, aber die gepanzerten Schotten scheinen die Absicht gut genug zu verstehen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581066&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a7b4422-294a-4404-af1f-0ac3d66fbccd\', \'multiverseId\': 581066}, \'multiverseid\': 581066}, {\'name\': \'Asesino Aullante\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nAullido bioplásmico — Siempre que lances un hechizo de criatura con valor de maná de 5 o más, el Asesino Aullante hace 5 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiránido\', \'flavor\': \'Su chillido es ininteligible, pero los mamparos blindados parecen entender bastante bien el mensaje.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581226&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb0792ae-7137-4af5-9eb0-94751d0a907d\', \'multiverseId\': 581226}, \'multiverseid\': 581226}, {\'name\': \'Carnifex Tueur-hurlant\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nHurlement bioplasmique — À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort de créature avec une valeur de mana supérieure ou égale à 5, le Carnifex Tueur-hurlant inflige 5 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Créature : tyranide\', \'flavor\': "Son cri est inintelligible, mais les plaques de blindage semblent comprendre ce qu\'il veut dire.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581386&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a236c856-0268-499b-ba89-4cca7eb1445e\', \'multiverseId\': 581386}, \'multiverseid\': 581386}, {\'name\': \'Assassino Urlante\', \'text\': "Travolgere\\nUrlo al Bioplasma — Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia creatura con valore di mana pari o superiore a 5, l\'Assassino Urlante infligge 5 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Tiranide\', \'flavor\': "Il suo grido è incomprensibile, ma le paratie corazzate sembrano capirne piuttosto bene l\'intento.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'392efcfd-0918-439b-bb0b-af4808017c8b\', \'multiverseId\': 581546}, \'multiverseid\': 581546}, {\'name\': \'スクリーマーキラー\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\nバイオプラズミック・スクリーム — あなたがマナ総量が５以上であるクリーチャー・呪文を唱えるたび、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。スクリーマーキラーはそれに５点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ティラニッド\', \'flavor\': \'それの悲鳴は意味不明だが、武装隔壁の方は真意をよく理解しているようであった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d36a06a5-71a3-47be-9c0b-ac6ab845edba\', \'multiverseId\': 581706}, \'multiverseid\': 581706}, {\'name\': \'Matador do Grito\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nGrito Bioplásmico — Toda vez que você conjura uma mágica de criatura com valor de mana igual ou superior a 5, Matador do Grito causa 5 pontos de dano a qualquer alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiranídeo\', \'flavor\': \'O guincho é ininteligível, mas os armocéfalos parecem compreender perfeitamente a intenção.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581866&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'180fe4d3-b620-42b9-aa52-0e5dea189200\', \'multiverseId\': 581866}, \'multiverseid\': 581866}, {\'name\': \'尖啸杀手\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n生物等离子尖啸～每当你施放法术力值等于或大于5的生物咒语时，尖啸杀手对任意一个目标造成5点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～泰伦虫族\', \'flavor\': \'虽然无人能解其尖啸含义，但这片加厚舱壁比谁都懂。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582186&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63558054-59fa-4b80-a970-bffd1ea6b5bc\', \'multiverseId\': 582186}, \'multiverseid\': 582186}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kryptoknecht\', \'text\': \'Protektor — Andere Artefaktkreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Fluchsicherheit.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': \'Der Kryptoknecht ist an einen Kryptomanten gebunden und existiert nur aus einem Grund: Seinen Meister bis zum Tod zu verteidigen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581137&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f597d191-b9e7-4d90-a3ce-866035ff1b5d\', \'multiverseId\': 581137}, \'multiverseid\': 581137}, {\'name\': \'Criptosiervo\', \'text\': \'Protector — Las otras criaturas artefacto que controlas tienen la habilidad de antimaleficio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'Un criptosiervo está vinculado a un criptecnólogo y tiene una razón de ser simple: defender a su amo hasta la muerte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581297&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3fa368a-6823-4999-9ce7-04a76c5cad5a\', \'multiverseId\': 581297}, \'multiverseid\': 581297}, {\'name\': \'Cryptoserf\', \'text\': \'Protecteur — Les autres créatures-artefacts que vous contrôlez ont la défense talismanique.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': "Lié à un cryptek, le cryptoserf n\'existe que pour une seule raison : défendre son maître à mort.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581457&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cab4f446-0067-40ff-89dd-654ee52044d3\', \'multiverseId\': 581457}, \'multiverseid\': 581457}, {\'name\': \'Cryptoschiavo\', \'text\': \'Protettore — Le altre creature artefatto che controlli hanno anti-malocchio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': \'Vincolato a un cryptek, il cryptoschiavo esiste per una sola ragione: difendere il suo padrone fino alla morte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01d4bac2-9d64-42b4-a009-16df72ce6ebd\', \'multiverseId\': 581617}, \'multiverseid\': 581617}, {\'name\': \'クリプトスロール\', \'text\': \'プロテクター — あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのアーティファクト・クリーチャーは呪禁を持つ。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': \'クリプテックに縛られているクリプトスロールはたった一つの理由のために存在する。それは死ぬまで主を守ることである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3821139b-63ef-4f68-a2ca-30a750bafe35\', \'multiverseId\': 581777}, \'multiverseid\': 581777}, {\'name\': \'Criptosservo\', \'text\': \'Protetor — As outras criaturas artefato que você controla têm resistência a magia.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'Os criptosservos estão vinculados a um criptoteca e sua existência tem um único objetivo: defender seu mestre até a morte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581937&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f42eaa77-60e1-444f-951e-606ce8d3ebf0\', \'multiverseId\': 581937}, \'multiverseid\': 581937}, {\'name\': \'神秘奴工\', \'text\': \'保卫者～由你操控的其他神器生物具有辟邪异能。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～组构体\', \'flavor\': \'神秘奴工与墓穴技师成对搭配，两者均只为一个目的存在：守卫主人、至死方休。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582257&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ae3f84f-112f-4ba1-9f93-1765a96f9611\', \'multiverseId\': 582257}, \'multiverseid\': 582257}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kryptomant\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, {T}: Bestimme eine andere Artefaktkreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst. Wenn die Kreatur in diesem Zug stirbt, bringe sie getappt unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Necron, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Manche stellen falsche Vergleiche zwischen den Tech-Magi des Adeptus Mechanicus und den Xenotechnikern der Necrons an. Für solche Ketzer kann es keine Gnade geben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581015&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf7a787f-f979-4b44-b6cd-20bc02b46f90\', \'multiverseId\': 581015}, \'multiverseid\': 581015}, {\'name\': \'Criptecnólogo\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, {T}: Elige otra criatura artefacto objetivo que controlas. Cuando esa criatura muera este turno, regrésala al campo de batalla girada bajo tu control.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Hechicero necrón\', \'flavor\': \'Hay quienes hacen comparaciones falsas entre los tecnomagos del Adeptus Mechanicus y los xenotecnólogos de la raza necrona. Ante tamaña herejía no se puede mostrar piedad alguna.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3aece0c-4735-413e-8fb7-046d86109274\', \'multiverseId\': 581175}, \'multiverseid\': 581175}, {\'name\': \'Cryptek\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, {T} : Choisissez une autre créature-artefact ciblée que vous contrôlez. Quand cette créature meurt ce tour-ci, renvoyez-la sur le champ de bataille, engagée et sous votre contrôle.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : nécron et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'Il y en a qui tirent des fausses comparaisons entre les techno-mages des Adeptus Mechanicus et les xénotechnologues des Nécrons. Il ne peut y avoir aucune pitié pour de tels hérétiques.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581335&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a48e304-bae2-49ea-9be3-4cf4ecfe5079\', \'multiverseId\': 581335}, \'multiverseid\': 581335}, {\'name\': \'Cryptek\', \'text\': "{1}{B}, {T}: Scegli un\'altra creatura artefatto bersaglio che controlli. Quando quella creatura muore in questo turno, rimettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata sotto il tuo controllo.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Mago Necron\', \'flavor\': "C\'è chi traccia falsi paragoni fra i tecnomagi dell\'Adeptus Mechanicus e gli xenotecnologi della razza Necron. Non può esserci pietà per simili eretici.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0239efce-0b6e-48cf-805f-51b940358afa\', \'multiverseId\': 581495}, \'multiverseid\': 581495}, {\'name\': \'クリプテック\', \'text\': \'{1}{B},{T}：あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないアーティファクト・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターンにそのクリーチャーが死亡したとき、それをあなたのコントロール下でタップ状態で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ネクロン・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'帝国技術局の技術賢人とネクロン族の異星技術者を誤って比較する者がいる。そのような異端者には情けは無用である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581655&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f84bf85-89a8-43ad-a078-5e6c99646852\', \'multiverseId\': 581655}, \'multiverseid\': 581655}, {\'name\': \'Cripteca\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, {T}: Escolha outra criatura artefato alvo que você controla. Quando aquela criatura morrer neste turno, devolva-a ao campo de batalha virada sob seu controle.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Necron Mago\', \'flavor\': \'Há quem trace falsos paralelos entre os tecnomagos do Adeptus Mechanicus e os xenotecnólogos da raça dos necrons. Não pode haver misericórdia com tais hereges.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581815&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e8065ca-ee9f-4a6c-af04-b3a86fa6a790\', \'multiverseId\': 581815}, \'multiverseid\': 581815}, {\'name\': \'墓穴技师\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}，{T}：选择另一个目标由你操控的神器生物。本回合中，当该生物死去时，将它在你的操控下横置移回战场。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～太空死灵／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'有人竟妄将太空死灵的异形科技师与机械神教的机械贤者相提并论。持有这种异端思想者将决不宽贷。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582135&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28583cc4-3851-4704-9dde-b72af41fd514\', \'multiverseId\': 582135}, \'multiverseid\': 582135}]', '[{\'name\': \'Königswächter\', \'text\': \'Phalanx-Commander — Wenn der Königswächter ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge zwei getappte 2/2 schwarze Necron-Krieger-Artefaktkreaturenspielsteine.\\nExhumieren {3}{B} ({3}{B}: Bringe diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Sie erhält Eile. Schicke sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments, oder falls sie das Spiel verlassen würde, ins Exil. Spiele Exhumieren wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Necron\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581034&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c4314df-1217-4b49-b657-764e3793e0a5\', \'multiverseId\': 581034}, \'multiverseid\': 581034}, {\'name\': \'Guardia Real\', \'text\': \'Comandante de falange — Cuando el Guardia Real entre al campo de batalla, crea dos fichas de criatura artefacto Guerrero Necrón negras 2/2 giradas.\\nDesenterrar {3}{B}. ({3}{B}: Regresa esta carta de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Gana la habilidad de prisa. Exíliala al comienzo del próximo paso final o si fuera a dejar el campo de batalla. Activa la habilidad de desenterrar solo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Necrón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'401f6a4f-9ba8-4a4b-b290-f12ef057b5e7\', \'multiverseId\': 581194}, \'multiverseid\': 581194}, {\'name\': \'Garde royal\', \'text\': "Commandant de phalanges — Quand le Garde royal arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez deux jetons de créature-artefact 2/2 noire Nécron et Guerrier engagés.\\nExhumation {3}{B} ({3}{B} : Renvoyez cette carte sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière. Elle acquiert la célérité. Exilez-la au début de la prochaine étape de fin ou si elle devait quitter le champ de bataille. N\'exhumez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : nécron\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581354&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d981c052-eb2a-4ec7-bca1-29dab2386074\', \'multiverseId\': 581354}, \'multiverseid\': 581354}, {\'name\': \'Guardiano Reale\', \'text\': "Comandante della Falange — Quando il Guardiano Reale entra nel campo di battaglia, crea due pedine creatura artefatto Guerriero Necron 2/2 nere TAPpate.\\nDissotterrare {3}{B} ({3}{B}: Rimetti sul campo di battaglia questa carta dal tuo cimitero. Ha rapidità. Esiliala all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale o se sta per lasciare il campo di battaglia. Dissotterra solo come una stregoneria.)", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Necron\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d58971b2-f7db-4e13-aeaa-d8cb5c29131a\', \'multiverseId\': 581514}, \'multiverseid\': 581514}, {\'name\': \'ロイヤルワーデン\', \'text\': \'ファランクス・コマンダー — ロイヤルワーデンが戦場に出たとき、黒の２/２のネクロン・戦士・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン２体をタップ状態で生成する。\\n蘇生{3}{B}（{3}{B}：あなたの墓地にあるこのカードを戦場に戻す。これは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、またはこれが戦場を離れるなら、これを追放する。蘇生はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ネクロン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581674&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cadd8f50-2c03-4554-906f-68dd797c87b6\', \'multiverseId\': 581674}, \'multiverseid\': 581674}, {\'name\': \'Protetor Real\', \'text\': \'Comandante de Falange — Quando Protetor Real entrar no campo de batalha, crie duas fichas de criatura artefato Necron Guerreiro preta 2/2 viradas.\\nDesenterrar {3}{B} ({3}{B}: Devolva este card de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha. Ele ganha ímpeto. Exile-o no início da próxima etapa final ou se ele for deixar o campo de batalha. Use desenterrar somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Necron\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581834&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5617b976-3658-4b8d-9587-3b60d93d054a\', \'multiverseId\': 581834}, \'multiverseid\': 581834}, {\'name\': \'皇家主管\', \'text\': \'山阵指挥官～当皇家主管进战场时，派出两个已横置的2/2黑色太空死灵／战士衍生神器生物。\\n破坟{3}{B}（{3}{B}：将此牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。它获得敏捷异能。在下一个结束步骤开始时，或若它将离开战场，将它放逐。只能于法术时机破坟。）\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～太空死灵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582154&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1798017-ac35-4e67-aa4f-df9938123c4d\', \'multiverseId\': 582154}, \'multiverseid\': 582154}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lasst die Galaxis brennen\', \'text\': \'Kaskade (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, schicke Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis du eine Nichtland-Karte ins Exil schickst, die weniger kostet. Du kannst sie wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Lege die so ins Exil geschickten Karten in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.)\\nLasst die Galaxis brennen fügt jeder Kreatur, die nicht in diesem Zug ins Spiel gekommen ist, X plus 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581063&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7d0ff0c-3f0c-4187-a7e3-70ad6df336f1\', \'multiverseId\': 581063}, \'multiverseid\': 581063}, {\'name\': \'Que arda la galaxia\', \'text\': \'Cascada. (Cuando lances este hechizo, exilia cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca hasta que exilies una carta que no sea tierra y que cueste menos. Puedes lanzarla sin pagar su coste de maná. Pon las cartas exiliadas en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.)\\nQue arda la galaxia hace X más 2 puntos de daño a cada criatura que no entró al campo de batalla este turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581223&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'894fea35-f293-4fbd-9e38-6ebe6e7671cf\', \'multiverseId\': 581223}, \'multiverseid\': 581223}, {\'name\': \'Que brûle la galaxie\', \'text\': "Cascade (Quand vous lancez ce sort, exilez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous exiliez une carte non-terrain d\'un coût inférieur. Vous pouvez la lancer sans payer son coût de mana. Mettez les cartes exilées au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.)\\nQue brûle la galaxie inflige X plus 2 blessures à chaque créature qui n\'est pas arrivée sur le champ de bataille ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581383&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c0bcac3-446c-4637-9da5-4a51516b41aa\', \'multiverseId\': 581383}, \'multiverseid\': 581383}, {\'name\': \'Date Fuoco alla Galassia\', \'text\': \'Cascata (Quando lanci questa magia, esilia carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non esili una carta non terra che costa meno. Puoi lanciarla senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Metti le carte esiliate in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.)\\nDate Fuoco alla Galassia infligge X più 2 danni a ogni creatura che non è entrata nel campo di battaglia in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581543&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5d9bdb4-a7bd-4920-bb49-e1b75b409016\', \'multiverseId\': 581543}, \'multiverseid\': 581543}, {\'name\': \'銀河を焔羅のままに\', \'text\': \'続唱（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、コストがこれより低く土地でないカード１枚が追放されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ追放していく。あなたはそれをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。追放したカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。）\\n銀河を焔羅のままにはこのターンに戦場に出たのでない各クリーチャーにそれぞれＸに２を足した点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581703&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e00496f-7e39-4f71-9dff-e32ef9c18a43\', \'multiverseId\': 581703}, \'multiverseid\': 581703}, {\'name\': \'Que A Galáxia Queime\', \'text\': \'Cascata (Quando conjurar esta mágica, exile cards do topo de seu grimório até exilar um não de terreno com custo inferior. Você pode conjurá-lo sem pagar seu custo de mana. Coloque os cards exilados no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.)\\nQue A Galáxia Queime causa dano igual a X mais 2 a cada criatura que não entrou no campo de batalha neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581863&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a390496a-9800-40f7-835c-c2f5a0e57a82\', \'multiverseId\': 581863}, \'multiverseid\': 581863}, {\'name\': \'焚灭银河\', \'text\': \'倾曳（当你施放此咒语时，从你的牌库顶开始放逐牌，直到放逐一张费用比此咒语低的非地牌为止。你可以施放该牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。将所放逐的牌以随机顺序置于你牌库底。）\\n焚灭银河对每个并非于本回合进战场的生物各造成X加2点伤害。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'509aa805-2a8a-44f4-80d8-9a8662e9ef49\', \'multiverseId\': 582183}, \'multiverseid\': 582183}]', '[{\'name\': \'Liktor\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nPheromonspur — Wenn der Liktor ins Spiel kommt und falls eine Kreatur in diesem Zug unter der Kontrolle eines Gegners ins Spiel gekommen ist, erzeuge einen 3/3 grünen Tyranide-Krieger-Kreaturenspielstein, der Trampelschaden verursacht.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Tyranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581076&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1062467-5aa5-4871-9b05-b6b7428a7252\', \'multiverseId\': 581076}, \'multiverseid\': 581076}, {\'name\': \'Líctor\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nRastro de feromonas — Cuando el Líctor entre al campo de batalla, si una criatura entró al campo de batalla bajo el control de un oponente este turno, crea una ficha de criatura Guerrero Tiránido verde 3/3 con la habilidad de arrollar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiránido\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581236&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'194bb9f7-bccd-48e2-9c6c-da18df8423db\', \'multiverseId\': 581236}, \'multiverseid\': 581236}, {\'name\': \'Lictor\', \'text\': "Flash\\nTraînée de phéromones — Quand le Lictor arrive sur le champ de bataille, si une créature est arrivée sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle d\'un adversaire ce tour-ci, créez un jeton de créature 3/3 verte Tyranide et Guerrier avec le piétinement.", \'type\': \'Créature : tyranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581396&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e74355a-c33a-4305-a341-3fc42f7e4a0b\', \'multiverseId\': 581396}, \'multiverseid\': 581396}, {\'name\': \'Littore\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nTraccia Feromonica — Quando il Littore entra nel campo di battaglia, se una creatura è entrata nel campo di battaglia sotto il controllo di un avversario in questo turno, crea una pedina creatura Guerriero Tiranide 3/3 verde con travolgere.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Tiranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581556&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9367cf49-f71a-4e5d-b568-4590bb758556\', \'multiverseId\': 581556}, \'multiverseid\': 581556}, {\'name\': \'リクター\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\nフェロモンの道標 — リクターが戦場に出たとき、このターンにクリーチャーが対戦相手のコントロール下で戦場に出たことがある場合、トランプルを持つ緑の３/３のティラニッド・戦士・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ティラニッド\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581716&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'024e4910-6b4f-47ec-a466-edd9c49aa30c\', \'multiverseId\': 581716}, \'multiverseid\': 581716}, {\'name\': \'Lictor\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nRastro de Feromônios — Quando Lictor entrar no campo de batalha, se uma criatura tiver entrado no campo de batalha sob o controle de um oponente neste turno, crie uma ficha de criatura Tiranídeo Guerreiro verde 3/3 com atropelar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiranídeo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581876&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e45a298-3f17-434a-a7a1-b45cbd942500\', \'multiverseId\': 581876}, \'multiverseid\': 581876}, {\'name\': \'刀斧虫\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n信息素追踪～当刀斧虫进战场时，若本回合中有生物在对手的操控下进战场，则派出一个3/3绿色，具践踏异能的泰伦虫族／战士衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～泰伦虫族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582196&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ad4b2a9-cb2b-49ac-955f-3e493dd7aaaf\', \'multiverseId\': 582196}, \'multiverseid\': 582196}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lucius der Ewige\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nRüstung der kreischenden Seelen — Wenn Lucius der Ewige stirbt, schicke ihn ins Exil und bestimme eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert. Wenn jene Kreatur das Spiel verlässt, bringe Lucius unter der Kontrolle seines Besitzers aus dem Exil ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Astartes, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581112&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b063fa33-49dd-47a3-b6d0-4c08441f1f8c\', \'multiverseId\': 581112}, \'multiverseid\': 581112}, {\'name\': \'Lucius, el Eterno\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nArmadura de las almas aullantes — Cuando Lucius, el Eterno muera, exílialo y elige una criatura objetivo que controla un oponente. Cuando esa criatura deje el campo de batalla, regresa a Lucius, el Eterno del exilio al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Guerrero astartes\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e22540ba-ce48-4f83-94ce-6554f2da77c8\', \'multiverseId\': 581272}, \'multiverseid\': 581272}, {\'name\': "Lucius l\'Éternel", \'text\': "Célérité\\nArmure des Âmes Hurlantes — Quand Lucius l\'Éternel meurt, exilez-le et choisissez une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle. Quand cette créature quitte le champ de bataille, renvoyez, sous le contrôle de son propriétaire, Lucius l\'Éternel depuis l\'exil sur le champ de bataille.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : astartes et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581432&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d887595-f41b-49ea-8ca5-a76275acbe33\', \'multiverseId\': 581432}, \'multiverseid\': 581432}, {\'name\': "Lucius l\'Eterno", \'text\': "Rapidità\\nArmatura delle Anime Urlanti — Quando Lucius l\'Eterno muore, esilialo e scegli una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario. Quando quella creatura lascia il campo di battaglia, rimetti Lucius l\'Eterno dall\'esilio sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Guerriero Astartes\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581592&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c10200d-17f2-4da0-b19c-55de32dd59d6\', \'multiverseId\': 581592}, \'multiverseid\': 581592}, {\'name\': \'永劫なるルシウス\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n叫魂の鎧 — 永劫なるルシウスが死亡したとき、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これを追放する。そのクリーチャーが戦場を離れたとき、追放領域にある永劫なるルシウスをオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — アスタルテス・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581752&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b87171aa-2fb2-4aca-ad32-02b9150bbd62\', \'multiverseId\': 581752}, \'multiverseid\': 581752}, {\'name\': \'Lucius, o Eterno\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto\\nArmadura de Almas Ululantes — Quando Lucius, o Eterno, morrer, exile-o e escolha uma criatura alvo que um oponente controla. Quando aquela criatura deixar o campo de batalha, devolva Lucius, o Eterno, do exílio ao campo de batalha sob o controle de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Astartes Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581912&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7d54afd-90f1-4981-a09d-e2274ba6337e\', \'multiverseId\': 581912}, \'multiverseid\': 581912}, {\'name\': \'不朽者卢修斯\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n哀号之魂盔甲～当不朽者卢修斯死去时，将它放逐并选择目标由对手操控的生物。当该生物离开战场时，将不朽者卢修斯在其拥有者的操控下从放逐区移回战场。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～阿斯塔特／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582232&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd42ae7e-1bd9-41dc-b032-b21da1fc2bf9\', \'multiverseId\': 582232}, \'multiverseid\': 582232}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lychgardist\', \'text\': \'Wächterprotokolle — {3}{B}, opfere den Lychgardisten: Bringe alle legendären Kreaturenkarten aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Necron\', \'flavor\': \'„Nur die Todlosen können die Bürde der unerschütterlichen Loyalität wirklich begreifen."\\n—Vargard Obyron aus der Sautekh-Dynastie\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581021&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00d21809-08d8-4c6e-baf3-dd296d95925c\', \'multiverseId\': 581021}, \'multiverseid\': 581021}, {\'name\': \'Necroguardia\', \'text\': \'Protocolos guardianes — {3}{B}, sacrificar el Necroguardia: Regresa todas las cartas de criatura legendaria de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Necrón\', \'flavor\': \'"Solo los inmortales comprenden de verdad el peso de la lealtad inquebrantable".\\n—Vargard Obyron de la Dinastía Sautekh\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d09f3e62-7be9-4d79-8d2b-d6efce0c0192\', \'multiverseId\': 581181}, \'multiverseid\': 581181}, {\'name\': \'Factionnaire\', \'text\': "Protocoles d\'escorte — {3}{B}, sacrifiez le Factionnaire : Renvoyez toutes les cartes de créature légendaire dans votre main depuis votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : nécron\', \'flavor\': "« Seul l\'éternel peut appréhender le fardeau d\'une loyauté inébranlable. »\\n—Vargarde Obyron de la Dynastie Sautekh", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581341&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e15650e-a70d-448b-a6a2-c7394eb47682\', \'multiverseId\': 581341}, \'multiverseid\': 581341}, {\'name\': \'Necroguardia\', \'text\': \'Protocolli Guardiani — {3}{B}, Sacrifica la Necroguardia: Riprendi in mano tutte le carte creatura leggendaria dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Necron\', \'flavor\': \'"Solo gli immortali possono comprendere a fondo il fardello di una fedeltà incrollabile."\\n—Vargard Obyron della Dinastia Sautekh\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581501&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'001f6270-cdaf-4695-babb-12bd3c51a00c\', \'multiverseId\': 581501}, \'multiverseid\': 581501}, {\'name\': \'リッチーガード\', \'text\': \'ガーディアン・プロトコル — {3}{B},リッチーガードを生け贄に捧げる：あなたの墓地にあるすべての伝説のクリーチャー・カードをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ネクロン\', \'flavor\': \'「揺らぎない忠誠心の重荷を真に理解できるのは不朽の者のみである。」\\n――ソーテク王朝のヴァルガード・オビロン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a3a9d7c-b3cd-43fb-b189-6621bc2f12b8\', \'multiverseId\': 581661}, \'multiverseid\': 581661}, {\'name\': \'Guardalych\', \'text\': \'Protocolos do Guardião — {3}{B}, sacrifique Guardalych: Devolva todos os cards de criatura lendária de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Necron\', \'flavor\': \'"Só os incapazes de morrer podem compreender verdadeiramente o fardo da lealdade infalível."\\n— Vargard Obyron, da Dinastia Sautekh\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581821&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af90445a-6cdd-4a4e-b26b-4ee12644002b\', \'multiverseId\': 581821}, \'multiverseid\': 581821}, {\'name\': \'巫妖卫士\', \'text\': \'守护程序～{3}{B}，牺牲巫妖卫士：将所有传奇生物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～太空死灵\', \'flavor\': \'「只有不会死的东西才能真正理解『忠贞不渝』有多沉重。」\\n～索泰克王朝的禁卫奥比隆\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582141&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c19b440-7d4a-46d5-a51e-884e659f1e62\', \'multiverseId\': 582141}, \'multiverseid\': 582141}]', '[{\'name\': \'Magnus der Rote\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nÜbernatürliche Macht — Spontanzauber und Hexereien, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken für jeden Kreaturenspielstein, den du kontrollierst, {1} weniger.\\nKlinge des Magnus — Immer wenn Magnus der Rote einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, erzeuge einen 3/3 roten Ausgeburt-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Dämon, Primarch\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581113&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94c239d5-8061-4ead-9da4-5fc2409af331\', \'multiverseId\': 581113}, \'multiverseid\': 581113}, {\'name\': \'Magnus, el Rojo\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nPoder ultraterreno — Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar los hechizos de instantáneo y de conjuro por cada ficha de criatura que controlas.\\nFilo de Magnus — Siempre que Magnus, el Rojo haga daño de combate a un jugador, crea una ficha de criatura Engendro roja 3/3.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Primarca demonio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c27e1615-b1ad-442e-b8e9-4e83221a0785\', \'multiverseId\': 581273}, \'multiverseid\': 581273}, {\'name\': \'Magnus le Rouge\', \'text\': "Vol\\nPuissance surnaturelle — Les sorts d\'éphémère et de rituel que vous lancez coûtent {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque jeton de créature que vous contrôlez.\\nLame de Magnus — À chaque fois que Magnus le Rouge inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, créez un jeton de créature 3/3 rouge Engeance.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : démon et primarque\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581433&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be4a2810-f7f7-4681-8094-c62d335aeb8d\', \'multiverseId\': 581433}, \'multiverseid\': 581433}, {\'name\': \'Magnus il Rosso\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nPotere Ultraterreno — Le magie istantaneo e stregoneria che lanci costano {1} in meno per essere lanciate per ogni pedina creatura che controlli.\\nLama di Magnus — Ogniqualvolta Magnus il Rosso infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, crei una pedina creatura Progenie 3/3 rossa.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Primarca Demone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5ac3686-d01d-4f9c-9ecc-fc0582deada6\', \'multiverseId\': 581593}, \'multiverseid\': 581593}, {\'name\': \'赤きマグヌス\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nこの世ならざる力 — あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるためのコストは、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー・トークン１体につき{1}少なくなる。\\nマグヌスの刃 — 赤きマグヌスがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、赤の３/３の落とし子・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — デーモン・ホラー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581753&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bef1f2f-0583-4b36-a28f-a6096804a9c4\', \'multiverseId\': 581753}, \'multiverseid\': 581753}, {\'name\': \'Magnus, o Vermelho\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nPoder Sobrenatural — As mágicas instantâneas e os feitiços que você conjura custam {1} a menos para serem conjurados para cada ficha de criatura que você controla.\\nLâmina de Magnus — Toda vez que Magnus, o Vermelho, causar dano de combate a um jogador, crie uma ficha de criatura Prole vermelha 3/3.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Demônio Primarca\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581913&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc244645-b4ea-4e33-88f5-81ec8f6bc117\', \'multiverseId\': 581913}, \'multiverseid\': 581913}, {\'name\': \'红魔马格努斯\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n异界之力～你每操控一个衍生生物，你施放的瞬间与法术咒语便减少{1}来施放。\\n马格努斯之刃～每当红魔马格努斯对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，派出一个3/3红色后裔衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～恶魔／原体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582233&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'392b2289-3276-4b23-be5f-11c1bb24fc15\', \'multiverseId\': 582233}, \'multiverseid\': 582233}]', '[{\'name\': \'Malanthroph\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nDie Toten plündern — Wenn der Malanthroph ins Spiel kommt, schicke den Friedhof eines Spielers deiner Wahl ins Exil. Lege für jede auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickte Kreaturenkarte eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Malanthrophen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Tyranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581114&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c686ff46-37ce-4a34-ace9-953b5b93cc9b\', \'multiverseId\': 581114}, \'multiverseid\': 581114}, {\'name\': \'Malanthrope\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nRebuscar entre los cadáveres — Cuando el Malanthrope entre al campo de batalla, exilia el cementerio del jugador objetivo. Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Malanthrope por cada carta de criatura exiliada de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiránido\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581274&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0078887-6226-4b70-bb68-6bc9caedd260\', \'multiverseId\': 581274}, \'multiverseid\': 581274}, {\'name\': \'Malanthrope\', \'text\': "Vol\\nRecyclage des morts — Quand le Malanthrope arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez le cimetière d\'un joueur ciblé. Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Malanthrope pour chaque carte de créature exilée de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Créature : tyranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581434&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff6b96e7-9acc-47b6-b53e-9e2f7a51f572\', \'multiverseId\': 581434}, \'multiverseid\': 581434}, {\'name\': \'Malanthrope\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nSfruttare i Morti — Quando il Malanthrope entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia il cimitero di un giocatore bersaglio. Metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Malanthrope per ogni carta creatura esiliata in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Tiranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28ac481c-8719-42dc-8496-b33edfc81383\', \'multiverseId\': 581594}, \'multiverseid\': 581594}, {\'name\': \'マランスロープ\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n屍肉漁り — マランスロープが戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーの墓地を追放する。マランスロープの上に、これにより追放されたクリーチャー・カード１枚についき１個の＋１/＋１カウンターを置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ティラニッド\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581754&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff8eba26-bd78-4bbc-b763-7920a853e9d1\', \'multiverseId\': 581754}, \'multiverseid\': 581754}, {\'name\': \'Malanthrope\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nSaquear os Mortos — Quando Malanthrope entrar no campo de batalha, exile o cemitério do jogador alvo. Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Malanthrope para cada card de criatura exilado dessa forma.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiranídeo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581914&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6242c7b3-f84b-4db9-9a84-abf7421bf9a2\', \'multiverseId\': 581914}, \'multiverseid\': 581914}, {\'name\': \'马兰脑虫\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n饱食亡者～当马兰脑虫进战场时，放逐目标牌手的坟墓场。每以此法放逐一张生物牌，便在马兰脑虫上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～泰伦虫族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d79bb08e-fdee-4577-867f-6972c7a41188\', \'multiverseId\': 582234}, \'multiverseid\': 582234}]', '[{\'name\': \'Morgon\', \'text\': \'Unersättlich (Diese Kreatur kommt mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel. Falls X gleich 5 oder mehr ist, ziehe eine Karte, wenn sie ins Spiel kommt.)\\nTerror aus der Tiefe — Wenn der Morgon ins Spiel kommt, kämpft er gegen bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert. Falls die Kreatur in diesem Zug sterben würde, schicke sie stattdessen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Tyranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581115&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6ced20b-7a2c-49bd-b8fe-372d0124aa9d\', \'multiverseId\': 581115}, \'multiverseid\': 581115}, {\'name\': \'Mawloc\', \'text\': \'Voracidad. (Esta criatura entra al campo de batalla con X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella. Si X es 5 o más, roba una carta cuando entre.)\\nTerror de las profundidades — Cuando el Mawloc entre al campo de batalla, lucha contra hasta una criatura objetivo que controla un oponente. Si esa criatura fuera a morir este turno, en vez de eso, exíliala.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiránido\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b68b3d78-82f6-4817-8729-5551c0608053\', \'multiverseId\': 581275}, \'multiverseid\': 581275}, {\'name\': \'Mawloc\', \'text\': "Voracité (Cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle. Si X est supérieur ou égal à 5, piochez une carte quand elle arrive sur le champ de bataille.)\\nTerreur des profondeurs — Quand le Mawloc arrive sur le champ de bataille, il se bat contre jusqu\'à une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle. Si cette créature devait mourir ce tour-ci, exilez-la à la place.", \'type\': \'Créature : tyranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581435&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9739d75-1d1d-477a-a752-df14718a3c2d\', \'multiverseId\': 581435}, \'multiverseid\': 581435}, {\'name\': \'Mawloc\', \'text\': \'Famelico (Questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia con X segnalini +1/+1. Se X è pari o superiore a 5, pesca una carta quando entra.)\\nTerrore dal Profondo — Quando il Mawloc entra nel campo di battaglia, lotta con fino a una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario. Se quella creatura sta per morire in questo turno, invece esiliala.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Tiranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a21c346-407a-438a-93f2-30538517077e\', \'multiverseId\': 581595}, \'multiverseid\': 581595}, {\'name\': \'モウロック\', \'text\': \'貪欲（このクリーチャーは＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。Ｘが５以上であるなら、これが戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引く。）\\n深遠からの恐怖 — モウロックが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。これはそれと格闘を行う。このターンにそのクリーチャーが死亡するなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ティラニッド\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581755&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c29310d-43ef-48c5-8547-56cd1c4d8d11\', \'multiverseId\': 581755}, \'multiverseid\': 581755}, {\'name\': \'Mawloc\', \'text\': \'Voraz (Esta criatura entra no campo de batalha com X marcadores +1/+1. Se X for igual ou superior a 5, compre um card quando ela entrar.)\\nTerror das Profundezas — Quando Mawloc entra no campo de batalha, ele luta com até uma criatura alvo que um oponente controla. Se aquela criatura for morrer neste turno, em vez disso, exile-a.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiranídeo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581915&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'891e9baf-8783-4a42-8b99-2b6ffd32c259\', \'multiverseId\': 581915}, \'multiverseid\': 581915}, {\'name\': \'沙蟒\', \'text\': \'贪食（此生物进战场时上面有X个+1/+1指示物。如果X等于或大于5，则当它进战场时抓一张牌。）\\n地底恐惧～当沙蟒进战场时，它与至多一个目标由对手操控的生物互斗。如果本回合中该生物将死去，则改为将它放逐。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～泰伦虫族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d67435d-acdb-42f0-a54f-44eb43dd70e0\', \'multiverseId\': 582235}, \'multiverseid\': 582235}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mortarion, Dämonenprimarch\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nPrimarch der Death Guard — Zu Beginn deines Endsegments kannst du {X} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, erzeuge X 2/2 schwarze Astartes-Krieger-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Bedrohlichkeit. X kann nicht größer sein als die Anzahl an Lebenspunkten, die du in diesem Zug verloren hast.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Dämon, Primarch\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581023&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8be4e4c-6288-429a-8bf2-41473d9049b7\', \'multiverseId\': 581023}, \'multiverseid\': 581023}, {\'name\': \'Mortarion, Primarca daemon\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nPrimarca de la Guardia de la Muerte — Al comienzo de tu paso final, puedes pagar {X}. Si lo haces, crea X fichas de criatura Guerrero Astartes negras 2/2 con la habilidad de amenaza. X no puede ser mayor que la cantidad de vidas que perdiste este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Primarca demonio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05514b9b-f790-4d38-b658-78178e57eb2f\', \'multiverseId\': 581183}, \'multiverseid\': 581183}, {\'name\': \'Mortarion, Primarque démon\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nPrimarque de la Death Guard — Au début de votre étape de fin, vous pouvez payer {X}. Si vous faites ainsi, créez X jetons de créature 2/2 noire Astartes et Guerrier avec la menace. X ne peut pas être supérieur au nombre de points de vie que vous avez perdus ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : démon et primarque\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581343&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eab384b6-a818-434d-a225-1984c3d41a68\', \'multiverseId\': 581343}, \'multiverseid\': 581343}, {\'name\': \'Mortarion, Primarca Demoniaco\', \'text\': "Volare\\nPrimarca della Death Guard — All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, puoi pagare {X}. Se lo fai, crea X pedine creatura Guerriero Astartes 2/2 nere con minacciare. X non può essere maggiore dei punti vita che hai perso in questo turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Primarca Demone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581503&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17bdd3c2-a864-4874-a72d-bc73331da859\', \'multiverseId\': 581503}, \'multiverseid\': 581503}, {\'name\': \'総魔長、モータリオン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nデスガードの総主長 — あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたは{X}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、威迫を持つ黒の２/２のアスタルテス・戦士・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体を生成する。Ｘはこのターンにあなたが失ったライフの点数以下でなければならない。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — デーモン・総主長\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40d2b1a4-d070-4c25-b5d1-d29dd431aab0\', \'multiverseId\': 581663}, \'multiverseid\': 581663}, {\'name\': \'Mortarion, Primarca Daemônio\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nPrimarca da Guarda da Morte — No início de sua etapa final, você pode pagar {X}. Se fizer isso, crie X fichas de criatura Astartes Guerreiro preta 2/2 com ameaçar. X não pode ser maior que a quantidade de pontos de vida que você perdeu neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Demônio Primarca\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581823&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9dcd8a62-46d3-40e6-baaf-aca4d49a3170\', \'multiverseId\': 581823}, \'multiverseid\': 581823}, {\'name\': \'恶魔原体莫塔里安\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n死亡守卫原体～在你的结束步骤开始时，你可以支付{X}。若你如此作，则派出X个2/2黑色，具威慑异能的阿斯塔特／战士衍生生物。X不能大于你本回合中失去过的生命数量。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～恶魔／原体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582143&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2cadebe-007f-4efd-a01e-253908e78f15\', \'multiverseId\': 582143}, \'multiverseid\': 582143}]', "[{'name': 'Mutalith-Vortexbestie', 'text': 'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nWarpstrudel — Wenn die Mutalith-Vortexbestie ins Spiel kommt, wirf für jeden deiner Gegner eine Münze. Für jeden gewonnenen Münzwurf ziehst du eine Karte. Für jeden verlorenen Münzwurf fügt die Mutalith-Vortexbestie jenem Spieler 3 Schadenspunkte zu.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mutant, Bestie', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581116&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0f94ebe1-004f-4d20-bcc1-5f8f2130b678', 'multiverseId': 581116}, 'multiverseid': 581116}, {'name': 'Bestia de Vórtice Mutalith', 'text': 'Arrolla.\\nVórtice disforme — Cuando la Bestia de Vórtice Mutalith entre al campo de batalla, lanza una moneda a cara o cruz por cada oponente que tengas. Por cada lanzamiento que ganes, roba una carta. Por cada lanzamiento que pierdas, la Bestia de Vórtice Mutalith hace 3 puntos de daño a ese jugador.', 'type': 'Criatura — Bestia mutante', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581276&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8625e8cf-3db1-4628-9478-a9a18d357495', 'multiverseId': 581276}, 'multiverseid': 581276}, {'name': 'Bête de vortex Mutalith', 'text': 'Piétinement\\nVortex warp — Quand la Bête de vortex Mutalith arrive sur le champ de bataille, jouez à pile ou face pour chaque adversaire que vous avez. Pour chaque fois où vous gagnez, piochez une carte. Pour chaque fois où vous perdez, la Bête de vortex Mutalith inflige 3 blessures à ce joueur.', 'type': 'Créature : mutant et bête', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581436&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '787eb8da-307a-4e03-9491-1dc0410c9eea', 'multiverseId': 581436}, 'multiverseid': 581436}, {'name': 'Bestia del Cambiamento Mutalith', 'text': 'Travolgere\\nVortice Warp — Quando la Bestia del Cambiamento Mutalith entra nel campo di battaglia, lancia una moneta per ogni avversario che hai. Per ogni lancio che vinci, pesca una carta. Per ogni lancio che perdi, la Bestia del Cambiamento Mutalith infligge 3 danni a quel giocatore.', 'type': 'Creatura — Bestia Mutante', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581596&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '07eb397f-69c8-4cb5-b9d7-68f2cf815d10', 'multiverseId': 581596}, 'multiverseid': 581596}, {'name': 'ミュータリス・ヴォーテックスビースト', 'text': 'トランプル\\n歪みの渦 — ミュータリス・ヴォーテックスビーストが戦場に出たとき、各対戦相手につきそれぞれ、１回コイン投げをする。このコイン投げであなたが勝ったなら、あなたはカード１枚を引く。このコイン投げであなたが負けたなら、ミュータリス・ヴォーテックスビーストはそのプレイヤーに３点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ミュータント・ビースト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581756&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aa92fa24-2cd6-4b95-b17d-099e88ec7390', 'multiverseId': 581756}, 'multiverseid': 581756}, {'name': 'Fera do Vórtice Mutalith', 'text': 'Atropelar\\nVórtice da Distorção — Quando Fera do Vórtice Mutalith entrar no campo de batalha, lance uma moeda para cada oponente que você tem. Cada vez que você vencer, compre um card. Cada vez que você perder, Fera do Vórtice Mutalith causará 3 pontos de dano àquele jogador.', 'type': 'Criatura — Mutante Besta', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581916&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f1567224-f975-46e7-9a06-ffde557e1402', 'multiverseId': 581916}, 'multiverseid': 581916}, {'name': '异变漩涡兽', 'text': '践踏\\n亚空间漩涡～当异变漩涡兽进战场时，你每有一位对手，便掷一枚硬币。你每猜对一掷，便抓一张牌。你每猜错一掷，异变漩涡兽便对该牌手造成3点伤害。', 'type': '生物 ～突变体／野兽', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582236&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ea28e2f7-fd7a-4661-9600-0735997ecf49', 'multiverseId': 582236}, 'multiverseid': 582236}]", '[{\'name\': \'Nachtsichel\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nInvasions-Teleporter — Wenn die Nachtsichel ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 2/2 schwarzen Necron-Krieger-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.\\nBemannen 2 (Tappe eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst und die zusammen Stärke 2 oder mehr haben: Dieses Fahrzeug wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer Artefaktkreatur.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Fahrzeug\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581144&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a2f15bf-63af-4fea-8030-bed01d6fa3a8\', \'multiverseId\': 581144}, \'multiverseid\': 581144}, {\'name\': \'Guadaña de la Noche\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nHaces de invasión — Cuando la Guadaña de la Noche entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Guerrero Necrón negra 2/2.\\nTripular 2. (Girar cualquier cantidad de criaturas que controlas con una fuerza total de 2 o más: Este Vehículo se convierte en una criatura artefacto hasta el final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Vehículo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581304&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f908411a-858e-470b-8cd1-e6bb04aef613\', \'multiverseId\': 581304}, \'multiverseid\': 581304}, {\'name\': \'Moissonneur\', \'text\': "Vol\\nFaisceaux d\'invasion — Quand le Moissonneur arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 2/2 noire Nécron et Guerrier.\\nPilotage 2 (Engagez n\'importe quel nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez dont la force totale est supérieure ou égale à 2 : Ce véhicule devient une créature-artefact jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : véhicule\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581464&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa624ce8-fc7e-44d7-959f-d22b1875ad59\', \'multiverseId\': 581464}, \'multiverseid\': 581464}, {\'name\': \'Falce della Notte\', \'text\': "Volare\\nRaggi d\'Invasione — Quando la Falce della Notte entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Guerriero Necron 2/2 nera.\\nManovrare 2 (TAPpa un qualsiasi numero di creature che controlli con forza totale pari o superiore a 2: Questo Veicolo diventa una creatura artefatto fino alla fine del turno.)", \'type\': \'Artefatto — Veicolo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e6d5df2-45ad-4577-bfe4-5e14164df249\', \'multiverseId\': 581624}, \'multiverseid\': 581624}, {\'name\': \'ナイトサイズ\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nインヴェイジョン・ビーム — ナイトサイズが戦場に出たとき、黒の２/２のネクロン・戦士・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n搭乗２（あなたがコントロールしている望む数のクリーチャーを、パワーの合計が２以上になるように選んでタップする：ターン終了時まで、この機体はアーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 機体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581784&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84512288-3614-4ab5-aa2c-eddd618345ce\', \'multiverseId\': 581784}, \'multiverseid\': 581784}, {\'name\': \'Foice Noturna\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nFeixes de Invasão — Quando Foice Noturna entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de criatura artefato Necron Guerreiro preta 2/2.\\nTripular 2 (Vire qualquer número de criaturas que você controla com total de poder igual ou superior a 2: Este Veículo torna-se uma criatura artefato até o final do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Veículo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581944&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fee36394-7da3-46ce-9ae4-c416c8624f8c\', \'multiverseId\': 581944}, \'multiverseid\': 581944}, {\'name\': \'暗夜之镰\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n入侵光束～当暗夜之镰进战场时，派出一个2/2黑色太空死灵／战士衍生神器生物。\\n搭载2（横置任意数量由你操控且力量总和等于或大于2的生物：此载具成为神器生物直到回合结束。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～载具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c7d3efc-6f77-48d2-a688-611ca22846b8\', \'multiverseId\': 582264}, \'multiverseid\': 582264}]', '[{\'name\': \'Necron-Hochlord\', \'text\': \'Unerbittlicher Marsch — {X}, {T}, tappe X ungetappte Artefakte, die du kontrollierst: Ein Gegner deiner Wahl verliert X Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Necron, Adliger\', \'flavor\': \'„Diese Galaxie beugte einst das Knie vor uns und sie wird es wieder tun."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581025&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ede577eb-261b-4d27-836a-e492d8a8c145\', \'multiverseId\': 581025}, \'multiverseid\': 581025}, {\'name\': \'Señor Supremo Necrón\', \'text\': \'Marcha implacable — {X}, {T}, girar X artefactos enderezados que controlas: El oponente objetivo pierde X vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Noble necrón\', \'flavor\': \'"Antaño, toda esta galaxia se arrodillaba ante nosotros, y lo volverá a hacer".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581185&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9365b359-ec85-4598-b3bb-ff466a7ea95f\', \'multiverseId\': 581185}, \'multiverseid\': 581185}, {\'name\': \'Tétrarque nécron\', \'text\': \'Progression implacable — {X}, {T}, engagez X artefacts dégagés que vous contrôlez : Un adversaire ciblé perd X points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : nécron et noble\', \'flavor\': "« Jadis, cette galaxie s\'est agenouillée devant nous, et elle recommencera. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581345&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f90583d7-72ed-41c4-b838-95abf1f70d4f\', \'multiverseId\': 581345}, \'multiverseid\': 581345}, {\'name\': \'Signore Supremo Necron\', \'text\': \'Marcia Inesorabile — {X}, {T}, TAPpa X artefatti STAPpati che controlli: Un avversario bersaglio perde X punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Nobile Necron\', \'flavor\': \'"Questa galassia si è inginocchiata davanti a noi in passato e lo farà di nuovo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581505&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50fbebe3-426a-4739-b48c-39bfdbb9eceb\', \'multiverseId\': 581505}, \'multiverseid\': 581505}, {\'name\': \'ネクロン・オーヴァーロード\', \'text\': \'無慈悲な行進 — {X},{T},あなたがコントロールしているアンタップ状態のアーティファクトＸ個をタップする：対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはＸ点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ネクロン・貴族\', \'flavor\': \'「この銀河系はかつて我々の元に跪いていた。そしていずれまたそうすることになる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74c7bbd6-7924-403a-87ff-20a3af92ae69\', \'multiverseId\': 581665}, \'multiverseid\': 581665}, {\'name\': \'Soberano Necron\', \'text\': \'Marcha Implacável — {X}, {T}, vire X artefatos desvirados que você controla: O oponente alvo perde X pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Necron Nobre\', \'flavor\': \'"Esta galáxia já se ajoelhou perante nós, e ela o fará novamente."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581825&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df6e5b16-6201-4591-949c-e6388fedfee8\', \'multiverseId\': 581825}, \'multiverseid\': 581825}, {\'name\': \'太空死灵霸主\', \'text\': \'无情行军～{X}，{T}，横置X个由你操控且未横置的神器：目标对手失去X点生命。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～太空死灵／贵族\', \'flavor\': \'「这片银河曾经臣服于我们，历史必将重演。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582145&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e10314b-8674-48b9-a8b0-86eee44548af\', \'multiverseId\': 582145}, \'multiverseid\': 582145}]', '[{\'name\': \'Necron-Monolith\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Unzerstörbar\\nTor der Ewigkeit — Immer wenn der Necron-Monolith angreift, millst du drei Karten. Erzeuge für jede auf diese Weise gemillte Kreaturenkarte einen 2/2 schwarzen Necron-Krieger-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.\\nBemannen 4 (Tappe eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst und die zusammen Stärke 4 oder mehr haben: Dieses Fahrzeug wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer Artefaktkreatur.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Fahrzeug\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581143&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e5b94e5-1e1e-4636-8296-73700eef2ff4\', \'multiverseId\': 581143}, \'multiverseid\': 581143}, {\'name\': \'Monolito Necrón\', \'text\': \'Vuela, indestructible.\\nPuerta de la eternidad — Siempre que el Monolito Necrón ataque, muele tres cartas. Por cada carta de criatura molida de esta manera, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Guerrero Necrón negra 2/2.\\nTripular 4. (Girar cualquier cantidad de criaturas que controlas con una fuerza total de 4 o más: Este Vehículo se convierte en una criatura artefacto hasta el final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Vehículo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581303&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2761fb2a-67f9-4d45-9f6c-3301e7ccbf8c\', \'multiverseId\': 581303}, \'multiverseid\': 581303}, {\'name\': \'Monolithe nécron\', \'text\': "Vol, indestructible\\nPortail d\'Éternité — À chaque fois que le Monolithe nécron attaque, meulez trois cartes. Pour chaque carte de créature meulée de cette manière, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 2/2 noire Nécron et Guerrier.\\nPilotage 4 (Engagez n\'importe quel nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez dont la force totale est supérieure ou égale à 4 : Ce véhicule devient une créature-artefact jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : véhicule\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581463&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c16bc290-3751-4ac4-b2ea-9f4cf77b3f0e\', \'multiverseId\': 581463}, \'multiverseid\': 581463}, {\'name\': \'Monolito Necron\', \'text\': "Volare, indistruttibile\\nPortale dell\'Eternità — Ogniqualvolta il Monolito Necron attacca, macina tre carte. Per ogni carta creatura macinata in questo modo, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Guerriero Necron 2/2 nera.\\nManovrare 4 (TAPpa un qualsiasi numero di creature che controlli con forza totale pari o superiore a 4: Questo Veicolo diventa una creatura artefatto fino alla fine del turno.)", \'type\': \'Artefatto — Veicolo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b53da74c-132f-409a-95ee-dc045633e3fd\', \'multiverseId\': 581623}, \'multiverseid\': 581623}, {\'name\': \'ネクロン・モノリス\', \'text\': \'飛行、破壊不能\\n永久の門 — ネクロン・モノリスが攻撃するたび、カード３枚を切削する。これにより切削されたクリーチャー・カード１枚につき１体の、黒の２/２のネクロン・戦士・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。\\n搭乗４（あなたがコントロールしている望む数のクリーチャーを、パワーの合計が４以上になるように選んでタップする：ターン終了時まで、この機体はアーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 機体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581783&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'506addc9-3851-40ba-ae6c-eb8d6d6030ae\', \'multiverseId\': 581783}, \'multiverseid\': 581783}, {\'name\': \'Monólito Necron\', \'text\': \'Voar, indestrutível\\nPortão da Eternidade — Toda vez que Monólito Necron atacar, triture três cards. Para cada card de criatura triturado dessa forma, crie uma ficha de criatura artefato Necron Guerreiro preta 2/2.\\nTripular 4 (Vire qualquer número de criaturas que você controla com total de poder igual ou superior a 4: Este Veículo torna-se uma criatura artefato até o final do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Veículo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581943&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f08061df-8d5e-4220-9df7-03082de1d62d\', \'multiverseId\': 581943}, \'multiverseid\': 581943}, {\'name\': \'太空死灵巨石堡垒\', \'text\': \'飞行，不灭\\n永恒之门～每当太空死灵巨石堡垒攻击时，磨三张牌。每以此法磨掉一张生物牌，便派出一个2/2黑色太空死灵／战士衍生神器生物。\\n搭载4（横置任意数量由你操控且力量总和等于或大于4的生物：此载具成为神器生物直到回合结束。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～载具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'991e128b-04f3-42dc-aeb8-b5b3b5546a0c\', \'multiverseId\': 582263}, \'multiverseid\': 582263}]', '[{\'name\': \'Necron-Neurojäger\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nSynapsen-Desintegrator — Wenn der Necron-Neurojäger ins Spiel kommt, zerstöre bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl und ein Spieler deiner Wahl millt drei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Necron\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581024&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b0feca5-f3ef-43a3-90c0-d1802df829c7\', \'multiverseId\': 581024}, \'multiverseid\': 581024}, {\'name\': \'Omnicida Necrón\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nDesintegrador sináptico — Cuando el Omnicida Necrón entre al campo de batalla, destruye hasta una criatura objetivo y el jugador objetivo muele tres cartas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Necrón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581184&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a5377ed-fbbf-4189-8d44-0e48700e8f72\', \'multiverseId\': 581184}, \'multiverseid\': 581184}, {\'name\': \'Traqueur nécron\', \'text\': "Flash\\nDésintégrateur synaptique — Quand le Traqueur nécron arrive sur le champ de bataille, détruisez jusqu\'à une créature ciblée et un joueur ciblé meule trois cartes.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : nécron\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581344&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff960ae4-1c15-4869-b5b3-ed8bf316eeb7\', \'multiverseId\': 581344}, \'multiverseid\': 581344}, {\'name\': \'Necrocecchino Necron\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nDisintegratore Sinaptico — Quando il Necrocecchino Necron entra nel campo di battaglia, distruggi fino a una creatura bersaglio e un giocatore bersaglio macina tre carte.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Necron\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581504&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b2fc9a8-2ddb-453a-9b8b-c65d41978c5a\', \'multiverseId\': 581504}, \'multiverseid\': 581504}, {\'name\': \'ネクロン・デスマーク\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\nシナプティック・ディスインテグレイター — ネクロン・デスマークが戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー最大１体とプレイヤー１人を対象とする。その前者を破壊し、その後者はカード３枚を切削する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ネクロン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a226c1f8-7d1f-4a5c-b7df-02da04de52fd\', \'multiverseId\': 581664}, \'multiverseid\': 581664}, {\'name\': \'Necroatirador Necron\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nDesintegrador Sináptico — Quando Necroatirador Necron entrar no campo de batalha, destrua até uma criatura alvo e o jogador alvo tritura três cards.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Necron\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581824&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'160de8e3-2140-4c89-a96c-40d848ea69a2\', \'multiverseId\': 581824}, \'multiverseid\': 581824}, {\'name\': \'太空死灵死印战士\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n突触粉碎枪～当太空死灵死印战士进战场时，消灭至多一个目标生物且目标牌手磨三张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～太空死灵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582144&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32403552-1dd6-4b08-9320-31395d11733b\', \'multiverseId\': 582144}, \'multiverseid\': 582144}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nexos\', \'text\': \'Strategischer Koordinator — Standardländer, die du kontrollierst, haben „{T}: Erzeuge {C}{C}. Gib dieses Mana nur für Kosten aus, die {X} enthalten."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Tyranide, Berater\', \'flavor\': \'Die gesegnete Verbindung von Waffen, Klauen und erbarmungsloser Absicht ist eine Kraft, die man wirklich fürchten muss.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581077&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ed0235e-5df5-413c-b292-9577034f34a7\', \'multiverseId\': 581077}, \'multiverseid\': 581077}, {\'name\': \'Nexos\', \'text\': \'Coordinador estratégico — Las tierras básicas que controlas tienen "{T}: Agrega {C}{C}. Usa este maná solo para costes que contengan {X}".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Consejero tiránido humano\', \'flavor\': \'La unión dichosa de armas, garras y falta de escrúpulos da como resultado una fuerza verdaderamente temible.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'daf16fea-5de0-4b44-9d89-e5bfa4828078\', \'multiverseId\': 581237}, \'multiverseid\': 581237}, {\'name\': \'Nexos\', \'text\': \'Coordinateur stratégique — Les terrains de base que vous contrôlez ont « {T} : Ajoutez {C}{C}. Ne dépensez ce mana que pour des coûts qui contiennent {X}. »\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et tyranide et conseiller\', \'flavor\': "L\'union bénie du blaster, de la griffe et de l\'absence totale de pitié est une force vraiment redoutable.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581397&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9a59011-e8d6-4ac6-a639-d23c35ee2704\', \'multiverseId\': 581397}, \'multiverseid\': 581397}, {\'name\': \'Nexos\', \'text\': \'Coordinatore Strategico — Le terre base che controlli hanno "{T}: Aggiungi {C}{C}. Spendi questo mana solo per costi che contengono {X}".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Consigliere Tiranide Umano\', \'flavor\': "L\'unione benedetta di pistola, artiglio e spietatezza è una forza da temere sul serio.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d8fe73d-ecfd-43b2-843c-76396db93d22\', \'multiverseId\': 581557}, \'multiverseid\': 581557}, {\'name\': \'ネクソス\', \'text\': \'戦略的連携 — あなたがコントロールしているすべての基本土地は「{T}：{C}{C}を加える。このマナは{X}を含むコストにしか支払えない。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ティラニッド・アドバイザー\', \'flavor\': \'銃と鉤爪と無慈悲な殺意の神聖なる団結は真に恐怖すべき暴力である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581717&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3718dcf1-5e28-48cd-9cfe-806c5158ad4a\', \'multiverseId\': 581717}, \'multiverseid\': 581717}, {\'name\': \'Nexos\', \'text\': \'Coordenador Estratégico — Os terrenos básicos que você controla têm "{T}: Adicione {C}{C}. Gaste este mana somente em custos que contenham {X}."\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Tiranídeo Conselheiro\', \'flavor\': \'A abençoada união entre pistola, garra e crueldade é de meter medo realmente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581877&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76fabd85-a9dd-40a2-abd4-1853182e3048\', \'multiverseId\': 581877}, \'multiverseid\': 581877}, {\'name\': \'指挥员\', \'text\': \'策略协调员～由你操控的基本地具有「{T}：加{C}{C}。此法术力只能用来支付包含{X}的费用。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／泰伦虫族／参谋\', \'flavor\': \'枪炮、利爪和无情杀意～这三者得祝福结合后，便化作一股可怖力量。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582197&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0a5af29-965e-4914-8506-706dfd90e96e\', \'multiverseId\': 582197}, \'multiverseid\': 582197}]', "[{'name': 'Neyam Shai Murad', 'text': 'Freihändler — Immer wenn Neyam Shai Murad einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du den Spieler eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl aus seinem Friedhof auf seine Hand zurückbringen lassen. Falls du dies tust, bestimmt jener Spieler eine bleibende Karte in deinem Friedhof und du bringst sie dann unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Räuber', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581117&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '901a7a60-17cf-45ac-82ee-d1f1b373bb59', 'multiverseId': 581117}, 'multiverseid': 581117}, {'name': 'Neyam Shai Murad', 'text': 'Comerciante independiente — Siempre que Neyam Shai Murad haga daño de combate a un jugador, puedes hacer que ese jugador regrese la carta de permanente objetivo de su cementerio a su mano. Si lo haces, ese jugador elige una carta de permanente en tu cementerio y luego la pones en el campo de batalla bajo tu control.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Bribón humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581277&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '21ee9e4d-577a-4585-af75-bba2c99ec614', 'multiverseId': 581277}, 'multiverseid': 581277}, {'name': 'Neyam Shai Murad', 'text': 'Libre-marchand — À chaque fois que Neyam Shai Murad inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, vous pouvez faire que ce joueur renvoie une carte de permanent ciblée depuis son cimetière dans sa main. Si vous faites ainsi, ce joueur choisit une carte de permanent dans votre cimetière, puis vous la mettez sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire : humain et gredin', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581437&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a4f42ae4-b2ec-46f0-8b8c-a07b0d1a5d47', 'multiverseId': 581437}, 'multiverseid': 581437}, {'name': 'Neyam Shai Murad', 'text': 'Mercante Corsaro — Ogniqualvolta Neyam Shai Murad infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, puoi far riprendere in mano a quel giocatore una carta permanente bersaglio dal suo cimitero. Se lo fai, quel giocatore sceglie una carta permanente nel tuo cimitero, poi tu la metti sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo.', 'type': 'Creatura Leggendaria — Farabutto Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581597&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2865fb26-87c0-4c16-8776-39ef4be778be', 'multiverseId': 581597}, 'multiverseid': 581597}, {'name': 'ネイヤム・シャイ・ムラド', 'text': 'ローグトレーダー — ネイヤム・シャイ・ムラドがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたは「そのプレイヤーの墓地にあるパーマネント・カード１枚を対象とする。そのカードをそのプレイヤーの手札に戻す。」を選んでもよい。そうしたなら、そのプレイヤーはあなたの墓地にあるパーマネント・カード１枚を選ぶ。その後、あなたはそれをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ならず者', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581757&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '916d79a2-a991-4a8e-97f4-d453754691ca', 'multiverseId': 581757}, 'multiverseid': 581757}, {'name': 'Neyam Shai Murad', 'text': 'Comerciante Independente — Toda vez que Neyam Shai Murad causar dano de combate a um jogador, você pode fazer com que aquele jogador devolva o card de permanente alvo do próprio cemitério para a própria mão. Se você fizer isso, aquele jogador escolhe um card de permanente em seu cemitério e depois você o coloca no campo de batalha sob seu controle.', 'type': 'Criatura Lendária — Humano Ladino', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581917&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '32116a79-7705-43a2-a9b9-d0d239489c0c', 'multiverseId': 581917}, 'multiverseid': 581917}, {'name': '妮娅·萨伊·穆拉德', 'text': '行商浪人～每当妮娅·萨伊·穆拉德对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，你可以令该牌手将目标永久物牌从其坟墓场中移回其手上。若你如此作，则该牌手选择你坟墓场中的一张永久物牌，然后你将该牌在你的操控下放进战场。', 'type': '传奇生物 ～人类／浪客', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582237&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '878334de-0dce-43ab-9a35-421c4d8af302', 'multiverseId': 582237}, 'multiverseid': 582237}]", '[{\'name\': \'Nurgles Zwang\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus dem Friedhof eines Gegners getappt unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel und schicke dann den Friedhof jenes Spielers ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„In der Umarmung des großen Nurgle verspüre ich keine Angst mehr, denn mit seiner pestilenten Gunst wurde ich das, was ich einst am meisten fürchtete: der Tod."\\n—Kulvain Hestarius von der Death Guard\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581026&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21dbf4d7-a0d3-41bc-bfcf-628743ecde84\', \'multiverseId\': 581026}, \'multiverseid\': 581026}, {\'name\': \'Reclutamiento de Nurgle\', \'text\': \'Pon en el campo de batalla girada bajo tu control la carta de criatura objetivo del cementerio de un oponente y luego exilia el cementerio de ese jugador.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"En el abrazo del gran Nurgle no tengo miedo, porque con Su pestilente favor me he convertido en lo que antaño temía: Muerte".\\n—Kulvain Hestarius, de la Guardia de la Muerte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581186&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5262b08-5eb6-4995-8441-97a96a117380\', \'multiverseId\': 581186}, \'multiverseid\': 581186}, {\'name\': \'Conscription de Nurgle\', \'text\': "Mettez sur le champ de bataille, engagée et sous votre contrôle, une carte de créature ciblée depuis le cimetière d\'un adversaire, puis exilez le cimetière de ce joueur.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Dans l\'étreinte du grand Nurgle, je n\'ai plus peur, car avec Sa faveur pestilentielle, je suis devenu ce que je craignais autrefois : la Mort. »\\n—Kulvain Hestarius de la Death Guard", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581346&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc1ac9a4-2105-47fe-a733-8b474b6d4c31\', \'multiverseId\': 581346}, \'multiverseid\': 581346}, {\'name\': \'Reclutamento di Nurgle\', \'text\': \'Metti sul campo di battaglia TAPpata sotto il tuo controllo una carta creatura bersaglio dal cimitero di un avversario, poi esilia il cimitero di quel giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Nell\\\'abbraccio del grande Nurgle, non ho più paura, perché con il suo favore pestilenziale sono diventato ciò che una volta temevo di più: la morte."\\n—Kulvain Hestarius della Death Guard\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46b94154-da76-40ed-a099-93cf7ce5744c\', \'multiverseId\': 581506}, \'multiverseid\': 581506}, {\'name\': \'ナーグルの徴兵\', \'text\': \'対戦相手の墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたのコントロール下でタップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、そのプレイヤーの墓地を追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「偉大なるナーグルの腕の中で、私はもはや恐れ知らずだ。何故なら主の伝染する恵みによって私が最も恐れていたもの、すなわち『死』そのものに生まれ変わったのだから。」\\n――デスガードのクルヴェイン・ヘスタリウス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581666&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4c479a7-7f7a-461a-89b3-a8563377e4e9\', \'multiverseId\': 581666}, \'multiverseid\': 581666}, {\'name\': \'Conscrição de Nurgle\', \'text\': \'Coloque o card de criatura alvo do cemitério de um oponente no campo de batalha virado sob seu controle e depois exile o cemitério daquele jogador.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"No abraço do grande Nurgle, não tenho mais medo, pois com Sua pestilenta bênção me tornei o que eu mais temia: a Morte."\\n— Kulvain Hestarius da Guarda da Morte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581826&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'874d22ad-3cb7-407b-897c-d4a77b6ffb2e\', \'multiverseId\': 581826}, \'multiverseid\': 581826}, {\'name\': \'纳垢征召\', \'text\': \'将目标生物牌在你操控下从对手坟墓场横置放进战场，然后放逐该牌手的坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「得受纳垢之拥，我从此不再害怕；如今我已蒙获其疫病加持，转变为我曾最惧怕之物：死亡。」\\n～死亡守卫的寇维恩·赫斯塔流斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d38f53de-f3b2-438e-af48-bc74e340d7af\', \'multiverseId\': 582146}, \'multiverseid\': 582146}]', '[{\'name\': \'Paladinritter\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nSchnellfeuer-Kampfgeschütz — Wenn der Paladinritter ins Spiel kommt, fügt er jedem Gegner 4 Schadenspunkte zu.\\nBemannen 1 (Tappe eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst und die zusammen Stärke 1 oder mehr haben: Dieses Fahrzeug wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer Artefaktkreatur.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Fahrzeug\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581142&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95a15eae-b90c-4f1a-8873-33ec53590564\', \'multiverseId\': 581142}, \'multiverseid\': 581142}, {\'name\': \'Caballero Paladín\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nCañón de batalla de fuego rápido — Cuando el Caballero Paladín entre al campo de batalla, hace 4 puntos de daño a cada oponente.\\nTripular 1. (Girar cualquier cantidad de criaturas que controlas con una fuerza total de 1 o más: Este Vehículo se convierte en una criatura artefacto hasta el final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Vehículo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581302&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91cdc481-1e65-4563-ae67-38a10ebd796e\', \'multiverseId\': 581302}, \'multiverseid\': 581302}, {\'name\': \'Chevalier Paladin\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nObusier à tir rapide — Quand le Chevalier Paladin arrive sur le champ de bataille, il inflige 4 blessures à chaque adversaire.\\nPilotage 1 (Engagez n\'importe quel nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez dont la force totale est supérieure ou égale à 1 : Ce véhicule devient une créature-artefact jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : véhicule\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581462&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82892836-edb7-4057-8bc1-4bdbfb4861ff\', \'multiverseId\': 581462}, \'multiverseid\': 581462}, {\'name\': \'Cavaliere Paladin\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nCannone da Battaglia a Cadenza Rapida — Quando il Cavaliere Paladin entra nel campo di battaglia, infligge 4 danni a ogni avversario.\\nManovrare 1 (TAPpa un qualsiasi numero di creature che controlli con forza totale pari o superiore a 1: Questo Veicolo diventa una creatura artefatto fino alla fine del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Veicolo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581622&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e88753c8-3316-4c1d-b0b3-51e46852c79b\', \'multiverseId\': 581622}, \'multiverseid\': 581622}, {\'name\': \'ナイト・パラディン\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\nラピッドファイア・バトルキャノン — ナイト・パラディンが戦場に出たとき、これは各対戦相手にそれぞれ４点のダメージを与える。\\n搭乗１（あなたがコントロールしている望む数のクリーチャーを、パワーの合計が１以上になるように選んでタップする：ターン終了時まで、この機体はアーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 機体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e509a771-7f8a-4f2b-8412-633b76d64b9d\', \'multiverseId\': 581782}, \'multiverseid\': 581782}, {\'name\': \'Knight Paladin\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nCanhão de Batalha de Fogo Rápido — Quando Knight Paladin entra no campo de batalha, ele causa 4 pontos de dano a cada oponente.\\nTripular 1 (Vire qualquer número de criaturas que você controla com total de poder igual ou superior a 1: Este Veículo torna-se uma criatura artefato até o final do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Veículo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581942&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25e5a7ab-a66d-4451-a908-7aebaf3fd206\', \'multiverseId\': 581942}, \'multiverseid\': 581942}, {\'name\': \'圣堂骑士\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n速射战斗加农炮～当圣堂骑士进战场时，它向每位对手各造成4点伤害。\\n搭载1（横置任意数量由你操控且力量总和等于或大于1的生物：此载具成为神器生物直到回合结束。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～载具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bfc9721-0e50-4c2a-aa4e-790fc4747145\', \'multiverseId\': 582262}, \'multiverseid\': 582262}]', '[{\'name\': \'Paragon der Grey Knights\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nRiten der Verbannung — Wenn der Paragon der Grey Knights ins Spiel kommt, zerstöre eine angreifende Kreatur deiner Wahl. Falls die Kreatur ein Dämon ist, schicke sie stattdessen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Astartes, Ritter\', \'flavor\': \'„Unser Wille soll unsere Waffe sein, unser Glaube unsere Rüstung."\\n—Lobgesang der Absolution\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=580995&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8437830f-0e57-4360-899d-d09f6756d435\', \'multiverseId\': 580995}, \'multiverseid\': 580995}, {\'name\': \'Dechado de los Caballeros Grises\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nRitos de destierro — Cuando el Dechado de los Caballeros Grises entre al campo de batalla, destruye la criatura atacante objetivo. Si esa criatura es un Demonio, en vez de eso, exíliala.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero astartes\', \'flavor\': \'"Nuestra arma será la voluntad, y nuestra armadura, la fe".\\n—Cántico de Absolución\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba1abf19-b894-4a2c-8aa2-bb8566a47a10\', \'multiverseId\': 581155}, \'multiverseid\': 581155}, {\'name\': \'Parangon Grey Knight\', \'text\': \'Flash\\nRites de bannissement — Quand le Parangon Grey Knight arrive sur le champ de bataille, détruisez une créature attaquante ciblée. Si cette créature est un démon, exilez-la à la place.\', \'type\': \'Créature : astartes et chevalier\', \'flavor\': "« Notre volonté sera notre arme, notre foi sera notre armure. »\\n—Cantique d\'Absolution", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581315&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7b98d84-fea8-49b9-8416-8e3b6d3e895d\', \'multiverseId\': 581315}, \'multiverseid\': 581315}, {\'name\': \'Paragon Grey Knight\', \'text\': "Lampo\\nRituale dell\'Esilio — Quando il Paragon Grey Knight entra nel campo di battaglia, distruggi una creatura attaccante bersaglio. Se quella creatura è un Demone, invece esiliala.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Astartes\', \'flavor\': \'"Le nostre armi saranno la nostra volontà, la nostra armatura sarà la nostra fede."\\n—Cantico dell\\\'Assoluzione\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581475&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84c4e33c-3058-48e3-88b9-b763cc81c0cc\', \'multiverseId\': 581475}, \'multiverseid\': 581475}, {\'name\': \'グレイナイト・パラゴン\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n消失の儀式 — グレイナイト・パラゴンが戦場に出たとき、攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。そのクリーチャーがデーモンであるなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — アスタルテス・騎士\', \'flavor\': \'「我らの意志が我らの武器に、我らの信仰が我らの鎧にならんことを。」\\n――断罪の祈祷\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581635&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb74d2cd-57dd-40c4-a31d-0f70ceba65d4\', \'multiverseId\': 581635}, \'multiverseid\': 581635}, {\'name\': \'Grey Knight Exemplar\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nRitos de Banimento — Quando Grey Knight Exemplar entrar no campo de batalha, destrua a criatura atacante alvo. Se aquela criatura for um Demônio, em vez disso, exile-a.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Astartes Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Nossa vontade será nossa arma, nossa fé será nossa armadura."\\n— Cântico da Absolvição\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581795&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edd2d1ca-6f77-443c-a1b9-5af6e76f79ac\', \'multiverseId\': 581795}, \'multiverseid\': 581795}, {\'name\': \'灰骑士楷模\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n放逐仪式～当灰骑士楷模进战场时，消灭目标进行攻击的生物。若该生物是恶魔，则改为将它放逐。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～阿斯塔特／骑士\', \'flavor\': \'「吾人当以尖锐意志为兵，坚实信念作甲。」\\n～赦罪圣歌\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582115&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3478c0cb-cc49-4460-b9ac-d3af7216a80d\', \'multiverseId\': 582115}, \'multiverseid\': 582115}]', '[{\'name\': \'Patriarch der Symbionten\', \'text\': \'Kuss des Symbionten — Immer wenn der Patriarch der Symbionten angreift, lege eine Infektionsmarke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die der verteidigender Spieler kontrolliert.\\nKinder des Kults — Immer wenn eine Kreatur mit Infektionsmarke stirbt, erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie der Kreatur ist, außer dass er zusätzlich zu seinen anderen Typen ein Tyranide ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Tyranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581004&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f19a3bf-9b4d-43b8-ac41-6f76161d4dfc\', \'multiverseId\': 581004}, \'multiverseid\': 581004}, {\'name\': \'Patriarca Genestealer\', \'text\': \'Beso del Genestealer — Siempre que el Patriarca Genestealer ataque, pon un contador de infección sobre la criatura objetivo que controla el jugador defensor.\\nHijos del Culto — Siempre que una criatura con un contador de infección sobre ella muera, creas una ficha que es una copia de esa criatura, excepto que es un Tiránido además de sus otros tipos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiránido\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec7c1bbe-d7db-4253-abb9-00c9c19814bc\', \'multiverseId\': 581164}, \'multiverseid\': 581164}, {\'name\': \'Patriarche Genestealer\', \'text\': "Baiser du Genestealer — À chaque fois que le Patriarche Genestealer attaque, mettez un marqueur « infection » sur une créature ciblée que le joueur défenseur contrôle.\\nEnfants du culte — À chaque fois qu\'une créature avec un marqueur « infection » sur elle meurt, vous créez un jeton qui est une copie de cette créature, excepté que c\'est un tyranide en plus de ses autres types.", \'type\': \'Créature : tyranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581324&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1b68f70-729d-417d-bfee-3470a0ab5f70\', \'multiverseId\': 581324}, \'multiverseid\': 581324}, {\'name\': \'Patriarca dei Genoraptor\', \'text\': \'Bacio del Genoraptor — Ogniqualvolta il Patriarca dei Genoraptor attacca, metti un segnalino infezione su una creatura bersaglio controllata dal giocatore in difesa.\\nFigli del Culto — Ogniqualvolta una creatura con un segnalino infezione muore, crei una pedina che è una copia di quella creatura, tranne che è un Tiranide in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Tiranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581484&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a479666e-1ffb-48a0-b9ff-057bba0debc2\', \'multiverseId\': 581484}, \'multiverseid\': 581484}, {\'name\': \'ジーンスティーラー・パトリアーク\', \'text\': \'ジーンスティーラーの接吻 — ジーンスティーラー・パトリアークが攻撃するたび、防御プレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に感染カウンター１個を置く。\\n教団の子ら — 感染カウンターが置かれているクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、あなたは、それの他のタイプに加えてティラニッドであることを除き、そのクリーチャーのコピーであるトークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ティラニッド\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581644&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b771481-c418-416b-9ae0-27ba3134c5d9\', \'multiverseId\': 581644}, \'multiverseid\': 581644}, {\'name\': \'Patriarca Genestealer\', \'text\': \'Beijo do Genestealer — Toda vez que Patriarca Genestealer atacar, coloque um marcador de infecção na criatura alvo que o jogador defensor controla.\\nFilhos do Culto — Toda vez que uma criatura com um marcador de infecção morre, você cria uma ficha que seja uma cópia daquela criatura, exceto por ser um Tiranídeo além de seus outros tipos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiranídeo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581804&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79706abc-ffb5-4178-b829-6df4b851fb59\', \'multiverseId\': 581804}, \'multiverseid\': 581804}, {\'name\': \'基因窃取者族长\', \'text\': \'基因窃取者之吻～每当基因窃取者族长攻击时，在目标由防御牌手操控的生物上放置一个感染指示物。\\n教派之子～每当一个其上有感染指示物的生物死去时，你派出一个衍生物，此衍生物为该生物的复制品，但它额外具有泰伦虫族此类别。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～泰伦虫族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef4ee337-402d-45ff-a6e4-3eadbbfe25b9\', \'multiverseId\': 582124}, \'multiverseid\': 582124}]', '[{\'name\': \'Plasmant\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nDynastie-Berater — Wenn der Plasmant ins Spiel kommt, durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Sumpf-Standardlandkarte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Necron, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Als Meister der Dimensionsdissonanz, der Singularitätsmanipulation und zahlloser anderer Technologien sind Plasmanten ein furchterregender Anblick.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581030&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ad70b92-073a-4396-a02e-c6eeb68635f8\', \'multiverseId\': 581030}, \'multiverseid\': 581030}, {\'name\': \'Plasmante\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nConsejero dinástico — Cuando el Plasmante entre al campo de batalla, busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Pantano básica, muéstrala, ponla en tu mano y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Hechicero necrón\', \'flavor\': \'Los plasmantes, maestros de la disonancia dimensional, la manipulación de la singularidad e innumerables otras tecnologías, resultan siempre un oponente aterrador.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581190&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21b2f08a-a0b1-4682-a65b-08f02fb2b8de\', \'multiverseId\': 581190}, \'multiverseid\': 581190}, {\'name\': \'Plasmancien\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nConseiller dynastique — Quand le Plasmancien arrive sur le champ de bataille, cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de marais de base, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main, puis mélangez.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : nécron et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "Maîtres de la dissonance dimensionnelle, de la manipulation des singularités cosmiques et de bien d\'autres technologies, les plasmanciens défient la raison.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581350&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a70ceec2-7c06-4b87-bdd7-1dc0885ca5ae\', \'multiverseId\': 581350}, \'multiverseid\': 581350}, {\'name\': \'Plasmomante\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nConsigliere Dinastico — Quando il Plasmomante entra nel campo di battaglia, passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Palude base, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Mago Necron\', \'flavor\': \'Esperti di dissonanza dimensionale, manipolazione della singolarità e innumerevoli altre tecnologie, i plasmomanti sono una visione terrificante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581510&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9205427-f9c8-4b23-8adc-2335af0d7be6\', \'multiverseId\': 581510}, \'multiverseid\': 581510}, {\'name\': \'プラズマンサー\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n王朝の助言者 — プラズマンサーが戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーから基本沼・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ネクロン・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'次元の不調和やシンギュラリティの操作、その他無数の技術に精通するプラズマンサーは見た目も脅威的である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581670&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cff4683-d745-45e0-9359-571ca1bfe010\', \'multiverseId\': 581670}, \'multiverseid\': 581670}, {\'name\': \'Plasmante\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nConselheiro Dinástico — Quando Plasmante entrar no campo de batalha, procure em seu grimório um card de Pântano básico, revele-o, coloque-o em sua mão e depois embaralhe.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Necron Mago\', \'flavor\': \'Mestres da dissonância espacial, da manipulação de singularidades e de outras incontáveis tecnologias, os plasmantes são uma visão aterrorizante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581830&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2dae0bd-5dee-4a69-ab90-24daae30a86f\', \'multiverseId\': 581830}, \'multiverseid\': 581830}, {\'name\': \'能量巫师\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n王朝参谋～当能量巫师进战场时，从你牌库中搜寻一张基本的沼泽牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～太空死灵／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'能量巫师精通维度失谐、奇点摆弄及其他无数科技，每次出现都让人不寒而栗。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582150&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65b211e1-ab2f-4b48-9c3f-eedc3c64625b\', \'multiverseId\': 582150}, \'multiverseid\': 582150}]', '[{\'name\': \'Plünderer-Titan\', \'text\': \'Deflektorschilde — Schutz vor Manabetrag 3 oder weniger.\\nGatling-Blaster — Immer wenn der Plünderer-Titan angreift, fügt er jedem Gegner 5 Schadenspunkte zu.\\nBemannen 4 (Tappe eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst und die zusammen Stärke 4 oder mehr haben: Dieses Fahrzeug wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer Artefaktkreatur.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Fahrzeug\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581145&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0b9045a-ac34-4af0-ba8d-e04c12f25f30\', \'multiverseId\': 581145}, \'multiverseid\': 581145}, {\'name\': \'Titán Segador\', \'text\': \'Escudos de vacío — Protección contra los valores de maná de 3 o menos\\nBláster gatling — Siempre que el Titán Segador ataque, hace 5 puntos de daño a cada oponente.\\nTripular 4. (Girar cualquier cantidad de criaturas que controlas con una fuerza total de 4 o más: Este Vehículo se convierte en una criatura artefacto hasta el final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Vehículo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581305&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'609a42ae-d82b-4878-a79d-8c14876ad9de\', \'multiverseId\': 581305}, \'multiverseid\': 581305}, {\'name\': \'Titan Reaver\', \'text\': "Boucliers Void — Protection contre les valeurs de mana inférieures ou égale à 3\\nÉclateur Gatling — À chaque fois que le Titan Reaver attaque, il inflige 5 blessures à chaque adversaire.\\nPilotage 4 (Engagez n\'importe quel nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez dont la force totale est supérieure ou égale à 4 : Ce véhicule devient une créature-artefact jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : véhicule\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581465&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f183272e-8605-4060-8888-27784da98d68\', \'multiverseId\': 581465}, \'multiverseid\': 581465}, {\'name\': \'Titano Reaver\', \'text\': \'Scudi Vacuum — Protezione da valore di mana pari o inferiore a 3\\nSterminatore a Raffica — Ogniqualvolta il Titano Reaver attacca, infligge 5 danni a ogni avversario.\\nManovrare 4 (TAPpa un qualsiasi numero di creature che controlli con forza totale pari o superiore a 4: Questo Veicolo diventa una creatura artefatto fino alla fine del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Veicolo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6cb9a62-2d42-42a2-bda7-51a7797251dd\', \'multiverseId\': 581625}, \'multiverseid\': 581625}, {\'name\': \'リーヴァー・タイタン\', \'text\': \'ヴォイドシールド — プロテクション（マナ総量３以下）\\nガトリングブラスター — リーヴァー・タイタンが攻撃するたび、これは各対戦相手にそれぞれ５点のダメージを与える。\\n搭乗４（あなたがコントロールしている望む数のクリーチャーを、パワーの合計が４以上になるように選んでタップする：ターン終了時まで、この機体はアーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 機体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4176fb16-adb3-4415-b381-891fb853b60b\', \'multiverseId\': 581785}, \'multiverseid\': 581785}, {\'name\': \'Titã Despojador\', \'text\': \'Escudos do Vazio — Proteção contra valor de mana igual ou inferior a 3.\\nMetralhadora Destruidora — Toda vez que Titã Despojador ataca, ele causa 5 pontos de dano a cada oponente.\\nTripular 4 (Vire qualquer número de criaturas que você controla com total de poder igual ou superior a 4: Este Veículo torna-se uma criatura artefato até o final do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Veículo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581945&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ae6e0b1-d477-4a34-8cb0-adf2316f9932\', \'multiverseId\': 581945}, \'multiverseid\': 581945}, {\'name\': \'掠夺者级泰坦\', \'text\': \'虚空盾～反法术力值等于或小于3保护\\n加特林爆裂炮～每当掠夺者级泰坦攻击时，它向每位对手各造成5点伤害。\\n搭载4（横置任意数量由你操控且力量总和等于或大于4的生物：此载具成为神器生物直到回合结束。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～载具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b41d50e4-ffe7-4014-b0d4-e03357ea624a\', \'multiverseId\': 582265}, \'multiverseid\': 582265}]', '[{\'name\': \'Primaris-Eliminator\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Primaris-Eliminator ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eines —\\n• Executor-Geschoss — Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\\n• Hyper-Schrapnellgeschoss — Kreaturen, die ein Spieler deiner Wahl kontrolliert, erhalten -2/-2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Astartes, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581032&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec817403-ac4f-48bb-86d1-a79c690a808e\', \'multiverseId\': 581032}, \'multiverseid\': 581032}, {\'name\': \'Eliminador Primaris\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Eliminador Primaris entre al campo de batalla, elige uno:\\n• Balas ejecutor — Destruye la criatura objetivo.\\n• Balas hiperfrag — Las criaturas que controla el jugador objetivo obtienen -2/-2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero astartes\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'257c1d8c-c298-45ce-9104-2dc6e0cd7ee2\', \'multiverseId\': 581192}, \'multiverseid\': 581192}, {\'name\': \'Eliminator Primaris\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Eliminator Primaris arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez l\'un —\\n• Balle Executioner — Détruisez une créature ciblée.\\n• Balle Hyperfrag — Les créatures qu\'un joueur ciblé contrôle gagnent -2/-2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : astartes et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581352&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e308f71c-6acc-4870-b8e4-2e5706e81889\', \'multiverseId\': 581352}, \'multiverseid\': 581352}, {\'name\': \'Eliminatore Primaris\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Eliminatore Primaris entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli uno —\\n• Proiettile Executioner — Distruggi una creatura bersaglio.\\n• Proiettile a Iperframmentazione — Le creature controllate da un giocatore bersaglio prendono -2/-2 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Astartes\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581512&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8aa81455-c2f5-434f-89b8-fe58a021c10d\', \'multiverseId\': 581512}, \'multiverseid\': 581512}, {\'name\': \'プライマリス・エリミネイター\', \'text\': \'プライマリス・エリミネイターが戦場に出たとき、以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• エクスキューショナー弾 — クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。\\n• ハイパーフラグ弾 — プレイヤー１人を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは－２/－２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — アスタルテス・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7100d33b-0dde-417d-bebd-3fa1bc58a924\', \'multiverseId\': 581672}, \'multiverseid\': 581672}, {\'name\': \'Eliminador Primaris\', \'text\': \'Quando Eliminador Primaris entrar no campo de batalha, escolha um —\\n• Munição do Executor — Destrua a criatura alvo.\\n• Munição à Hiperfragmentação — As criaturas que o jogador alvo controla recebem -2/-2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Astartes Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581832&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'546a75ba-6a67-4b8b-9d4d-cb6b6fcea10c\', \'multiverseId\': 581832}, \'multiverseid\': 581832}, {\'name\': \'原铸歼灭者\', \'text\': \'当原铸歼灭者进战场时，选择一项～\\n•处刑者爆矢弹～消灭目标生物。\\n•超破片弹～由目标牌手操控的生物得-2/-2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～阿斯塔特／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582152&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c29c7e54-d6fc-4bd4-8021-d0df8e9070b9\', \'multiverseId\': 582152}, \'multiverseid\': 582152}]', '[{\'name\': \'Primaris-Ordenspriester\', \'text\': \'Schlachtruf (Immer wenn diese Kreatur angreift, erhält jede andere angreifende Kreaturen +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.)\\nRosarius — Immer wenn der Primaris-Ordenspriester angreift, erhält er Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Astartes, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'Jeder Tote ist ein Sakrament an die Herrlichkeit des Imperators.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581119&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fd6a3f0-6f70-470a-9fca-85444c253656\', \'multiverseId\': 581119}, \'multiverseid\': 581119}, {\'name\': \'Capellán Primaris\', \'text\': \'Grito de batalla. (Siempre que esta criatura ataque, cada otra criatura atacante obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno.)\\nRosarius — Siempre que el Capellán Primaris ataque, gana la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo astartes\', \'flavor\': \'Cada asesinato es un sacramento de la gloria del Emperador.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d696547-4e2c-4f62-8091-46850eed8431\', \'multiverseId\': 581279}, \'multiverseid\': 581279}, {\'name\': \'Chapelain Primaris\', \'text\': "Cri de guerre (À chaque fois que cette créature attaque, chaque autre créature attaquante gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)\\nRosarius — À chaque fois que le Chapelain Primaris attaque, il acquiert l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : astartes et clerc\', \'flavor\': "Chaque victime est un sacrement de la gloire de l\'Empereur.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581439&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ce3a8b8-b3e3-4ae7-865d-040259307ae5\', \'multiverseId\': 581439}, \'multiverseid\': 581439}, {\'name\': \'Cappellano Primaris\', \'text\': \'Grido di guerra (Ogniqualvolta questa creatura attacca, ogni altra creatura attaccante prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno.)\\nRosarius — Ogniqualvolta il Cappellano Primaris attacca, ha indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Astartes\', \'flavor\': "Ogni uccisione è un sacramento della gloria dell\'Imperatore.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ebb1e52-e405-425e-a954-020fdda29baf\', \'multiverseId\': 581599}, \'multiverseid\': 581599}, {\'name\': \'プライマリス・チャプレイン\', \'text\': \'喊声（このクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、これでないすべての攻撃クリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。）\\nロザリウス — プライマリス・チャプレインが攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、これは破壊不能を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — アスタルテス・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'殺されたすべての者は皇帝の栄光のための聖体なのである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581759&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84854f70-e00e-4fa6-82e3-7b06ff054627\', \'multiverseId\': 581759}, \'multiverseid\': 581759}, {\'name\': \'Primaris Chaplain\', \'text\': \'Grito de guerra (Toda vez que esta criatura ataca, cada outra criatura atacante recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno.)\\nRosarius — Toda vez que Primaris Chaplain ataca, ele ganha indestrutível até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Astartes Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'Cada morte é um sacramento da glória do Imperador.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581919&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72cf91d8-eef9-44a3-be39-b03ffcbc4c16\', \'multiverseId\': 581919}, \'multiverseid\': 581919}, {\'name\': \'原铸教士\', \'text\': \'战嚎（每当此生物攻击时，每个进行攻击的其他生物各得+1/+0直到回合结束。）\\n玫瑰念珠～每当原铸教士攻击时，它获得不灭异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～阿斯塔特／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'每次杀戮，都是宣扬帝皇荣光的圣礼。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582239&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41cec12b-d2fb-48e5-8b71-6a73fcb7772a\', \'multiverseId\': 582239}, \'multiverseid\': 582239}]', '[{\'name\': \'Psibanntest\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch, eine aktivierte Fähigkeit oder eine ausgelöste Fähigkeit deiner Wahl. Sein bzw. ihr Beherrscher verliert so viele Lebenspunkte, wie du Kreaturen kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Diese Ketzerei ist inakzeptabel!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581098&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a3df2de-4701-4ebe-a047-6a1dc73aed9b\', \'multiverseId\': 581098}, \'multiverseid\': 581098}, {\'name\': \'Rechazar a la bruja\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo, habilidad activada o habilidad disparada objetivo. Su controlador pierde una cantidad de vidas igual a la cantidad de criaturas que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Esta herejía es intolerable!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581258&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a29f6699-257b-46b6-9328-820f50d4fb2e\', \'multiverseId\': 581258}, \'multiverseid\': 581258}, {\'name\': \'Abjurer le sorcier\', \'text\': \'Contrecarrez un sort ciblé, une capacité activée ciblée ou une capacité déclenchée ciblée. Son contrôleur perd un nombre de points de vie égal au nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Cette hérésie est insupportable ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581418&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0a1aad2-3112-49e2-84ad-33da4aac270c\', \'multiverseId\': 581418}, \'multiverseid\': 581418}, {\'name\': \'Bloccare il Potere\', \'text\': "Neutralizza una magia, un\'abilità attivata o un\'abilità innescata bersaglio. Il suo controllore perde punti vita pari al numero di creature che controlli.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Una tale eresia non può continuare a esistere!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581578&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15f6e4e5-382a-4513-a774-98487a5a9154\', \'multiverseId\': 581578}, \'multiverseid\': 581578}, {\'name\': \'魔女の否定\', \'text\': \'呪文や起動型能力や誘発型能力のうち１つを対象とする。それを打ち消す。それのコントローラーは、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーの数に等しい点数のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「このような大逆を認めるわけにはいかない！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581738&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f8f21b2-da37-4ad2-ba07-f169d97cd888\', \'multiverseId\': 581738}, \'multiverseid\': 581738}, {\'name\': \'Negar a Bruxa\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica, a habilidade ativada ou a habilidade desencadeada alvo. Seu controlador perde uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual ao número de criaturas que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Essa heresia não pode ficar assim!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581898&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccbefe2b-6b13-4c5e-931d-beef8d4a2aa9\', \'multiverseId\': 581898}, \'multiverseid\': 581898}, {\'name\': \'抗御巫法\', \'text\': \'反击目标咒语，起动式异能或触发式异能。其操控者失去若干生命，其数量等同于由你操控的生物数量。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「这种异端邪说不能留！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582218&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24f06ec3-ab58-43ed-9674-1fc97278e2bf\', \'multiverseId\': 582218}, \'multiverseid\': 582218}]', "[{'name': 'Psychomant', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nBote der Verzweiflung — Immer wenn der Psychomant oder ein anderes Nichtspielsteinartefakt, das du kontrollierst, aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt oder aus dem Spiel ins Exil geschickt wird, verliert ein Gegner deiner Wahl 1 Lebenspunkt und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Necron, Zauberer', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581033&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cdb7295f-e9b7-40f5-899a-c75621bc5dd3', 'multiverseId': 581033}, 'multiverseid': 581033}, {'name': 'Psicomante', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nHeraldo de desesperación — Siempre que el Psicomante u otro artefacto que no sea ficha que controlas vaya a un cementerio desde el campo de batalla o vaya al exilio desde el campo de batalla, el oponente objetivo pierde 1 vida y tú ganas 1 vida.', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto — Hechicero necrón', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581193&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a26e0845-99d8-45fb-8c01-a231cc9533b1', 'multiverseId': 581193}, 'multiverseid': 581193}, {'name': 'Psychomancien', 'text': 'Vol\\nÉmissaire du désespoir — À chaque fois que le Psychomancien ou un autre artefact non-jeton que vous contrôlez est mis dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille ou en exil depuis le champ de bataille, un adversaire ciblé perd 1 point de vie et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : nécron et sorcier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581353&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c4ba6423-cf59-4d5a-979b-4c7eafa23aa9', 'multiverseId': 581353}, 'multiverseid': 581353}, {'name': 'Psicomante', 'text': 'Volare\\nAraldo della Disperazione — Ogniqualvolta lo Psicomante o un altro artefatto non pedina che controlli viene messo in un cimitero dal campo di battaglia o viene messo in esilio dal campo di battaglia, un avversario bersaglio perde 1 punto vita e tu guadagni 1 punto vita.', 'type': 'Creatura Artefatto — Mago Necron', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581513&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '64761f17-f1e2-4acf-92a6-3b9fc267ab7e', 'multiverseId': 581513}, 'multiverseid': 581513}, {'name': 'サイコマンサー', 'text': '飛行\\n絶望の先触れ — サイコマンサーや、あなたがコントロールしていてトークンでもこれでもないアーティファクト１つが戦場から墓地や追放領域に置かれるたび、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは１点のライフを失い、あなたは１点のライフを得る。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ネクロン・ウィザード', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581673&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1d7aea1b-6d96-4890-a029-36fdfcf98bc5', 'multiverseId': 581673}, 'multiverseid': 581673}, {'name': 'Psicomante', 'text': 'Voar\\nAnunciador do Desespero — Toda vez que Psicomante ou outro artefato não ficha que você controla é colocado do campo de batalha em um cemitério ou no exílio, o oponente alvo perde 1 ponto de vida e você ganha 1 ponto de vida.', 'type': 'Criatura Artefato — Necron Mago', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581833&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '415315a9-d399-4b7a-a35a-f74ded13de6c', 'multiverseId': 581833}, 'multiverseid': 581833}, {'name': '精神巫师', 'text': '飞行\\n绝望先兆～每当精神巫师或另一个由你操控且非衍生物的神器从战场进入坟墓场或放逐区时，目标对手失去1点生命且你获得1点生命。', 'type': '神器生物 ～太空死灵／法术师', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582153&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a47a67b7-58e5-4d56-8966-cc0eea0e9d19', 'multiverseId': 582153}, 'multiverseid': 582153}]", '[{\'name\': \'Redemptor Dreadnought\', \'text\': \'Gefallener Krieger — Als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken, kannst du eine Kreaturenkarte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil schicken.\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden\\nPlasmabrenner — Immer wenn der Redemptor Dreadnought angreift und falls eine Karte von ihm ins Exil geschickt wurde, erhält er bis zum Ende des Zuges +X/+X, wobei X gleich der Stärke der ins Exil geschickten Karte ist.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Astartes, Schlachtschiff\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581146&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3cb5d1f-385a-4705-9e4f-105505cb7601\', \'multiverseId\': 581146}, \'multiverseid\': 581146}, {\'name\': \'Dreadnought Redentor\', \'text\': \'Guerrero caído — Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, puedes exiliar una carta de criatura de tu cementerio.\\nArrolla.\\nIncinerador de plasma — Siempre que el Dreadnought Redentor ataque, si hay en el exilio una carta exiliada con él, obtiene +X/+X hasta el final del turno, donde X es la fuerza de la carta exiliada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Acorazado astartes\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581306&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'014b9b8b-852b-45c9-b2a9-77bee4e076c9\', \'multiverseId\': 581306}, \'multiverseid\': 581306}, {\'name\': \'Dreadnought Redemptor\', \'text\': "Guerrier défunt — En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, vous pouvez exiler une carte de créature depuis votre cimetière.\\nPiétinement\\nIncinérateur à plasma — À chaque fois que le Dreadnought Redemptor attaque, si une carte est exilée par lui, il gagne +X/+X jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant la force de la carte exilée.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : astartes et dreadnought\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581466&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a794b442-f8a0-4552-bb9e-5be0aadef2bb\', \'multiverseId\': 581466}, \'multiverseid\': 581466}, {\'name\': \'Dreadnought Redemptor\', \'text\': \'Guerriero Caduto — Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, puoi esiliare una carta creatura dal tuo cimitero.\\nTravolgere\\nInceneritore Plasma — Ogniqualvolta il Dreadnought Redemptor attacca, se è stata esiliata una carta con esso, prende +X/+X fino alla fine del turno, dove X è la forza della carta esiliata.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Sterminatore Astartes\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca95c0aa-813c-4f42-afbb-8a82f9927d8f\', \'multiverseId\': 581626}, \'multiverseid\': 581626}, {\'name\': \'リデンプター・ドレッドノート\', \'text\': \'堕ちたる戦士 — この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、あなたはあなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を追放してもよい。\\nトランプル\\nプラズマインシネレイター — リデンプター・ドレッドノートが攻撃するたび、これによりカードが追放されている場合、ターン終了時まで、これは＋Ｘ/＋Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘはその追放されているカードのパワーに等しい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — アスタルテス・ドレッドノート\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581786&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3e316da-47fb-4f43-b994-6087e16d55b2\', \'multiverseId\': 581786}, \'multiverseid\': 581786}, {\'name\': \'Dreadnought Redentor\', \'text\': \'Guerreiro Tombado — Como custo adicional para conjurar esta mágica, você pode exilar um card de criatura de seu cemitério.\\nAtropelar\\nIncinerador de Plasma — Toda vez que Dreadnought Redentor ataca, se um card estiver exilado com ele, ele recebe +X/+X até o final do turno, sendo X o poder do card exilado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Astartes Encouraçado\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581946&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16669f0e-d328-4fa1-b70e-e55ee68a3d7f\', \'multiverseId\': 581946}, \'multiverseid\': 581946}, {\'name\': \'救赎者无畏机甲\', \'text\': \'往生战士～你可以从你的坟墓场放逐一张生物牌，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。\\n践踏\\n等离子焚化枪～每当救赎者无畏机甲攻击时，若以它放逐过某牌，则它得+X/+X直到回合结束，X为所放逐之牌的力量。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～阿斯塔特／无畏舰\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'948370ce-60fc-4264-8865-5bab0b3b2c65\', \'multiverseId\': 582266}, \'multiverseid\': 582266}]', '[{\'name\': \'Reinrassiger Symbiont\', \'text\': \'Der Reinrassige Symbiont kommt mit zwei +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\\nVorhut-Spezies — Immer wenn der Reinrassige Symbiont angreift, kannst du eine +1/+1-Marke von ihm entfernen. Falls du dies tust, durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Tyranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581079&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42d9cb6f-41fd-479a-82c3-f3f368b4eaaa\', \'multiverseId\': 581079}, \'multiverseid\': 581079}, {\'name\': \'Genestealer Puro\', \'text\': \'El Genestealer Puro entra al campo de batalla con dos contadores +1/+1 sobre él.\\nEspecie de vanguardia — Siempre que el Genestealer Puro ataque, puedes remover un contador +1/+1 de él. Si lo haces, busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, ponla en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiránido\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581239&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cba34f3-0cea-4338-ae3a-5bf2b11fae7b\', \'multiverseId\': 581239}, \'multiverseid\': 581239}, {\'name\': \'Genestealer pure-souche\', \'text\': \'Le Genestealer pure-souche arrive sur le champ de bataille avec deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui.\\nEspèce avant-garde — À chaque fois que le Genestealer pure-souche attaque, vous pouvez lui retirer un marqueur +1/+1. Si vous faites ainsi, cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélangez.\', \'type\': \'Créature : tyranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581399&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfb6ec5d-6442-4b2e-b6a2-c33864eafec9\', \'multiverseId\': 581399}, \'multiverseid\': 581399}, {\'name\': \'Genoraptor Puro\', \'text\': "Il Genoraptor Puro entra nel campo di battaglia con due segnalini +1/+1.\\nSpecie d\'Avanguardia — Ogniqualvolta il Genoraptor Puro attacca, puoi rimuovere un segnalino +1/+1 da esso. Se lo fai, passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescola.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Tiranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581559&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68e71d3f-8bc8-40c7-a069-cffbb58ca950\', \'multiverseId\': 581559}, \'multiverseid\': 581559}, {\'name\': \'ピュアストレイン・ジーンスティーラー\', \'text\': \'ピュアストレイン・ジーンスティーラーは＋１/＋１カウンター２個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\nヴァンガード種 — ピュアストレイン・ジーンスティーラーが攻撃するたび、あなたはこれの上から＋１/＋１カウンター１個を取り除いてもよい。そうしたなら、あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ティラニッド\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581719&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e36701c2-590c-4530-b5a7-354904694d94\', \'multiverseId\': 581719}, \'multiverseid\': 581719}, {\'name\': \'Genestealer de Cepa Pura\', \'text\': \'Genestealer de Cepa Pura entra no campo de batalha com dois marcadores +1/+1.\\nEspécie de Vanguarda — Toda vez que Genestealer de Cepa Pura ataca, você pode remover um marcador +1/+1 dele. Se fizer isso, procure em seu grimório um card de terreno básico, coloque-o no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhe.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiranídeo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581879&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21e24981-92b2-415a-8e92-a343354cd1a8\', \'multiverseId\': 581879}, \'multiverseid\': 581879}, {\'name\': \'纯血基因窃取者\', \'text\': \'纯血基因窃取者进战场时上面有两个+1/+1指示物。\\n先锋种～每当纯血基因窃取者攻击时，你可以从其上移去一个+1/+1指示物。若你如此作，则从你牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，将之横置放进战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～泰伦虫族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582199&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40fe142d-1dc9-4f7a-8802-dc2f6e3781dc\', \'multiverseId\': 582199}, \'multiverseid\': 582199}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rosa Horror\', \'text\': \'Flackernde Flammen — Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst, fügt der Rosa Horror einem Ziel deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\\nTeilen — Wenn der Rosa Horror stirbt, erzeuge zwei 2/2 blaue und rote Dämon-Schrecken-Kreaturenspielsteine namens Blauer Horror mit „Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst, fügt diese Kreatur einem Ziel deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon, Schrecken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581118&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d30964f-5d11-4a04-ace1-ce3837c5b7b9\', \'multiverseId\': 581118}, \'multiverseid\': 581118}, {\'name\': \'Horror Rosa\', \'text\': \'Llamas refulgentes — Siempre que lances un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, el Horror Rosa hace 2 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\\nDividirse — Cuando el Horror Rosa muera, crea dos fichas de criatura Horror Demonio azules y rojas 2/2 llamadas Horror azul con "Siempre que lances un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, esta criatura hace 1 punto de daño a cualquier objetivo".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Horror demonio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581278&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56a7e6ee-7c39-43ac-9271-c36fbe6a3e13\', \'multiverseId\': 581278}, \'multiverseid\': 581278}, {\'name\': \'Horreur rose\', \'text\': "Flammes scintillantes — À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, l\'Horreur rose inflige 2 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.\\nDivision — Quand l\'Horreur rose meurt, créez deux jetons de créature 2/2 bleue et rouge Démon et Horreur appelés Horreur bleue avec « À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, cette créature inflige 1 blessure à n\'importe quelle cible. »", \'type\': \'Créature : démon et horreur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581438&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68ee77af-a9d9-4d16-9be8-ea16b582ca03\', \'multiverseId\': 581438}, \'multiverseid\': 581438}, {\'name\': \'Orrore Rosa\', \'text\': \'Fiamme Variopinte — Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, l\\\'Orrore Rosa infligge 2 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\\nDivisione — Quando l\\\'Orrore Rosa muore, crea due pedine creatura Orrore Demone 2/2 blu e rosse chiamate Orrore Blu con "Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, questa creatura infligge 1 danno a un qualsiasi bersaglio".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Orrore Demone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581598&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2f8bc84-2ecf-4315-88de-3513d5b9acfe\', \'multiverseId\': 581598}, \'multiverseid\': 581598}, {\'name\': \'ピンクのホラー\', \'text\': \'艶彩のフレイム — あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。ピンクのホラーはそれに２点のダメージを与える。\\n分裂 — ピンクのホラーが死亡したとき、「青のホラー」という名前で「あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。このクリーチャーはそれに１点のダメージを与える。」を持つ青赤の２/２のデーモン・ホラー・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン・ホラー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581758&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b258fbb3-af64-4781-8b02-650c830b52be\', \'multiverseId\': 581758}, \'multiverseid\': 581758}, {\'name\': \'Horror Rosa\', \'text\': \'Chamas Coruscantes — Toda vez que você conjura uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço, Horror Rosa causa 2 pontos de dano a qualquer alvo.\\nDividir-se — Quando Horror Rosa morrer, crie duas fichas de criatura Demônio Horror azul e vermelha 2/2 com o nome Horror Azul com "Toda vez que você conjura uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço, esta criatura causa 1 ponto de dano a qualquer alvo".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demônio Horror\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581918&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6832b49e-d0eb-4524-be87-f78c2fd5b5e0\', \'multiverseId\': 581918}, \'multiverseid\': 581918}, {\'name\': \'粉色惧妖\', \'text\': \'闪耀焰光～每当你施放瞬间或法术咒语时，粉色惧妖对任意一个目标造成2点伤害。\\n形体分裂～当粉色惧妖死去时，派出两个2/2，蓝红双色，名称为蓝色惧妖的恶魔／惊惧兽衍生生物，且具有「每当你施放瞬间或法术咒语时，此生物对任意一个目标造成1点伤害。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～恶魔／惊惧兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582238&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c8e2a0b-e916-4c91-b476-58af0fba8e99\', \'multiverseId\': 582238}, \'multiverseid\': 582238}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sanguiniuspriester\', \'text\': \'Lebensverknüpfung\\nBlutkelch — Immer wenn eine andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt, fügt der Sanguiniuspriester einem Ziel deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Astartes, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Begrüßt die Stärke eures Primarchen, aber widersteht dem Roten Durst, Brüder! Von diesem dunkelsten aller Wege gibt es kein Zurück."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581035&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54ebfdab-4ca8-4392-b974-6c52f1340c6c\', \'multiverseId\': 581035}, \'multiverseid\': 581035}, {\'name\': \'Sacerdote Sanguinario\', \'text\': \'Vínculo vital.\\nCáliz de Sangre — Siempre que otra criatura que controlas muera, el Sacerdote Sanguinario hace 1 punto de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo astartes\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Dejen que los inunde la fuerza del Primarca, pero cuídense de la Sed de Sangre, hermanos! Es un camino oscuro del que nunca se regresa".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fe9df1f-9e00-4f1d-970e-2a487e5aa31c\', \'multiverseId\': 581195}, \'multiverseid\': 581195}, {\'name\': \'Prêtre sanguinaire\', \'text\': "Lien de vie\\nCalice de sang — À chaque fois qu\'une autre créature que vous contrôlez meurt, le Prêtre sanguinaire inflige 1 blessure à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Créature : astartes et clerc\', \'flavor\': \'« Acceptez la force de votre Primarque, mais résistez à la Soif rouge, mes frères ! On ne revient pas de cette voie noire. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581355&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd1244df-0df1-4db8-8aa2-aa6c301d3a67\', \'multiverseId\': 581355}, \'multiverseid\': 581355}, {\'name\': \'Sacerdote Sanguinario\', \'text\': "Legame vitale\\nCalice del Sangue — Ogniqualvolta un\'altra creatura che controlli muore, il Sacerdote Sanguinario infligge 1 danno a un qualsiasi bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Astartes\', \'flavor\': \'"Abbracciate la forza del vostro Primarca, fratelli, ma rifiutate la Sete Rossa! Non vi è ritorno dal più oscuro dei sentieri."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581515&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4744ae28-7262-4335-9034-57acc3a0abf6\', \'multiverseId\': 581515}, \'multiverseid\': 581515}, {\'name\': \'サングィナリー・プリースト\', \'text\': \'絆魂\\n血の盃 — あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。サングィナリー・プリーストはそれに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — アスタルテス・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「同志よ、総主長の力を受け入れよ！そして紅き餓えに抗え！あの暗黒の道から生還することは不可能だ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581675&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d80cda12-421d-4b23-ad96-9e9d2c44b091\', \'multiverseId\': 581675}, \'multiverseid\': 581675}, {\'name\': \'Sacerdote Sanguinário\', \'text\': \'Vínculo com a vida\\nCálice de Sangue — Toda vez que outra criatura que você controla morre, Sacerdote Sanguinário causa 1 ponto de dano a qualquer alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Astartes Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'"Abracem a força de seu Primarca, mas recusem a Sede Vermelha, irmãos! Os caminhos mais sombrios não têm volta."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581835&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'584b6a1c-84ce-4b3e-a15c-6ce6d84c052e\', \'multiverseId\': 581835}, \'multiverseid\': 581835}, {\'name\': \'圣血祭司\', \'text\': \'系命\\n饮血圣杯～每当另一个由你操控的生物死去时，圣血祭司对任意一个目标造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～阿斯塔特／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'「兄弟们，你们大可自由运用原体之力，但请务必抵御红渴引诱！一旦踏上黑暗道途，便再无回头之路。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6403e10c-9ee3-46fd-9375-65b8b47047f7\', \'multiverseId\': 582155}, \'multiverseid\': 582155}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sautekh-Unsterblicher\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nElitetruppen — Der Sautekh-Unsterbliche kommt für jede Kreatur, die in diesem Zug gestorben ist, mit einer +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Necron\', \'flavor\': \'„Nichts räumt ein Schlachtfeld so gut auf wie eine Todesstoßrakete. Wartet. Bewegt sich da draußen was?"\\n—Kommandeur Zander At\\\'lan, 115. Tallarn Panzerregiment\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581036&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40d887d6-0530-456a-b1a9-eef2ca648cca\', \'multiverseId\': 581036}, \'multiverseid\': 581036}, {\'name\': \'Inmortal Sautekh\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nTropas de élite — El Inmortal Sautekh entra al campo de batalla con un contador +1/+1 sobre él por cada criatura que murió este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Necrón\', \'flavor\': \'"No hay nada como un misil Deathstrike para despejar el campo de batalla. Un momento. ¿Hay algo moviéndose ahí fuera?".\\n—Comandante Zander At\\\'lan, 115° Regimiento Blindado de Tallarn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581196&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e8461c1-27c8-4004-b2d6-526e03d61c5f\', \'multiverseId\': 581196}, \'multiverseid\': 581196}, {\'name\': \'Immortel Sautekh\', \'text\': "Flash\\nTroupes d\'élite — L\'Immortel Sautekh arrive sur le champ de bataille avec, sur lui, un marqueur +1/+1 pour chaque créature qui est morte ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : nécron\', \'flavor\': "« Rien ne nettoie un champ de bataille mieux qu\'un missile Deathstrike. Attendez. Il n\'y a pas quelque chose qui bouge ? »\\n—Commandant Zander At\'lan, 115e régiment blindé de Tallarn", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581356&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6903ca1a-48b4-4cf9-9eb2-bbf0fed4ce44\', \'multiverseId\': 581356}, \'multiverseid\': 581356}, {\'name\': \'Sautekh Immortale\', \'text\': "Lampo\\nTruppe d\'Élite — Il Sautekh Immortale entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1 per ogni creatura morta in questo turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Necron\', \'flavor\': \'"Niente ripulisce un campo di battaglia come un missile Giustiziere. Un momento... C\\\'è qualcosa che si muove là fuori?"\\n—Comandante Zander At\\\'lan, 115º reggimento corazzato di Tallarn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581516&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'382d5258-8ec9-41f5-8387-a0c4f1f41336\', \'multiverseId\': 581516}, \'multiverseid\': 581516}, {\'name\': \'ソーテク・イモータル\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n精鋭兵 — ソーテク・イモータルは、このターンに死亡したクリーチャー１体につき１個の＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ネクロン\', \'flavor\': \'「戦場の浄化力において、デスストライク・ミサイルに並ぶものはないな。待てよ。あそこで何かが動いていないか？」\\n――ザンダー・アト＝ラン司令官、第115タラーン機甲連隊\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581676&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff090144-a761-442c-b914-37edc2151eed\', \'multiverseId\': 581676}, \'multiverseid\': 581676}, {\'name\': \'Sautekh Imortal\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nTropas de Elite — Sautekh Imortal entra no campo de batalha com um marcador +1/+1 para cada criatura que morreu neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Necron\', \'flavor\': \'"Nada limpa um campo de batalha como um míssil de Ataque Mortal. Espera. Tem alguma coisa se mexendo ali?"\\n— Comandante Zander At\\\'lan, 115º Regimento de Blindados de Tallarn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581836&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9787b145-defd-4aae-b5b1-f926b66be827\', \'multiverseId\': 581836}, \'multiverseid\': 581836}, {\'name\': \'索泰克不朽者\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n精英部队～索泰克不朽者进战场时上面有数个+1/+1指示物，其数量等同于本回合中死去的生物数量。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～太空死灵\', \'flavor\': \'「清扫战场还是死亡打击导弹最好用。等等。那边是不是有什么动静？」\\n～詹德·阿塔兰团长，塔兰第115装甲团\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582156&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45a63ea0-58c0-4c2e-8d0d-c0d2c9380b93\', \'multiverseId\': 582156}, \'multiverseid\': 582156}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schatten im Warp\', \'text\': \'Der erste Kreaturenzauber, den du pro Zug wirkst, kostet beim Wirken {2} weniger.\\nImmer wenn ein Gegner in einem Zug zum ersten Mal einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch wirkt, fügt Schatten im Warp jenem Spieler 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Der Astropath sackte zusammen und seine leeren Augenhöhlen glühten. Er sprach zwei Worte, bevor er leblos zu Boden fiel: „Sie … kommen!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581122&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58db8cff-1d61-4268-b7ae-518e28b4350d\', \'multiverseId\': 581122}, \'multiverseid\': 581122}, {\'name\': \'Sombra de la disformidad\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {2} menos el primer hechizo de criatura que lances cada turno.\\nSiempre que un oponente lance su primer hechizo que no sea de criatura cada turno, la Sombra de la disformidad hace 2 puntos de daño a ese jugador.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'El astrópata se derrumbó y las cuencas vacías de sus ojos brillaron. Antes de caer al suelo muerto, pronunció tres palabras: "Ya... están... llegando.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581282&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4ac47ba-4109-4bf7-91ce-6383f784777f\', \'multiverseId\': 581282}, \'multiverseid\': 581282}, {\'name\': \'Ombre dans le Warp\', \'text\': "Le premier sort de créature que vous lancez à chaque tour coûte {2} de moins à lancer.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un adversaire lance son premier sort non-créature à chaque tour, l\'Ombre dans le Warp inflige 2 blessures à ce joueur.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "L\'astropathe s\'effondra, ses orbites vides brillant d\'une étrange lueur. Il articula deux mots avant de tomber au sol sans vie : « Ils... arrivent ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581442&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31370fd9-9020-4e57-9518-0d68da1188a6\', \'multiverseId\': 581442}, \'multiverseid\': 581442}, {\'name\': \'Ombra nel Warp\', \'text\': "La prima magia creatura che lanci in ogni turno costa {2} in meno per essere lanciata.\\nOgniqualvolta un avversario lancia la sua prima magia non creatura in ogni turno, l\'Ombra nel Warp infligge 2 danni a quel giocatore.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'L\\\'astropate crollò, con le orbite vuote ardenti. Proferì tre parole prima di cadere a terra senza vita: "Loro... stanno... arrivando!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581602&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ac6f98d-079b-485c-b7eb-f3ff61a0d1db\', \'multiverseId\': 581602}, \'multiverseid\': 581602}, {\'name\': \'歪みを侵食する影\', \'text\': \'各ターンであなたが最初に唱えるクリーチャー・呪文を唱えるためのコストは{2}少なくなる。\\n対戦相手１人が各ターンで自分の最初の、クリーチャーでない呪文を唱えるたび、歪みを侵食する影はそのプレイヤーに２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'空の眼窩の中から光を放ち、感応通信官は倒れた。彼は命尽きる寸前にこう言い放った。「奴らが……来る！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca08566f-153b-4ee4-8b76-64211b8185a6\', \'multiverseId\': 581762}, \'multiverseid\': 581762}, {\'name\': \'Sombra na Distorção\', \'text\': \'A primeira mágica de criatura que você conjura em cada turno custa {2} a menos para ser conjurada.\\nToda vez que um oponente conjura a própria primeira mágica não de criatura a cada turno, Sombra na Distorção causa 2 pontos de dano àquele jogador.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'O astropata entrou em colapso, as órbitas oculares vazias brilhando. Ele disse três palavras antes de ir ao chão: "Eles... estão... vindo!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581922&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2005d92c-dbe0-434d-a4d3-6d715c53d651\', \'multiverseId\': 581922}, \'multiverseid\': 581922}, {\'name\': \'亚空间阴影\', \'text\': \'你每回合施放的第一个生物咒语减少{2}来施放。\\n每当任一对手施放其每回合的第一个非生物咒语时，亚空间阴影对该牌手造成2点伤害。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'星语者轰然跌坐，眼神空洞但冒着幽光。他艰难地吐出六个字便倒毙在地：「他们…就要…来了！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582242&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54fdc0cc-b540-40ff-a991-733642bbc2b8\', \'multiverseId\': 582242}, \'multiverseid\': 582242}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schwerer Lokhusta-Destruktor\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nInimica-Exterminator — Wenn der Schwere Lokhusta-Destruktor ins Spiel kommt, opfert jeder Spieler eine Kreatur.\\nExhumieren {5}{B}{B}{B} ({5}{B}{B}{B}: Bringe diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Sie erhält Eile. Schicke sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments, oder falls sie das Spiel verlassen würde, ins Exil. Spiele Exhumieren wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Necron\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581020&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6e9769f-aee7-4e65-a53a-de3e37d0d465\', \'multiverseId\': 581020}, \'multiverseid\': 581020}, {\'name\': \'Destructor Pesado Lokhust\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nExterminador emítico — Cuando el Destructor Pesado Lokhust entre al campo de batalla, cada jugador sacrifica una criatura.\\nDesenterrar {5}{B}{B}{B}. ({5}{B}{B}{B}: Regresa esta carta de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Gana la habilidad de prisa. Exíliala al comienzo del próximo paso final o si fuera a dejar el campo de batalla. Activa la habilidad de desenterrar solo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Necrón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fe471e6-d53d-4f17-a49a-80babc8a31a5\', \'multiverseId\': 581180}, \'multiverseid\': 581180}, {\'name\': \'Destroyer lourd Lokhust\', \'text\': "Vol\\nExterminateur d\'hostiles — Quand le Destroyer lourd Lokhust arrive sur le champ de bataille, chaque joueur sacrifie une créature.\\nExhumation {5}{B}{B}{B} ({5}{B}{B}{B} : Renvoyez cette carte sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière. Elle acquiert la célérité. Exilez-la au début de la prochaine étape de fin ou si elle devait quitter le champ de bataille. N\'exhumez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : nécron\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581340&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56894b7e-c1d2-4d93-9219-8c4679c63c01\', \'multiverseId\': 581340}, \'multiverseid\': 581340}, {\'name\': \'Distruttore Pesante Lokhust\', \'text\': "Volare\\nSterminatore Ostile — Quando il Distruttore Pesante Lokhust entra nel campo di battaglia, ogni giocatore sacrifica una creatura.\\nDissotterrare {5}{B}{B}{B} ({5}{B}{B}{B}: Rimetti sul campo di battaglia questa carta dal tuo cimitero. Ha rapidità. Esiliala all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale o se sta per lasciare il campo di battaglia. Dissotterra solo come una stregoneria.)", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Necron\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581500&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9263e961-c9c9-4e45-961d-b1bc55d0034d\', \'multiverseId\': 581500}, \'multiverseid\': 581500}, {\'name\': \'ローカスト・ヘヴィ・デストロイヤー\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nエンミティック・エクスターミネイター — ローカスト・ヘヴィ・デストロイヤーが戦場に出たとき、各プレイヤーはそれぞれクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。\\n蘇生{5}{B}{B}{B}（{5}{B}{B}{B}：あなたの墓地にあるこのカードを戦場に戻す。これは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、またはこれが戦場を離れるなら、これを追放する。蘇生はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ネクロン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581660&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ce13d72-6635-4240-80ed-7c7136a47bf7\', \'multiverseId\': 581660}, \'multiverseid\': 581660}, {\'name\': \'Destruidor Pesado Lokhust\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nExterminador Inimítico — Quando Destruidor Pesado Lokhust entra no campo de batalha, cada jogador sacrifica uma criatura.\\nDesenterrar {5}{B}{B}{B} ({5}{B}{B}{B}: Devolva este card de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha. Ele ganha ímpeto. Exile-o no início da próxima etapa final ou se ele for deixar o campo de batalha. Use desenterrar somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Necron\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581820&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a05de8b-a6fb-42e2-959e-b331fab983ee\', \'multiverseId\': 581820}, \'multiverseid\': 581820}, {\'name\': \'洛克哈斯特重装毁灭者\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n冥能灭绝炮～当洛克哈斯特重装毁灭者进战场时，每位牌手各牺牲一个生物。\\n破坟{5}{B}{B}{B}（{5}{B}{B}{B}：将此牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。它获得敏捷异能。在下一个结束步骤开始时，或若它将离开战场，将它放逐。只能于法术时机破坟。）\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～太空死灵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1250a5f7-ee20-497b-a43f-dc14e01c273a\', \'multiverseId\': 582140}, \'multiverseid\': 582140}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schwester der Stille\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nPsionische Scheußlichkeit — Wenn die Schwester der Stille ins Spiel kommt, neutralisiere einen Spontanzauber, eine Hexerei, eine aktivierte Fähigkeit oder eine ausgelöste Fähigkeit deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581008&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b7efd2e-3a1e-48dc-88ed-a4e877b35b6f\', \'multiverseId\': 581008}, \'multiverseid\': 581008}, {\'name\': \'Hermana del Silencio\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nAbominación psíquica — Cuando la Hermana del Silencio entre al campo de batalla, contrarresta el hechizo de instantáneo, el hechizo de conjuro, la habilidad activada o la habilidad disparada objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'702132b7-cf79-4a0c-aeb6-d7e919412adf\', \'multiverseId\': 581168}, \'multiverseid\': 581168}, {\'name\': \'Sœur du Silence\', \'text\': "Flash\\nAbomination psychique — Quand la Sœur du Silence arrive sur le champ de bataille, contrecarrez une cible, sort d\'éphémère, sort de rituel, capacité activée ou capacité déclenchée.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581328&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2811626-1798-43ca-9a1e-e3c521244a11\', \'multiverseId\': 581328}, \'multiverseid\': 581328}, {\'name\': \'Sorella del Silenzio\', \'text\': "Lampo\\nAbominio Psichico — Quando la Sorella del Silenzio entra nel campo di battaglia, neutralizza una magia istantaneo, una magia stregoneria, un\'abilità attivata o un\'abilità innescata bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581488&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5758b5f9-bbc0-4e6b-910a-924f87c5f55c\', \'multiverseId\': 581488}, \'multiverseid\': 581488}, {\'name\': \'シスター・オヴ・サイレンス\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n異能滅却 — シスター・オヴ・サイレンスが戦場に出たとき、インスタント・呪文やソーサリー・呪文や起動型能力や誘発型能力のうち１つを対象とする。それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581648&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93f1fcd6-0b10-40db-ba16-fbe2087460d1\', \'multiverseId\': 581648}, \'multiverseid\': 581648}, {\'name\': \'Irmã do Silêncio\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nAbominação Psíquica — Quando Irmã do Silêncio entrar no campo de batalha, anule a mágica instantânea, o feitiço, a habilidade ativada ou a habilidade desencadeada alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581808&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'068aa534-0828-4b0d-8ca6-d8d96ce46e51\', \'multiverseId\': 581808}, \'multiverseid\': 581808}, {\'name\': \'寂静修女\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n灵能异变～当寂静修女进战场时，反击目标瞬间咒语，法术咒语，起动式异能或触发式异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／骑士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d90eab31-1b85-4ec9-97fc-b831f9a7525d\', \'multiverseId\': 582128}, \'multiverseid\': 582128}]', '[{\'name\': \'Scout der Space Marines\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag, Wachsamkeit\\nVerdeckte Position — Wenn der Scout der Space Marines ins Spiel kommt und falls ein Gegner mehr Länder kontrolliert als du, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Ebene-Karte durchsuchen, sie getappt ins Spiel bringen und danach mischen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Astartes, Späher\', \'flavor\': \'Durch Blut und Kampf werden Scouts von Grünschnäbeln zu den besten Kämpfern des Imperiums geformt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=580997&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff48745e-954e-42d8-bb1f-377a9f484c01\', \'multiverseId\': 580997}, \'multiverseid\': 580997}, {\'name\': \'Marine Espacial Explorador\', \'text\': \'Daña primero, vigilancia.\\nPosición oculta — Cuando el Marine Espacial Explorador entre al campo de batalla, si un oponente controla más tierras que tú, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de Llanura, ponerla en el campo de batalla girada y luego barajar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Explorador astartes\', \'flavor\': \'Con sangre, sudor y batallas, los exploradores pasan de ser reclutas novatos a los mejores efectivos del Imperium.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581157&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9ae75ff-2773-432e-bfec-57068805c93c\', \'multiverseId\': 581157}, \'multiverseid\': 581157}, {\'name\': \'Space Marine Scout\', \'text\': \'Initiative, vigilance\\nPositions cachées — Quand le Space Marine Scout arrive sur le champ de bataille, si un adversaire contrôle plus de terrains que vous, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de plaine, la mettre sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélanger.\', \'type\': \'Créature : astartes et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': "Les éclaireurs sont forgés dans le sang et les combats pour devenir les meilleures troupes de l\'Imperium.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581317&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5893a5e3-ae2d-4328-be55-943d228442d9\', \'multiverseId\': 581317}, \'multiverseid\': 581317}, {\'name\': \'Space Marine Esploratore\', \'text\': \'Attacco improvviso, cautela\\nPosizione Nascosta — Quando lo Space Marine Esploratore entra nel campo di battaglia, se un avversario controlla più terre di te, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Pianura, metterla sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescolare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Esploratore Astartes\', \'flavor\': "Attraverso il sangue e la battaglia, gli esploratori vengono forgiati da reclute inesperte nei migliori uomini dell\'Imperium.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581477&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abf5f410-54a5-457d-bfa6-97d4fea7077a\', \'multiverseId\': 581477}, \'multiverseid\': 581477}, {\'name\': \'スペースマリーン・スカウト\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃、警戒\\n配置地点秘匿 — スペースマリーン・スカウトが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手１人があなたよりも多くの土地をコントロールしている場合、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーから平地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — アスタルテス・スカウト\', \'flavor\': \'血と戦闘によって、スカウトはひ弱な新米兵から帝国の精鋭へと鍛え上げられる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581637&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0374a22a-0b43-4450-a91b-b9e357046d73\', \'multiverseId\': 581637}, \'multiverseid\': 581637}, {\'name\': \'Batedor Space Marine\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa, vigilância\\nPosição Oculta — Quando Batedor Space Marine entra no campo de batalha, se um oponente controla mais terrenos que você, você pode procurar em seu grimório um card de Planície, colocá-lo no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Astartes Batedor\', \'flavor\': \'É através do sangue e das batalhas que os batedores passam de recrutas crus a elite do Imperium.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581797&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cca89412-7b73-4831-8466-c8842bf03b1b\', \'multiverseId\': 581797}, \'multiverseid\': 581797}, {\'name\': \'星际战士侦察兵\', \'text\': \'先攻，警戒\\n隐密地点～当星际战士侦察兵进战场时，若某对手操控的地比你多，则你可以从你牌库中搜寻一张平原牌，将之横置放进战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～阿斯塔特／斥候\', \'flavor\': \'经过热血与战火的洗礼，侦察兵已从懵懂新员锤炼为帝国精锐。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b307543c-69e5-4066-9e0f-27c0949da41a\', \'multiverseId\': 582117}, \'multiverseid\': 582117}]', '[{\'name\': \'Scriptor-Epistolarius\', \'text\': \'Schleier der Zeit — Immer wenn der Scriptor-Epistolarius angreift, kannst du einen Zauberspruch mit Manabetrag X oder weniger aus deiner Hand wirken, ohne seine Manakosten zu bezahlen, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an angreifenden Kreaturen ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Astartes, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Bolter? Kettenschwerter? Das sind alles gute Waffen, aber ich verfüge über eine viel gefährlichere Macht."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581100&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'016e74cd-d069-48e1-9ff6-9efb04ccb8a3\', \'multiverseId\': 581100}, \'multiverseid\': 581100}, {\'name\': \'Bibliotecario Epistolario\', \'text\': \'Velo del tiempo — Siempre que el Bibliotecario Epistolario ataque, puedes lanzar un hechizo con valor de maná de X o menos desde tu mano sin pagar su coste de maná, donde X es la cantidad de criaturas atacantes.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero astartes\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Bólteres? ¿Espadas sierra? Son buenas armas, pero yo tengo un poder mucho más peligroso".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581260&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90fb43c7-8f4a-41ac-a682-2350e681f311\', \'multiverseId\': 581260}, \'multiverseid\': 581260}, {\'name\': \'Archiviste épistolier\', \'text\': "Voile du temps — À chaque fois que l\'Archiviste épistolier attaque, vous pouvez lancer un sort avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à X depuis votre main sans payer son coût de mana, X étant le nombre de créatures attaquantes.", \'type\': \'Créature : astartes et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'« Les bolters ? Les épées tronçonneuses ? Ce sont de bonnes armes, mais je manie une énergie bien plus dangereuse. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581420&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1ee660c-4e89-4b7e-b765-f117dd8af38c\', \'multiverseId\': 581420}, \'multiverseid\': 581420}, {\'name\': \'Bibliotecario Epistolario\', \'text\': \'Velo del Tempo — Ogniqualvolta il Bibliotecario Epistolario attacca, puoi lanciare una magia con valore di mana pari o inferiore a X dalla tua mano senza pagare il suo costo di mana, dove X è il numero di creature attaccanti.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Astartes\', \'flavor\': \'"Requiem? Spade a catena? Tutte armi eccellenti, tuttavia quello che brandisco io è un potere di gran lunga più pericoloso."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ed78779-9eab-4ff0-819f-948e9454588d\', \'multiverseId\': 581580}, \'multiverseid\': 581580}, {\'name\': \'書記官位階のライブラリアン\', \'text\': \'時のヴェール — 書記官位階のライブラリアンが攻撃するたび、あなたは、あなたの手札からマナ総量がＸ以下である呪文１つを、マナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。Ｘは攻撃クリーチャーの数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — アスタルテス・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「ボルター？ チェーンソード？ どれも良い武器だが、私の武器はそれらをはるかに凌駕する力を持っている。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581740&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be23631d-dfd3-4b7c-9dcd-fe10b6a890cf\', \'multiverseId\': 581740}, \'multiverseid\': 581740}, {\'name\': \'Bibliotecário Epistolário\', \'text\': \'Véu do Tempo — Toda vez que Bibliotecário Epistolário ataca, você pode conjurar uma mágica com valor de mana igual ou inferior a X de sua mão sem pagar seu custo de mana, sendo X o número de criaturas atacantes.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Astartes Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Metrancas? Motoespadas? Armas ótimas, todas elas, mas eu empunho um poder muito mais ameaçador."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581900&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8c0dd74-f806-4140-ad95-ffb2d37d6548\', \'multiverseId\': 581900}, \'multiverseid\': 581900}, {\'name\': \'智库编修长\', \'text\': \'时光帷幕～每当智库编修长攻击时，你可以从你手上施放一个法术力值等于或小于X的咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用，X为进行攻击的生物数量。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～阿斯塔特／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「爆矢枪？链锯剑？这些武器都不错，但我的力量更危险。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582220&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4dae7f34-5c3e-49de-bae7-870be854380f\', \'multiverseId\': 582220}, \'multiverseid\': 582220}]', '[{\'name\': \'Seuchendrohne\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nFäulnisfliege — Falls ein Gegner Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten würde, verliert er stattdessen entsprechend viele Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': \'Hochrangige Seuchenhüter aus dem Reich von Nurgle reiten auf Fäulnisfliegen in den Realraum — kolossalen dämonischen Insekten, deren Aussehen so abstoßend ist, dass man bei ihrem Anblick den Verstand verliert.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581029&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9d91df1-97c3-4516-ab13-11d06293a42e\', \'multiverseId\': 581029}, \'multiverseid\': 581029}, {\'name\': \'Plague Drone\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nMosca de putrefacción — Si un oponente fuera a ganar vidas, en vez de eso, ese jugador pierde esa misma cantidad de vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio\', \'flavor\': \'Los portadores de plaga de alto rango del reino de Nurgle se adentran en el espacio real sobre Moscas de putrefacción, colosales insectos daemónicos con una apariencia tan repugnante que horroriza a quien llega a verlos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581189&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35add074-01ae-451a-b6f0-10f658b91425\', \'multiverseId\': 581189}, \'multiverseid\': 581189}, {\'name\': \'Plague Drone\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nMouche à peste — Si un adversaire devait gagner des points de vie, ce joueur perd autant de points de vie à la place.\', \'type\': \'Créature : démon\', \'flavor\': "Les portepestes de haut rang du royaume de Nurgle chargent dans l\'espace réel montés sur des mouches à peste, des insectes démoniaques colossaux dont l\'apparence est si répugnante qu\'elle endommage l\'esprit.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581349&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92917a8e-d470-4a52-a332-968484160a9c\', \'multiverseId\': 581349}, \'multiverseid\': 581349}, {\'name\': \'Plague Drone\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nMosca della Peste — Se un avversario sta per guadagnare punti vita, quel giocatore perde invece altrettanti punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone\', \'flavor\': \'Gli untori di alto rango del regno di Nurgle cavalcano nello spazio in sella alle mosche della peste, giganteschi insetti demoniaci il cui aspetto è così ripugnante da sfigurare la mente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581509&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff8b9acf-2eaa-4f12-9e48-e2b86b3a2ef5\', \'multiverseId\': 581509}, \'multiverseid\': 581509}, {\'name\': \'プレーグ・ドローン\', \'text\': \'飛行,\\nロット・フライ — 対戦相手１人がライフを得るなら、代わりにそのプレイヤーはその点数に等しいライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン\', \'flavor\': \'ナーグルの領域の高位のプレーグベアラーは、心に傷を負うほど醜い巨大ディーモン蟲、ロット・フライに乗って物質界に乗り込む。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581669&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b7b373a-80e6-4479-b462-28119425df19\', \'multiverseId\': 581669}, \'multiverseid\': 581669}, {\'name\': \'Plague Drone\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nMosca da Podridão — Se um oponente ganharia pontos de vida, em vez disso, aquele jogador perde aquela quantidade de pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demônio\', \'flavor\': \'Os porta-pestes de alto escalão do reino de Nurgle entram no espaço real montados em Moscas da Podridão, gigantescos insetos daemoníacos tão repugnantes que chegam a causar traumas mentais.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581829&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a907de8-4ce0-43b4-8678-7313eb6a4b85\', \'multiverseId\': 581829}, \'multiverseid\': 581829}, {\'name\': \'瘟疫蜂兵\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n腐蝇～如果某对手将获得生命，则改为该牌手失去等量的生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～恶魔\', \'flavor\': \'纳垢领域的高阶瘟疫行者会骑着腐蝇闯入实体宇宙～这种庞巨魔虫外貌极丑，甚至能给心灵留下创伤。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582149&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1704d42-08ea-45db-82c5-86d39a35330f\', \'multiverseId\': 582149}, \'multiverseid\': 582149}]', '[{\'name\': \'Seuchengranate\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\\nAlle Kreaturen erhalten -3/-3 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Seuchengranaten — die verheerenden Schaden an ihren Opfern anrichten — haben keine Auswirkungen auf die Death Guard, die sie gerne im Nahkampf gegen ihre Feinde einsetzen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581013&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c16d6e1b-ef50-45a9-a563-a4fb5b9429ee\', \'multiverseId\': 581013}, \'multiverseid\': 581013}, {\'name\': \'Granada de plaga\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo.\\nTodas las criaturas obtienen -3/-3 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Las granadas de plaga, que provocan efectos horripilantes a sus víctimas, no afectan a la Guardia de la Muerte, que no duda en usarlas a muy poca distancia de sus enemigos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2a8b9ec-25f2-436a-a941-55eb911f3107\', \'multiverseId\': 581173}, \'multiverseid\': 581173}, {\'name\': \'Grenade bubonique\', \'text\': "Détruisez une créature ciblée.\\nToutes les créatures gagnent -3/-3 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Les grenades buboniques (qui ont des effets horribles sur leurs victimes) n\'ont aucun impact sur la Death Guard, qui utilise sans hésiter les appareils en contact extrêmement rapproché avec l\'ennemi.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581333&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31fd7ba6-292f-4427-b611-a6a24817124c\', \'multiverseId\': 581333}, \'multiverseid\': 581333}, {\'name\': \'Granata del Contagio\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio.\\nTutte le creature prendono -3/-3 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Le granate del contagio inducono effetti orribili sulle loro vittime, ma non hanno alcun impatto sulla Death Guard, che le usa senza remore nei combattimenti a distanza ravvicinata con il nemico.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581493&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ddc29c0c-0fcd-4384-bc6a-13ef738609ca\', \'multiverseId\': 581493}, \'multiverseid\': 581493}, {\'name\': \'ブライトグレネード\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。\\nターン終了時まで、すべてのクリーチャーは－３/－３の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'被害者におぞましい症状を引き起こすブライトグレネードはデスガードに何の効果もないため、至近距離で敵に投擲することをためらわない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581653&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'751a540b-12e1-4630-9c08-b5edc49c61a3\', \'multiverseId\': 581653}, \'multiverseid\': 581653}, {\'name\': \'Granada de Praga\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura alvo.\\nTodas as criaturas recebem -3/-3 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'As granadas de praga, que causam efeitos horrendos nas vítimas, não têm nenhum impacto na Guarda da Morte, que as usa tranquilamente no copo a corpo com o inimigo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581813&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'001b3d49-b07d-4ff5-a297-099fabda0b19\', \'multiverseId\': 581813}, \'multiverseid\': 581813}, {\'name\': \'枯萎手雷\', \'text\': \'消灭目标生物。\\n所有生物得-3/-3直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'枯萎手雷爆炸后会对范围内人员造成恐怖损害，而死亡守卫却能毫发无伤～因而他们在与敌人近距肉搏时也乐于使用这种武器。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582133&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abebd942-6658-48a7-8a74-5f0db9bb3cb1\', \'multiverseId\': 582133}, \'multiverseid\': 582133}]', "[{'name': 'Seuchenwandler', 'text': 'Todesberührung\\nFluch der Wanderpocken — Immer wenn du einen Zauberspruch von irgendwoher außer deiner Hand wirkst, bringe die Seuchenwandler aus deinem Friedhof getappt ins Spiel zurück.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Zombie', 'flavor': 'Seuchenwandler sind Opfer der wandelnden Pocken, einer grausamen Seuche, die die Infizierten zu Tode verwest, sie aber bei Bewusstsein hält.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581031&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5decda53-d51e-411e-ad8c-3ccea9c8d5cd', 'multiverseId': 581031}, 'multiverseid': 581031}, {'name': 'Plagabundos', 'text': 'Toque mortal.\\nMaldición de la Viruela Caminante — Siempre que lances un hechizo desde cualquier parte excepto desde tu mano, regresa a los Plagabundos desde tu cementerio al campo de batalla girados.', 'type': 'Criatura — Zombie', 'flavor': 'Los Plagabundos son víctimas de la Viruela Caminante, una cruel afección que hace que los infectados, conscientes en todo momento, se pudran hasta morir.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581191&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ea4a450e-6423-47c6-bbbb-0765b0e737a4', 'multiverseId': 581191}, 'multiverseid': 581191}, {'name': 'Scrofuleux', 'text': 'Contact mortel\\nMalédiction de la vérole ambulante — À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort depuis autre part que votre main, renvoyez les Scrofuleux sur le champ de bataille, engagés, depuis votre cimetière.', 'type': 'Créature : zombie', 'flavor': 'Les scrofuleux sont les victimes de la vérole ambulante, une virulence cruelle qui décompose les infectés à mort tout en les maintenant conscients.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581351&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0fceba0f-4fe8-452f-b21e-6c9d2b6d3945', 'multiverseId': 581351}, 'multiverseid': 581351}, {'name': 'Pestevaganti', 'text': 'Tocco letale\\nAfflizione della Peste Vagante — Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia da una zona diversa dalla tua mano, rimetti sul campo di battaglia TAPpati i Pestevaganti dal tuo cimitero.', 'type': 'Creatura — Zombie', 'flavor': 'I pestevaganti sono vittime della peste vagante, un virus crudele che fa marcire gli infetti fino alla morte mantenendoli coscienti.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581511&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '69815404-2065-410a-9bae-1bbf739f6008', 'multiverseId': 581511}, 'multiverseid': 581511}, {'name': 'ポクスウォーカー', 'text': '接死\\n歩き膿疱の呪い — あなたがあなたの手札以外から呪文を唱えるたび、あなたの墓地にあるポクスウォーカーをタップ状態で戦場に戻す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゾンビ', 'flavor': 'ポクスウォーカーは、感染者の意識を残したまま腐敗させ死に至らしめる残酷な病原菌歩き膿疱の被害者である。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581671&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '80f0caf9-08a9-4181-be3c-a70e918f3b59', 'multiverseId': 581671}, 'multiverseid': 581671}, {'name': 'Pustâmbulos', 'text': 'Toque mortífero\\nMaldição da Pústula Ambulante — Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica de qualquer lugar além de sua mão, devolva Pustâmbulos de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha virado.', 'type': 'Criatura — Zumbi', 'flavor': 'Os pustâmbulos são vítimas da Pústula Ambulante, uma doença cruel que faz com que os infectados apodreçam até morrer, mas conscientes.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581831&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ab3b1c2b-2bad-430c-a6bc-f6c98b3b313d', 'multiverseId': 581831}, 'multiverseid': 581831}, {'name': '瘟疫行尸', 'text': '死触\\n致疫诅咒～每当你从你手牌以外的任何区域施放咒语时，将瘟疫行尸从你的坟墓场横置移回战场。', 'type': '生物 ～灵俑', 'flavor': '行尸瘟疫这种残忍病毒会令感染者在神智清醒的情况下眼睁睁地看着自己的躯体逐渐腐烂，直至死亡；而病殁者便转化为瘟疫行尸。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582151&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '40cea7ee-282a-44fe-adb1-f0db87318c9a', 'multiverseId': 582151}, 'multiverseid': 582151}]", '[{\'name\': \'Sicarian Infiltrator\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nTrupp {2} (Als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken, kannst du beliebig oft {2} bezahlen. Wenn diese Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge entsprechend viele Spielsteine, die Kopien von ihr sind.)\\nSegnung des Omnissiah — Wenn der Sicarian Infiltrator ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581007&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6c80692-643d-4022-9f15-bbbbf0065681\', \'multiverseId\': 581007}, \'multiverseid\': 581007}, {\'name\': \'Infiltrador Sicariano\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nEscuadra {2}. (Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, puedes pagar {2} tantas veces como quieras. Cuando esta criatura entre al campo de batalla, crea esa cantidad de fichas que son copias de ella.)\\nBendición del Omnissiah — Cuando el Infiltrador Sicariano entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc7b64ed-7799-413c-834e-e946662964ac\', \'multiverseId\': 581167}, \'multiverseid\': 581167}, {\'name\': \'Infiltrateur sicarian\', \'text\': "Flash\\nEscouade {2} (En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, vous pouvez payer {2} autant de fois que vous le souhaitez. Quand cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez autant de jetons qui en sont des copies.)\\nBénédiction de l\'Omnimessie — Quand l\'Infiltrateur sicarian arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581327&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5a763c5-c434-46af-b503-ab82f3289a75\', \'multiverseId\': 581327}, \'multiverseid\': 581327}, {\'name\': \'Sicarian Infiltratore\', \'text\': "Lampo\\nSquadra {2} (Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, puoi pagare {2} un qualsiasi numero di volte. Quando questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia, crea altrettante pedine che sono sue copie.)\\nBenedizione dell\'Omnissiah — Quando il Sicarian Infiltratore entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581487&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ff39095-8b7a-442a-b234-ba60a84013eb\', \'multiverseId\': 581487}, \'multiverseid\': 581487}, {\'name\': \'シカリアン・インフィルトレイター\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n分隊{2}（この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、あなたは望む回数の{2}を支払ってもよい。このクリーチャーが戦場に出たとき、その回数に等しい数の、これのコピーであるトークンを生成する。）\\n万機神の祈祷 — シカリアン・インフィルトレイターが戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581647&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'366678d6-4d4f-4936-aa51-f84c42d3b2a3\', \'multiverseId\': 581647}, \'multiverseid\': 581647}, {\'name\': \'Infiltrado Sicarian\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nEsquadrão {2} (Como custo adicional para conjurar esta mágica, você pode pagar {2} qualquer número de vezes. Quando esta criatura entrar no campo de batalha, crie aquela quantidade de fichas que sejam cópias dela.)\\nBendição do Onissias — Quando Infiltrado Sicarian entrar no campo de batalha, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8365f572-1043-420a-9bef-9206429b1837\', \'multiverseId\': 581807}, \'multiverseid\': 581807}, {\'name\': \'斯卡里安渗透者\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n小队{2}（你可以支付{2}任意次数，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。当此生物进战场时，派出等量为其复制品的衍生物。）\\n机械神的祝福～当斯卡里安渗透者进战场时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd75ead9-5933-4ce8-b84a-822415a25dfa\', \'multiverseId\': 582127}, \'multiverseid\': 582127}]', '[{\'name\': \'Skorpekh-Destruktor\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung\\nHyperphasendrescher — Immer wenn ein Artefakt unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhält der Skorpekh-Destruktor Erstschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Necron\', \'flavor\': \'Nichts kann den fest verdrahteten Wunsch zu töten außer Kraft setzen, der diese von Wut getriebenen Necrons antreibt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581039&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'710abeb8-b862-40d2-8ddd-20f17ada34d0\', \'multiverseId\': 581039}, \'multiverseid\': 581039}, {\'name\': \'Destructor Skorpekh\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal.\\nTrilladoras de hiperfase — Siempre que un artefacto entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, el Destructor Skorpekh gana la habilidad de dañar primero hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Necrón\', \'flavor\': \'Nada puede anular la sed de sangre instintiva que mueve a estos Necrones consumidos por la rabia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581199&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c41c8fc0-8436-41eb-b5f9-9c0277558305\', \'multiverseId\': 581199}, \'multiverseid\': 581199}, {\'name\': \'Destroyer Skorpekh\', \'text\': "Contact mortel\\nFauchons d\'hyperphase — À chaque fois qu\'un artefact arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, le Destroyer Skorpekh acquiert l\'initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : nécron\', \'flavor\': \'Rien ne peut supplanter le désir inné de tuer qui motive ces Nécrons enragés.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581359&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2a5d2ee-0fcf-4582-b36a-7a11e80232f7\', \'multiverseId\': 581359}, \'multiverseid\': 581359}, {\'name\': \'Distruttore Skorpekh\', \'text\': \'Tocco letale\\nFalcetti Iperfasici — Ogniqualvolta un artefatto entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, il Distruttore Skorpekh ha attacco improvviso fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Necron\', \'flavor\': \'Niente può sovrastare il desiderio congenito di uccidere che alimenta la furia di questi Necron.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da35a330-9800-400c-b6dc-875d532287c9\', \'multiverseId\': 581519}, \'multiverseid\': 581519}, {\'name\': \'スコーペク・デストロイヤー\', \'text\': \'接死\\nハイパーフェイズ・スレッシャー — アーティファクト１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、スコーペク・デストロイヤーは先制攻撃を得る。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ネクロン\', \'flavor\': \'怒りを原動力とするネクロンを力づける生粋の殺戮願望を抑制できるものなどない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581679&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a41df2bf-1173-4d0b-9e13-f1beb7d59d45\', \'multiverseId\': 581679}, \'multiverseid\': 581679}, {\'name\': \'Destruidor Skorpekh\', \'text\': \'Toque mortífero\\nDebulhadores Hiperfásicos — Toda vez que um artefato entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, Destruidor Skorpekh ganha iniciativa até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Necron\', \'flavor\': \'Nada é capaz de sobrepujar o desejo de matar que dá força aos necrons motivados pela fúria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581839&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'436af273-9a78-46a2-8fe3-3ba9760f3d89\', \'multiverseId\': 581839}, \'multiverseid\': 581839}, {\'name\': \'斯科尔比克毁灭者\', \'text\': \'死触\\n高相位斧～每当一个神器在你的操控下进战场时，斯科尔比克毁灭者获得先攻异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～太空死灵\', \'flavor\': \'这些受愤怒驱使的太空死灵动力来自固有杀戮欲望，任何事物都不能抹消此等天性。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582159&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb1d085b-27d7-4b2d-9a1a-5c4cf8214117\', \'multiverseId\': 582159}, \'multiverseid\': 582159}]', '[{\'name\': \'Skorpekh-Lord\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich\\nKommandoprotokolle — Andere Artefaktkreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+0 und haben Bedrohlichkeit.\\nExhumieren {2}{B} ({2}{B}: Bringe diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Sie erhält Eile. Schicke sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments, oder falls sie das Spiel verlassen würde, ins Exil. Spiele Exhumieren wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Necron, Adliger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581040&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48527608-4739-4c89-9c03-a61536f3acc8\', \'multiverseId\': 581040}, \'multiverseid\': 581040}, {\'name\': \'Señor Skorpekh\', \'text\': \'Amenaza.\\nProtocolos de mando — Las otras criaturas artefacto que controlas obtienen +1/+0 y tienen la habilidad de amenaza.\\nDesenterrar {2}{B}. ({2}{B}: Regresa esta carta de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Gana la habilidad de prisa. Exíliala al comienzo del próximo paso final o si fuera a dejar el campo de batalla. Activa la habilidad de desenterrar solo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Noble necrón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581200&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47e1851e-45b1-41a1-809b-f6a7b045aecd\', \'multiverseId\': 581200}, \'multiverseid\': 581200}, {\'name\': \'Seigneur Skorpekh\', \'text\': "Menace\\nProtocoles de commandement — Les autres créatures-artefacts que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+0 et ont la menace.\\nExhumation {2}{B} ({2}{B} : Renvoyez cette carte sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière. Elle acquiert la célérité. Exilez-la au début de la prochaine étape de fin ou si elle devait quitter le champ de bataille. N\'exhumez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : nécron et noble\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581360&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d81ad9b4-37d0-476a-93a5-751db973d1e1\', \'multiverseId\': 581360}, \'multiverseid\': 581360}, {\'name\': \'Tiranno Skorpekh\', \'text\': "Minacciare\\nProtocolli di Comando — Le altre creature artefatto che controlli prendono +1/+0 e hanno minacciare.\\nDissotterrare {2}{B} ({2}{B}: Rimetti sul campo di battaglia questa carta dal tuo cimitero. Ha rapidità. Esiliala all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale o se sta per lasciare il campo di battaglia. Dissotterra solo come una stregoneria.)", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Nobile Necron\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581520&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23670297-d2c0-48b5-910d-ee77f0b95d09\', \'multiverseId\': 581520}, \'multiverseid\': 581520}, {\'name\': \'スコーペク・ロード\', \'text\': \'威迫\\n指揮プロトコル — あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのアーティファクト・クリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受け威迫を持つ。\\n蘇生{2}{B}（{2}{B}：あなたの墓地にあるこのカードを戦場に戻す。これは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、またはこれが戦場を離れるなら、これを追放する。蘇生はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ネクロン・貴族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581680&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6ba8d96-64e0-4fed-abbb-92b6d12215e8\', \'multiverseId\': 581680}, \'multiverseid\': 581680}, {\'name\': \'Senhor Skorpekh\', \'text\': \'Ameaçar\\nProtocolos de Comando — As outras criaturas artefato que você controla recebem +1/+0 e têm ameaçar.\\nDesenterrar {2}{B} ({2}{B}: Devolva este card de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha. Ele ganha ímpeto. Exile-o no início da próxima etapa final ou se ele for deixar o campo de batalha. Use desenterrar somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Necron Nobre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581840&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2160a2c0-c266-4c64-86ec-8fc54dfec62d\', \'multiverseId\': 581840}, \'multiverseid\': 581840}, {\'name\': \'斯科尔比克领主\', \'text\': \'威慑\\n指挥程序～由你操控的其他神器生物得+1/+0且具有威慑异能。\\n破坟{2}{B}（{2}{B}：将此牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。它获得敏捷异能。在下一个结束步骤开始时，或若它将离开战场，将它放逐。只能于法术时机破坟。）\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～太空死灵／贵族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582160&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c262064a-88a5-4e29-b715-10c9f293a6ec\', \'multiverseId\': 582160}, \'multiverseid\': 582160}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sloppity Bilepiper\', \'text\': \'Fröhlicher Dudelsack — {2}, {T}, opfere eine Kreatur: Der nächste Kreaturenzauber, den du in diesem Zug wirkst, hat Kaskade. (Wenn du deinen nächsten Kreaturenzauber wirkst, schicke Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis du eine Nichtland-Karte ins Exil schickst, die weniger kostet. Du kannst sie wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Lege die so ins Exil geschickten Karten in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581041&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b54c82a6-ad16-4217-ad49-43cfd89e34bd\', \'multiverseId\': 581041}, \'multiverseid\': 581041}, {\'name\': \'Sloppity Bilepiper\', \'text\': \'Gaita de vejiga — {2}, {T}, sacrificar una criatura: El próximo hechizo de criatura que lances este turno tiene la habilidad de cascada. (Cuando lances tu próximo hechizo de criatura, exilia cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca hasta que exilies una carta que no sea tierra y que cueste menos. Puedes lanzarla sin pagar su coste de maná. Pon las cartas exiliadas en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581201&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f0f4e2f-c2ff-4310-ba43-15c2ace540a2\', \'multiverseId\': 581201}, \'multiverseid\': 581201}, {\'name\': \'Sloppity Bilepiper\', \'text\': "Cornepanse entraînante — {2}, {T}, sacrifiez une créature : Le prochain sort de créature que vous lancez ce tour-ci a la cascade. (Quand vous lancez votre prochain sort de créature, exilez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous exiliez une carte non-terrain d\'un coût inférieur. Vous pouvez la lancer sans payer son coût de mana. Mettez les cartes exilées au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.)", \'type\': \'Créature : démon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581361&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95bfde49-c5c4-4926-8e02-4b879e8b7b02\', \'multiverseId\': 581361}, \'multiverseid\': 581361}, {\'name\': \'Sloppity Bilepiper\', \'text\': \'Garruli Flauti Intestinali — {2}, {T}, Sacrifica una creatura: La prossima magia creatura che lanci in questo turno ha cascata. (Quando lanci la tua prossima magia creatura, esilia carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non esili una carta non terra che costa meno. Puoi lanciarla senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Metti le carte esiliate in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581521&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eacfedc8-00cb-4aa8-b2e4-e217d4821f30\', \'multiverseId\': 581521}, \'multiverseid\': 581521}, {\'name\': \'スロッピティ・バイルパイパー\', \'text\': \'愉快なはらわたのパイプ — {2},{T},クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：このターンにあなたが唱える次のクリーチャー・呪文は続唱を持つ。（あなたが次のあなたのクリーチャー・呪文を唱えたとき、コストがこれより低く土地でないカード１枚が追放されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ追放していく。あなたはそれをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。追放したカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65efca67-b46d-4c0c-873c-a0da07d78250\', \'multiverseId\': 581681}, \'multiverseid\': 581681}, {\'name\': \'Sloppity Bilepiper\', \'text\': \'Gástria da Alegria — {2}, {T}, sacrifique uma criatura: A próxima mágica de criatura que você conjurar neste turno terá cascata. (Quando você conjurar sua próxima mágica de criatura, exile cards do topo de seu grimório até exilar um card não de terreno de custo inferior. Você pode conjurá-lo sem pagar seu custo de mana. Coloque os cards exilados no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demônio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581841&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cc8fca4-fedd-4f21-b4b9-2ba0274f40c3\', \'multiverseId\': 581841}, \'multiverseid\': 581841}, {\'name\': \'雀跃乐手\', \'text\': \'逗趣肠管～{2}，{T}，牺牲一个生物：你本回合中施放的下一个生物咒语具有倾曳异能。（当你施放你的下一个生物咒语时，从你的牌库顶开始放逐牌，直到放逐一张费用比该咒语低的非地牌为止。你可以施放该牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。将所放逐的牌以随机顺序置于你牌库底。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～恶魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'205e76e6-1ab5-4965-8ab1-771884811d8f\', \'multiverseId\': 582161}, \'multiverseid\': 582161}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sonanzmarine\', \'text\': \'Kaskade (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, schicke Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis du eine Nichtland-Karte ins Exil schickst, die weniger kostet. Du kannst sie wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Lege die so ins Exil geschickten Karten in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.)\\nSonic Blaster — Wenn der Sonanzmarine ins Spiel kommt, fügt er einem Ziel deiner Wahl so viele Schadenspunkte zu, wie du in diesem Zug Zaubersprüche gewirkt hast.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Astartes, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581064&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c78656a1-7c7b-4737-98a1-803ecaa0e57c\', \'multiverseId\': 581064}, \'multiverseid\': 581064}, {\'name\': \'Marine Ruidoso\', \'text\': \'Cascada. (Cuando lances este hechizo, exilia cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca hasta que exilies una carta que no sea tierra y que cueste menos. Puedes lanzarla sin pagar su coste de maná. Pon las cartas exiliadas en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.)\\nDestructor sónico — Cuando el Marine Ruidoso entre al campo de batalla, hace una cantidad de daño a cualquier objetivo igual a la cantidad de hechizos que lanzaste este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero astartes\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c075b976-b8ad-4abe-beba-33bab2f634d7\', \'multiverseId\': 581224}, \'multiverseid\': 581224}, {\'name\': \'Marine du Vacarme\', \'text\': "Cascade (Quand vous lancez ce sort, exilez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous exiliez une carte non-terrain d\'un coût inférieur. Vous pouvez la lancer sans payer son coût de mana. Mettez les cartes exilées au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.)\\nÉclateur sonique — Quand le Marine du Vacarme arrive sur le champ de bataille, il inflige un nombre de blessures égal au nombre de sorts que vous avez lancés ce tour-ci à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Créature : astartes et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581384&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ada4e1f5-a696-49a4-b307-c71dbebdcb1b\', \'multiverseId\': 581384}, \'multiverseid\': 581384}, {\'name\': \'Noise Marine\', \'text\': \'Cascata (Quando lanci questa magia, esilia carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non esili una carta non terra che costa meno. Puoi lanciarla senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Metti le carte esiliate in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.)\\nFucile Sonico — Quando il Noise Marine entra nel campo di battaglia, infligge a un qualsiasi bersaglio danno pari al numero di magie che hai lanciato in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Astartes\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f346159a-ef7d-4d3b-9d05-f40c277a1d6e\', \'multiverseId\': 581544}, \'multiverseid\': 581544}, {\'name\': \'ノイズマリーン\', \'text\': \'続唱（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、コストがこれより低く土地でないカード１枚が追放されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ追放していく。あなたはそれをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。追放したカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。）\\nソニックブラスター — ノイズマリーンが戦場に出たとき、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。これはそれに、このターンにあなたが唱えた呪文の数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — アスタルテス・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581704&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46d7a15b-747b-4fbf-abe0-e895912bd2b1\', \'multiverseId\': 581704}, \'multiverseid\': 581704}, {\'name\': \'Noise Marine\', \'text\': \'Cascata (Quando conjurar esta mágica, exile cards do topo de seu grimório até exilar um não de terreno com custo inferior. Você pode conjurá-lo sem pagar seu custo de mana. Coloque os cards exilados no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.)\\nDestruidor Sônico — Quando Noise Marine entra no campo de batalha, ele causa dano igual ao número de mágicas que você conjurou neste turno a qualquer alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Astartes Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581864&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c5edcc9-beeb-418b-9348-995fd0ee6513\', \'multiverseId\': 581864}, \'multiverseid\': 581864}, {\'name\': \'噪音战士\', \'text\': \'倾曳（当你施放此咒语时，从你的牌库顶开始放逐牌，直到放逐一张费用比此咒语低的非地牌为止。你可以施放该牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。将所放逐的牌以随机顺序置于你牌库底。）\\n音波爆击枪～当噪音战士进战场时，它对任意一个目标造成伤害，其数量等同于你本回合中施放过的咒语数量。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～阿斯塔特／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582184&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf59fbe7-7905-422e-95f7-dccf2ce1db82\', \'multiverseId\': 582184}, \'multiverseid\': 582184}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sororita Hospitalis\', \'text\': \'Medicus Ministorum — Wenn die Sororita Hospitalis ins Spiel kommt, bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Du erhältst Lebenspunkte in Höhe ihres Manabetrags dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Unsere Aufgabe ist es, die Märtyrer zu ehren, die Gefallenen zu betreuen, die Unschuldigen zu verteidigen und immer im Licht zu wandeln." —*Das Stundenbuch der Hospitaler*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581123&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d3e0570-23ba-4099-a424-48104de35713\', \'multiverseId\': 581123}, \'multiverseid\': 581123}, {\'name\': \'Hermana Hospitalaria\', \'text\': \'Medicus Ministorum — Cuando la Hermana Hospitalaria entre al campo de batalla, regresa la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Ganas una cantidad de vidas igual a su valor de maná.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Es nuestro cometido honrar a los mártires, cuidar de los caídos, defender a los inocentes y recorrer siempre el sendero de la luz". —*El Libro de las Horas de las Hospitalarias*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581283&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f8e694a-7712-4770-9e79-7422a8fd7a8c\', \'multiverseId\': 581283}, \'multiverseid\': 581283}, {\'name\': \'Sœur hospitalière\', \'text\': \'Medicus Ministorum — Quand la Sœur hospitalière arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière sur le champ de bataille. Vous gagnez un nombre de points de vie égal à sa valeur de mana.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': "« Il nous appartient d\'honorer le martyr, de panser le blessé, de défendre l\'innocent et de toujours marcher dans la lumière. » —*Le Livre d\'heures des Hospitalières*", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581443&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c4a379f-96dd-4ef2-a176-fd11d50350b8\', \'multiverseId\': 581443}, \'multiverseid\': 581443}, {\'name\': \'Sorella Hospitaller\', \'text\': \'Medicus Ministorum — Quando la Sorella Hospitaller entra nel campo di battaglia, rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero. Guadagni punti vita pari al suo valore di mana.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"I nostri precetti prevedono di onorare il martire, curare i caduti, difendere gli innocenti e camminare sempre nella luce." —*Il Libro delle Ore di Hospitaller*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9392e3d1-18f8-4080-86f9-ab18daa13a70\', \'multiverseId\': 581603}, \'multiverseid\': 581603}, {\'name\': \'シスター・ホスピタラー\', \'text\': \'宗務局医療聖具 — シスター・ホスピタラーが戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それを戦場に戻す。あなたはそれのマナ総量に等しい点数のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「私達は、殉死者を貴び、墜ちた者を手当てし、無辜の者を守り、常に光の道を歩むことを誓います。」――*医療修道女の時祷書*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581763&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa4fb1b1-4ed3-42c7-ae48-7b7efb555961\', \'multiverseId\': 581763}, \'multiverseid\': 581763}, {\'name\': \'Irmã Hospitaleira\', \'text\': \'Medicus Ministorum — Quando Irmã Hospitaleira entrar no campo de batalha, devolva o card de criatura alvo de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha. Você ganha uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual ao valor de mana dele.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'"Honramos os mártires, cuidamos dos que tombaram, defendemos os inocentes e caminhamos sempre na luz." — *O Livro das Horas das Hospitaleiras*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581923&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0de31844-10db-4c11-bea6-383577a59ddc\', \'multiverseId\': 581923}, \'multiverseid\': 581923}, {\'name\': \'医疗修女\', \'text\': \'国教施治～当医疗修女进战场时，将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。你获得等同于其法术力值的生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'「吾人应追思逝者，照顾伤者，守护无辜之人，行于明光之下。」～*《医疗修女时祷书》*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582243&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3bd5d1ee-7927-4bae-9c26-406f1141b0a8\', \'multiverseId\': 582243}, \'multiverseid\': 582243}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sororita Repentia\', \'text\': \'Märtyrertod — Wenn die Sororita Repentia stirbt, erhältst du 2 Lebenspunkte dazu und ziehst zwei Karten.\\nMirakulum {W}{B} (Du kannst diese Karte für ihre Mirakulum-Kosten wirken, wenn du sie ziehst, falls es die erste Karte ist, die du in diesem Zug gezogen hast.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich werde den Imperator an den dunkelsten Orten der Nacht um Vergebung bitten."\\n—Eid der Büßer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581124&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'659fdcd2-413f-48e8-9f8b-148fd65f50e2\', \'multiverseId\': 581124}, \'multiverseid\': 581124}, {\'name\': \'Hermana Repentia\', \'text\': \'Martirio — Cuando la Hermana Repentia muera, ganas 2 vidas y robas dos cartas.\\nMilagro {W}{B}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta pagando su coste de milagro cuando la robes si es la primera carta que robaste este turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Buscaré el perdón del Emperador en los lugares más oscuros de la noche".\\n—Juramento del Penitente\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581284&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdc22059-bf30-439d-8a67-84d712bb4fcc\', \'multiverseId\': 581284}, \'multiverseid\': 581284}, {\'name\': \'Sœur Repentia\', \'text\': "Martyre — Quand la Sœur Repentia meurt, vous gagnez 2 points de vie et vous piochez deux cartes.\\nMiracle {W}{B} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte pour son coût de miracle quand vous la piochez si c\'est la première carte que vous avez piochée ce tour-ci.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« Je demanderai le pardon de l\'Empereur dans les lieux les plus noirs de la nuit. »\\n—Serment du Pénitent", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581444&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58dcda40-90b5-4216-9ae6-2651f8da5bee\', \'multiverseId\': 581444}, \'multiverseid\': 581444}, {\'name\': \'Sorella Repentia\', \'text\': \'Martirio — Quando la Sorella Repentia muore, guadagni 2 punti vita e peschi due carte.\\nMiracolo {W}{B} (Puoi lanciare questa carta pagando il suo costo di miracolo quando la peschi, se è la prima che hai pescato in questo turno.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Cercherò il perdono dell\\\'Imperatore nei luoghi più bui della notte."\\n—Giuramento del Penitente\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581604&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0b7fd73-5656-4348-8319-90b1ddeb0355\', \'multiverseId\': 581604}, \'multiverseid\': 581604}, {\'name\': \'シスター・リペンティア\', \'text\': \'殉死 — シスター・リペンティアが死亡したとき、あなたは２点のライフを得てカード２枚を引く。\\n奇跡{W}{B}（あなたがこのターンに最初に引いたカードとしてこのカードを引き、すぐに公開したとき、あなたはこれを奇跡コストで唱えてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「最も暗い夜の中で皇帝の赦しを乞います。」\\n――悔悟者の誓い\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581764&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64eda836-d5a6-4a98-8b99-cb08e6374047\', \'multiverseId\': 581764}, \'multiverseid\': 581764}, {\'name\': \'Irmã Repentia\', \'text\': \'Martírio — Quando Irmã Repentia morre, você ganha 2 pontos de vida e compra dois cards.\\nMilagre {W}{B} (Você pode conjurar este card pagando seu custo de milagre ao comprá-lo se este for o primeiro card que você compra neste turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Buscarei o perdão do Imperador nos lugares mais escuros da noite."\\n— Juramento da Penitente\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581924&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b38d614e-a9ed-4efd-8e02-984faa897120\', \'multiverseId\': 581924}, \'multiverseid\': 581924}, {\'name\': \'赎罪修女\', \'text\': \'殉难～当赎罪修女死去时，你获得2点生命且抓两张牌。\\n奇迹{W}{B}（当你抓此牌时，如果它是你于本回合抓的第一张牌，你可以支付其奇迹费用来施放它。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「我将在夜晚最黑暗之处寻求帝皇宽恕。」\\n～忏悔者誓约\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aafd479b-9349-4471-b674-facb7dc534ed\', \'multiverseId\': 582244}, \'multiverseid\': 582244}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sphäre der Wiederauferstehung\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur hat Lebensverknüpfung.\\nImmer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur stirbt, bringe sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.\\nAusrüsten {4} ({4}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581147&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02ef9c6f-6261-4825-b28d-5a36aa189f2a\', \'multiverseId\': 581147}, \'multiverseid\': 581147}, {\'name\': \'Orbe de resurrección\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada tiene la habilidad de vínculo vital.\\nSiempre que la criatura equipada muera, regresa esa carta al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario al comienzo del próximo paso final.\\nEquipar {4}. ({4}: Anexa este Equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95ae2b81-aead-4f09-a798-1113920547f7\', \'multiverseId\': 581307}, \'multiverseid\': 581307}, {\'name\': \'Orbe de Résurrection\', \'text\': "La créature équipée a le lien de vie.\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature équipée meurt, renvoyez cette carte sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire au début de la prochaine étape de fin.\\nÉquipement {4} ({4} : Attachez à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581467&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e41252d9-3b92-4aa5-b07b-99d9811e9b8b\', \'multiverseId\': 581467}, \'multiverseid\': 581467}, {\'name\': \'Globo della Resurrezione\', \'text\': "La creatura equipaggiata ha legame vitale.\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata muore, rimetti quella carta sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.\\nEquipaggiare {4} ({4}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo come una stregoneria.)", \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ff50dec-6287-4662-94e7-6173a700fe65\', \'multiverseId\': 581627}, \'multiverseid\': 581627}, {\'name\': \'リザレクション・オーブ\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは絆魂を持つ。\\n装備しているクリーチャーが死亡するたび、次の終了ステップの開始時に、そのカードをオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。\\n装備{4}（{4}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581787&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0229d029-c441-4fca-b63e-b1586addc8d2\', \'multiverseId\': 581787}, \'multiverseid\': 581787}, {\'name\': \'Orbe da Ressurreição\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada tem vínculo com a vida.\\nToda vez que a criatura equipada morrer, devolva aquele card ao campo de batalha sob o controle de seu dono no início da próxima etapa final.\\nEquipar {4} ({4}: Anexe este equipamento à criatura alvo que você controla. Equipe somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581947&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdbbf93f-c2b0-42e2-8dd5-71d7d7e17cb4\', \'multiverseId\': 581947}, \'multiverseid\': 581947}, {\'name\': \'复生之球\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物具有系命异能。\\n每当佩带此武具的生物死去时，在下一个结束步骤开始时，将该牌在其拥有者的操控下移回战场。\\n佩带{4}（{4}：贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。只能于法术时机佩带。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18df5405-b9a5-4122-b400-e6e51e0b50d1\', \'multiverseId\': 582267}, \'multiverseid\': 582267}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sporenzyste\', \'text\': \'Unersättlich (Diese Kreatur kommt mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel. Falls X gleich 5 oder mehr ist, ziehe eine Karte, wenn sie ins Spiel kommt.)\\nVerteidiger\\nSporenschlot — Wenn die Sporenzyste ins Spiel kommt, durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu X Standardland-Karten, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Tyranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581080&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9cf1ade-4b16-4ab6-8657-e53c2daaf38c\', \'multiverseId\': 581080}, \'multiverseid\': 581080}, {\'name\': \'Sporocyst\', \'text\': \'Voracidad. (Esta criatura entra al campo de batalla con X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella. Si X es 5 o más, roba una carta cuando entre.)\\nDefensor.\\nChimenea de esporas — Cuando el Sporocyst entre al campo de batalla, busca en tu biblioteca hasta X cartas de tierra básica, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiránido\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581240&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a98a772c-6693-444b-b2a1-e7c965e3a4fa\', \'multiverseId\': 581240}, \'multiverseid\': 581240}, {\'name\': \'Sporocyste\', \'text\': "Voracité (Cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle. Si X est supérieur ou égal à 5, piochez une carte quand elle arrive sur le champ de bataille.)\\nDéfenseur\\nCheminée à spores — Quand le Sporocyste arrive sur le champ de bataille, cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à X cartes de terrain de base, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Créature : tyranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581400&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d1314bd-8ec0-4d11-b227-1e93a1109290\', \'multiverseId\': 581400}, \'multiverseid\': 581400}, {\'name\': \'Sporocyst\', \'text\': \'Famelico (Questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia con X segnalini +1/+1. Se X è pari o superiore a 5, pesca una carta quando entra.)\\nDifensore\\nCiminiera Sporifera — Quando lo Sporocyst entra nel campo di battaglia, passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a X carte terra base, mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Tiranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581560&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2ae35ce-b097-4c44-88a9-fc8467801eca\', \'multiverseId\': 581560}, \'multiverseid\': 581560}, {\'name\': \'スポロシスト\', \'text\': \'貪欲（このクリーチャーは＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。Ｘが５以上であるなら、これが戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引く。）\\n防衛\\n胞子噴出筒 — スポロシストが戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大Ｘ枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ティラニッド\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581720&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3d5013e-bdc0-409d-863c-94be1d7f4719\', \'multiverseId\': 581720}, \'multiverseid\': 581720}, {\'name\': \'Sporocyst\', \'text\': \'Voraz (Esta criatura entra no campo de batalha com X marcadores +1/+1. Se X for igual ou superior a 5, compre um card quando ela entrar.)\\nDefensor\\nChaminé de Esporos — Quando Sporocyst entrar no campo de batalha, procure em seu grimório até X cards de terreno básico, coloque-os no campo de batalha virados e depois embaralhe.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiranídeo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581880&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b894daff-3a43-4cca-9bd7-29338912b9da\', \'multiverseId\': 581880}, \'multiverseid\': 581880}, {\'name\': \'孢囊要塞\', \'text\': \'贪食（此生物进战场时上面有X个+1/+1指示物。如果X等于或大于5，则当它进战场时抓一张牌。）\\n守军\\n孢子烟囊～当孢囊要塞进战场时，从你牌库中搜寻至多X张基本地牌，将它们横置放进战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～泰伦虫族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582200&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78b74d23-d631-4a9a-9a15-7bcd7152bc62\', \'multiverseId\': 582200}, \'multiverseid\': 582200}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sturm-Intercessor\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag, Bedrohlich\\nKettenschwert — Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, stirbt, verliert jener Spieler 2 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Astartes, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Feind ohne Ehre ist bereits besiegt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581086&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61b092f4-c66f-48f2-96f4-be52ad2b8e70\', \'multiverseId\': 581086}, \'multiverseid\': 581086}, {\'name\': \'Intercesor de Asalto\', \'text\': \'Daña primero, amenaza.\\nEspada sierra — Siempre que una criatura que controla un oponente muera, ese jugador pierde 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero astartes\', \'flavor\': \'Un oponente sin honor es un oponente que ya ha perdido.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581246&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b4e2b6e-1d79-44ec-a3b1-a8e1f6e0e8f3\', \'multiverseId\': 581246}, \'multiverseid\': 581246}, {\'name\': "Intercessor d\'assaut", \'text\': "Initiative, menace\\nÉpée tronçonneuse — À chaque fois qu\'une créature qu\'un adversaire contrôle meurt, ce joueur perd 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : astartes et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'Un ennemi sans honneur est un ennemi déjà vaincu.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581406&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f62d301-2efa-4c52-aca7-818c206e4813\', \'multiverseId\': 581406}, \'multiverseid\': 581406}, {\'name\': "Intercessor d\'Assalto", \'text\': \'Attacco improvviso, minacciare\\nSpada a Catena — Ogniqualvolta una creatura controllata da un avversario muore, quel giocatore perde 2 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Astartes\', \'flavor\': \'Un nemico senza onore è un nemico già sconfitto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b51254ef-bd99-462f-8333-5bc959e8cd5a\', \'multiverseId\': 581566}, \'multiverseid\': 581566}, {\'name\': \'アサルト・インターセッサー\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃、威迫\\nチェーンソード — 対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、そのプレイヤーは２点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — アスタルテス・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'名誉なき敵はすでに敗れたも同然である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581726&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33965a71-025c-4950-af2e-beef0889fd68\', \'multiverseId\': 581726}, \'multiverseid\': 581726}, {\'name\': \'Intercessor de Assalto\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa, ameaçar\\nMotoespada — Toda vez que uma criatura que um oponente controla morre, aquele jogador perde 2 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Astartes Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'Um adversário sem honra é um adversário que já está derrotado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581886&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f69324d5-6464-4f02-9a3b-807ec81e3bb1\', \'multiverseId\': 581886}, \'multiverseid\': 581886}, {\'name\': \'突袭仲裁者\', \'text\': \'先攻，威慑\\n链锯剑～每当一个由对手操控的生物死去时，该牌手失去2点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～阿斯塔特／战士\', \'flavor\': \'敌人无德则必败。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b180021-2078-4208-8124-2fa0084e852c\', \'multiverseId\': 582206}, \'multiverseid\': 582206}]', '[{\'name\': \'Symbiarch\', \'text\': \'Unersättlich (Diese Kreatur kommt mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel. Falls X gleich 5 oder mehr ist, ziehe eine Karte, wenn sie ins Spiel kommt.)\\nRotten-Telepathie — Wenn der Symbiarch ins Spiel kommt, verteile X +1/+1-Marken auf eine beliebige Anzahl an anderen Kreaturen deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Tyranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581071&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4b86b9e-2127-4cf9-80fb-cf6febcfca25\', \'multiverseId\': 581071}, \'multiverseid\': 581071}, {\'name\': \'Líder de Progenie\', \'text\': \'Voracidad. (Esta criatura entra al campo de batalla con X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella. Si X es 5 o más, roba una carta cuando entre.)\\nTelepatía de progenie — Cuando el Líder de Progenie entre al campo de batalla, distribuye X contadores +1/+1 entre cualquier cantidad de otras criaturas objetivo que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiránido\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be53780b-b21b-41ba-8198-b3a19915948d\', \'multiverseId\': 581231}, \'multiverseid\': 581231}, {\'name\': \'Génocrate\', \'text\': "Voracité (Cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle. Si X est supérieur ou égal à 5, piochez une carte quand elle arrive sur le champ de bataille.)\\nTélépathie du couvain — Quand le Génocrate arrive sur le champ de bataille, répartissez X marqueurs +1/+1 entre n\'importe quel nombre d\'autres créatures ciblées que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature : tyranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581391&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92b0ceee-52a3-4694-a1cb-c850cb4c9b96\', \'multiverseId\': 581391}, \'multiverseid\': 581391}, {\'name\': \'Signore della Nidiata\', \'text\': \'Famelico (Questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia con X segnalini +1/+1. Se X è pari o superiore a 5, pesca una carta quando entra.)\\nTelepatia della Nidiata — Quando il Signore della Nidiata entra nel campo di battaglia, distribuisci X segnalini +1/+1 tra un qualsiasi numero di altre creature bersaglio che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Tiranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8004f162-6bb6-42bb-b55b-8575ef29756d\', \'multiverseId\': 581551}, \'multiverseid\': 581551}, {\'name\': \'ブルードロード\', \'text\': \'貪欲（このクリーチャーは＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。Ｘが５以上であるなら、これが戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引く。）\\nブルード・テレパシー — ブルードロードが戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでない望む数のクリーチャーを対象とし、Ｘ個分をあなたの望むように割り振る。それらの上にその割り振った個数の＋１/＋１カウンターを置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ティラニッド\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581711&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dee91cc-abcf-4427-8640-5c2a2d971f8c\', \'multiverseId\': 581711}, \'multiverseid\': 581711}, {\'name\': \'Senhor da Prole\', \'text\': \'Voraz (Esta criatura entra no campo de batalha com X marcadores +1/+1. Se X for igual ou superior a 5, compre um card quando ela entrar.)\\nTelepatia da Linhagem — Quando Senhor da Prole entrar no campo de batalha, distribua X marcadores +1/+1 entre qualquer número de outras criaturas alvo que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiranídeo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581871&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0791c915-097d-471f-b0e7-559ef5f7e102\', \'multiverseId\': 581871}, \'multiverseid\': 581871}, {\'name\': \'族群之主\', \'text\': \'贪食（此生物进战场时上面有X个+1/+1指示物。如果X等于或大于5，则当它进战场时抓一张牌。）\\n心灵感应～当族群之主进战场时，将X个+1/+1指示物分配给任意数量目标由你操控的其他生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～泰伦虫族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582191&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62f9e914-7c2b-488e-b8de-bb0337b91dcb\', \'multiverseId\': 582191}, \'multiverseid\': 582191}]', '[{\'name\': \'Symbiontenlocus\', \'text\': \'Neurotraumalstab — Immer wenn eine Kreatur dich angreift, erhält sie -1/-0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur einen deiner Gegner angreift, erhält sie +0/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Tyranide, Mensch\', \'flavor\': \'Entsetzliche Visionen, lähmende Schmerzen und schreckliche Gehirnkrämpfe erwarten diejenigen, die den Kult herausfordern.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581003&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c2469b6-e370-4bfc-a3d4-42bb488953a1\', \'multiverseId\': 581003}, \'multiverseid\': 581003}, {\'name\': \'Locus Genestealer\', \'text\': \'Vara neurotraumática — Siempre que una criatura te ataque, obtiene -1/-0 hasta el final del turno.\\nSiempre que una criatura ataque a uno de tus oponentes, obtiene +0/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano tiránido\', \'flavor\': \'Visiones desgarradoras, dolor paralizante y aterradores espasmos cerebrales: ese es el destino que aguarda a quienes se oponen al Culto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1c6eb3e-bbc8-4f02-b74f-a7da0c229ddf\', \'multiverseId\': 581163}, \'multiverseid\': 581163}, {\'name\': \'Locus Genestealer\', \'text\': "Bâton neurotraumatique — À chaque fois qu\'une créature vous attaque, elle gagne -1/-0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature attaque un de vos adversaires, elle gagne +0/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : tyranide et humain\', \'flavor\': "D\'horribles visions, une douleur paralysante et de terribles spasmes cérébraux attendent quiconque ose défier le culte.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581323&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'136204c3-7e8e-406b-a656-8ffd867e6a50\', \'multiverseId\': 581323}, \'multiverseid\': 581323}, {\'name\': \'Locus dei Genoraptor\', \'text\': \'Bastone Neurotraumatico — Ogniqualvolta una creatura ti attacca, prende -1/-0 fino alla fine del turno.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura attacca uno dei tuoi avversari, prende +0/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Umano Tiranide\', \'flavor\': \'Visioni strazianti, dolore paralizzante e terrificanti spasmi cerebrali attendono coloro che sfidano il culto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581483&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'202410bb-ebc8-4154-9430-b6720e4fb763\', \'multiverseId\': 581483}, \'multiverseid\': 581483}, {\'name\': \'ジーンスティーラー・ローカス\', \'text\': \'神経損傷杖 — クリーチャー１体があなたを攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、それは－１/－０の修整を受ける。\\nクリーチャー１体が対戦相手１人を攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、それは＋０/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ティラニッド・人間\', \'flavor\': \'魔女団の秩序を脅かす者には、心を病む幻覚、正気を奪うほどの苦痛、そして恐ろしい脳発作が待ち受けている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581643&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8276645-2c7d-4c0a-b72b-3b17a93dbf33\', \'multiverseId\': 581643}, \'multiverseid\': 581643}, {\'name\': \'Locus Genestealer\', \'text\': \'Bastão de Neurotrauma — Toda vez que uma criatura ataca você, ela recebe -1/-0 até o final do turno.\\nToda vez que uma criatura ataca um de seus oponentes, ela recebe +0/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiranídeo Humano\', \'flavor\': \'Visões perturbadoras, dores paralisantes e espasmos cerebrais terríveis aguardam os que desafiam o culto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581803&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce7431bc-b29e-4146-903c-c4159cf5c520\', \'multiverseId\': 581803}, \'multiverseid\': 581803}, {\'name\': \'基因窃取者基卫\', \'text\': \'灵创权杖～每当一个生物攻击你时，它得-1/-0直到回合结束。\\n每当一个生物攻击你的任一对手时，它得+0/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～泰伦虫族／人类\', \'flavor\': \'胆敢挑战教派者，都将经历骇目视像、钻心苦痛以及破脑痉挛。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582123&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c22500ea-a85f-4b8c-942c-d9b32c152149\', \'multiverseId\': 582123}, \'multiverseid\': 582123}]', '[{\'name\': \'Technomant\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Technomant ins Spiel kommt, millst du drei Karten und bringst dann eine beliebige Anzahl an Artefaktkreaturenkarten mit Gesamt-Manabetrag 6 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Necron, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Ob Hexerei oder Technologie, es ist blasphemisch und muss gestoppt werden."\\n—Inquisitorin Greyfax\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581043&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b47b99b8-247f-4590-bdf1-bb510f38fed7\', \'multiverseId\': 581043}, \'multiverseid\': 581043}, {\'name\': \'Tecnomante\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Tecnomante entre al campo de batalla, muele tres cartas y luego regresa cualquier cantidad de cartas de criatura artefacto con un valor de maná total de 6 o menos de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Hechicero necrón\', \'flavor\': \'"Ya sea brujería o tecnología, es una blasfemia que ha de erradicarse".\\n—Inquisidora Greyfax\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e21ce80f-d322-44ee-924d-0417dba43ece\', \'multiverseId\': 581203}, \'multiverseid\': 581203}, {\'name\': \'Technomancien\', \'text\': "Quand le Technomancien arrive sur le champ de bataille, meulez trois cartes, puis renvoyez sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière n\'importe quel nombre de cartes de créature-artefact avec une valeur de mana totale inférieure ou égale à 6.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : nécron et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Sorcellerie ou technologie, c\'est blasphématoire, et cela doit être arrêté. »\\n—Inquisitrice Greyfax", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581363&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'201841ae-74d3-4991-9e46-5373d2768797\', \'multiverseId\': 581363}, \'multiverseid\': 581363}, {\'name\': \'Tecnomante\', \'text\': \'Quando il Tecnomante entra nel campo di battaglia, macina tre carte, poi rimetti sul campo di battaglia un qualsiasi numero di carte creatura artefatto con valore di mana totale pari o inferiore a 6 dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Mago Necron\', \'flavor\': \'"Stregoneria o tecnologia non importa: è blasfemo e deve essere fermato."\\n—Inquisitrice Greyfax\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581523&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3805f0ae-6bfb-4c14-a64a-771f5f9cff68\', \'multiverseId\': 581523}, \'multiverseid\': 581523}, {\'name\': \'テクノマンサー\', \'text\': \'テクノマンサーが戦場に出たとき、カード３枚を切削する。その後、あなたの墓地にある望む枚数のアーティファクト・クリーチャー・カードをマナ総量の合計が６以下になるように選び、戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ネクロン・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「魔法だろうが技術だろうが、冒涜に変わりない。何としてでも止めなければならない。」\\n――異端審問官、グレイファクス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581683&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dada703a-6b1a-40d9-ba17-9dffac8e3f8e\', \'multiverseId\': 581683}, \'multiverseid\': 581683}, {\'name\': \'Tecnomante\', \'text\': \'Quando Tecnomante entrar no campo de batalha, triture três cards, depois devolva de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha qualquer número de cards de criatura artefato com valor de mana total igual ou inferior a 6.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Necron Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Bruxaria ou tecnologia, isso é blasfêmia e tem que acabar."\\n— Inquisidora Greyfax\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581843&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'365b4117-855f-4818-9288-485fa889dac7\', \'multiverseId\': 581843}, \'multiverseid\': 581843}, {\'name\': \'机械巫师\', \'text\': \'当机械巫师进战场时，磨三张牌，然后将任意数量的神器生物牌从你坟墓场移回战场，且这些牌法术力值总和须等于或小于6。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～太空死灵／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「巫术也好，机械也罢，这些都是渎神之举，必须停止。」\\n～审判官格雷法克斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59215e8e-4542-44ab-afa0-b56a384ea2ab\', \'multiverseId\': 582163}, \'multiverseid\': 582163}]', "[{'name': 'Termaganten-Schwarm', 'text': 'Unersättlich (Diese Kreatur kommt mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel. Falls X gleich 5 oder mehr ist, ziehe eine Karte, wenn sie ins Spiel kommt.)\\nTodesrausch — Wenn der Termaganten-Schwarm stirbt, erzeuge so viele 1/1 grüne Tyranide-Kreaturenspielsteine, wie die Stärke des Termaganten-Schwarms beträgt.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Tyranide', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581081&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7dffc206-1645-4094-8b0d-f3dbbc53ff18', 'multiverseId': 581081}, 'multiverseid': 581081}, {'name': 'Enjambre de Termagantes', 'text': 'Voracidad. (Esta criatura entra al campo de batalla con X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella. Si X es 5 o más, roba una carta cuando entre.)\\nLocura agónica — Cuando el Enjambre de Termagantes muera, crea una cantidad de fichas de criatura Tiránido verdes 1/1 igual a la fuerza del Enjambre de Termagantes.', 'type': 'Criatura — Tiránido', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581241&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e974f86d-db72-4b62-bc00-ed805a88865f', 'multiverseId': 581241}, 'multiverseid': 581241}, {'name': 'Nuée de termagants', 'text': 'Voracité (Cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle. Si X est supérieur ou égal à 5, piochez une carte quand elle arrive sur le champ de bataille.)\\nFrénésie de mort — Quand la Nuée de termagants meurt, créez un nombre de jetons de créature 1/1 verte Tyranide égal à la force de la Nuée de termagants.', 'type': 'Créature : tyranide', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581401&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5e5c3bba-580f-4ae5-9b94-60e13a8b90dc', 'multiverseId': 581401}, 'multiverseid': 581401}, {'name': 'Sciame di Termagant', 'text': 'Famelico (Questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia con X segnalini +1/+1. Se X è pari o superiore a 5, pesca una carta quando entra.)\\nMorte Furiosa — Quando lo Sciame di Termagant muore, crea un numero di pedine creatura Tiranide 1/1 verdi pari alla forza dello Sciame di Termagant.', 'type': 'Creatura — Tiranide', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581561&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f674efcc-8bf5-4e1c-8d2b-46fe51093816', 'multiverseId': 581561}, 'multiverseid': 581561}, {'name': 'ターマガント・スウォーム', 'text': '貪欲（このクリーチャーは＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。Ｘが５以上であるなら、これが戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引く。）\\n死のフレンジー — ターマガント・スウォームが死亡したとき、ターマガント・スウォームのパワーに等しい数の緑の１/１のティラニッド・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ティラニッド', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581721&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '81aa1394-1c81-4896-a664-1715109e5bf4', 'multiverseId': 581721}, 'multiverseid': 581721}, {'name': 'Enxame de Termagantes', 'text': 'Voraz (Esta criatura entra no campo de batalha com X marcadores +1/+1. Se X for igual ou superior a 5, compre um card quando ela entrar.)\\nFrenesi da Morte — Quando Enxame de Termagantes morrer, crie um número de fichas de criatura Tiranídeo verde 1/1 igual ao poder de Enxame de Termagantes.', 'type': 'Criatura — Tiranídeo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581881&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2bc76302-eb3b-44f4-a4ae-64ac6b5445c4', 'multiverseId': 581881}, 'multiverseid': 581881}, {'name': '枪虫大群', 'text': '贪食（此生物进战场时上面有X个+1/+1指示物。如果X等于或大于5，则当它进战场时抓一张牌。）\\n死亡狂暴～当枪虫大群死去时，派出若干1/1绿色泰伦虫族衍生生物，其数量等同于枪虫大群的力量。', 'type': '生物 ～泰伦虫族', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582201&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aa2d3549-1c04-4c33-b8dc-046e61946b20', 'multiverseId': 582201}, 'multiverseid': 582201}]", "[{'name': 'Tervigon', 'text': 'Unersättlich (Diese Kreatur kommt mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel. Falls X gleich 5 oder mehr ist, ziehe eine Karte, wenn sie ins Spiel kommt.)\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden\\nTermaganten brüten — Immer wenn der Tervigon einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, erzeuge entsprechend viele 1/1 grüne Tyranide-Kreaturenspielsteine.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Tyranide', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581082&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ac6659ed-8718-4b94-9637-319236ac786e', 'multiverseId': 581082}, 'multiverseid': 581082}, {'name': 'Tervigón', 'text': 'Voracidad. (Esta criatura entra al campo de batalla con X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella. Si X es 5 o más, roba una carta cuando entre.)\\nArrolla.\\nEngendrar Termagantes — Siempre que el Tervigón haga daño de combate a un jugador, crea esa misma cantidad de fichas de criatura Tiránido verdes 1/1.', 'type': 'Criatura — Tiránido', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581242&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd9b98971-6ad9-441a-a169-a8d3beb7cb7e', 'multiverseId': 581242}, 'multiverseid': 581242}, {'name': 'Tervigon', 'text': 'Voracité (Cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle. Si X est supérieur ou égal à 5, piochez une carte quand elle arrive sur le champ de bataille.)\\nPiétinement\\nÉclosion de termagants — À chaque fois que le Tervigon inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, créez autant de jetons de créature 1/1 verte Tyranide.', 'type': 'Créature : tyranide', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581402&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1284e8f2-ebc5-4d7b-9a77-04f8361b8d6d', 'multiverseId': 581402}, 'multiverseid': 581402}, {'name': 'Tervigone', 'text': 'Famelico (Questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia con X segnalini +1/+1. Se X è pari o superiore a 5, pesca una carta quando entra.)\\nTravolgere\\nGenera Termagant — Ogniqualvolta il Tervigone infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, crei altrettante pedine creatura Tiranide 1/1 verdi.', 'type': 'Creatura — Tiranide', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581562&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ca42c452-4843-408c-9e4e-3ea62fca86f5', 'multiverseId': 581562}, 'multiverseid': 581562}, {'name': 'ターヴィゴン', 'text': '貪欲（このクリーチャーは＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。Ｘが５以上であるなら、これが戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引く。）\\nトランプル\\nターマガント生成 — ターヴィゴンがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、その点数に等しい数の緑の１/１のティラニッド・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ティラニッド', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581722&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '85d06226-635d-4f6c-8301-9c7680bb6b96', 'multiverseId': 581722}, 'multiverseid': 581722}, {'name': 'Tervigon', 'text': 'Voraz (Esta criatura entra no campo de batalha com X marcadores +1/+1. Se X for igual ou superior a 5, compre um card quando ela entrar.)\\nAtropelar\\nGerar Termagantes — Toda vez que Tervigon causar dano de combate a um jogador, crie aquela quantidade de fichas de criatura Tiranídeo verde 1/1.', 'type': 'Criatura — Tiranídeo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581882&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6250135f-c422-4a79-ac6c-2fdb833dfcba', 'multiverseId': 581882}, 'multiverseid': 581882}, {'name': '母虫', 'text': '贪食（此生物进战场时上面有X个+1/+1指示物。如果X等于或大于5，则当它进战场时抓一张牌。）\\n践踏\\n孽生枪虫～每当母虫对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，派出等量的1/1绿色泰伦虫族衍生生物。', 'type': '生物 ～泰伦虫族', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582202&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6f2f7f39-89c3-48de-825f-a7abbb97fe51', 'multiverseId': 582202}, 'multiverseid': 582202}]", '[{\'name\': \'Thunderhawk-Angriffsschiff\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn das Thunderhawk-Angriffsschiff ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge zwei 2/2 weiße Astartes-Krieger-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Wachsamkeit.\\nImmer wenn das Thunderhawk-Angriffsschiff angreift, erhalten angreifende Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, Flugfähigkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nBemannen 2\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Fahrzeug\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581149&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1068fd6-c8a6-403e-9d23-742058c05e92\', \'multiverseId\': 581149}, \'multiverseid\': 581149}, {\'name\': \'Cañonera Thunderhawk\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando la Cañonera Thunderhawk entre al campo de batalla, crea dos fichas de criatura Guerrero Astartes blancas 2/2 con la habilidad de vigilancia.\\nSiempre que la Cañonera Thunderhawk ataque, las criaturas atacantes que controlas ganan la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno.\\nTripular 2.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Vehículo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581309&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7470ec81-e0d7-4959-98b2-ee7b86aef3ef\', \'multiverseId\': 581309}, \'multiverseid\': 581309}, {\'name\': \'Escorteur Thunderhawk\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Escorteur Thunderhawk arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez deux jetons de créature 2/2 blanche Astartes et Guerrier avec la vigilance.\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Escorteur Thunderhawk attaque, les créatures attaquantes que vous contrôlez acquièrent le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nPilotage 2", \'type\': \'Artefact : véhicule\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581469&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4790c5f-c178-4b3f-adcd-b27372cbfff8\', \'multiverseId\': 581469}, \'multiverseid\': 581469}, {\'name\': \'Cannoniera Thunderhawk\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando la Cannoniera Thunderhawk entra nel campo di battaglia, crea due pedine creatura Guerriero Astartes 2/2 bianche con cautela.\\nOgniqualvolta la Cannoniera Thunderhawk attacca, le creature attaccanti che controlli hanno volare fino alla fine del turno.\\nManovrare 2\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Veicolo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5d14db5-c941-4bf0-81f6-6af680bf2e39\', \'multiverseId\': 581629}, \'multiverseid\': 581629}, {\'name\': \'サンダーホーク・ガンシップ\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nサンダーホーク・ガンシップが戦場に出たとき、警戒を持つ白の２/２のアスタルテス・戦士・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\\nサンダーホーク・ガンシップが攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべての攻撃クリーチャーは飛行を得る。\\n搭乗２\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 機体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581789&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62b42f2c-27a5-4c57-a9ad-c83b608cd9c8\', \'multiverseId\': 581789}, \'multiverseid\': 581789}, {\'name\': \'Canhonave Thunderhawk\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Canhonave Thunderhawk entrar no campo de batalha, crie duas fichas de criatura Astartes Guerreiro branca 2/2 com vigilância.\\nToda vez que Canhonave Thunderhawk ataca, as criaturas atacantes que você controla ganham voar até o final do turno.\\nTripular 2\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Veículo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581949&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bba2b951-19d6-4175-bbd0-f77d93001783\', \'multiverseId\': 581949}, \'multiverseid\': 581949}, {\'name\': \'雷鹰炮艇\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当雷鹰炮艇进战场时，派出两个2/2白色，具警戒异能的阿斯塔特／战士衍生生物。\\n每当雷鹰炮艇攻击时，由你操控且进行攻击的生物获得飞行异能直到回合结束。\\n搭载2\', \'type\': \'神器 ～载具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'640e79e6-0256-4520-a8b2-53db95943337\', \'multiverseId\': 582269}, \'multiverseid\': 582269}]', "[{'name': 'Todeshetzer, Terrorwaffe', 'text': 'Aufblitzen\\nEile\\nFanghaken — Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst und die in diesem Zug ins Spiel gekommen sind, haben Doppelschlag.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Tyranide', 'flavor': 'Geschaffen, um Willen und Knochen mit gleicher Grausamkeit zu brechen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581097&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aa105b80-522e-4113-b013-b549e16a3203', 'multiverseId': 581097}, 'multiverseid': 581097}, {'name': 'Muerte Silenciosa, arma terrorífica', 'text': 'Destello.\\nPrisa.\\nGarras garfio — Las criaturas que controlas que entraron al campo de batalla este turno tienen la habilidad de dañar dos veces.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Tiránido', 'flavor': 'Creada para romper la voluntad y los huesos con igual ferocidad.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581257&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e57ab91d-7d15-4eac-93d0-3c55e3318140', 'multiverseId': 581257}, 'multiverseid': 581257}, {'name': 'Mort subite, arme de terreur', 'text': 'Flash\\nCélérité\\nCrochets de chair — Les créatures que vous contrôlez qui sont arrivées sur le champ de bataille ce tour-ci ont la double initiative.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire : tyranide', 'flavor': 'Créée pour briser les os et la volonté avec la même férocité.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581417&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2a4271e8-759b-431c-963e-b4473758dad0', 'multiverseId': 581417}, 'multiverseid': 581417}, {'name': 'Raptomorte, Arma di Terrore', 'text': 'Lampo\\nRapidità\\nBiouncini — Le creature che controlli che sono entrate nel campo di battaglia in questo turno hanno doppio attacco.', 'type': 'Creatura Leggendaria — Tiranide', 'flavor': 'Creata per spezzare la volontà e le ossa con eguale ferocia.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581577&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd8e169ba-12c0-4396-872e-cb0c0ed8d5e3', 'multiverseId': 581577}, 'multiverseid': 581577}, {'name': '恐怖の武器、デスリーパー', 'text': '瞬速\\n速攻\\n肉フック — このターンに戦場に出てあなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは二段攻撃を持つ。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — ティラニッド', 'flavor': '士気も骨も同等の惨たらしさで粉砕するために造られた。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581737&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd292e7b7-a94a-4902-8cf0-7f355dc613c5', 'multiverseId': 581737}, 'multiverseid': 581737}, {'name': 'Saltador Mortal, Arma de Terror', 'text': 'Lampejo\\nÍmpeto\\nGanchos de Carne — As criaturas que você controla e que entraram no campo de batalha neste turno têm golpe duplo.', 'type': 'Criatura Lendária — Tiranídeo', 'flavor': 'Criado para quebrar os ossos e a força de vontade com idêntica ferocidade.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581897&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c94d5ec0-3d44-461a-8e0b-8b53597bbf8a', 'multiverseId': 581897}, 'multiverseid': 581897}, {'name': '恐惧武器死亡跃袭者', 'text': '闪现\\n敏捷\\n肉钩～由你操控且于本回合进战场的生物具有连击异能。', 'type': '传奇生物 ～泰伦虫族', 'flavor': '为能同样残暴地粉碎意志和骨头而生。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582217&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd5203e1-4a81-4571-8e9a-ef6a0a387aca', 'multiverseId': 582217}, 'multiverseid': 582217}]", '[{\'name\': \'Toxicrene\', \'text\': \'Reichweite, Todesberührung\\nHypertoxisches Miasma — Alle Länder haben „{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe" und verlieren alle anderen Fähigkeiten.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Tyranide\', \'flavor\': \'Es stößt eine stinkende Wolke aus Millionen von aufkeimenden, mikroskopischen Organismen aus, von denen jeder ein Fragment eines räuberischen Instinkts besitzt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581083&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5cb1b61-8aea-4d3a-a66d-3353d3bb3a38\', \'multiverseId\': 581083}, \'multiverseid\': 581083}, {\'name\': \'Toxicreno\', \'text\': \'Alcance, toque mortal.\\nMiasma hipertóxica — Todas las tierras tienen "{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color" y pierden todas las otras habilidades.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiránido\', \'flavor\': \'Emite una nube apestosa compuesta por millones de organismos microscópicos latentes, cada uno de ellos con un ápice de consciencia depredadora.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581243&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79ea5151-55e4-466b-a6cf-8a83d57ece4c\', \'multiverseId\': 581243}, \'multiverseid\': 581243}, {\'name\': \'Toxicrene\', \'text\': \'Portée, contact mortel\\nMiasmes hypertoxiques — Tous les terrains ont « {T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix » et perdent toutes leurs autres capacités.\', \'type\': \'Créature : tyranide\', \'flavor\': "Il émet un nuage puant composé de millions d\'organismes microscopiques, chacun possédant un fragment d\'intelligence prédatoire.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581403&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3bc2d5ea-3237-4142-ace1-15b7d6c1194b\', \'multiverseId\': 581403}, \'multiverseid\': 581403}, {\'name\': \'Tossicrene\', \'text\': \'Raggiungere, tocco letale\\nMiasma Ipertossico — Tutte le terre hanno "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore" e perdono tutte le altre abilità.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Tiranide\', \'flavor\': \'Emette una nube puzzolente composta da milioni di microrganismi nascenti, ognuno dei quali possiede un frammento di sensibilità predatoria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e9992f4-01cf-47a2-9f7a-7c3977669aa8\', \'multiverseId\': 581563}, \'multiverseid\': 581563}, {\'name\': \'トキシクレイン\', \'text\': \'到達、接死\\n猛毒瘴気 — すべての土地は「{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持ち、他のすべての能力を失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ティラニッド\', \'flavor\': \'それは数万もの微生物からなる悪臭の雲を放つ。それらの微生物はぞれぞれかすかな捕食本能を持っている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581723&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70c3563e-77e6-43ad-9d79-41266d4e332b\', \'multiverseId\': 581723}, \'multiverseid\': 581723}, {\'name\': \'Toxicrene\', \'text\': \'Alcance, toque mortífero\\nMiasma Hipertóxico — Todos os terrenos têm "{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor" e perdem todas as outras habilidades.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiranídeo\', \'flavor\': \'Ele emite uma fétida nuvem de milhões de organismos microscópicos latentes, cada um com um fragmento de senciência predatória.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581883&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29140814-b02b-400f-9ecf-04c885e6e517\', \'multiverseId\': 581883}, \'multiverseid\': 581883}, {\'name\': \'毒鞭兽\', \'text\': \'延势，死触\\n超剧毒瘴～所有地都具有「{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力」且失去所有其他异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～泰伦虫族\', \'flavor\': \'他能喷出由数以百万计微生幼体组成的恶臭毒云，而每个幼体都多少渴望捕猎。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d168cc8-0ac9-4f7f-88f8-cd35825a5e68\', \'multiverseId\': 582203}, \'multiverseid\': 582203}]', '[{\'name\': \'Toxotroph\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Todesberührung, Fluchsicher\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Tyranide\', \'flavor\': \'„Siehst du die Wolke, die um ihn schwebt? Wenn du länger als eine Minute da drin bist, blutest aus Stellen, von denen du nicht einmal wusstest, dass du sie hast."\\n—Captain Ascote\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581129&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f38b01d-0816-45bc-9d36-929ffb95e22f\', \'multiverseId\': 581129}, \'multiverseid\': 581129}, {\'name\': \'Venóntropo\', \'text\': \'Vuela, toque mortal, antimaleficio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiránido\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Ves esa nube que hay a su alrededor? Si pasas más de un minuto allí empezarás a sangrar por orificios que ni sabías que tenías".\\n—Capitán Ascote\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac299928-60b7-4865-a0d6-84888ad3de4c\', \'multiverseId\': 581289}, \'multiverseid\': 581289}, {\'name\': \'Venomthrope\', \'text\': \'Vol, contact mortel, défense talismanique\', \'type\': \'Créature : tyranide\', \'flavor\': "« Vous voyez ce nuage qui l\'entoure ? Si vous y restez plus d\'une minute, vous commencerez à saigner d\'orifices que vous n\'aviez même pas conscience d\'avoir. »\\n—Capitaine Ascote", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581449&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cef597b-d611-4ee7-9006-e2d214b62808\', \'multiverseId\': 581449}, \'multiverseid\': 581449}, {\'name\': \'Velenotropo\', \'text\': \'Volare, tocco letale, anti-malocchio\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Tiranide\', \'flavor\': \'"Vedi quella nuvola che lo circonda? Trascorri più di un minuto lì dentro e sanguinerai da posti che non sapevi nemmeno di avere."\\n—Capitano Ascote\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581609&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a2bbf5e-2802-4c73-8ec0-3dceb4e79e36\', \'multiverseId\': 581609}, \'multiverseid\': 581609}, {\'name\': \'ヴェノムスロープ\', \'text\': \'飛行、接死、呪禁\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ティラニッド\', \'flavor\': \'「あれの周りに立ち込める雲が見えるか？あの中に一分以上いたら全身の思いも寄らぬ所から出血するんだ。」\\n――アスコート隊長\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581769&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3125e244-7854-42bf-8ad1-27956f249764\', \'multiverseId\': 581769}, \'multiverseid\': 581769}, {\'name\': \'Venenótropo\', \'text\': \'Voar, toque mortífero, resistência a magia\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiranídeo\', \'flavor\': \'"Está vendo aquela nuvem em volta dele? Mais de um minuto ali e você já vai estar sangrando por lugares que você nem sabe que existem."\\n— Capitão Ascote\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581929&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53a4db3d-cf37-4a13-8a7a-3e1124f14576\', \'multiverseId\': 581929}, \'multiverseid\': 581929}, {\'name\': \'毒烟虫\', \'text\': \'飞行，死触，辟邪\', \'type\': \'生物 ～泰伦虫族\', \'flavor\': \'「看到他周围的那朵云了吗？你要在里面待上一分钟，血就会从你都不知道哪来的窟窿里喷出。」\\n～阿斯科特上尉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582249&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35cc23d8-b3ff-4d4f-bef6-6d98cbb90139\', \'multiverseId\': 582249}, \'multiverseid\': 582249}]', '[{\'name\': \'Trazyn der Unendliche\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung\\nPrismatische Galerie — Solange Trazyn der Unendliche im Spiel ist, hat er alle aktivierten Fähigkeiten aller Artefaktkarten in deinem Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Artefaktkreatur — Necron\', \'flavor\': \'Der Archivar der Galerien von Solemnum wird nicht eher ruhen, bis er alle Schätze der Galaxis sicher in seinen Händen hält.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581047&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25eef138-166a-4580-92d5-c19b75aed969\', \'multiverseId\': 581047}, \'multiverseid\': 581047}, {\'name\': \'Trazyn, el Infinito\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal.\\nGalerías Prismáticas — Mientras Trazyn, el Infinito esté en el campo de batalla, tiene todas las habilidades activadas de todas las cartas de artefacto en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto legendaria — Necrón\', \'flavor\': \'El Arqueovista de las Galerías Solemnáceas no descansará hasta que todos los tesoros de la galaxia estén a salvo en sus garras.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581207&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7dd7084b-e95b-4b59-9655-32641e4d341b\', \'multiverseId\': 581207}, \'multiverseid\': 581207}, {\'name\': "Trazyn l\'Infini", \'text\': "Contact mortel\\nGalerie prismatique — Tant que Trazyn l\'Infini est sur le champ de bataille, il a toutes les capacités activées de toutes les cartes d\'artefact de votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact légendaire : nécron\', \'flavor\': "L\'Archéoviste des Galeries de Solemnace ne trouvera le repos que lorsque tous les trésors de la galaxie seront en sa possession.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581367&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2593e1e-d7b1-4c12-b54d-69a1c473002a\', \'multiverseId\': 581367}, \'multiverseid\': 581367}, {\'name\': "Trazyn l\'Infinito", \'text\': "Tocco letale\\nGalleria Prismatica — Fintanto che Trazyn l\'Infinito è sul campo di battaglia, ha tutte le abilità attivate di tutte le carte artefatto nel tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto Leggendaria — Necron\', \'flavor\': "L\'Archeovista delle Gallerie di Solemnace non avrà pace finché tutti i tesori della galassia non saranno al sicuro nelle sue grinfie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581527&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01dff90a-0f94-4c26-a2f2-44701b9f2553\', \'multiverseId\': 581527}, \'multiverseid\': 581527}, {\'name\': \'無限なるトラザイン\', \'text\': \'接死\\n絢爛たる展示場 — 無限なるトラザインが戦場にあるかぎり、これはあなたの墓地にあるすべてのアーティファクト・カードのすべての起動型能力を持つ。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト・クリーチャー — ネクロン\', \'flavor\': \'ソレムネス・ギャラリーの文書考古学者は、この銀河に眠るありとあらゆる財宝をつつがなく手中に収めるまで休むことはない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1bacac0-034e-453e-8481-960df916d3ed\', \'multiverseId\': 581687}, \'multiverseid\': 581687}, {\'name\': \'Trazyn, o Infinito\', \'text\': \'Toque mortífero\\nGaleria Prismática — Enquanto Trazyn, o Infinito, estiver no campo de batalha, ele terá todas as habilidades ativadas de todos os cards de artefato em seu cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato Lendária — Necron\', \'flavor\': \'O Arqueovista das Galerias de Solemnace não descansará até ter todos os tesouros da galáxia à salvo sob sua proteção.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581847&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2cac84a-f777-4c0f-a4df-5af72ed2ee81\', \'multiverseId\': 581847}, \'multiverseid\': 581847}, {\'name\': \'无限者特拉金\', \'text\': \'死触\\n棱镜画廊～只要无限者特拉金在战场上，它便具有你坟墓场中每张神器牌的所有起动式异能。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器生物 ～太空死灵\', \'flavor\': \'索勒姆纳斯博物馆的考古馆长立志将全银河系宝藏悉数稳妥入怀，不达目的誓不休。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89a1f78e-4120-4e8e-8ec3-e6eee9940bf7\', \'multiverseId\': 582167}, \'multiverseid\': 582167}]', '[{\'name\': \'Triarchat-Jagdläufer\', \'text\': \'Zielrelais — Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug bestimmst du einen Gegner.\\nKreaturen, die den zuletzt bestimmten Spieler angreifen, haben Bedrohlichkeit.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Necron\', \'flavor\': \'„Reinigt diese Welt von diesen unverschämten Eindringlingen!"\\n—Lord Traedrekkh der Sekemtar-Dynastie\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581049&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36da5f54-8667-4c44-a84c-33d7d32dc0c9\', \'multiverseId\': 581049}, \'multiverseid\': 581049}, {\'name\': \'Acechante de la Triarca\', \'text\': \'Sistema de puntería — Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, elige un oponente.\\nLas criaturas que atacan al último jugador elegido tienen la habilidad de amenaza.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Necrón\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Exterminen a estos intrusos insolentes!".\\n—Lord Traedrekkh de la Dinastía Sekemtar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581209&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'785a81b4-3b07-4350-a1bc-6e64c9fc1359\', \'multiverseId\': 581209}, \'multiverseid\': 581209}, {\'name\': \'Rôdeur du Triarcat\', \'text\': \'Relais de visée — Au début du combat pendant votre tour, choisissez un adversaire.\\nLes créatures qui attaquent le dernier joueur choisi ont la menace.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : nécron\', \'flavor\': \'« Débarrassez-moi ce monde de ces intrus impudents ! »\\n—Seigneur Traedrekkh de la Dynastie Sekemtar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581369&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12ebb19e-8c72-40ff-a507-5b7eb29b4d8b\', \'multiverseId\': 581369}, \'multiverseid\': 581369}, {\'name\': \'Cacciatore del Triarcato\', \'text\': "Relè di Puntamento — All\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, scegli un avversario.\\nLe creature che attaccano l\'ultimo giocatore scelto hanno minacciare.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Necron\', \'flavor\': \'"Ripulisci questo mondo di impudenti intrusi!"\\n—Lord Traedrekkh della Dinastia Sekemtar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e807bcbc-90a4-48c2-9b4d-27c323ac20cd\', \'multiverseId\': 581529}, \'multiverseid\': 581529}, {\'name\': \'トライアーク・ストーカー\', \'text\': \'攻撃座標データ中継機能 — あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、対戦相手１人を選ぶ。\\n最後に選ばれたそのプレイヤーを攻撃しているすべてのクリーチャーは威迫を持つ。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ネクロン\', \'flavor\': \'「この恥知らずの侵入者どもをこの惑星から一掃するのだ！」\\n――セケムタール王朝のロード・トレイドレック\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581689&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30cf7160-b806-456e-962b-bcb55130d10f\', \'multiverseId\': 581689}, \'multiverseid\': 581689}, {\'name\': \'Espreitador dos Triarcas\', \'text\': \'Relé de Mira — No início do combate no seu turno, escolha um oponente.\\nAs criaturas atacando o último jogador escolhido têm ameaçar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Necron\', \'flavor\': \'"Escorrace esses invasores insolentes deste mundo!"\\n— Senhor Traedrekkh, da Dinastia Sekemtar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04de4de2-195e-42c4-bc93-d10630869947\', \'multiverseId\': 581849}, \'multiverseid\': 581849}, {\'name\': \'三圣追猎者\', \'text\': \'定位信标～在你回合的战斗开始时，选择一位对手。\\n正向最后选中之牌手攻击的生物具有威慑异能。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～太空死灵\', \'flavor\': \'「这些无耻的擅闯者，将他们统统赶出这个世界！」\\n～赛克梅特王朝的崔卓克王\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aedc37b3-22d7-4135-8133-519d62291db4\', \'multiverseId\': 582169}, \'multiverseid\': 582169}]', '[{\'name\': \'Triarchat-Prätorianer\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nDynastie-Kodizes — Wenn der Triarchat-Prätorianer aus einem Friedhof ins Spiel kommt, ziehst du zwei Karten und verlierst 2 Lebenspunkte.\\nExhumieren {4}{B} ({4}{B}: Bringe diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Sie erhält Eile. Schicke sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments, oder falls sie das Spiel verlassen würde, ins Exil. Spiele Exhumieren wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Necron\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581048&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'979e222b-db79-4c3a-b4a8-3f68621c7ef4\', \'multiverseId\': 581048}, \'multiverseid\': 581048}, {\'name\': \'Pretoriano de la Triarca\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCódigos dinásticos — Cuando el Pretoriano de la Triarca entre al campo de batalla desde un cementerio, robas dos cartas y pierdes 2 vidas.\\nDesenterrar {4}{B}. ({4}{B}: Regresa esta carta de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Gana la habilidad de prisa. Exíliala al comienzo del próximo paso final o si fuera a dejar el campo de batalla. Activa la habilidad de desenterrar solo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Necrón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581208&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88f4af33-7ee3-4bb1-b33d-4cf16e503ffd\', \'multiverseId\': 581208}, \'multiverseid\': 581208}, {\'name\': \'Prétorien du Triarcat\', \'text\': "Vol\\nCodes dynastiques — Quand le Prétorien du Triarcat arrive sur le champ de bataille depuis un cimetière, vous piochez deux cartes et vous perdez 2 points de vie.\\nExhumation {4}{B} ({4}{B} : Renvoyez cette carte sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière. Elle acquiert la célérité. Exilez-la au début de la prochaine étape de fin ou si elle devait quitter le champ de bataille. N\'exhumez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : nécron\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581368&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68b0a45a-fcd9-434c-8147-3380135e6b9f\', \'multiverseId\': 581368}, \'multiverseid\': 581368}, {\'name\': \'Pretoriano del Triarcato\', \'text\': "Volare\\nCodici Dinastici — Quando il Pretoriano del Triarcato entra nel campo di battaglia da un cimitero, peschi due carte e perdi 2 punti vita.\\nDissotterrare {4}{B} ({4}{B}: Rimetti sul campo di battaglia questa carta dal tuo cimitero. Ha rapidità. Esiliala all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale o se sta per lasciare il campo di battaglia. Dissotterra solo come una stregoneria.)", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Necron\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dd0e049-af17-4053-93c4-00c7584cfee2\', \'multiverseId\': 581528}, \'multiverseid\': 581528}, {\'name\': \'トライアーク・プラエトリアン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n王朝の戦闘様式 — トライアーク・プラエトリアンが墓地から戦場に出たとき、あなたはカード２枚を引き２点のライフを失う。\\n蘇生{4}{B}（{4}{B}：あなたの墓地にあるこのカードを戦場に戻す。これは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、またはこれが戦場を離れるなら、これを追放する。蘇生はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ネクロン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581688&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47babaf0-0de9-499a-a329-199e06c51ce9\', \'multiverseId\': 581688}, \'multiverseid\': 581688}, {\'name\': \'Pretoriano dos Triarcas\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nCódigos Dinásticos — Quando Pretoriano dos Triarcas entra no campo de batalha vindo de um cemitério, você compra dois cards e perde 2 pontos de vida.\\nDesenterrar {4}{B} ({4}{B}: Devolva este card de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha. Ele ganha ímpeto. Exile-o no início da próxima etapa final ou se ele for deixar o campo de batalha. Use desenterrar somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Necron\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581848&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02fd7101-0de0-4a2e-bbea-afb8013876bc\', \'multiverseId\': 581848}, \'multiverseid\': 581848}, {\'name\': \'三圣禁卫\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n王朝法典～当三圣禁卫从坟墓场进战场时，你抓两张牌且失去2点生命。\\n破坟{4}{B}（{4}{B}：将此牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。它获得敏捷异能。在下一个结束步骤开始时，或若它将离开战场，将它放逐。只能于法术时机破坟。）\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～太空死灵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e958363-9b1c-48f0-88d8-ea937dfc1825\', \'multiverseId\': 582168}, \'multiverseid\': 582168}]', '[{\'name\': \'Triumph der Heiligen Katherine\', \'text\': \'Lebensverknüpfung\\nPraesidium Protectiva — Wenn der Triumph der Heiligen Katherine stirbt, schicke ihn und die obersten sechs Karten deiner Bibliothek als verdeckten Haufen ins Exil. Falls du dies tust, mische den Haufen und lege ihn danach oben auf deine Bibliothek zurück.\\nMirakulum {1}{W} (Du kannst diese Karte für ihre Mirakulum-Kosten wirken, wenn du sie ziehst, falls es die erste Karte ist, die du in diesem Zug gezogen hast.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=580999&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b215bec-8c7a-4ac6-b4ec-2e4e4463a00f\', \'multiverseId\': 580999}, \'multiverseid\': 580999}, {\'name\': \'Triunfo de Santa Katherine\', \'text\': \'Vínculo vital.\\nPraesidium Protectiva — Cuando el Triunfo de Santa Katherine muera, exílialo a él y a las seis primeras cartas de tu biblioteca en un montón boca abajo. Si lo haces, baraja ese montón y ponlo en la parte superior de tu biblioteca.\\nMilagro {1}{W}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta pagando su coste de milagro cuando la robes si es la primera carta que robaste este turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581159&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47ddd1be-9ab0-48ad-b533-9e98109c4c99\', \'multiverseId\': 581159}, \'multiverseid\': 581159}, {\'name\': \'Triomphe de Sainte-Katherine\', \'text\': "Lien de vie\\nPraesidium Protectiva — Quand le Triomphe de Sainte-Katherine meurt, exilez-le et les six cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans un tas face cachée. Si vous faites ainsi, mélangez ce tas et remettez-le au-dessus de votre bibliothèque.\\nMiracle {1}{W} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte pour son coût de miracle quand vous la piochez si c\'est la première carte que vous avez piochée ce tour-ci.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581319&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c40a0cd-5e5b-4b88-9b75-db08595904b3\', \'multiverseId\': 581319}, \'multiverseid\': 581319}, {\'name\': \'Trionfo di Santa Katherine\', \'text\': \'Legame vitale\\nPraesidium Protectiva — Quando il Trionfo di Santa Katherine muore, esilialo insieme alle prime sei carte del tuo grimorio in una pila a faccia in giù. Se lo fai, rimescola quella pila e rimettila in cima al tuo grimorio.\\nMiracolo {1}{W} (Puoi lanciare questa carta pagando il suo costo di miracolo quando la peschi, se è la prima che hai pescato in questo turno.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581479&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71566f69-e8e4-42b6-bf28-2517429143fa\', \'multiverseId\': 581479}, \'multiverseid\': 581479}, {\'name\': \'聖カトリーヌの凱旋\', \'text\': \'絆魂\\n聖骸保護執行会 — 聖カトリーヌの凱旋が死亡したとき、これとあなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード６枚を裏向きの束１つにして追放する。そうしたなら、その束を切り直し、あなたのライブラリーの一番上に置く。\\n奇跡{1}{W}（あなたがこのターンに最初に引いたカードとしてこのカードを引き、すぐに公開したとき、あなたはこれを奇跡コストで唱えてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581639&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf86b0af-4788-4a1a-a375-cff5a3e8a002\', \'multiverseId\': 581639}, \'multiverseid\': 581639}, {\'name\': \'Triunfo de Santa Katherine\', \'text\': \'Vínculo com a vida\\nPraesidium Protectiva — Quando Triunfo de Santa Katherine morrer, exile-o com os seis cards do topo de seu grimório em um monte com a face voltada para baixo. Se fizer isso, embaralhe aquele monte e coloque-o de volta no topo de seu grimório.\\nMilagre {1}{W} (Você pode conjurar este card pagando seu custo de milagre ao comprá-lo se este for o primeiro card que você compra neste turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581799&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5f6b024-3fd2-4aa2-821e-2627198d6a73\', \'multiverseId\': 581799}, \'multiverseid\': 581799}, {\'name\': \'凯旋之圣凯瑟琳\', \'text\': \'系命\\n圣灵护盾～当凯旋之圣凯瑟琳死去时，将它和你牌库顶的六张牌放逐作牌面朝下的一堆。若你如此作，则将该堆洗牌并放回你的牌库顶。\\n奇迹{1}{W}（当你抓此牌时，如果它是你于本回合抓的第一张牌，你可以支付其奇迹费用来施放它。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e989fce4-6a8f-434d-a637-c7ca8162f293\', \'multiverseId\': 582119}, \'multiverseid\': 582119}]', '[{\'name\': \'Trygon-Primus\', \'text\': \'Unterirdischer Angriff — Immer wenn der Trygon-Primus angreift, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf ihn und eine +1/+1-Marke auf bis zu eine andere angreifende Kreatur deiner Wahl. Jene Kreatur kann in diesem Zug nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Tyranide\', \'flavor\': \'Die Mauern der Necron-Gruft waren undurchdringlich. Der Boden darunter war es nicht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581125&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc077c7f-204a-41a5-82da-60efe2ace65e\', \'multiverseId\': 581125}, \'multiverseid\': 581125}, {\'name\': \'Trigón Primus\', \'text\': \'Asalto subterráneo — Siempre que el Trigón Primus ataque, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre él y un contador +1/+1 sobre hasta una otra criatura atacante objetivo. Esa criatura no puede ser bloqueada este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiránido\', \'flavor\': \'Las murallas de la necrópolis necrona son inexpugnables. La tierra que hay debajo, no.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8fa05f1-0cf9-4038-ace7-12bd89138efc\', \'multiverseId\': 581285}, \'multiverseid\': 581285}, {\'name\': \'Trygon Prime\', \'text\': "Assaut souterrain — À chaque fois que le Trygon Prime attaque, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur lui et un marqueur +1/+1 sur jusqu\'à une autre créature attaquante ciblée. Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature : tyranide\', \'flavor\': "Les murs de la nécropole nécron étaient indestructibles. Le sol sur lequel elle reposait ne l\'était pas.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581445&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a59aa68-1e02-4a5c-84e1-094ff5f67297\', \'multiverseId\': 581445}, \'multiverseid\': 581445}, {\'name\': \'Trigone Primus\', \'text\': "Assalto Sotterraneo — Ogniqualvolta il Trigone Primus attacca, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di esso e scegli fino a un\'altra creatura attaccante bersaglio. Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa. Quella creatura non può essere bloccata in questo turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Tiranide\', \'flavor\': \'Le pareti della tomba Necron erano indistruttibili. Il terreno sottostante non lo era.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581605&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'367a2075-4402-4515-b84c-2bb93516276a\', \'multiverseId\': 581605}, \'multiverseid\': 581605}, {\'name\': \'トライゴン・プライム\', \'text\': \'地中強襲 — トライゴン・プライムが攻撃するたび、これでない攻撃クリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。これとそれの上にそれぞれ＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。このターン、そのクリーチャーはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ティラニッド\', \'flavor\': \'ネクロンの墓壁は不壊だった。しかしその下の地面は違ったのである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc7d200a-8a98-4514-bc59-0ba6a06fa720\', \'multiverseId\': 581765}, \'multiverseid\': 581765}, {\'name\': \'Trigão Primus\', \'text\': \'Assalto Subterrâneo — Toda vez que Trigão Primus atacar, coloque um marcador +1/+1 nele e um marcador +1/+1 em até uma outra criatura atacante alvo. Aquela criatura não pode ser bloqueada neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiranídeo\', \'flavor\': \'As muralhas da tumba dos necrons eram inquebráveis. O chão sob elas não era.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97ec0642-4884-47d5-b99c-4ccbf6a12a18\', \'multiverseId\': 581925}, \'multiverseid\': 581925}, {\'name\': \'掘蟒王虫\', \'text\': \'地底突袭～每当掘蟒王虫攻击时，在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物，并在至多另一个目标进行攻击的生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。该生物本回合不能被阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～泰伦虫族\', \'flavor\': \'太空死灵墓穴的墙壁坚不可摧。但底部则不然。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582245&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba026479-53bb-431b-b23f-5c416838d6bd\', \'multiverseId\': 582245}, \'multiverseid\': 582245}]', "[{'name': 'Tyraniden-Harridan', 'text': 'Fliegend, Abwehr {4}\\nKreischende Gargoyles — Immer wenn der Tyraniden-Harridan oder ein anderer Tyranide, den du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, erzeuge einen 1/1 blauen Tyranide-Gargoyle-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Tyranide', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581126&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9f90b84c-9910-4d38-b3f3-f67396ef8bea', 'multiverseId': 581126}, 'multiverseid': 581126}, {'name': 'Harridan Tiránida', 'text': 'Vuela, rebatir {4}.\\nGárgolas aullantes — Siempre que la Harridan Tiránida u otro Tiránido que controlas haga daño de combate a un jugador, crea una ficha de criatura Gárgola Tiránida azul 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.', 'type': 'Criatura — Tiránido', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581286&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f96e90ee-f24d-4c5d-892d-1ffce4c393f8', 'multiverseId': 581286}, 'multiverseid': 581286}, {'name': 'Harridan tyranide', 'text': 'Vol, parade {4}\\nGargouilles hurlantes — À chaque fois que le Harridan tyranide ou un autre tyranide que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 bleue Tyranide et Gargouille avec le vol.', 'type': 'Créature : tyranide', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581446&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd6801f39-c48f-446a-99e4-b1801ef393d8', 'multiverseId': 581446}, 'multiverseid': 581446}, {'name': 'Tiranide Megera', 'text': 'Volare, egida {4}\\nGargolle Urlanti — Ogniqualvolta la Tiranide Megera o un altro Tiranide che controlli infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, crei una pedina creatura Tiranide Gargolla 1/1 blu con volare.', 'type': 'Creatura — Tiranide', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581606&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '59a4a326-c269-45ad-a839-7aa9b929b325', 'multiverseId': 581606}, 'multiverseid': 581606}, {'name': 'ティラニッド・ハリダン', 'text': '飛行、護法{4}\\n金切り声のガーゴイル — ティラニッド・ハリダンやあなたがコントロールしていてこれでないティラニッド１体がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、飛行を持つ青の１/１のティラニッド・ガーゴイル・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ティラニッド', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581766&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '09316891-aac4-4375-a099-07190045de7c', 'multiverseId': 581766}, 'multiverseid': 581766}, {'name': 'Megera Tiranídea', 'text': 'Voar, salvaguarda {4}\\nGárgulas Guinchantes — Toda vez que Megera Tiranídea ou outro Tiranídeo que você controla causar dano de combate a um jogador, crie uma ficha de criatura Tiranídeo Gárgula azul 1/1 com voar.', 'type': 'Criatura — Tiranídeo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581926&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b1778baf-9832-4f1c-a8a6-fa7027c6fd68', 'multiverseId': 581926}, 'multiverseid': 581926}, {'name': '泰伦虫族飞龙兽', 'text': '飞行，守护{4}\\n尖鸣石像鬼～每当泰伦虫族飞龙兽或另一个由你操控的泰伦虫族对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，派出一个1/1蓝色，具飞行异能的泰伦虫族／石像鬼衍生生物。', 'type': '生物 ～泰伦虫族', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582246&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e987776c-9357-43e4-baac-ec856bc89831', 'multiverseId': 582246}, 'multiverseid': 582246}]", '[{\'name\': \'Tyraniden-Primus\', \'text\': \'Weiterentwicklung (Immer wenn eine andere Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt und falls deren Stärke oder Widerstandskraft höher ist, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf diese Kreatur.)\\nSynapsenkreatur — Andere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Weiterentwicklung.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Tyranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581127&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6b48cb5-9dc6-4978-a286-c18ea7853d9e\', \'multiverseId\': 581127}, \'multiverseid\': 581127}, {\'name\': \'Tiránido Primus\', \'text\': \'Evolucionar. (Siempre que una criatura entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, si la fuerza o la resistencia de esa criatura es mayor que la de esta criatura, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre esta criatura.)\\nCriatura sináptica — Las otras criaturas que controlas tienen la habilidad de evolucionar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiránido\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581287&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0b09374-6554-435e-83a6-90f6ccf53694\', \'multiverseId\': 581287}, \'multiverseid\': 581287}, {\'name\': \'Tyranide Prime\', \'text\': "Évolution (À chaque fois qu\'une créature arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, si sa force ou son endurance est supérieure à celle de cette créature, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur cette créature.)\\nCréature synapse — Les autres créatures que vous contrôlez ont l\'évolution.", \'type\': \'Créature : tyranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581447&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fef137d-70f6-411f-903b-80413d962490\', \'multiverseId\': 581447}, \'multiverseid\': 581447}, {\'name\': \'Tiranide Primus\', \'text\': \'Evoluzione (Ogniqualvolta una creatura entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, se quella creatura ha forza o costituzione maggiori di questa creatura, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su questa creatura.)\\nCreatura Sinapsi — Le altre creature che controlli hanno evoluzione.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Tiranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'faab6a03-c1cc-4f3c-8f20-057fca5f1a13\', \'multiverseId\': 581607}, \'multiverseid\': 581607}, {\'name\': \'ティラニッド・プライム\', \'text\': \'進化（クリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、そのクリーチャーのパワーかタフネスがこのクリーチャーよりも大きい場合、このクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。）\\nシナプス個体 — あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのクリーチャーは進化を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ティラニッド\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f81de36b-5989-471d-97ca-c05e01fb5d2f\', \'multiverseId\': 581767}, \'multiverseid\': 581767}, {\'name\': \'Tiranídeo Primus\', \'text\': \'Evoluir (Toda vez que uma criatura entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, se ela tiver poder ou resistência maior que o desta criatura, coloque um marcador +1/+1 nesta criatura.)\\nCriatura Sinapse — As outras criaturas que você controla têm evoluir.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiranídeo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581927&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55e8b517-2e3d-4bfd-9ad5-2656fdf3b2c5\', \'multiverseId\': 581927}, \'multiverseid\': 581927}, {\'name\': \'泰伦王虫\', \'text\': \'进化（每当一个生物在你的操控下进战场时，若该生物的力量或防御力大于此生物，则在后者上放置一个+1/+1指示物。）\\n节点生物～由你操控的其他生物具有进化异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～泰伦虫族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23b5bac3-fac4-4408-86ef-bf7419eaeb01\', \'multiverseId\': 582247}, \'multiverseid\': 582247}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tyrantenwache\', \'text\': \'Unersättlich (Diese Kreatur kommt mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel. Falls X gleich 5 oder mehr ist, ziehe eine Karte, wenn sie ins Spiel kommt.)\\nSchildwall — Opfere die Tyrantenwache: Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst und auf denen Marken liegen, erhalten Fluchsicherheit und Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Tyranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581085&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3a850d2-f903-4763-8b54-2339d7050128\', \'multiverseId\': 581085}, \'multiverseid\': 581085}, {\'name\': \'Guardia Tiránida\', \'text\': \'Voracidad. (Esta criatura entra al campo de batalla con X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella. Si X es 5 o más, roba una carta cuando entre.)\\nMuralla — Sacrificar la Guardia Tiránida: Las criaturas que controlas con contadores sobre ellas ganan las habilidades de antimaleficio e indestructible hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiránido\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581245&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d43caa0-4d0e-4b4a-9124-ff513f2a6a56\', \'multiverseId\': 581245}, \'multiverseid\': 581245}, {\'name\': \'Garde du Tyran\', \'text\': "Voracité (Cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle. Si X est supérieur ou égal à 5, piochez une carte quand elle arrive sur le champ de bataille.)\\nMur de boucliers — Sacrifiez le Garde du Tyran : Les créatures que vous contrôlez avec des marqueurs sur elles acquièrent la défense talismanique et l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : tyranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581405&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99784a20-87d9-49ab-944a-6adfe680ceb4\', \'multiverseId\': 581405}, \'multiverseid\': 581405}, {\'name\': \'Guardia del Tiranno\', \'text\': \'Famelico (Questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia con X segnalini +1/+1. Se X è pari o superiore a 5, pesca una carta quando entra.)\\nMuro di Scudi — Sacrifica la Guardia del Tiranno: Le creature con segnalini che controlli hanno anti-malocchio e indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Tiranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581565&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56996c39-b4ff-4eb4-9ca0-e51aa2dff918\', \'multiverseId\': 581565}, \'multiverseid\': 581565}, {\'name\': \'タイラント・ガード\', \'text\': \'貪欲（このクリーチャーは＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。Ｘが５以上であるなら、これが戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引く。）\\n盾の壁 — タイラント・ガードを生け贄に捧げる：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしていてカウンターが置かれているすべてのクリーチャーは呪禁と破壊不能を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ティラニッド\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581725&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2a553cd-568d-4107-83d5-ac2a43bca37b\', \'multiverseId\': 581725}, \'multiverseid\': 581725}, {\'name\': \'Guarda do Tirano\', \'text\': \'Voraz (Esta criatura entra no campo de batalha com X marcadores +1/+1. Se X for igual ou superior a 5, compre um card quando ela entrar.)\\nBarreira de Escudos — Sacrifique Guarda do Tirano: As criaturas que você controla com marcadores ganham resistência a magia e indestrutível até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiranídeo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581885&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50d583a0-5587-4c8b-8d04-004fe9516538\', \'multiverseId\': 581885}, \'multiverseid\': 581885}, {\'name\': \'暴君护卫\', \'text\': \'贪食（此生物进战场时上面有X个+1/+1指示物。如果X等于或大于5，则当它进战场时抓一张牌。）\\n肉盾虫墙～牺牲暴君护卫：由你操控且其上有指示物的生物获得辟邪与不灭异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～泰伦虫族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88f38f25-7b18-4b2d-be15-b66ce34255d2\', \'multiverseId\': 582205}, \'multiverseid\': 582205}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tzaangor-Schamane\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nHexerisches Elixier — Immer wenn der Tzaangor-Schamane einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kopiere den nächsten Spontanzauber oder die nächste Hexerei, den bzw. die du in diesem Zug wirkst, wenn du ihn bzw. sie wirkst. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mutant, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'Die Tiermenschen von Tzeentch verdrehen die Realität so, wie sie selbst verdreht sind.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581128&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4286cb3f-afee-4d07-9b81-0ef152a9249f\', \'multiverseId\': 581128}, \'multiverseid\': 581128}, {\'name\': \'Chamán Tzaangor\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nElixir mágico — Siempre que el Chamán Tzaangor haga daño de combate a un jugador, copia el siguiente hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro que lances este turno cuando lo lances. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para la copia.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán mutante\', \'flavor\': \'Los hombres bestia de Tzeentch retuercen la realidad, pues ellos mismos son seres retorcidos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581288&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42eb4796-2748-458a-b5f3-6175ab021ff5\', \'multiverseId\': 581288}, \'multiverseid\': 581288}, {\'name\': \'Chaman Tzaangor\', \'text\': "Vol\\nElixir sorcier — À chaque fois que le Chaman Tzaangor inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, copiez le prochain sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel que vous lancez ce tour-ci quand vous le lancez. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour cette copie.", \'type\': \'Créature : mutant et shamane\', \'flavor\': "Les hommes-bêtes de Tzeentch corrompent la réalité autant qu\'eux-mêmes.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581448&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea05d956-e13e-4b8c-ba3e-9803a0dd1c16\', \'multiverseId\': 581448}, \'multiverseid\': 581448}, {\'name\': \'Tzaangor Sciamano\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nElisir Magico — Ogniqualvolta lo Tzaangor Sciamano infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, copia la prossima magia istantaneo o stregoneria che lanci in questo turno quando la lanci. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per la copia.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Mutante\', \'flavor\': \'Gli uomini bestia di Tzeentch corrompono la realtà poiché essi stessi sono corrotti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581608&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6bd1b7b-8b11-4778-a69f-6cf21cd44dd4\', \'multiverseId\': 581608}, \'multiverseid\': 581608}, {\'name\': \'ツァーンゴール・シャーマン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n魔術の霊薬 — ツァーンゴール・シャーマンがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、このターン、あなたが次にインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えたとき、それをコピーする。あなたはそのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ミュータント・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'ティーンチのビーストマン自身が捻じ曲がっているから、そいつらは現実を捻じ曲げるのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581768&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4545584a-8b86-4ac4-bde9-ff6c95ac8a87\', \'multiverseId\': 581768}, \'multiverseid\': 581768}, {\'name\': \'Xamã Tzaangor\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nElixir Mágico — Toda vez que Xamã Tzaangor causar dano de combate a um jogador, copie a próxima mágica instantânea ou de feitiço que você conjurar neste turno quando conjurá-la. Você poderá escolher novos alvos para a cópia.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Mutante Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'Os homens ferais de Tzeentch distorcem a realidade na medida de sua própria distorção.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581928&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6683a053-331a-4a36-afa3-62cb73546e20\', \'multiverseId\': 581928}, \'multiverseid\': 581928}, {\'name\': \'萨满飞盘\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n巫法药剂～每当萨满飞盘对任一牌手造成战斗伤害，本回合中，当你施放你的下一个瞬间或法术咒语时，将它复制。你可以为该复制品选择新的目标。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～突变体／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'奸奇的扭曲野兽人，能够将实界变得跟自己一样扭曲。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8564a22c-b959-40f2-8b01-deef882ab5f0\', \'multiverseId\': 582248}, \'multiverseid\': 582248}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ultramarines-Ehrengarde\', \'text\': \'Trupp {2} (Als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken, kannst du beliebig oft {2} bezahlen. Wenn diese Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge entsprechend viele Spielsteine, die Kopien von ihr sind.)\\nAndere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Astartes, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581000&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'520617be-e6fc-418f-a1eb-90d6273405a4\', \'multiverseId\': 581000}, \'multiverseid\': 581000}, {\'name\': \'Guardia de honor de los Ultramarines\', \'text\': \'Escuadra {2}. (Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, puedes pagar {2} tantas veces como quieras. Cuando esta criatura entre al campo de batalla, crea esa cantidad de fichas que son copias de ella.)\\nLas otras criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero astartes\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581160&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26318897-8b35-4f40-bcc3-d43a3494a2e8\', \'multiverseId\': 581160}, \'multiverseid\': 581160}, {\'name\': "Garde d\'honneur des Ultramarines", \'text\': \'Escouade {2} (En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, vous pouvez payer {2} autant de fois que vous le souhaitez. Quand cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez autant de jetons qui en sont des copies.)\\nLes autres créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Créature : astartes et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581320&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47569bdf-303f-43bd-a687-062ceb24e843\', \'multiverseId\': 581320}, \'multiverseid\': 581320}, {\'name\': "Guardia d\'Onore degli Ultramarines", \'text\': \'Squadra {2} (Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, puoi pagare {2} un qualsiasi numero di volte. Quando questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia, crea altrettante pedine che sono sue copie.)\\nLe altre creature che controlli prendono +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Astartes\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581480&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67bbc31c-4b51-48d9-a885-2486d9238598\', \'multiverseId\': 581480}, \'multiverseid\': 581480}, {\'name\': \'ウルトラマリーン・オナーガード\', \'text\': \'分隊{2}（この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、あなたは望む回数の{2}を支払ってもよい。このクリーチャーが戦場に出たとき、その回数に等しい数の、これのコピーであるトークンを生成する。）\\nあなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — アスタルテス・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581640&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2afd054f-c95e-41f6-bec2-2f4ec35c2d6c\', \'multiverseId\': 581640}, \'multiverseid\': 581640}, {\'name\': \'Guarda de Honra dos Ultramarines\', \'text\': \'Esquadrão {2} (Como custo adicional para conjurar esta mágica, você pode pagar {2} qualquer número de vezes. Quando esta criatura entrar no campo de batalha, crie aquela quantidade de fichas que sejam cópias dela.)\\nAs outras criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Astartes Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581800&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'777e00df-4866-4c71-8bac-e80c31847232\', \'multiverseId\': 581800}, \'multiverseid\': 581800}, {\'name\': \'极限战士荣誉卫队\', \'text\': \'小队{2}（你可以支付{2}任意次数，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。当此生物进战场时，派出等量为其复制品的衍生物。）\\n由你操控的其他生物得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～阿斯塔特／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59f55152-9b20-487d-8d2a-9815d5ac4ee5\', \'multiverseId\': 582120}, \'multiverseid\': 582120}]', "[{'name': 'Venator', 'text': 'Aufblitzen\\nUnersättlich (Diese Kreatur kommt mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel. Falls X gleich 5 oder mehr ist, ziehe eine Karte, wenn sie ins Spiel kommt.)\\nWenn der Venator ins Spiel kommt, greift eine Kreatur deiner Wahl einen Gegner deiner Wahl in diesem Zug an, falls möglich.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Tyranide', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581120&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f18f50a5-e96c-458b-b9e2-bd6e01fa7392', 'multiverseId': 581120}, 'multiverseid': 581120}, {'name': 'Vorace', 'text': 'Destello.\\nVoracidad. (Esta criatura entra al campo de batalla con X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella. Si X es 5 o más, roba una carta cuando entre.)\\nCuando el Vorace entre al campo de batalla, la criatura objetivo ataca al oponente objetivo este turno si puede.', 'type': 'Criatura — Tiránido', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581280&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f1220f9c-fdce-41ea-b091-1bfda9fd0165', 'multiverseId': 581280}, 'multiverseid': 581280}, {'name': 'Rôdeur tyranide', 'text': 'Flash\\nVoracité (Cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle. Si X est supérieur ou égal à 5, piochez une carte quand elle arrive sur le champ de bataille.)\\nQuand le Rôdeur tyranide arrive sur le champ de bataille, une créature ciblée attaque un adversaire ciblé ce tour-ci si possible.', 'type': 'Créature : tyranide', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581440&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1684c8c2-0377-4ac9-98ab-574811084ee9', 'multiverseId': 581440}, 'multiverseid': 581440}, {'name': 'Ravener', 'text': 'Lampo\\nFamelico (Questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia con X segnalini +1/+1. Se X è pari o superiore a 5, pesca una carta quando entra.)\\nQuando il Ravener entra nel campo di battaglia, una creatura bersaglio attacca un avversario bersaglio in questo turno, se può farlo.', 'type': 'Creatura — Tiranide', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581600&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '315e5bfa-4765-4fab-897d-6e2ab87747dd', 'multiverseId': 581600}, 'multiverseid': 581600}, {'name': 'ラヴェナー', 'text': '瞬速\\n貪欲（このクリーチャーは＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。Ｘが５以上であるなら、これが戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引く。）\\nラヴェナーが戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体と対戦相手１人を対象とする。このターン、その前者は可能ならその後者を攻撃する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ティラニッド', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581760&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a54f3e6a-d608-4f5f-ab8e-c0f1ce752d51', 'multiverseId': 581760}, 'multiverseid': 581760}, {'name': 'Voraçador', 'text': 'Lampejo\\nVoraz (Esta criatura entra no campo de batalha com X marcadores +1/+1. Se X for igual ou superior a 5, compre um card quando ela entrar.)\\nQuando Voraçador entra no campo de batalha, a criatura alvo ataca o oponente alvo neste turno se estiver apta.', 'type': 'Criatura — Tiranídeo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581920&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0081ced7-2df2-4040-b288-8e717c310e4b', 'multiverseId': 581920}, 'multiverseid': 581920}, {'name': '蛇虫', 'text': '闪现\\n贪食（此生物进战场时上面有X个+1/+1指示物。如果X等于或大于5，则当它进战场时抓一张牌。）\\n当蛇虫进战场时，目标生物本回合若能攻击目标对手，则须如此作。', 'type': '生物 ～泰伦虫族', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582240&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '86e82b87-89f5-4a9c-8297-e78e754ffb67', 'multiverseId': 582240}, 'multiverseid': 582240}]", '[{\'name\': \'Venomcrawler\', \'text\': \'Lebensverknüpfung\\nSeelenverschlinger — Immer wenn eine andere Kreatur stirbt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Venomcrawler.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581050&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c44d5809-2d47-475d-a0e8-2e7c653dc645\', \'multiverseId\': 581050}, \'multiverseid\': 581050}, {\'name\': \'Venomcrawler\', \'text\': \'Vínculo vital.\\nDevoraalmas — Siempre que otra criatura muera, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Venomcrawler.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Demonio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ad387b9-bc5a-40c6-8518-56ec136d282b\', \'multiverseId\': 581210}, \'multiverseid\': 581210}, {\'name\': \'Métaragne\', \'text\': "Lien de vie\\nRégénération infernale — À chaque fois qu\'une autre créature meurt, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur la Métaragne.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : démon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581370&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'994b032c-2bc3-49ab-b92a-46108dd71d6e\', \'multiverseId\': 581370}, \'multiverseid\': 581370}, {\'name\': \'Venomcrawler\', \'text\': "Legame vitale\\nMangiatore di Anime — Ogniqualvolta un\'altra creatura muore, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Venomcrawler.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Demone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'885d38bb-a7bc-416d-93d5-19308b8ffa19\', \'multiverseId\': 581530}, \'multiverseid\': 581530}, {\'name\': \'ヴェノムクローラー\', \'text\': \'絆魂\\n魂を貪るもの — これでないクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、ヴェノムクローラーの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — デーモン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581690&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7ac7696-043d-4c2e-a1ea-bd1cbea46296\', \'multiverseId\': 581690}, \'multiverseid\': 581690}, {\'name\': \'Venomcrawler\', \'text\': \'Vínculo com a vida\\nDevorador de Almas — Toda vez que outra criatura morrer, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Venomcrawler.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Demônio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581850&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47c0a323-53f4-47b2-940f-e7e8c06f903d\', \'multiverseId\': 581850}, \'multiverseid\': 581850}, {\'name\': \'剧毒爬行者\', \'text\': \'系命\\n噬魂者～每当另一个生物死去时，在剧毒爬行者上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～恶魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'508df6d6-51e3-457b-a50e-4e80b1027c43\', \'multiverseId\': 582170}, \'multiverseid\': 582170}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verteidiger der Menschheit\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Verteidiger der Menschheit ins Spiel kommen, erzeuge X 2/2 weiße Astartes-Krieger-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Wachsamkeit.\\n{X}{2}{W}, schicke die Verteidiger der Menschheit ins Exil: Erzeuge X 2/2 weiße Astartes-Krieger-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Wachsamkeit. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du keine Kreaturen kontrollierst und nur während deines Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=580993&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b986e313-d9b3-4b5d-91b7-b547066bb3a5\', \'multiverseId\': 580993}, \'multiverseid\': 580993}, {\'name\': \'Defensores de la humanidad\', \'text\': \'Cuando Defensores de la humanidad entre al campo de batalla, crea X fichas de criatura Guerrero Astartes blancas 2/2 con la habilidad de vigilancia.\\n{X}{2}{W}, exiliar Defensores de la humanidad: Crea X fichas de criatura Guerrero Astartes blancas 2/2 con la habilidad de vigilancia. Activa esto solo si no controlas ninguna criatura y solo durante tu turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581153&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d48517ae-2415-4a09-8445-1fb3e07dc1b1\', \'multiverseId\': 581153}, \'multiverseid\': 581153}, {\'name\': "Défenseurs de l\'Humanité", \'text\': "Quand les Défenseurs de l\'Humanité arrivent sur le champ de bataille, créez X jetons de créature 2/2 blanche Astartes et Guerrier avec la vigilance.\\n{X}{2}{W}, exilez les Défenseurs de l\'Humanité : Créez X jetons de créature 2/2 blanche Astartes et Guerrier avec la vigilance. N\'activez que si vous ne contrôlez pas de créature et que pendant votre tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581313&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ba5515b-faf4-4146-99fb-cccb79e87519\', \'multiverseId\': 581313}, \'multiverseid\': 581313}, {\'name\': "Difensori dell\'Umanità", \'text\': "Quando i Difensori dell\'Umanità entrano nel campo di battaglia, crea X pedine creatura Guerriero Astartes 2/2 bianche con cautela.\\n{X}{2}{W}, Esilia i Difensori dell\'Umanità: Crea X pedine creatura Guerriero Astartes 2/2 bianche con cautela. Attiva solo se non controlli creature e solo durante il tuo turno.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581473&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8fc9c31-d013-4578-aa04-534dc1f1de87\', \'multiverseId\': 581473}, \'multiverseid\': 581473}, {\'name\': \'人類の防衛者\', \'text\': \'人類の防衛者が戦場に出たとき、警戒を持つ白の２/２のアスタルテス・戦士・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体を生成する。\\n{X}{2}{W},人類の防衛者を追放する：警戒を持つ白の２/２のアスタルテス・戦士・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体を生成する。あなたのターン中であり、あなたがクリーチャーをコントロールしていない場合にのみ起動できる。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581633&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69025002-29a3-4ac3-9c46-98ce03ddda65\', \'multiverseId\': 581633}, \'multiverseid\': 581633}, {\'name\': \'Defensores da Humanidade\', \'text\': \'Quando Defensores da Humanidade entrar no campo de batalha, crie X fichas de criatura Astartes Guerreiro branca 2/2 com vigilância.\\n{X}{2}{W}, exile Defensores da Humanidade: crie X fichas de criatura Astartes Guerreiro branca 2/2 com vigilância. Ative somente se você não controlar nenhuma criatura e somente durante o seu turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3180f32c-ea53-45b0-adda-66d20845ddb5\', \'multiverseId\': 581793}, \'multiverseid\': 581793}, {\'name\': \'人类卫士\', \'text\': \'当人类卫士进战场时，派出X个2/2白色，具警戒异能的阿斯塔特／战士衍生生物。\\n{X}{2}{W}，放逐人类卫士：派出X个2/2白色，具警戒异能的阿斯塔特／战士衍生生物。只能于你未操控生物时起动，且仅限你的回合。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e83c9eae-9252-4ddb-9fda-1e25398bad25\', \'multiverseId\': 582113}, \'multiverseid\': 582113}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verweser des Nurgle\', \'text\': \'Lebensverknüpfung\\nDer siebenfältige Gesang — Zu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls eine Kreatur in diesem Zug gestorben ist, ziehst du eine Karte und verlierst 1 Lebenspunkt. Falls sieben oder mehr Kreaturen in diesem Zug gestorben sind, ziehst du stattdessen sieben Karten und verlierst 7 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Astartes, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581042&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31278aeb-dcf5-40a9-9a24-a388bd64d0e0\', \'multiverseId\': 581042}, \'multiverseid\': 581042}, {\'name\': \'Tallyman de Nurgle\', \'text\': \'Vínculo vital.\\nEl cántico séptuple — Al comienzo de tu paso final, si una criatura murió este turno, robas una carta y pierdes 1 vida. Si siete o más criaturas murieron este turno, en vez de eso, robas siete cartas y pierdes 7 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero astartes\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581202&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cbd601f-179e-42af-95d8-f6798d9f3c34\', \'multiverseId\': 581202}, \'multiverseid\': 581202}, {\'name\': \'Tallyman de Nurgle\', \'text\': \'Lien de vie\\nLe Septuple Chant — Au début de votre étape de fin, si une créature est morte ce tour-ci, vous piochez une carte et vous perdez 1 point de vie. Si au moins sept créatures sont mortes ce tour-ci, à la place vous piochez sept cartes et vous perdez 7 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : astartes et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581362&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aedffca6-67d3-49cd-8288-8fbcc6a0a761\', \'multiverseId\': 581362}, \'multiverseid\': 581362}, {\'name\': \'Attuario di Nurgle\', \'text\': "Legame vitale\\nIl Canto Settuplo — All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, se una creatura è morta in questo turno, peschi una carta e perdi 1 punto vita. Se sette o più creature sono morte in questo turno, invece peschi sette carte e perdi 7 punti vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Astartes\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c3a83b6-a7bf-47e8-a030-d6367f4d2fc9\', \'multiverseId\': 581522}, \'multiverseid\': 581522}, {\'name\': \'タリーマン・オヴ・ナーグル\', \'text\': \'絆魂\\n七重の詠唱 — あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、このターンにクリーチャーが死亡していた場合、あなたはカード１枚を引き１点のライフを失う。このターンに７体以上のクリーチャーが死亡していたなら、代わりにあなたはカード７枚を引き７点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — アスタルテス・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581682&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87531f9d-622a-4d2a-9323-1050208ef926\', \'multiverseId\': 581682}, \'multiverseid\': 581682}, {\'name\': \'Tallyman of Nurgle\', \'text\': \'Vínculo com a vida\\nO Canto Sétuplo — No início de sua etapa final, se uma criatura morreu neste turno, você compra um card e perde 1 ponto de vida. Se sete ou mais criaturas morreram neste turno, em vez disso, você compra sete cards e perde 7 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Astartes Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581842&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1774f7e-8827-4563-bca4-ae8c247cfe38\', \'multiverseId\': 581842}, \'multiverseid\': 581842}, {\'name\': \'纳垢书记官\', \'text\': \'系命\\n七重吟诵～在你的结束步骤开始时，若本回合中有生物死去，则你抓一张牌且失去1点生命。如果本回合中有七个或更多生物死去，则改为你抓七张牌且失去7点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～阿斯塔特／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582162&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e911a12-98e6-4ee9-8585-5d64acfdbfac\', \'multiverseId\': 582162}, \'multiverseid\': 582162}]', '[{\'name\': \'Vexilus-Praetor\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nWachsamkeit\\nAegis des Imperators — Kommandeure, die du kontrollierst, haben Schutz vor allem.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Custodes, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Es gibt kein größeres Bollwerk als die Praetoren des Adeptus Custodes, die Leibwächter des Imperators der Menschheit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581001&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'752cca46-71bb-4dba-aa0a-5c9932bd4ab6\', \'multiverseId\': 581001}, \'multiverseid\': 581001}, {\'name\': \'Vexilus Praetor\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nVigilancia.\\nÉgida del Emperador — Los comandantes que controlas tienen protección contra todo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero custodes\', \'flavor\': \'No hay mayor baluarte que los Pretores de los Adeptus Custodes, los guardaespaldas del Emperador de la Humanidad.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7562794-bb8e-439f-9c43-cfef795043a1\', \'multiverseId\': 581161}, \'multiverseid\': 581161}, {\'name\': \'Vexilus Praetor\', \'text\': "Flash\\nVigilance\\nÉgide de l\'Empereur — les commandants que vous contrôlez ont la protection contre tout.", \'type\': \'Créature : custodes et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "Il n\'y a pas plus puissant bastion que les Praetors des Adeptus Custodes, les gardes du corps de l\'Empereur de l\'Humanité.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581321&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'255153e5-d602-4429-8018-c36c9c47d6e3\', \'multiverseId\': 581321}, \'multiverseid\': 581321}, {\'name\': \'Vexilus Praetor\', \'text\': "Lampo\\nCautela\\nEgida dell\'Imperatore — I comandanti che controlli hanno protezione da tutto.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Custodes\', \'flavor\': "Non esiste baluardo più insormontabile dei Pretori dell\'Adeptus Custodes, le guardie del corpo dell\'Imperatore dell\'Umanità.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581481&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5f1a005-a2ad-43a8-9906-40778f3ed56d\', \'multiverseId\': 581481}, \'multiverseid\': 581481}, {\'name\': \'ヴェクシルス・プラエトール\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n警戒\\n皇帝陛下の御加護 — あなたがコントロールしているすべての統率者はプロテクション（すべて）を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 近衛団・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'人類の皇帝の用心棒である皇帝近衛団のプラエトールより優れた防護者はいない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581641&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dedab4c-4b20-4d45-bdc3-fc35d661198b\', \'multiverseId\': 581641}, \'multiverseid\': 581641}, {\'name\': \'Vexilus Praetor\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nVigilância\\nÉgide do Imperador — Os comandantes que você controla têm proteção contra tudo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Custodes Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'Não há baluarte maior que os Praetors dos Adeptus Custodes, os guarda-costas do Imperador da Humanidade.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581801&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c1b58db-e527-4936-9096-2585342b5e44\', \'multiverseId\': 581801}, \'multiverseid\': 581801}, {\'name\': \'战旗执行官\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n警戒\\n帝皇之盾～由你操控的指挥官具有反一切保护异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～禁军／战士\', \'flavor\': \'世间最坚实的壁垒，莫过于人类帝皇的贴身侍卫～禁军执行官。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df9b5734-06ea-4248-882e-78ad64e5d4ba\', \'multiverseId\': 582121}, \'multiverseid\': 582121}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zephyrim\', \'text\': \'Trupp {2} (Als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken, kannst du beliebig oft {2} bezahlen. Wenn diese Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge entsprechend viele Spielsteine, die Kopien von ihr sind.)\\nFliegend, Wachsamkeit\\nMirakulum {1}{W} (Du kannst diese Karte für ihre Mirakulum-Kosten wirken, wenn du sie ziehst, falls es die erste Karte ist, die du in diesem Zug gezogen hast.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581002&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21ab30c0-9bd3-4c3d-a8d2-a9cef5ab70e2\', \'multiverseId\': 581002}, \'multiverseid\': 581002}, {\'name\': \'Zephyrim\', \'text\': \'Escuadra {2}. (Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, puedes pagar {2} tantas veces como quieras. Cuando esta criatura entre al campo de batalla, crea esa cantidad de fichas que son copias de ella.)\\nVuela, vigilancia.\\nMilagro {1}{W}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta pagando su coste de milagro cuando la robes si es la primera carta que robaste este turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581162&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fee9871d-b7f5-49c9-92b2-e7fe38895151\', \'multiverseId\': 581162}, \'multiverseid\': 581162}, {\'name\': \'Zéphyrim\', \'text\': "Escouade {2} (En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, vous pouvez payer {2} autant de fois que vous le souhaitez. Quand cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez autant de jetons qui en sont des copies.)\\nVol, vigilance\\nMiracle {1}{W} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte pour son coût de miracle quand vous la piochez si c\'est la première carte que vous avez piochée ce tour-ci.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581322&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c02721f5-e052-4e34-b69d-04a13d58846b\', \'multiverseId\': 581322}, \'multiverseid\': 581322}, {\'name\': \'Zefirea\', \'text\': \'Squadra {2} (Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, puoi pagare {2} un qualsiasi numero di volte. Quando questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia, crea altrettante pedine che sono sue copie.)\\nVolare, cautela\\nMiracolo {1}{W} (Puoi lanciare questa carta pagando il suo costo di miracolo quando la peschi, se è la prima che hai pescato in questo turno.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581482&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13f3735c-0773-44c7-ad30-d23c1f48fcc4\', \'multiverseId\': 581482}, \'multiverseid\': 581482}, {\'name\': \'ゼフィリム\', \'text\': \'分隊{2}（この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、あなたは望む回数の{2}を支払ってもよい。このクリーチャーが戦場に出たとき、その回数に等しい数の、これのコピーであるトークンを生成する。）\\n飛行、警戒\\n奇跡{1}{W}（あなたがこのターンに最初に引いたカードとしてこのカードを引き、すぐに公開したとき、あなたはこれを奇跡コストで唱えてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581642&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44817bfc-002a-4b9e-affc-63b3f20ec61a\', \'multiverseId\': 581642}, \'multiverseid\': 581642}, {\'name\': \'Zephyrim\', \'text\': \'Esquadrão {2} (Como custo adicional para conjurar esta mágica, você pode pagar {2} qualquer número de vezes. Quando esta criatura entrar no campo de batalha, crie aquela quantidade de fichas que sejam cópias dela.)\\nVoar, vigilância\\nMilagre {1}{W} (Você pode conjurar este card pagando seu custo de milagre ao comprá-lo se este for o primeiro card que você compra neste turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581802&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04358fa5-8d7d-4000-a8dc-546a8c750164\', \'multiverseId\': 581802}, \'multiverseid\': 581802}, {\'name\': \'风天使\', \'text\': \'小队{2}（你可以支付{2}任意次数，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。当此生物进战场时，派出等量为其复制品的衍生物。）\\n飞行，警戒\\n奇迹{1}{W}（当你抓此牌时，如果它是你于本回合抓的第一张牌，你可以支付其奇迹费用来施放它。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582122&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c91fba6-2531-477b-8c21-4e8f038005f8\', \'multiverseId\': 582122}, \'multiverseid\': 582122}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zepter des ewigen Ruhms\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\\n{T}: Erzeuge drei Mana genau einer beliebigen Farbe. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du drei oder mehr Länder mit demselben Namen kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Es brennt mit demselben Feuer, das Szarekhs Spezies zum Verhängnis wurde, und kanalisiert es, um seine Feinde zu vernichten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581148&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0475fed9-0b31-4d6b-9e3d-63cd979765eb\', \'multiverseId\': 581148}, \'multiverseid\': 581148}, {\'name\': \'Cetro de gloria eterna\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\\n{T}: Agrega tres manás de un color cualquiera. Activa esto solo si controlas tres o más tierras con el mismo nombre.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': \'Arde con el mismo fuego que condenó a la especie de Szarekh y lo canaliza para arrasar a sus enemigos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581308&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5efb1cf-2432-47fc-83fb-9eedc17c3809\', \'multiverseId\': 581308}, \'multiverseid\': 581308}, {\'name\': \'Sceptre de Gloire Éternelle\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.\\n{T} : Ajoutez trois manas d\'une seule couleur de votre choix. N\'activez que si vous contrôlez au moins trois terrains du même nom.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': "Il brûle du feu-même qui a anéanti l\'espèce de Szarekh, qu\'il canalise pour dévaster ses ennemis.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581468&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'874c3522-cd79-493f-882b-bf9e7adb0974\', \'multiverseId\': 581468}, \'multiverseid\': 581468}, {\'name\': \'Scettro della Gloria Eterna\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\\n{T}: Aggiungi tre mana di un qualsiasi colore. Attiva solo se controlli tre o più terre con lo stesso nome.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': \'Brucia con lo stesso fuoco che ha condannato la specie di Szarekh e lo incanala per devastare i suoi nemici.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e599fb62-9cad-4e4b-9ce1-7df1f5dd3118\', \'multiverseId\': 581628}, \'multiverseid\': 581628}, {\'name\': \'久遠なる栄光の笏\', \'text\': \'{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ３点を加える。あなたが同じ名前を持つ３つ以上の土地をコントロールしていなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'スザーレクの種族を絶望に陥れたものと同じ炎で燃え盛り、その炎によって敵を焼き尽くす。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581788&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0346beaf-26be-42d7-bdc5-20a35763a4d6\', \'multiverseId\': 581788}, \'multiverseid\': 581788}, {\'name\': \'Cetro da Glória Eterna\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.\\n{T}: Adicione três manas de uma cor à sua escolha. Ative somente se você controlar três ou mais terrenos com o mesmo nome.\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário\', \'flavor\': \'Ele queima com o mesmo fogo que condenou a espécie de Szarekh, e o canaliza para devastar seus inimigos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581948&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af177fa0-19d7-4d49-bdd5-ff0b751b5232\', \'multiverseId\': 581948}, \'multiverseid\': 581948}, {\'name\': \'永恒荣耀权杖\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\\n{T}：加三点任意颜色的单色法术力。只能于你操控三个或更多具相同名称的地时起动。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': \'它重新点燃毁灭萨雷赫族亲的那团烈火，随号令将萨雷赫的新敌尽数消灭。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e061e9ea-2b90-4ef5-9cfc-0e671325ba08\', \'multiverseId\': 582268}, \'multiverseid\': 582268}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zerschmetterer des Khorne\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nVerheerender Ansturm — Andere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, verursachen Trampelschaden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon, Ritter\', \'flavor\': \'Die Brazen Thunder, die vordersten der Zerschmetterer-Legionen, sind nach dem Getöse benannt, das sie machen, wenn sie in die Schlacht reiten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581054&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10f4c7e4-f15a-48a3-ae1f-75c2db95bb7d\', \'multiverseId\': 581054}, \'multiverseid\': 581054}, {\'name\': \'Bloodcrusher de Khorne\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nCarga devastadora — Las otras criaturas que controlas tienen la habilidad de arrollar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero demonio\', \'flavor\': \'Los Trueno de Bronce, la más importante de las legiones de bloodcrushers, reciben su nombre por el sonido que hacen cuando se dirigen a la batalla.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581214&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f7d96ad-151c-481a-aa63-1ab320761fa7\', \'multiverseId\': 581214}, \'multiverseid\': 581214}, {\'name\': \'Équarrisseur de Khorne\', \'text\': \'Piétinement\\nCharge dévastatrice — Les autres créatures que vous contrôlez ont le piétinement.\', \'type\': \'Créature : démon et chevalier\', \'flavor\': "Le Tonnerre d\'Airain, la plus célèbre des légions d\'Équarrisseurs, est ainsi nommée à cause du son qu\'ils produisent quand ils chargent au combat.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581374&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef303dad-93dc-4d2b-881d-2a7f062df9d5\', \'multiverseId\': 581374}, \'multiverseid\': 581374}, {\'name\': \'Bloodcrusher of Khorne\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nCarica Devastante — Le altre creature che controlli hanno travolgere.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Demone\', \'flavor\': \'I Brazen Thunder, tra le principali legioni di bloodcrusher, prendono il nome dal suono che emettono mentre cavalcano in battaglia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cc02863-35e8-412d-a5a9-9bb85f0ee37d\', \'multiverseId\': 581534}, \'multiverseid\': 581534}, {\'name\': \'ブラッドクラッシャー・オヴ・コーン\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\nデヴァステーティング・チャージ — あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのクリーチャーはトランプルを持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン・騎士\', \'flavor\': \'ブラッドクラッシャー・レギオンの先陣を切るブレイズンサンダーは、戦場に乗り込む時の轟音にちなんで名付けられた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581694&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e3eccea-f848-4222-a73a-059476145ca9\', \'multiverseId\': 581694}, \'multiverseid\': 581694}, {\'name\': \'Bloodcrusher de Khorne\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nCarga Devastadora — As outras criaturas que você controla têm atropelar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demônio Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': \'A legião Trovão Temerário, a mais importante das legiões bloodcrusher, deve seu nome ao barulho que faz quando cavalga rumo à batalha.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581854&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2327fbc9-5bd7-45c0-a6bf-44c13c9771d3\', \'multiverseId\': 581854}, \'multiverseid\': 581854}, {\'name\': \'恐虐碎血者\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n毁灭冲锋～由你操控的其他生物具有践踏异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～恶魔／骑士\', \'flavor\': \'碎血者军团的先锋部队唤作莽雷军，因他们参战时发出的巨大声响而得名。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57f312ba-056f-4c4f-b885-bd4366b1de7f\', \'multiverseId\': 582174}, \'multiverseid\': 582174}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zerstören! Vernichten! Verbrennen!\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines oder mehrere —\\n• Zerstöre ein Artefakt deiner Wahl.\\n• Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\\n• Zerstören Vernichten Verbrennen fügt einem Spieler deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581110&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49f002f5-a2d5-466d-a598-03ea16187785\', \'multiverseId\': 581110}, \'multiverseid\': 581110}, {\'name\': \'¡Matar, mutilar y quemar!\', \'text\': \'Elige uno o más:\\n• Destruye el artefacto objetivo.\\n• Destruye la criatura objetivo.\\n• ¡Matar, mutilar y quemar hace 3 puntos de daño al jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c1f7a71-ce4d-4420-b7e1-7f917100d4ca\', \'multiverseId\': 581270}, \'multiverseid\': 581270}, {\'name\': \'Tuez ! Mutilez ! Brûlez !\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un ou plus —\\n• Détruisez un artefact ciblé.\\n• Détruisez une créature ciblée.\\n• Tuez Mutilez Brûlez inflige 3 blessures à un joueur ciblé.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581430&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02ebae66-1285-4e35-b2c1-239afa120e1b\', \'multiverseId\': 581430}, \'multiverseid\': 581430}, {\'name\': \'Uccidi! Mutila! Brucia!\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno o più —\\n• Distruggi un artefatto bersaglio.\\n• Distruggi una creatura bersaglio.\\n• Uccidi Mutila Brucia infligge 3 danni a un giocatore bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581590&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c2dd050-f19f-4736-912d-381133a8fd05\', \'multiverseId\': 581590}, \'multiverseid\': 581590}, {\'name\': \'殺せ！潰せ！燃やせ！\', \'text\': \'以下から１つ以上を選ぶ。\\n・アーティファクト１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\\n・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。\\n・プレイヤー１人を対象とする。殺せ！潰せ！燃やせ！はそのプレイヤーに３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581750&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2906e29-1d72-42c3-998c-b03a08c0efaa\', \'multiverseId\': 581750}, \'multiverseid\': 581750}, {\'name\': \'Matar! Mutilar! Queimar!\', \'text\': \'Escolha um ou mais —\\n• Destrua o artefato alvo.\\n• Destrua a criatura alvo.\\n• Matar Mutilar Queimar causa 3 pontos de dano ao jogador alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581910&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'354d8fc6-735a-49af-9822-8ab272a8a51f\', \'multiverseId\': 581910}, \'multiverseid\': 581910}, {\'name\': \'杀！残！烧！\', \'text\': \'选择一项或多项～\\n•消灭目标神器。\\n•消灭目标生物。\\n•杀！残！烧！对目标牌手造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c3c6189-dcce-4efe-8ba0-c1e33f3b1a12\', \'multiverseId\': 582230}, \'multiverseid\': 582230}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zoantroph\', \'text\': \'Unersättlich (Diese Kreatur kommt mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel. Falls X gleich 5 oder mehr ist, ziehe eine Karte, wenn sie ins Spiel kommt.)\\nFliegend, Abwehr {2}\\nWarpblitz — Wenn der Zoantroph ins Spiel kommt, fügt er einem Ziel deiner Wahl X Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Tyranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581131&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23db9afb-d3b6-4a0a-a817-cfe3241db419\', \'multiverseId\': 581131}, \'multiverseid\': 581131}, {\'name\': \'Zoántropo\', \'text\': \'Voracidad. (Esta criatura entra al campo de batalla con X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella. Si X es 5 o más, roba una carta cuando entre.)\\nVuela, rebatir {2}.\\nRayo disforme — Cuando el Zoántropo entre al campo de batalla, hace X puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiránido\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581291&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1265420a-5ed2-40f2-89e5-acd2850a8d04\', \'multiverseId\': 581291}, \'multiverseid\': 581291}, {\'name\': \'Zoanthrope\', \'text\': "Voracité (Cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle. Si X est supérieur ou égal à 5, piochez une carte quand elle arrive sur le champ de bataille.)\\nVol, parade {2}\\nDécharge Warp — Quand le Zoanthrope arrive sur le champ de bataille, il inflige X blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Créature : tyranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581451&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f33a82cd-5192-4060-a1bd-ed7f8c97bfc9\', \'multiverseId\': 581451}, \'multiverseid\': 581451}, {\'name\': \'Zoantropo\', \'text\': \'Famelico (Questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia con X segnalini +1/+1. Se X è pari o superiore a 5, pesca una carta quando entra.)\\nVolare, egida {2}\\nScoppio Warp — Quando lo Zoantropo entra nel campo di battaglia, infligge X danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Tiranide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581611&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8401346-a3fc-4525-97b2-952403890a33\', \'multiverseId\': 581611}, \'multiverseid\': 581611}, {\'name\': \'ゾアンスロープ\', \'text\': \'貪欲（このクリーチャーは＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。Ｘが５以上であるなら、これが戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引く。）\\n飛行、護法{2}\\n歪み破 — ゾアンスロープが戦場に出たとき、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。これはそれにＸ点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ティラニッド\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdd1a96a-16fc-4069-967e-0046712d60b6\', \'multiverseId\': 581771}, \'multiverseid\': 581771}, {\'name\': \'Zoântropo\', \'text\': \'Voraz (Esta criatura entra no campo de batalha com X marcadores +1/+1. Se X for igual ou superior a 5, compre um card quando ela entrar.)\\nVoar, salvaguarda {2}\\nExplosão da Distorção — Quando Zoântropo entra no campo de batalha, ele causa X pontos de dano a qualquer alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiranídeo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=581931&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d382d333-0f21-4de3-81b6-c5def78c2287\', \'multiverseId\': 581931}, \'multiverseid\': 581931}, {\'name\': \'脑虫\', \'text\': \'贪食（此生物进战场时上面有X个+1/+1指示物。如果X等于或大于5，则当它进战场时抓一张牌。）\\n飞行，守护{2}\\n亚空间爆裂～当脑虫进战场时，它对任意一个目标造成X点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～泰伦虫族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=582251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b26f09d6-6a24-4930-9b63-5934f08fe899\', \'multiverseId\': 582251}, \'multiverseid\': 582251}]']
